{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_11","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The engine version is exactly 0.46.0, so the plan's recipes should work.\n\nReading the large documentation files and API patterns to understand the architecture. The core design centers on a Mint Dial component in `src/data/title.js`.\n\nPure modules will contain the Dot class, drivers, tunables, save logic, voice syllabification, scoring functions, Wobble Age, drips, and headless activity simulators. Scenes should only apply state. Activity tests require real Game subclasses that run via Engine.headless to verify idle bots finish at zero stars and expert bots score at least two.\n\nActivities will be pure `stepActivity` functions that update scores. Tests must instantiate real scenes and functions rather than reimplement them. The structure starts with a `createStillness` factory returning an activity definition.\n\nHeadless tests will instantiate scenes with bot drivers and step the engine frame by frame to read final state. Activities have real durations: stillness spans roughly 31–41 seconds, the step class lasts 74 seconds, and the hoop lasts 60 seconds.\n\nOther activities include a 60-second header, a 75-second jog, a 90-second long stand, and a slackline up to 75 seconds. A full week of playthroughs spans roughly 7 days. Headless simulation is fast enough: 600 frames take about 80 milliseconds, so a 60-second activity runs in about half a second. The entire week could take 10 to 30 seconds, which is acceptable.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c0613189-911f-44c9-8cbe-bb02de3c5261-11","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"^## |^### ","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/GUIDE.md"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c0613189-911f-44c9-8cbe-bb02de3c5261-12","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/vendor/hub/README.md","limit":250}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c0613189-911f-44c9-8cbe-bb02de3c5261-13","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/game.js","limit":150}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8594,"output_tokens":1214,"cache_read_input_tokens":57088,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"206ab8d7-acde-40fe-a20b-67a3e5428b6b"}
