{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_27","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I have a thorough plan and am ready to write code.\n\nI'll create files in parallel batches, starting with core modules and the main game file. I also need to install Playwright via npm. For the credits screen, I'm considering using an esbuild text loader to import CREDITS.md as a string, though this might fail in Node tests.\n\nI'll hardcode a short credits summary in the World scene for Node tests. The full CREDITS.md will only be loaded in the browser bundle, so build.mjs needs no special handling.\n\nI'll create `src/data/kitCredits.js` containing a summary plus a note that the full text is shown. I'll import `../../CREDITS.md` from `src/data/about.js` using esbuild's text loader, though Node tests importing this module will fail.\n\nI'll avoid the esbuild text loader for credits to prevent Node test failures. Instead, I'll use a simple mutable module with `kitCredits()` and `setKitCredits()` functions. The browser bundle will populate this state directly, while Node tests can skip it entirely.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-90ddf066-c486-426a-8272-4cf886291750-50","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"DEV=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607\"\nwc -c \"$DEV/CREDITS.md\"\n# install playwright locally without downloading browsers\ncd \"$DEV\"\nnpm init -y >/dev/null 2>&1\nnpm install --no-save --no-fund --no-audit playwright@1.63.0 2>&1 | tail -20\nnode -e \"import('playwright').then(p=>console.log('pw', p.chromium ? 'ok' : 'no'))\"","description":"Install Playwright 1.63 and check credits size"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":20131,"output_tokens":820,"cache_read_input_tokens":124160,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1