o. This is not a trick. Usually.',\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'floor',\\n    q: 'What is your relationship with the floor?',\\n    answers: ['Distant.', 'Improving.', 'It is complicated.'],\\n    remarks: [\\n      'Distant. The floor remains available.',\\n      'Improving. The floor is cautiously pleased.',\\n      'Complicated. I will not take sides.',\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'knees',\\n    q: 'If your knees could talk, what would they say?',\\n    answers: ['Please.', 'Why.', 'Nothing. They have given up.'],\\n    remarks: [\\n      'Please. A complete sentence, for a knee.',\\n      'Why. I ask myself this every morning.',\\n      'Given up is still a position. It is a low one.',\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'happy',\\n    day: 7,\\n    q: 'Are you happy?',\\n    answers: ['Yes.', 'No.', 'Is this graded?'],\\n    remarks: ['I am glad. I think.', 'I have the form for that.', 'It is all graded.'],\\n  },\\n];\\n\\nexport function questionFor(day) {\\n  if (day === 7) return QUESTIONS[QUESTIONS.length - 1];\\n  return QUESTIONS[(Math.max(1, day) - 1) % (QUESTIONS.length - 1)];\\n}\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-03872d03-696e-4a6c-853f-2e30452ad856-68","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"/** Three timed events. The picks come from a seeded stream. */\\nexport const MEDLEY_SPAN = 185;\\n\\nexport function medleyPicks(rand) {\\n  const poses = ['tree', 'heron', 'warrior'];\\n  const beats = ['hoop', 'step', 'squat'];\\n  return {\\n    still: poses[Math.floor(rand() * poses.length)],\\n    beat: beats[Math.floor(rand() * beats.length)],\\n    lean: 'header',\\n  };\\n}\\n\\n/** Windows on the shared clock, in seconds. */\\nexport function medleyWindow(t) {\\n  if (t < 55) return { index: 0, phase: 'play', local: t };\\n  if (t < 65) return { index: 0, phase: 'gap', local: t - 55 };\\n  if (t < 120) return { index: 1, phase: 'play', local: t - 65 };\\n  if (t < 130) return { index: 1, phase: 'gap', local: t - 120 };\\n  if (t < 185) return { index: 2, phase: 'play', local: t - 130 };\\n  return { index: 2, phase: 'done', local: t - 185 };\\n}\\n\\nexport const EVENT_NAMES = ['Stillness', 'Beat', 'Balance'];\\n\\nexport function normalise(raw, max) {\\n  if (!(max > 0)) return 0;\\n  return Math.max(0, Math.min(1000, Math.round((raw / max) * 1000)));\\n}\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/data/medley.js has been created successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/data/medley.js has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/data/medley.js\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"/** Three timed events. The picks come from a seeded stream. */\\nexport const MEDLEY_SPAN = 185;\\n\\nexport function medleyPicks(rand) {\\n  const poses = ['tree', 'heron', 'warrior'];\\n  const beats = ['hoop', 'step', 'squat'];\\n  return {\\n    still: poses[Math.floor(rand() * poses.length)],\\n    beat: beats[Math.floor(rand() * beats.length)],\\n    lean: 'header',\\n  };\\n}\\n\\n/** Windows on the shared clock, in seconds. */\\nexport function medleyWindow(t) {\\n  if (t < 55) return { index: 0, phase: 'play', local: t };\\n  if (t < 65) return { index: 0, phase: 'gap', local: t - 55 };\\n  if (t < 120) return { index: 1, phase: 'play', local: t - 65 };\\n  if (t < 130) return { index: 1, phase: 'gap', local: t - 120 };\\n  if (t < 185) return { index: 2, phase: 'play', local: t - 130 };\\n  return { index: 2, phase: 'done', local: t - 185 };\\n}\\n\\nexport const EVENT_NAMES = ['Stillness', 'Beat', 'Balance'];\\n\\nexport function normalise(raw, max) {\\n  if (!(max > 0)) return 0;\\n  return Math.max(0, Math.min(1000, Math.round((raw / max) * 1000)));\\n}\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"16766499-c6f6-46b5-b6fc-b1112bf4ce5e"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_35","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Writing the main simulation file, sims.js.","signature":"I12hhinD/NE3J/A2TxnTfgAq53evJiJKVGHXvf93N3KyXLSDl13s/sDRharfrCfCAUiq9dS443Y6AQ4YwZTOOFOmv6vu4hLoAA1LyPQY2p9qqc9IqkPiXn2r"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-294384f2-8ffb-43fc-a762-13b9ae1a26c5-69","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/core/sims.js","new_string":"import { ACTIVITY_BY_ID } from '../data/activities.js';\nimport { Dot } from './dot.js';\nimport { BotDriver } from './drivers.js';\nimport { starsFor } from './score.js';\n\nconst ZERO = { x: 0, y: 0, breath: false, stepL: false, stepR: false, confirm: false, depth: 0, edgeL: false, edgeR: false };\n\nfunction clamp(v, a, b) {\n  return Math.max(a, Math.min(b, v));\n}\nfunction lerp(a, b, t) {\n  return a + (b - a) * t;\n}\n\nexport class Sim {\n  constructor(def, opts = {}) {\n    this.def = def;\n    this.opts = opts;\n    this.T = opts.tunables;\n    this.rand = opts.rand;\n    this.skill = opts.skill || 'idle';\n    this.hard = !!opts.hard;\n    this.gentle = !!opts.gentle;\n    this.god = !!opts.god;\n    this.practiceOn = opts.first !== false && opts.practice !== false;\n    this.dot = new Dot(opts.rand);\n    this.botRand = opts.botRand || opts.rand;\n    this.bot = new BotDriver(this.skill, this.botRand, () => this.botTarget());\n    this.phase = 'intro';\n    this.phaseT = 0;\n    this.elapsed = 0;\n    this.playT = 0;\n    this.done = false;\n    this.score = 0;\n    this.stars = 0;\n    this.seconds = 0;\n    this.note = '';\n    this.lied = false;\n    this.queue = [['intro', 2.2]];\n    if (this.practiceOn) this.queue.push(['practice', 8]);\n    this.queue.push(['countdown', 3], ['play', null], ['outro', 1.2]);\n    this.qi = 0;\n    this._built();\n  }\n  _built() {}\n  setSkill(skill) {\n    this.skill = skill || 'idle';\n    this.bot = new BotDriver(this.skill, this.botRand, () => this.botTarget());\n  }\n  ringOf(base) {\n    const scale = (this.T.ringScale ?? 1) * (this.gentle ? 1.25 : 1) * (this.hard ? 0.85 : 1);\n    return base * scale;\n  }\n  botTarget() {\n    return { x: 0, y: 0 };\n  }\n  auto(dt) {\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return { ...ZERO };\n    const u = this.bot.read(this.dot, dt);\n    return { ...ZERO, ...u };\n  }\n  playFinished() {\n    return this.playT >= (this.def.play || 30);\n  }\n  onStep() {}\n  onPhase() {}\n  step(dt, input) {\n    if (this.done) return;\n    const u = input || { ...ZERO };\n    this.elapsed += dt;\n    this.phaseT += dt;\n    if (this.phase === 'play' || this.phase === 'practice') this.onStep(dt, u, this.phase === 'play');\n    const limit = this.queue[this.qi][1];\n    const over = this.phase === 'play' && this.playFinished();\n    if ((limit != null && this.phaseT >= limit) || over) {\n      this.qi += 1;\n      if (this.qi >= this.queue.length) {\n        this.finish();\n        return;\n      }\n      this.phase = this.queue[this.qi][0];\n      this.phaseT = 0;\n      this.onPhase(this.phase);\n    }\n  }\n  finish() {\n    this.done = true;\n    this.seconds = this.playT;\n    this.scoreStars();\n  }\n  scoreStars() {\n    this.stars = starsFor(this.score, this.def.thresholds, this.T.starThresholdScale ?? 1);\n  }\n  stepDot(dt, u, m) {\n    const noiseMul = (this.gentle ? 0.8 : 1) * (m.noise ?? 1);\n    this.dot.step(dt, u.x || 0, u.y || 0, this.T, { ...m, noise: noiseMul });\n    if (this.god) {\n      const r = (m.ring ?? 0.4) * 0.92;\n      const d = Math.hypot(this.dot.x, this.dot.y);\n      if (d > r) {\n        const s = r / d;\n        this.dot.x *= s;\n        this.dot.y *= s;\n        this.dot.vx *= 0.2;\n        this.dot.vy *= 0.2;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nexport class StillSim extends Sim {\n  _built() {\n    this.inside = 0;\n    this.samples = 0;\n    this.breathSum = 0;\n    this.breathN = 0;\n    this.s = 0;\n    this.hold = this.def.hold;\n    this.settle = 4;\n    this.release = 2;\n  }\n  playFinished() {\n    return this.playT >= this.settle + this.hold + this.release;\n  }\n  ring() {\n    return this.ringOf(this.def.ring);\n  }\n  mods(scoring) {\n    const m = { noise: 1, inst: 1, bx: 0, by: 0, ring: this.ring() };\n    const twist = this.def.twist;\n    const k = this.hold > 0 ? clamp(this.playT / this.hold, 0, 1) : 0;\n    if (twist === 'bias') m.bx = (this.def.bias || 0.12) * Math.sin(0.45 * this.elapsed);\n    if (twist === 'ynoise') m.noise = this.def.noise || 1.3;\n    if (twist === 'ramp') m.noise = lerp(1, 1.5, clamp((this.playT - this.settle) / this.hold, 0, 1));\n    if (twist === 'plank') {\n      m.inst = 1.2;\n      if (this.playT > this.settle + 20) m.noise = 1.35;\n    }\n    if (this.def.breath && scoring) {\n      m.noise *= 1.25 - (this.T.breathBonus ?? 0.55) * this.s;\n    }\n    m.ring = this.ring();\n    return m;\n  }\n  auto(dt) {\n    const u = super.auto(dt);\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return u;\n    if (this.def.breath) {\n      const p = this.def.breath;\n      const ph = p ? (this.playT % p) / p : 0;\n      u.breath = ph < 0.5;\n    }\n    if (this.skill === 'sloppy') {\n      u.x += 0.35 * Math.sin(this.elapsed * 1.7);\n      u.y += 0.35 * Math.cos(this.elapsed * 1.3);\n    }\n    return u;\n  }\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\n    const m = this.mods(scoring);\n    this.stepDot(dt, u, m);\n    if (!scoring) return;\n    this.playT += dt;\n    const t = this.playT;\n    const inHold = t >= this.settle && t < this.settle + this.hold;\n    if (!inHold) return;\n    this.samples += 1;\n    if (Math.hypot(this.dot.x, this.dot.y) < m.ring) this.inside += 1;\n    if (this.def.breath) {\n      const p = this.def.breath;\n      const ph = (t % p) / p;\n      const inhale = ph < 0.5;\n      const correct = inhale ? !!u.breath : !u.breath;\n      this.s += ((correct ? 1 : 0) - this.s) * Math.min(1, dt / 0.12);\n      this.breathSum += this.s;\n      this.breathN += 1;\n    }\n  }\n  scoreStars() {\n    const inRing = this.samples ? this.inside / this.samples : 0;\n    if (this.def.breath && this.breathN) {\n      const b = this.breathSum / this.breathN;\n      this.score = 100 * (0.8 * inRing + 0.2 * b);\n    } else this.score = 100 * inRing;\n    super.scoreStars();\n  }\n}\n\nfunction repTarget(u) {\n  if (u < 0.4) return u / 0.4;\n  if (u < 0.55) return 1;\n  if (u < 0.9) return 1 - (u - 0.55) / 0.35;\n  return 0;\n}\nfunction repSlope(u) {\n  if (u < 0.4) return 1 / 0.4;\n  if (u < 0.55) return 0;\n  if (u < 0.9) return -1 / 0.35;\n  return 0;\n}\n\nexport class RepSim extends Sim {\n  _built() {\n    this.announced = this.def.reps;\n    this.total = this.def.reps + 2;\n    this.r = 0;\n    this.err = 0;\n    this.n = 0;\n    this.rep = 0;\n    this.gag = '';\n  }\n  tempo() {\n    return (this.def.tempo / (this.T.repTempoScale || 1)) * (this.hard ? 0.85 : 1);\n  }\n  playFinished() {\n    return this.playT >= this.total * this.tempo();\n  }\n  auto(dt) {\n    const tempo = this.tempo();\n    const uRep = this.playT > 0 ? (this.playT % tempo) / tempo : 0;\n    const target = repTarget(uRep);\n    const slope = repSlope(uRep) / tempo;\n    const lag = (this.T.repLag || 0.1) * (this.def.lag || 1);\n    let depth = 0;\n    if (this.skill === 'expert' || this.skill === 'good') depth = clamp(target + slope * lag, 0, 1);\n    else if (this.skill === 'average') depth = clamp(target * 0.75, 0, 1);\n    else if (this.skill === 'sloppy') depth = clamp(target * 0.25 + 0.1, 0, 1);\n    const side = this.rep % 2 === 0 ? 1 : -1;\n    return { ...ZERO, depth, x: this.def.axis === 'side' ? side * depth : 0, y: this.def.axis === 'up' ? depth : -depth };\n  }\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\n    const tempo = this.tempo();\n    if (scoring) this.playT += dt;\n    const clock = scoring ? this.playT : this.phaseT;\n    const rep = Math.min(this.total - 1, Math.floor(clock / tempo));\n    if (rep !== this.rep) {\n      this.rep = rep;\n      const n = rep + 1;\n      if (n === this.announced) this.gag = 'Last one.';\n      else if (n === this.announced + 1) this.gag = 'Last one.';\n      else if (n === this.announced + 2) {\n        this.gag = 'I lied. This is the last one.';\n        this.lied = true;\n      }\n    }\n    const uRep = (clock % tempo) / tempo;\n    const target = repTarget(uRep);\n    const lag = (this.T.repLag || 0.1) * (this.def.lag || 1);\n    let depth = u.depth || 0;\n    if (u.useRate) {\n      this.r = clamp(this.r + (u.rate || 0) * dt, 0, 1);\n    } else {\n      const k = Math.min(1, dt / lag);\n      this.r += (depth - this.r) * k;\n    }\n    const amp = (this.T.repFatigue || 0) * (rep / this.total) ** 2;\n    this.r = clamp(this.r + amp * Math.sin(40 * clock) * dt * 8, 0, 1);\n    if (scoring && uRep < 0.9) {\n      this.err += Math.abs(this.r - target);\n      this.n += 1;\n    }\n  }\n  scoreStars() {\n    const mean = this.n ? this.err / this.n : 1;\n    this.score = clamp(1 - 1.6 * mean, 0, 1) * 100;\n    super.scoreStars();\n  }\n}\n\nexport class HoopSim extends Sim {\n  _built() {\n    this.angle = 0;\n    this.omega = 0;\n    this.L = 1;\n    this.rot = 0;\n    this.drop = 0;\n    this.theta = 0;\n    this.catches = 0;\n    this.throwT = 6;\n    this.throw = null;\n  }\n  playFinished() {\n    return this.playT >= 60;\n  }\n  dirAt(t) {\n    if (t < 25) return 1;\n    if (t < 50) return -1;\n    return 0;\n  }\n  auto(dt) {\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return { ...ZERO };\n    const speed = this.skill === 'expert' || this.skill === 'good' ? 2 : this.skill === 'average' ? 1.15 : 0.35;\n    const want = this.dirAt(this.playT);\n    const spin = want === 0 ? 1 : want;\n    this.theta += spin * speed * Math.PI * 2 * dt;\n    return { ...ZERO, x: Math.cos(this.theta), y: Math.sin(this.theta) };\n  }\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\n    if (scoring) this.playT += dt;\n    const t = scoring ? this.playT : 0;\n    if (this.drop > 0) {\n      this.drop -= dt;\n      return;\n    }\n    const mag = Math.hypot(u.x, u.y);\n    if (mag > 0.5) {\n      const a = Math.atan2(u.y, u.x);\n      let d = a - this.angle;\n      while (d > Math.PI) d -= Math.PI * 2;\n      while (d < -Math.PI) d += Math.PI * 2;\n      this.angle = a;\n      const inst = d / Math.max(dt, 1e-4);\n      const k = 1 - Math.exp(-dt / 0.25);\n      this.omega += (inst - this.omega) * k;\n    } else {\n      this.omega += (0 - this.omega) * Math.min(1, dt / 0.25);\n    }\n    const rev = this.omega / (Math.PI * 2);\n    const want = this.dirAt(t);\n    const low = this.T.hoopLow ?? 0.9;\n    const high = (this.T.hoopHigh ?? 2.4) * (this.hard ? 0.9 : 1);\n    const signOk = want === 0 || rev * want > 0;\n    const inBand = Math.abs(rev) >= low && Math.abs(rev) <= high && signOk;\n    const wrong = want !== 0 && rev * want < -0.2;\n    const lift = this.T.hoopLiftRate ?? 0.35;\n    if (inBand) this.L += lift * dt;\n    else if (wrong) this.L -= 0.5 * dt;\n    else this.L -= 0.25 * dt;\n    this.L = clamp(this.L, 0, 1.4);\n    if (this.L <= 0) this.drop = 1.5;\n    if (scoring && inBand) this.rot += Math.abs(rev) * dt;\n    if (scoring) this.toss(dt, u, t);\n  }\n  toss(dt, u, t) {\n    if (!this.throw && t >= this.throwT) {\n      this.throw = { side: this.rand() < 0.5 ? -1 : 1, age: 0 };\n      this.throwT += 9;\n    }\n    if (!this.throw) return;\n    this.throw.age += dt;\n    const left = 1.5 - this.throw.age;\n    if (left < 0.4 && left > 0 && Math.abs(u.x) > 0.7 && Math.sign(u.x) === this.throw.side) {\n      this.catches += 1;\n      this.rot += 0.5;\n      this.throw = null;\n    } else if (this.throw.age >= 1.5) this.throw = null;\n  }\n  scoreStars() {\n    this.score = this.rot;\n    super.scoreStars();\n  }\n}\n\nconst STEP_BAR = 'L.R.L.R.LRL.R.L.R.';\n\nexport class StepSim extends Sim {\n  _built() {\n    this.notes = [];\n    const bpm = 104;\n    const step = 60 / bpm / 4;\n    const bars = 32;\n    let t = 0;\n    for (let b = 0; b < bars; b++) {\n      for (const ch of STEP_BAR) {\n        if (ch === 'L' || ch === 'R') this.notes.push({ t, foot: ch, hit: false });\n        t += step;\n      }\n    }\n    this.playLen = t;\n    this.p = 0;\n    this.g = 0;\n    this.o = 0;\n    this.miss = 0;\n    this.prevL = false;\n    this.prevR = false;\n    this.combo = 0;\n  }\n  playFinished() {\n    return this.playT >= this.playLen + 0.2;\n  }\n  auto() {\n    const win = 0.02;\n    const late = this.skill === 'sloppy' ? 0.12 : this.skill === 'average' ? 0.08 : this.skill === 'good' ? 0.04 : 0;\n    let stepL = false;\n    let stepR = false;\n    if (this.skill !== 'idle') {\n      for (const n of this.notes) {\n        if (n.hit) continue;\n        const when = n.t + late;\n        if (Math.abs(this.playT - when) <= win) {\n          if (n.foot === 'L') stepL = true;\n          else stepR = true;\n        }\n      }\n    }\n    return { ...ZERO, stepL, stepR, edgeL: stepL, edgeR: stepR };\n  }\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\n    if (scoring) this.playT += dt;\n    const judged = this.playT + (this.T.stepOffsetMs || 0) / 1000;\n    const scale = (this.T.stepWindow || 1) * (this.hard ? 0.85 : 1);\n    const P = 0.055 * scale;\n    const G = 0.1 * scale;\n    const O = 0.14 * scale;\n    const edgeL = !!u.stepL && !this.prevL;\n    const edgeR = !!u.stepR && !this.prevR;\n    this.prevL = !!u.stepL;\n    this.prevR = !!u.stepR;\n    if (!scoring) return;\n    if (edgeL) this.strike('L', judged, P, G, O);\n    if (edgeR) this.strike('R', judged, P, G, O);\n    for (const n of this.notes) {\n      if (!n.hit && judged > n.t + O) {\n        n.hit = true;\n        this.miss += 1;\n        this.combo = 0;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  strike(foot, judged, P, G, O) {\n    let best = null;\n    let bestAbs = 1e9;\n    for (const n of this.notes) {\n      if (n.hit || n.foot !== foot) continue;\n      const ad = Math.abs(judged - n.t);\n      if (ad < bestAbs) {\n        best = n;\n        bestAbs = ad;\n      }\n    }\n    if (!best || bestAbs > O) return;\n    best.hit = true;\n    if (bestAbs <= P) this.p += 1;\n    else if (bestAbs <= G) this.g += 1;\n    else this.o += 1;\n    this.combo += 1;\n  }\n  scoreStars() {\n    const N = this.notes.length || 1;\n    this.score = (100 * (this.p + 0.7 * this.g + 0.4 * this.o)) / N;\n    super.scoreStars();\n  }\n}\n\nexport class HeaderSim extends Sim {\n  _built() {\n    this.x = 0;\n    this.objs = [];\n    this.spawn = 0.4;\n    this.score = 0;\n    this.combo = 0;\n    this.daze = 0;\n    this.hitR = 0.2;\n  }\n  playFinished() {\n    return this.playT >= 60;\n  }\n  lane() {\n    return 2;\n  }\n  auto() {\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return { ...ZERO };\n    const soon = this.objs.filter((o) => !o.done).sort((a, b) => a.land - b.land)[0];\n    if (!soon) return { ...ZERO, x: -this.x * 0.5 };\n    let tx = soon.x;\n    const dodge = this.skill === 'expert' || this.skill === 'good' || this.skill === 'average';\n    if (soon.kind === 'flip' && dodge) tx = clamp(soon.x + (soon.x < 0 ? 0.7 : -0.7), -2, 2);\n    const err = tx - this.x;\n    const gain = this.skill === 'sloppy' ? 0.25 : 1;\n    return { ...ZERO, x: clamp(err * 2 * gain, -1, 1) };\n  }\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\n    if (scoring) this.playT += dt;\n    const t = this.playT;\n    if (this.daze > 0) this.daze -= dt;\n    const speed = 4.5 * (this.daze > 0 ? 0 : u.x || 0);\n    this.x = clamp(this.x + speed * dt, -this.lane(), this.lane());\n    if (!scoring) return;\n    const span = lerp(1.3, 0.7, clamp(t / 60, 0, 1)) * (this.T.headerInterval || 1) * (this.hard ? 0.8 : 1);\n    this.spawn -= dt;\n    if (this.spawn <= 0 && t < 58) {\n      this.spawn += span;\n      const roll = this.rand();\n      const kind = roll < 0.7 ? 'coco' : roll < 0.95 ? 'flip' : 'pine';\n      const x = (this.rand() * 2 - 1) * 1.85;\n      this.objs.push({ x, kind, land: t + 1.4, done: false });\n    }\n    const radius = this.hitR * (this.hard ? 0.85 : 1);\n    for (const o of this.objs) {\n      if (o.done || t < o.land) continue;\n      o.done = true;\n      const hit = Math.abs(this.x - o.x) < radius;\n      if (o.kind === 'coco' && hit) {\n        this.combo += 1;\n        const tier = this.combo >= 20 ? 4 : this.combo >= 10 ? 3 : this.combo >= 5 ? 2 : 1;\n        this.score += 10 * tier;\n      } else if (o.kind === 'pine' && hit) {\n        this.combo += 1;\n        this.score += 30;\n      } else if (o.kind === 'flip' && hit) {\n        this.score -= 10;\n        this.combo = 0;\n        this.daze = 0.6;\n      } else if (o.kind === 'flip' && !hit) {\n        /* dodged */\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  scoreStars() {\n    super.scoreStars();\n  }\n}\n\nexport class SlackSim extends Sim {\n  _built() {\n    this.progress = 0;\n    this.falls = 0;\n    this.stun = 0;\n    this.finished = false;\n    this.gustT = 0;\n    this.gust = 0;\n    this.nextGust = 6;\n    this.kevin = false;\n  }\n  playFinished() {\n    return this.finished || this.playT >= 75;\n  }\n  auto(dt) {\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return { ...ZERO };\n    const u = this.bot.read(this.dot, dt);\n    const limit = this.skill === 'expert' ? 0.45 : this.skill === 'good' ? 0.45 : this.skill === 'average' ? 0.4 : 0.3;\n    u.y = Math.abs(this.dot.x) < limit && this.stun <= 0 ? 0.9 : 0;\n    return { ...ZERO, x: u.x, y: u.y };\n  }\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\n    if (scoring) this.playT += dt;\n    if (this.finished) return;\n    const walking = (u.y || 0) > 0.3 && this.stun <= 0;\n    const standInst = 1.2 / (this.T.dotInstability || 0.6);\n    const walkInst = (this.T.slackWalkInst || 2.6) / (this.T.dotInstability || 0.6);\n    const m = {\n      inst: (walking ? walkInst : standInst) * (this.hard ? 1.1 : 1),\n      noise: 1.25,\n      bx: this.gust * (this.T.gustForce || 1.6),\n      ring: 1,\n    };\n    if (this.progress >= 18 && this.progress < 24) {\n      m.bx += 0.45;\n      this.kevin = true;\n    }\n    this.stepDot(dt, { x: u.x || 0, y: 0 }, m);\n    this.dot.y = 0;\n    this.dot.vy = 0;\n    if (this.gustT > 0) this.gustT -= dt;\n    else this.gust = 0;\n    if (scoring && this.stun <= 0 && walking) this.progress += 1.1 * dt;\n    if (this.progress >= this.nextGust && this.gustT <= 0) {\n      this.gust = this.rand() < 0.5 ? -1 : 1;\n      this.gustT = 1;\n      this.nextGust += 6;\n    }\n    if (this.stun > 0) this.stun -= dt;\n    if (Math.abs(this.dot.x) > 1) {\n      this.falls += 1;\n      this.stun = 1.2;\n      this.dot.x = 0;\n      this.dot.vx = 0;\n      this.progress = this.progress >= 20 ? 20 : this.progress >= 10 ? 10 : 0;\n      this.nextGust = this.progress + 6;\n    }\n    if (this.progress >= 30) this.finished = true;\n  }\n  scoreStars() {\n    this.seconds = this.playT;\n    if (!this.finished) {\n      this.stars = 0;\n      this.score = Math.round(this.progress * 10);\n      return;\n    }\n    const time = this.playT;\n    if (this.falls === 0 && time < 32) this.stars = 3;\n    else if (this.falls <= 1 && time < 45) this.stars = 2;\n    else this.stars = 1;\n    if (this.hard && this.stars === 3 && time >= 30) this.stars = 2;\n    this.score = 1000 - 60 * this.falls - 8 * (time - 27);\n  }\n}\n\nexport const TRAY_BOARDS = [\n  {\n    id: 'straight',\n    lanes: [\n      { z: -1.35, color: 'R', xs: [-1.5, -0.9], cup: 1.45 },\n      { z: -0.45, color: 'B', xs: [-1.5, -0.9], cup: 1.45 },\n      { z: 0.45, color: 'Y', xs: [-1.5, -0.9], cup: 1.45 },\n      { z: 1.35, color: 'R', xs: [-1.5, -0.9], cup: 1.45 },\n    ],\n  },\n];\n\nexport class TraySim extends Sim {\n  _built() {\n    this.tiltX = 0;\n    this.tiltZ = 0;\n    this.wishX = 0;\n    this.wishZ = 0;\n    this.items = [];\n    const board = TRAY_BOARDS[0];\n    for (const lane of board.lanes) {\n      for (const x of lane.xs) {\n        this.items.push({\n          color: lane.color,\n          x,\n          z: lane.z,\n          vx: 0,\n          vz: 0,\n          cupX: lane.cup,\n          cupZ: lane.z,\n          homeX: x,\n          homeZ: lane.z,\n          done: false,\n          wait: 0,\n        });\n      }\n    }\n    this.got = 0;\n    this.bad = 0;\n  }\n  playFinished() {\n    return this.playT >= 60 || this.items.every((v) => v.done);\n  }\n  auto() {\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return { ...ZERO };\n    const open = this.items.filter((v) => !v.done && v.wait <= 0);\n    if (!open.length) return { ...ZERO };\n    open.sort((a, b) => Math.abs(a.cupX - a.x) - Math.abs(b.cupX - b.x));\n    const v = open[0];\n    const dx = v.cupX - v.x;\n    const dz = v.cupZ - v.z;\n    const gain = this.skill === 'sloppy' ? 0.15 : this.skill === 'average' ? 0.45 : 1;\n    return { ...ZERO, x: clamp(dx * gain, -1, 1), y: clamp(dz * gain, -1, 1) };\n  }\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\n    if (scoring) this.playT += dt;\n    const max = (this.T.trayMaxTilt || 14) * (Math.PI / 180);\n    this.wishX += ((u.x || 0) * max - this.wishX) * Math.min(1, dt / 0.12);\n    this.wishZ += ((-(u.y || 0)) * max - this.wishZ) * Math.min(1, dt / 0.12);\n    this.tiltX = this.wishX;\n    this.tiltZ = this.wishZ;\n    const g = this.T.trayGravity || 9.8;\n    const ax = Math.sin(this.tiltX) * g;\n    const az = Math.sin(this.tiltZ) * g;\n    for (const v of this.items) {\n      if (v.done) continue;\n      if (v.wait > 0) {\n        v.wait -= dt;\n        continue;\n      }\n      v.vx += ax * dt;\n      v.vz += az * dt;\n      v.vx *= Math.exp(-dt * 1.4);\n      v.vz *= Math.exp(-dt * 1.4);\n      v.x += v.vx * dt;\n      v.z += v.vz * dt;\n      if (v.x < -1.8) {\n        v.x = -1.8;\n        v.vx *= -0.2;\n      }\n      if (v.x > 1.8) {\n        v.x = 1.8;\n        v.vx *= -0.2;\n      }\n      const wall = v.homeZ;\n      if (Math.abs(v.z - wall) > 0.28) {\n        v.z = wall + Math.sign(v.z - wall) * 0.28;\n        v.vz *= -0.2;\n      }\n      if (Math.hypot(v.x - v.cupX, v.z - v.cupZ) < 0.3 && v.x > 1.05) {\n        v.done = true;\n        this.got += 1;\n        v.vx = 0;\n        v.vz = 0;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  scoreStars() {\n    const max = this.items.length * 10;\n    const raw = this.got * 10 - this.bad * 3;\n    this.score = max ? (100 * Math.max(0, raw)) / max : 0;\n    super.scoreStars();\n  }\n}\n\nexport class JogSim extends Sim {\n  _built() {\n    this.cadence = 0;\n    this.side = 'L';\n    this.badSide = 0;\n    this.bandT = 0;\n    this.stitch = 0;\n    this.over = 0;\n    this.lateral = 0;\n    this.dist = 0;\n    this.cups = [];\n    for (let i = 0; i < 18; i++) this.cups.push({ at: 12 + i * 11, x: i % 2 === 0 ? -0.8 : 0.8, got: false });\n    this.got = 0;\n    this.pulse = 0;\n    this.nextFoot = 'L';\n  }\n  playFinished() {\n    return this.playT >= 70;\n  }\n  auto(dt) {\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return { ...ZERO };\n    const target = this.T.jogTargetCadence || 3;\n    const rate = this.skill === 'sloppy' ? 1.2 : this.skill === 'average' ? 2.2 : this.skill === 'good' ? target : target;\n    this.pulse += dt;\n    const period = 1 / Math.max(0.5, rate);\n    let stepL = false;\n    let stepR = false;\n    if (this.pulse >= period) {\n      this.pulse -= period;\n      if (this.nextFoot === 'L') stepL = true;\n      else stepR = true;\n      this.nextFoot = this.nextFoot === 'L' ? 'R' : 'L';\n    }\n    const upcoming = this.cups.find((c) => !c.got && c.at >= this.dist - 1);\n    let x = 0;\n    if (upcoming) x = clamp((upcoming.x - this.lateral) * 1.4, -1, 1);\n    return { ...ZERO, x, stepL, stepR, edgeL: stepL, edgeR: stepR };\n  }\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\n    if (scoring) this.playT += dt;\n    const edgeL = !!u.edgeL || (!!u.stepL && !this.prevL);\n    const edgeR = !!u.edgeR || (!!u.stepR && !this.prevR);\n    this.prevL = !!u.stepL;\n    this.prevR = !!u.stepR;\n    let stepped = false;\n    if (edgeL) {\n      if (this.side === 'L') this.badSide += 1;\n      this.side = 'L';\n      stepped = true;\n    }\n    if (edgeR) {\n      if (this.side === 'R') this.badSide += 1;\n      this.side = 'R';\n      stepped = true;\n    }\n    if (edgeL && edgeR) stepped = true;\n    const target = this.T.jogTargetCadence || 3;\n    if (stepped && scoring) this.cadence += (target * 0 + 1 / Math.max(dt, 0.05) - this.cadence) * 0.0;\n    if (scoring && stepped) {\n      this.stepTimes = this.stepTimes || [];\n      this.stepTimes.push(this.playT);\n    }\n    if (scoring) {\n      const times = this.stepTimes || [];\n      const recent = times.filter((t) => this.playT - t < 2);\n      this.cadence = recent.length / 2;\n      const lo = target - 0.6;\n      const hi = target + 0.6;\n      let speed = 3;\n      if (this.cadence >= lo && this.cadence <= hi) {\n        this.bandT += dt;\n        speed = 3;\n        this.over = 0;\n      } else {\n        speed = 2;\n        if (this.cadence > hi) this.over += dt;\n        else this.over = 0;\n      }\n      if (this.over > 2) this.stitch = 3;\n      if (this.stitch > 0) {\n        this.stitch -= dt;\n        speed *= 0.5;\n      }\n      if (this.badSide && edgeL && this.side === 'L') speed = Math.max(0, speed - 0.5);\n      this.dist += speed * dt;\n      this.lateral = clamp(this.lateral + (u.x || 0) * 2.2 * dt, -1.5, 1.5);\n      for (const c of this.cups) {\n        if (!c.got && this.dist >= c.at && this.dist - speed * dt < c.at + 0.6) {\n          if (Math.abs(this.lateral - c.x) < 0.55) {\n            c.got = true;\n            this.got += 1;\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  scoreStars() {\n    const pace = this.playT > 0 ? this.bandT / this.playT : 0;\n    const cups = this.got / this.cups.length;\n    this.score = 70 * pace * 100 / 100 * 1 + 30 * cups;\n    this.score = 70 * pace + 30 * cups;\n    if (this.score <= 1) this.score *= 100;\n    else this.score = 70 * (pace * 100) / 100 + 30 * cups;\n    this.score = 70 * pace + 30 * cups;\n    // pace and cups are 0..1. The published score is on a 0..100 scale.\n    this.score = 100 * (0.7 * pace + 0.3 * cups);\n    super.scoreStars();\n  }\n}\n\nexport class PierSim extends Sim {\n  _built() {\n    this.attempt = 0;\n    this.best = 0;\n    this.phaseLocal = 'run';\n    this.localT = 0;\n    this.zoneT = 0;\n    this.speed = 6;\n    this.pressed = false;\n    this.flightIn = 0;\n    this.flightN = 0;\n    this.cannon = false;\n    this.attemptT = 0;\n  }\n  playFinished() {\n    return this.attempt >= 3;\n  }\n  botTarget() {\n    if (this.phaseLocal === 'run') return { x: 0, y: -0.6 };\n    return { x: 0, y: 0 };\n  }\n  auto(dt) {\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return { ...ZERO };\n    const u = this.bot.read(this.dot, dt);\n    const lip = this.phaseLocal === 'run' && this.localT >= 4.92 && this.localT < 5.08;\n    const cannon = this.phaseLocal === 'flight' && this.localT > 3.05 && this.localT < 3.25;\n    const press = (this.skill === 'expert' || this.skill === 'good') && (lip || cannon);\n    return { ...ZERO, x: u.x, y: u.y, confirm: press };\n  }\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\n    if (!scoring) return;\n    this.playT += dt;\n    this.localT += dt;\n    this.attemptT += dt;\n    if (this.phaseLocal === 'run') {\n      const inZone = this.dot.y < -0.4 && this.dot.y > -0.8;\n      if (inZone) this.zoneT += dt;\n      const m = { noise: 1, inst: 1, ring: 0.5 };\n      this.stepDot(dt, u, m);\n      if (u.confirm && !this.pressed && this.localT > 4.2) {\n        this.pressed = true;\n        this.lipDt = Math.abs(this.localT - 5);\n      }\n      if (this.localT >= 5) {\n        this.speed = 6 + 8 * clamp(this.zoneT / 5, 0, 1);\n        this.phaseLocal = 'flight';\n        this.localT = 0;\n        this.flightIn = 0;\n        this.flightN = 0;\n        const p = this.pressed ? clamp(1 - (this.lipDt || 0.25) / 0.25, 0, 1) : 0;\n        this.p = p;\n      }\n    } else if (this.phaseLocal === 'flight') {\n      const ring = this.ringOf(0.45);\n      const m = { inst: 3, noise: 1, ring };\n      this.stepDot(dt, u, m);\n      this.flightN += 1;\n      if (Math.hypot(this.dot.x, this.dot.y) < ring) this.flightIn += 1;\n      if (u.confirm && this.localT > 3) this.cannon = true;\n      if (this.localT >= 3.5) {\n        const ringFrac = this.flightN ? this.flightIn / this.flightN : 0;\n        const dist = this.speed * (0.8 + 0.6 * (this.p || 0)) * (0.6 + 0.4 * ringFrac) * (this.T.pierBoost || 2.14);\n        if (dist > this.best) this.best = dist;\n        this.attempt += 1;\n        this.phaseLocal = 'run';\n        this.localT = 0;\n        this.zoneT = 0;\n        this.pressed = false;\n        this.speed = 6;\n        this.p = 0;\n        this.dot.x = 0;\n        this.dot.y = 0;\n        this.dot.vx = 0;\n        this.dot.vy = 0;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  scoreStars() {\n    this.score = this.best;\n    super.scoreStars();\n  }\n}\n\nexport const LONG_EVENTS = [\n  { t: 0, ring: 0.4, say: 'Stand.' },\n  { t: 10, bias: 0.1 },\n  { t: 20, impulse: -0.6 },\n  { t: 30, ring: 0.34 },\n  { t: 35, noise: 1.2 },\n  { t: 45, say: 'Ignore her.' },\n  { t: 50, ring: 0.28 },\n  { t: 55, drift: true },\n  { t: 65, shake: true },\n  { t: 75, ring: 0.24, noise: 1, swell: true },\n  { t: 85, bias: 0, impulse: 0.35 },\n  { t: 90, say: 'You may blink.' },\n];\n\nexport class LongSim extends StillSim {\n  _built() {\n    super._built();\n    this.hold = 90;\n    this.settle = 0;\n    this.release = 0;\n    this.ringNow = 0.4;\n    this.bias = 0;\n    this.noiseMul = 1;\n    this.fired = new Set();\n    this.says = [];\n  }\n  playFinished() {\n    return this.playT >= 90;\n  }\n  ring() {\n    return this.ringOf(this.ringNow);\n  }\n  mods() {\n    return { noise: this.noiseMul, inst: 1, bx: this.bias, by: 0, ring: this.ring() };\n  }\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\n    if (scoring) {\n      this.playT += dt;\n      for (const ev of LONG_EVENTS) {\n        if (this.playT >= ev.t && !this.fired.has(ev.t)) {\n          this.fired.add(ev.t);\n          if (ev.ring) this.ringNow = ev.ring;\n          if (ev.bias !== undefined) this.bias = ev.bias;\n          if (ev.noise) this.noiseMul = ev.noise;\n          if (ev.impulse) this.dot.vy += ev.impulse;\n          if (ev.shake) this.dot.vx += (this.rand() - 0.5) * 0.8;\n          if (ev.say) this.says.push(ev.say);\n        }\n      }\n    }\n    const m = this.mods();\n    this.stepDot(dt, u, m);\n    if (!scoring) return;\n    this.samples += 1;\n    if (Math.hypot(this.dot.x, this.dot.y) < m.ring) this.inside += 1;\n  }\n}\n\nexport class WeighSim {\n  constructor(kind, opts) {\n    this.kind = kind;\n    this.T = opts.tunables;\n    this.rand = opts.rand;\n    this.skill = opts.skill || 'idle';\n    this.dot = new Dot(opts.rand);\n    this.bot = new BotDriver(this.skill, opts.botRand || opts.rand, () => this.target());\n    this.t = 0;\n    this.done = false;\n    this.Tscore = 0;\n    this.samples = [];\n    this.hold = 0;\n    this.hit = 0;\n    this.idx = 0;\n    this.targets = [\n      { x: -0.7, y: 0 },\n      { x: 0.7, y: 0 },\n      { x: 0, y: 0.55 },\n    ];\n  }\n  target() {\n    if (this.kind === 'lean') return this.targets[Math.min(this.idx, 2)];\n    if (this.kind === 'chase') {\n      return { x: 0.42 * Math.sin(0.7 * this.t), y: 0.32 * Math.sin(1.05 * this.t + 0.4) };\n    }\n    return { x: 0, y: 0 };\n  }\n  auto(dt) {\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return { ...ZERO };\n    return { ...ZERO, ...this.bot.read(this.dot, dt) };\n  }\n  step(dt, input) {\n    if (this.done) return;\n    const u = input || { ...ZERO };\n    this.t += dt;\n    this.dot.step(dt, u.x || 0, u.y || 0, this.T, {});\n    if (this.kind === 'still') {\n      if (this.t > 3 && this.t < 14) this.samples.push(Math.hypot(this.dot.x, this.dot.y) < 0.3 ? 1 : 0);\n    } else if (this.kind === 'lean') {\n      const tgt = this.targets[this.idx];\n      if (tgt && Math.hypot(this.dot.x - tgt.x, this.dot.y - tgt.y) < 0.1) this.hold += dt;\n      else this.hold = Math.max(0, this.hold - dt * 0.5);\n      if (this.hold >= 1.5 && this.idx < 3) {\n        this.hit += 1;\n        this.idx += 1;\n        this.hold = 0;\n      }\n    } else if (this.t > 1) {\n      const tgt = this.target();\n      this.samples.push(Math.hypot(this.dot.x - tgt.x, this.dot.y - tgt.y));\n    }\n    if (this.t >= 14) this.finish();\n  }\n  finish() {\n    this.done = true;\n    if (this.kind === 'still') this.Tscore = this.samples.length ? this.samples.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) / this.samples.length : 0;\n    else if (this.kind === 'lean') this.Tscore = this.hit / 3;\n    else {\n      const mean = this.samples.length ? this.samples.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) / this.samples.length : 1;\n      this.Tscore = clamp(1 - mean * 2, 0, 1);\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nconst KINDS = {\n  still: StillSim,\n  reps: RepSim,\n  hoop: HoopSim,\n  step: StepSim,\n  header: HeaderSim,\n  slack: SlackSim,\n  tray: TraySim,\n  jog: JogSim,\n  pier: PierSim,\n  long: LongSim,\n};\n\nexport function createSim(id, opts) {\n  const def = typeof id === 'string' ? ACTIVITY_BY_ID[id] : id;\n  if (!def) throw new Error('unknown activity ' + id);\n  const Ctor = KINDS[def.kind];\n  if (!Ctor) throw new Error('unknown kind ' + def.kind);\n  return new Ctor(def, opts);\n}\n\nexport function simulate(id, opts) {\n  const sim = createSim(id, opts);\n  const dt = 1 / 60;\n  let guard = 0;\n  while (!sim.done && guard < 60 * 200) {\n    const u = sim.auto(dt);\n    sim.step(dt, u);\n    guard += 1;\n  }\n  return sim;\n}\n","old_string":""}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10519,"output_tokens":11945,"cache_read_input_tokens":177024,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"7c495476-b8e9-4407-9649-bd18ea6494d5"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-294384f2-8ffb-43fc-a762-13b9ae1a26c5-69","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"import { ACTIVITY_BY_ID } from '../data/activities.js';\\nimport { Dot } from './dot.js';\\nimport { BotDriver } from './drivers.js';\\nimport { starsFor } from './score.js';\\n\\nconst ZERO = { x: 0, y: 0, breath: false, stepL: false, stepR: false, confirm: false, depth: 0, edgeL: false, edgeR: false };\\n\\nfunction clamp(v, a, b) {\\n  return Math.max(a, Math.min(b, v));\\n}\\nfunction lerp(a, b, t) {\\n  return a + (b - a) * t;\\n}\\n\\nexport class Sim {\\n  constructor(def, opts = {}) {\\n    this.def = def;\\n    this.opts = opts;\\n    this.T = opts.tunables;\\n    this.rand = opts.rand;\\n    this.skill = opts.skill || 'idle';\\n    this.hard = !!opts.hard;\\n    this.gentle = !!opts.gentle;\\n    this.god = !!opts.god;\\n    this.practiceOn = opts.first !== false && opts.practice !== false;\\n    this.dot = new Dot(opts.rand);\\n    this.botRand = opts.botRand || opts.rand;\\n    this.bot = new BotDriver(this.skill, this.botRand, () => this.botTarget());\\n    this.phase = 'intro';\\n    this.phaseT = 0;\\n    this.elapsed = 0;\\n    this.playT = 0;\\n    this.done = false;\\n    this.score = 0;\\n    this.stars = 0;\\n    this.seconds = 0;\\n    this.note = '';\\n    this.lied = false;\\n    this.queue = [['intro', 2.2]];\\n    if (this.practiceOn) this.queue.push(['practice', 8]);\\n    this.queue.push(['countdown', 3], ['play', null], ['outro', 1.2]);\\n    this.qi = 0;\\n    this._built();\\n  }\\n  _built() {}\\n  setSkill(skill) {\\n    this.skill = skill || 'idle';\\n    this.bot = new BotDriver(this.skill, this.botRand, () => this.botTarget());\\n  }\\n  ringOf(base) {\\n    const scale = (this.T.ringScale ?? 1) * (this.gentle ? 1.25 : 1) * (this.hard ? 0.85 : 1);\\n    return base * scale;\\n  }\\n  botTarget() {\\n    return { x: 0, y: 0 };\\n  }\\n  auto(dt) {\\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return { ...ZERO };\\n    const u = this.bot.read(this.dot, dt);\\n    return { ...ZERO, ...u };\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n    return this.playT >= (this.def.play || 30);\\n  }\\n  onStep() {}\\n  onPhase() {}\\n  step(dt, input) {\\n    if (this.done) return;\\n    const u = input || { ...ZERO };\\n    this.elapsed += dt;\\n    this.phaseT += dt;\\n    if (this.phase === 'play' || this.phase === 'practice') this.onStep(dt, u, this.phase === 'play');\\n    const limit = this.queue[this.qi][1];\\n    const over = this.phase === 'play' && this.playFinished();\\n    if ((limit != null && this.phaseT >= limit) || over) {\\n      this.qi += 1;\\n      if (this.qi >= this.queue.length) {\\n        this.finish();\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      this.phase = this.queue[this.qi][0];\\n      this.phaseT = 0;\\n      this.onPhase(this.phase);\\n    }\\n  }\\n  finish() {\\n    this.done = true;\\n    this.seconds = this.playT;\\n    this.scoreStars();\\n  }\\n  scoreStars() {\\n    this.stars = starsFor(this.score, this.def.thresholds, this.T.starThresholdScale ?? 1);\\n  }\\n  stepDot(dt, u, m) {\\n    const noiseMul = (this.gentle ? 0.8 : 1) * (m.noise ?? 1);\\n    this.dot.step(dt, u.x || 0, u.y || 0, this.T, { ...m, noise: noiseMul });\\n    if (this.god) {\\n      const r = (m.ring ?? 0.4) * 0.92;\\n      const d = Math.hypot(this.dot.x, this.dot.y);\\n      if (d > r) {\\n        const s = r / d;\\n        this.dot.x *= s;\\n        this.dot.y *= s;\\n        this.dot.vx *= 0.2;\\n        this.dot.vy *= 0.2;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport class StillSim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.inside = 0;\\n    this.samples = 0;\\n    this.breathSum = 0;\\n    this.breathN = 0;\\n    this.s = 0;\\n    this.hold = this.def.hold;\\n    this.settle = 4;\\n    this.release = 2;\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n    return this.playT >= this.settle + this.hold + this.release;\\n  }\\n  ring() {\\n    return this.ringOf(this.def.ring);\\n  }\\n  mods(scoring) {\\n    const m = { noise: 1, inst: 1, bx: 0, by: 0, ring: this.ring() };\\n    const twist = this.def.twist;\\n    const k = this.hold > 0 ? clamp(this.playT / this.hold, 0, 1) : 0;\\n    if (twist === 'bias') m.bx = (this.def.bias || 0.12) * Math.sin(0.45 * this.elapsed);\\n    if (twist === 'ynoise') m.noise = this.def.noise || 1.3;\\n    if (twist === 'ramp') m.noise = lerp(1, 1.5, clamp((this.playT - this.settle) / this.hold, 0, 1));\\n    if (twist === 'plank') {\\n      m.inst = 1.2;\\n      if (this.playT > this.settle + 20) m.noise = 1.35;\\n    }\\n    if (this.def.breath && scoring) {\\n      m.noise *= 1.25 - (this.T.breathBonus ?? 0.55) * this.s;\\n    }\\n    m.ring = this.ring();\\n    return m;\\n  }\\n  auto(dt) {\\n    const u = super.auto(dt);\\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return u;\\n    if (this.def.breath) {\\n      const p = this.def.breath;\\n      const ph = p ? (this.playT % p) / p : 0;\\n      u.breath = ph < 0.5;\\n    }\\n    if (this.skill === 'sloppy') {\\n      u.x += 0.35 * Math.sin(this.elapsed * 1.7);\\n      u.y += 0.35 * Math.cos(this.elapsed * 1.3);\\n    }\\n    return u;\\n  }\\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\\n    const m = this.mods(scoring);\\n    this.stepDot(dt, u, m);\\n    if (!scoring) return;\\n    this.playT += dt;\\n    const t = this.playT;\\n    const inHold = t >= this.settle && t < this.settle + this.hold;\\n    if (!inHold) return;\\n    this.samples += 1;\\n    if (Math.hypot(this.dot.x, this.dot.y) < m.ring) this.inside += 1;\\n    if (this.def.breath) {\\n      const p = this.def.breath;\\n      const ph = (t % p) / p;\\n      const inhale = ph < 0.5;\\n      const correct = inhale ? !!u.breath : !u.breath;\\n      this.s += ((correct ? 1 : 0) - this.s) * Math.min(1, dt / 0.12);\\n      this.breathSum += this.s;\\n      this.breathN += 1;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  scoreStars() {\\n    const inRing = this.samples ? this.inside / this.samples : 0;\\n    if (this.def.breath && this.breathN) {\\n      const b = this.breathSum / this.breathN;\\n      this.score = 100 * (0.8 * inRing + 0.2 * b);\\n    } else this.score = 100 * inRing;\\n    super.scoreStars();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction repTarget(u) {\\n  if (u < 0.4) return u / 0.4;\\n  if (u < 0.55) return 1;\\n  if (u < 0.9) return 1 - (u - 0.55) / 0.35;\\n  return 0;\\n}\\nfunction repSlope(u) {\\n  if (u < 0.4) return 1 / 0.4;\\n  if (u < 0.55) return 0;\\n  if (u < 0.9) return -1 / 0.35;\\n  return 0;\\n}\\n\\nexport class RepSim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.announced = this.def.reps;\\n    this.total = this.def.reps + 2;\\n    this.r = 0;\\n    this.err = 0;\\n    this.n = 0;\\n    this.rep = 0;\\n    this.gag = '';\\n  }\\n  tempo() {\\n    return (this.def.tempo / (this.T.repTempoScale || 1)) * (this.hard ? 0.85 : 1);\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n    return this.playT >= this.total * this.tempo();\\n  }\\n  auto(dt) {\\n    const tempo = this.tempo();\\n    const uRep = this.playT > 0 ? (this.playT % tempo) / tempo : 0;\\n    const target = repTarget(uRep);\\n    const slope = repSlope(uRep) / tempo;\\n    const lag = (this.T.repLag || 0.1) * (this.def.lag || 1);\\n    let depth = 0;\\n    if (this.skill === 'expert' || this.skill === 'good') depth = clamp(target + slope * lag, 0, 1);\\n    else if (this.skill === 'average') depth = clamp(target * 0.75, 0, 1);\\n    else if (this.skill === 'sloppy') depth = clamp(target * 0.25 + 0.1, 0, 1);\\n    const side = this.rep % 2 === 0 ? 1 : -1;\\n    return { ...ZERO, depth, x: this.def.axis === 'side' ? side * depth : 0, y: this.def.axis === 'up' ? depth : -depth };\\n  }\\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\\n    const tempo = this.tempo();\\n    if (scoring) this.playT += dt;\\n    const clock = scoring ? this.playT : this.phaseT;\\n    const rep = Math.min(this.total - 1, Math.floor(clock / tempo));\\n    if (rep !== this.rep) {\\n      this.rep = rep;\\n      const n = rep + 1;\\n      if (n === this.announced) this.gag = 'Last one.';\\n      else if (n === this.announced + 1) this.gag = 'Last one.';\\n      else if (n === this.announced + 2) {\\n        this.gag = 'I lied. This is the last one.';\\n        this.lied = true;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    const uRep = (clock % tempo) / tempo;\\n    const target = repTarget(uRep);\\n    const lag = (this.T.repLag || 0.1) * (this.def.lag || 1);\\n    let depth = u.depth || 0;\\n    if (u.useRate) {\\n      this.r = clamp(this.r + (u.rate || 0) * dt, 0, 1);\\n    } else {\\n      const k = Math.min(1, dt / lag);\\n      this.r += (depth - this.r) * k;\\n    }\\n    const amp = (this.T.repFatigue || 0) * (rep / this.total) ** 2;\\n    this.r = clamp(this.r + amp * Math.sin(40 * clock) * dt * 8, 0, 1);\\n    if (scoring && uRep < 0.9) {\\n      this.err += Math.abs(this.r - target);\\n      this.n += 1;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  scoreStars() {\\n    const mean = this.n ? this.err / this.n : 1;\\n    this.score = clamp(1 - 1.6 * mean, 0, 1) * 100;\\n    super.scoreStars();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport class HoopSim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.angle = 0;\\n    this.omega = 0;\\n    this.L = 1;\\n    this.rot = 0;\\n    this.drop = 0;\\n    this.theta = 0;\\n    this.catches = 0;\\n    this.throwT = 6;\\n    this.throw = null;\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n    return this.playT >= 60;\\n  }\\n  dirAt(t) {\\n    if (t < 25) return 1;\\n    if (t < 50) return -1;\\n    return 0;\\n  }\\n  auto(dt) {\\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return { ...ZERO };\\n    const speed = this.skill === 'expert' || this.skill === 'good' ? 2 : this.skill === 'average' ? 1.15 : 0.35;\\n    const want = this.dirAt(this.playT);\\n    const spin = want === 0 ? 1 : want;\\n    this.theta += spin * speed * Math.PI * 2 * dt;\\n    return { ...ZERO, x: Math.cos(this.theta), y: Math.sin(this.theta) };\\n  }\\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\\n    if (scoring) this.playT += dt;\\n    const t = scoring ? this.playT : 0;\\n    if (this.drop > 0) {\\n      this.drop -= dt;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const mag = Math.hypot(u.x, u.y);\\n    if (mag > 0.5) {\\n      const a = Math.atan2(u.y, u.x);\\n      let d = a - this.angle;\\n      while (d > Math.PI) d -= Math.PI * 2;\\n      while (d < -Math.PI) d += Math.PI * 2;\\n      this.angle = a;\\n      const inst = d / Math.max(dt, 1e-4);\\n      const k = 1 - Math.exp(-dt / 0.25);\\n      this.omega += (inst - this.omega) * k;\\n    } else {\\n      this.omega += (0 - this.omega) * Math.min(1, dt / 0.25);\\n    }\\n    const rev = this.omega / (Math.PI * 2);\\n    const want = this.dirAt(t);\\n    const low = this.T.hoopLow ?? 0.9;\\n    const high = (this.T.hoopHigh ?? 2.4) * (this.hard ? 0.9 : 1);\\n    const signOk = want === 0 || rev * want > 0;\\n    const inBand = Math.abs(rev) >= low && Math.abs(rev) <= high && signOk;\\n    const wrong = want !== 0 && rev * want < -0.2;\\n    const lift = this.T.hoopLiftRate ?? 0.35;\\n    if (inBand) this.L += lift * dt;\\n    else if (wrong) this.L -= 0.5 * dt;\\n    else this.L -= 0.25 * dt;\\n    this.L = clamp(this.L, 0, 1.4);\\n    if (this.L <= 0) this.drop = 1.5;\\n    if (scoring && inBand) this.rot += Math.abs(rev) * dt;\\n    if (scoring) this.toss(dt, u, t);\\n  }\\n  toss(dt, u, t) {\\n    if (!this.throw && t >= this.throwT) {\\n      this.throw = { side: this.rand() < 0.5 ? -1 : 1, age: 0 };\\n      this.throwT += 9;\\n    }\\n    if (!this.throw) return;\\n    this.throw.age += dt;\\n    const left = 1.5 - this.throw.age;\\n    if (left < 0.4 && left > 0 && Math.abs(u.x) > 0.7 && Math.sign(u.x) === this.throw.side) {\\n      this.catches += 1;\\n      this.rot += 0.5;\\n      this.throw = null;\\n    } else if (this.throw.age >= 1.5) this.throw = null;\\n  }\\n  scoreStars() {\\n    this.score = this.rot;\\n    super.scoreStars();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nconst STEP_BAR = 'L.R.L.R.LRL.R.L.R.';\\n\\nexport class StepSim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.notes = [];\\n    const bpm = 104;\\n    const step = 60 / bpm / 4;\\n    const bars = 32;\\n    let t = 0;\\n    for (let b = 0; b < bars; b++) {\\n      for (const ch of STEP_BAR) {\\n        if (ch === 'L' || ch === 'R') this.notes.push({ t, foot: ch, hit: false });\\n        t += step;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    this.playLen = t;\\n    this.p = 0;\\n    this.g = 0;\\n    this.o = 0;\\n    this.miss = 0;\\n    this.prevL = false;\\n    this.prevR = false;\\n    this.combo = 0;\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n    return this.playT >= this.playLen + 0.2;\\n  }\\n  auto() {\\n    const win = 0.02;\\n    const late = this.skill === 'sloppy' ? 0.12 : this.skill === 'average' ? 0.08 : this.skill === 'good' ? 0.04 : 0;\\n    let stepL = false;\\n    let stepR = false;\\n    if (this.skill !== 'idle') {\\n      for (const n of this.notes) {\\n        if (n.hit) continue;\\n        const when = n.t + late;\\n        if (Math.abs(this.playT - when) <= win) {\\n          if (n.foot === 'L') stepL = true;\\n          else stepR = true;\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    return { ...ZERO, stepL, stepR, edgeL: stepL, edgeR: stepR };\\n  }\\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\\n    if (scoring) this.playT += dt;\\n    const judged = this.playT + (this.T.stepOffsetMs || 0) / 1000;\\n    const scale = (this.T.stepWindow || 1) * (this.hard ? 0.85 : 1);\\n    const P = 0.055 * scale;\\n    const G = 0.1 * scale;\\n    const O = 0.14 * scale;\\n    const edgeL = !!u.stepL && !this.prevL;\\n    const edgeR = !!u.stepR && !this.prevR;\\n    this.prevL = !!u.stepL;\\n    this.prevR = !!u.stepR;\\n    if (!scoring) return;\\n    if (edgeL) this.strike('L', judged, P, G, O);\\n    if (edgeR) this.strike('R', judged, P, G, O);\\n    for (const n of this.notes) {\\n      if (!n.hit && judged > n.t + O) {\\n        n.hit = true;\\n        this.miss += 1;\\n        this.combo = 0;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  strike(foot, judged, P, G, O) {\\n    let best = null;\\n    let bestAbs = 1e9;\\n    for (const n of this.notes) {\\n      if (n.hit || n.foot !== foot) continue;\\n      const ad = Math.abs(judged - n.t);\\n      if (ad < bestAbs) {\\n        best = n;\\n        bestAbs = ad;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (!best || bestAbs > O) return;\\n    best.hit = true;\\n    if (bestAbs <= P) this.p += 1;\\n    else if (bestAbs <= G) this.g += 1;\\n    else this.o += 1;\\n    this.combo += 1;\\n  }\\n  scoreStars() {\\n    const N = this.notes.length || 1;\\n    this.score = (100 * (this.p + 0.7 * this.g + 0.4 * this.o)) / N;\\n    super.scoreStars();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport class HeaderSim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.x = 0;\\n    this.objs = [];\\n    this.spawn = 0.4;\\n    this.score = 0;\\n    this.combo = 0;\\n    this.daze = 0;\\n    this.hitR = 0.2;\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n    return this.playT >= 60;\\n  }\\n  lane() {\\n    return 2;\\n  }\\n  auto() {\\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return { ...ZERO };\\n    const soon = this.objs.filter((o) => !o.done).sort((a, b) => a.land - b.land)[0];\\n    if (!soon) return { ...ZERO, x: -this.x * 0.5 };\\n    let tx = soon.x;\\n    const dodge = this.skill === 'expert' || this.skill === 'good' || this.skill === 'average';\\n    if (soon.kind === 'flip' && dodge) tx = clamp(soon.x + (soon.x < 0 ? 0.7 : -0.7), -2, 2);\\n    const err = tx - this.x;\\n    const gain = this.skill === 'sloppy' ? 0.25 : 1;\\n    return { ...ZERO, x: clamp(err * 2 * gain, -1, 1) };\\n  }\\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\\n    if (scoring) this.playT += dt;\\n    const t = this.playT;\\n    if (this.daze > 0) this.daze -= dt;\\n    const speed = 4.5 * (this.daze > 0 ? 0 : u.x || 0);\\n    this.x = clamp(this.x + speed * dt, -this.lane(), this.lane());\\n    if (!scoring) return;\\n    const span = lerp(1.3, 0.7, clamp(t / 60, 0, 1)) * (this.T.headerInterval || 1) * (this.hard ? 0.8 : 1);\\n    this.spawn -= dt;\\n    if (this.spawn <= 0 && t < 58) {\\n      this.spawn += span;\\n      const roll = this.rand();\\n      const kind = roll < 0.7 ? 'coco' : roll < 0.95 ? 'flip' : 'pine';\\n      const x = (this.rand() * 2 - 1) * 1.85;\\n      this.objs.push({ x, kind, land: t + 1.4, done: false });\\n    }\\n    const radius = this.hitR * (this.hard ? 0.85 : 1);\\n    for (const o of this.objs) {\\n      if (o.done || t < o.land) continue;\\n      o.done = true;\\n      const hit = Math.abs(this.x - o.x) < radius;\\n      if (o.kind === 'coco' && hit) {\\n        this.combo += 1;\\n        const tier = this.combo >= 20 ? 4 : this.combo >= 10 ? 3 : this.combo >= 5 ? 2 : 1;\\n        this.score += 10 * tier;\\n      } else if (o.kind === 'pine' && hit) {\\n        this.combo += 1;\\n        this.score += 30;\\n      } else if (o.kind === 'flip' && hit) {\\n        this.score -= 10;\\n        this.combo = 0;\\n        this.daze = 0.6;\\n      } else if (o.kind === 'flip' && !hit) {\\n        /* dodged */\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  scoreStars() {\\n    super.scoreStars();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport class SlackSim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.progress = 0;\\n    this.falls = 0;\\n    this.stun = 0;\\n    this.finished = false;\\n    this.gustT = 0;\\n    this.gust = 0;\\n    this.nextGust = 6;\\n    this.kevin = false;\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n    return this.finished || this.playT >= 75;\\n  }\\n  auto(dt) {\\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return { ...ZERO };\\n    const u = this.bot.read(this.dot, dt);\\n    const limit = this.skill === 'expert' ? 0.45 : this.skill === 'good' ? 0.45 : this.skill === 'average' ? 0.4 : 0.3;\\n    u.y = Math.abs(this.dot.x) < limit && this.stun <= 0 ? 0.9 : 0;\\n    return { ...ZERO, x: u.x, y: u.y };\\n  }\\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\\n    if (scoring) this.playT += dt;\\n    if (this.finished) return;\\n    const walking = (u.y || 0) > 0.3 && this.stun <= 0;\\n    const standInst = 1.2 / (this.T.dotInstability || 0.6);\\n    const walkInst = (this.T.slackWalkInst || 2.6) / (this.T.dotInstability || 0.6);\\n    const m = {\\n      inst: (walking ? walkInst : standInst) * (this.hard ? 1.1 : 1),\\n      noise: 1.25,\\n      bx: this.gust * (this.T.gustForce || 1.6),\\n      ring: 1,\\n    };\\n    if (this.progress >= 18 && this.progress < 24) {\\n      m.bx += 0.45;\\n      this.kevin = true;\\n    }\\n    this.stepDot(dt, { x: u.x || 0, y: 0 }, m);\\n    this.dot.y = 0;\\n    this.dot.vy = 0;\\n    if (this.gustT > 0) this.gustT -= dt;\\n    else this.gust = 0;\\n    if (scoring && this.stun <= 0 && walking) this.progress += 1.1 * dt;\\n    if (this.progress >= this.nextGust && this.gustT <= 0) {\\n      this.gust = this.rand() < 0.5 ? -1 : 1;\\n      this.gustT = 1;\\n      this.nextGust += 6;\\n    }\\n    if (this.stun > 0) this.stun -= dt;\\n    if (Math.abs(this.dot.x) > 1) {\\n      this.falls += 1;\\n      this.stun = 1.2;\\n      this.dot.x = 0;\\n      this.dot.vx = 0;\\n      this.progress = this.progress >= 20 ? 20 : this.progress >= 10 ? 10 : 0;\\n      this.nextGust = this.progress + 6;\\n    }\\n    if (this.progress >= 30) this.finished = true;\\n  }\\n  scoreStars() {\\n    this.seconds = this.playT;\\n    if (!this.finished) {\\n      this.stars = 0;\\n      this.score = Math.round(this.progress * 10);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const time = this.playT;\\n    if (this.falls === 0 && time < 32) this.stars = 3;\\n    else if (this.falls <= 1 && time < 45) this.stars = 2;\\n    else this.stars = 1;\\n    if (this.hard && this.stars === 3 && time >= 30) this.stars = 2;\\n    this.score = 1000 - 60 * this.falls - 8 * (time - 27);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport const TRAY_BOARDS = [\\n  {\\n    id: 'straight',\\n    lanes: [\\n      { z: -1.35, color: 'R', xs: [-1.5, -0.9], cup: 1.45 },\\n      { z: -0.45, color: 'B', xs: [-1.5, -0.9], cup: 1.45 },\\n      { z: 0.45, color: 'Y', xs: [-1.5, -0.9], cup: 1.45 },\\n      { z: 1.35, color: 'R', xs: [-1.5, -0.9], cup: 1.45 },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n];\\n\\nexport class TraySim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.tiltX = 0;\\n    this.tiltZ = 0;\\n    this.wishX = 0;\\n    this.wishZ = 0;\\n    this.items = [];\\n    const board = TRAY_BOARDS[0];\\n    for (const lane of board.lanes) {\\n      for (const x of lane.xs) {\\n        this.items.push({\\n          color: lane.color,\\n          x,\\n          z: lane.z,\\n          vx: 0,\\n          vz: 0,\\n          cupX: lane.cup,\\n          cupZ: lane.z,\\n          homeX: x,\\n          homeZ: lane.z,\\n          done: false,\\n          wait: 0,\\n        });\\n      }\\n    }\\n    this.got = 0;\\n    this.bad = 0;\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n    return this.playT >= 60 || this.items.every((v) => v.done);\\n  }\\n  auto() {\\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return { ...ZERO };\\n    const open = this.items.filter((v) => !v.done && v.wait <= 0);\\n    if (!open.length) return { ...ZERO };\\n    open.sort((a, b) => Math.abs(a.cupX - a.x) - Math.abs(b.cupX - b.x));\\n    const v = open[0];\\n    const dx = v.cupX - v.x;\\n    const dz = v.cupZ - v.z;\\n    const gain = this.skill === 'sloppy' ? 0.15 : this.skill === 'average' ? 0.45 : 1;\\n    return { ...ZERO, x: clamp(dx * gain, -1, 1), y: clamp(dz * gain, -1, 1) };\\n  }\\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\\n    if (scoring) this.playT += dt;\\n    const max = (this.T.trayMaxTilt || 14) * (Math.PI / 180);\\n    this.wishX += ((u.x || 0) * max - this.wishX) * Math.min(1, dt / 0.12);\\n    this.wishZ += ((-(u.y || 0)) * max - this.wishZ) * Math.min(1, dt / 0.12);\\n    this.tiltX = this.wishX;\\n    this.tiltZ = this.wishZ;\\n    const g = this.T.trayGravity || 9.8;\\n    const ax = Math.sin(this.tiltX) * g;\\n    const az = Math.sin(this.tiltZ) * g;\\n    for (const v of this.items) {\\n      if (v.done) continue;\\n      if (v.wait > 0) {\\n        v.wait -= dt;\\n        continue;\\n      }\\n      v.vx += ax * dt;\\n      v.vz += az * dt;\\n      v.vx *= Math.exp(-dt * 1.4);\\n      v.vz *= Math.exp(-dt * 1.4);\\n      v.x += v.vx * dt;\\n      v.z += v.vz * dt;\\n      if (v.x < -1.8) {\\n        v.x = -1.8;\\n        v.vx *= -0.2;\\n      }\\n      if (v.x > 1.8) {\\n        v.x = 1.8;\\n        v.vx *= -0.2;\\n      }\\n      const wall = v.homeZ;\\n      if (Math.abs(v.z - wall) > 0.28) {\\n        v.z = wall + Math.sign(v.z - wall) * 0.28;\\n        v.vz *= -0.2;\\n      }\\n      if (Math.hypot(v.x - v.cupX, v.z - v.cupZ) < 0.3 && v.x > 1.05) {\\n        v.done = true;\\n        this.got += 1;\\n        v.vx = 0;\\n        v.vz = 0;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  scoreStars() {\\n    const max = this.items.length * 10;\\n    const raw = this.got * 10 - this.bad * 3;\\n    this.score = max ? (100 * Math.max(0, raw)) / max : 0;\\n    super.scoreStars();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport class JogSim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.cadence = 0;\\n    this.side = 'L';\\n    this.badSide = 0;\\n    this.bandT = 0;\\n    this.stitch = 0;\\n    this.over = 0;\\n    this.lateral = 0;\\n    this.dist = 0;\\n    this.cups = [];\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 18; i++) this.cups.push({ at: 12 + i * 11, x: i % 2 === 0 ? -0.8 : 0.8, got: false });\\n    this.got = 0;\\n    this.pulse = 0;\\n    this.nextFoot = 'L';\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n    return this.playT >= 70;\\n  }\\n  auto(dt) {\\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return { ...ZERO };\\n    const target = this.T.jogTargetCadence || 3;\\n    const rate = this.skill === 'sloppy' ? 1.2 : this.skill === 'average' ? 2.2 : this.skill === 'good' ? target : target;\\n    this.pulse += dt;\\n    const period = 1 / Math.max(0.5, rate);\\n    let stepL = false;\\n    let stepR = false;\\n    if (this.pulse >= period) {\\n      this.pulse -= period;\\n      if (this.nextFoot === 'L') stepL = true;\\n      else stepR = true;\\n      this.nextFoot = this.nextFoot === 'L' ? 'R' : 'L';\\n    }\\n    const upcoming = this.cups.find((c) => !c.got && c.at >= this.dist - 1);\\n    let x = 0;\\n    if (upcoming) x = clamp((upcoming.x - this.lateral) * 1.4, -1, 1);\\n    return { ...ZERO, x, stepL, stepR, edgeL: stepL, edgeR: stepR };\\n  }\\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\\n    if (scoring) this.playT += dt;\\n    const edgeL = !!u.edgeL || (!!u.stepL && !this.prevL);\\n    const edgeR = !!u.edgeR || (!!u.stepR && !this.prevR);\\n    this.prevL = !!u.stepL;\\n    this.prevR = !!u.stepR;\\n    let stepped = false;\\n    if (edgeL) {\\n      if (this.side === 'L') this.badSide += 1;\\n      this.side = 'L';\\n      stepped = true;\\n    }\\n    if (edgeR) {\\n      if (this.side === 'R') this.badSide += 1;\\n      this.side = 'R';\\n      stepped = true;\\n    }\\n    if (edgeL && edgeR) stepped = true;\\n    const target = this.T.jogTargetCadence || 3;\\n    if (stepped && scoring) this.cadence += (target * 0 + 1 / Math.max(dt, 0.05) - this.cadence) * 0.0;\\n    if (scoring && stepped) {\\n      this.stepTimes = this.stepTimes || [];\\n      this.stepTimes.push(this.playT);\\n    }\\n    if (scoring) {\\n      const times = this.stepTimes || [];\\n      const recent = times.filter((t) => this.playT - t < 2);\\n      this.cadence = recent.length / 2;\\n      const lo = target - 0.6;\\n      const hi = target + 0.6;\\n      let speed = 3;\\n      if (this.cadence >= lo && this.cadence <= hi) {\\n        this.bandT += dt;\\n        speed = 3;\\n        this.over = 0;\\n      } else {\\n        speed = 2;\\n        if (this.cadence > hi) this.over += dt;\\n        else this.over = 0;\\n      }\\n      if (this.over > 2) this.stitch = 3;\\n      if (this.stitch > 0) {\\n        this.stitch -= dt;\\n        speed *= 0.5;\\n      }\\n      if (this.badSide && edgeL && this.side === 'L') speed = Math.max(0, speed - 0.5);\\n      this.dist += speed * dt;\\n      this.lateral = clamp(this.lateral + (u.x || 0) * 2.2 * dt, -1.5, 1.5);\\n      for (const c of this.cups) {\\n        if (!c.got && this.dist >= c.at && this.dist - speed * dt < c.at + 0.6) {\\n          if (Math.abs(this.lateral - c.x) < 0.55) {\\n            c.got = true;\\n            this.got += 1;\\n          }\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  scoreStars() {\\n    const pace = this.playT > 0 ? this.bandT / this.playT : 0;\\n    const cups = this.got / this.cups.length;\\n    this.score = 70 * pace * 100 / 100 * 1 + 30 * cups;\\n    this.score = 70 * pace + 30 * cups;\\n    if (this.score <= 1) this.score *= 100;\\n    else this.score = 70 * (pace * 100) / 100 + 30 * cups;\\n    this.score = 70 * pace + 30 * cups;\\n    // pace and cups are 0..1. The published score is on a 0..100 scale.\\n    this.score = 100 * (0.7 * pace + 0.3 * cups);\\n    super.scoreStars();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport class PierSim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.attempt = 0;\\n    this.best = 0;\\n    this.phaseLocal = 'run';\\n    this.localT = 0;\\n    this.zoneT = 0;\\n    this.speed = 6;\\n    this.pressed = false;\\n    this.flightIn = 0;\\n    this.flightN = 0;\\n    this.cannon = false;\\n    this.attemptT = 0;\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n    return this.attempt >= 3;\\n  }\\n  botTarget() {\\n    if (this.phaseLocal === 'run') return { x: 0, y: -0.6 };\\n    return { x: 0, y: 0 };\\n  }\\n  auto(dt) {\\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return { ...ZERO };\\n    const u = this.bot.read(this.dot, dt);\\n    const lip = this.phaseLocal === 'run' && this.localT >= 4.92 && this.localT < 5.08;\\n    const cannon = this.phaseLocal === 'flight' && this.localT > 3.05 && this.localT < 3.25;\\n    const press = (this.skill === 'expert' || this.skill === 'good') && (lip || cannon);\\n    return { ...ZERO, x: u.x, y: u.y, confirm: press };\\n  }\\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\\n    if (!scoring) return;\\n    this.playT += dt;\\n    this.localT += dt;\\n    this.attemptT += dt;\\n    if (this.phaseLocal === 'run') {\\n      const inZone = this.dot.y < -0.4 && this.dot.y > -0.8;\\n      if (inZone) this.zoneT += dt;\\n      const m = { noise: 1, inst: 1, ring: 0.5 };\\n      this.stepDot(dt, u, m);\\n      if (u.confirm && !this.pressed && this.localT > 4.2) {\\n        this.pressed = true;\\n        this.lipDt = Math.abs(this.localT - 5);\\n      }\\n      if (this.localT >= 5) {\\n        this.speed = 6 + 8 * clamp(this.zoneT / 5, 0, 1);\\n        this.phaseLocal = 'flight';\\n        this.localT = 0;\\n        this.flightIn = 0;\\n        this.flightN = 0;\\n        const p = this.pressed ? clamp(1 - (this.lipDt || 0.25) / 0.25, 0, 1) : 0;\\n        this.p = p;\\n      }\\n    } else if (this.phaseLocal === 'flight') {\\n      const ring = this.ringOf(0.45);\\n      const m = { inst: 3, noise: 1, ring };\\n      this.stepDot(dt, u, m);\\n      this.flightN += 1;\\n      if (Math.hypot(this.dot.x, this.dot.y) < ring) this.flightIn += 1;\\n      if (u.confirm && this.localT > 3) this.cannon = true;\\n      if (this.localT >= 3.5) {\\n        const ringFrac = this.flightN ? this.flightIn / this.flightN : 0;\\n        const dist = this.speed * (0.8 + 0.6 * (this.p || 0)) * (0.6 + 0.4 * ringFrac) * (this.T.pierBoost || 2.14);\\n        if (dist > this.best) this.best = dist;\\n        this.attempt += 1;\\n        this.phaseLocal = 'run';\\n        this.localT = 0;\\n        this.zoneT = 0;\\n        this.pressed = false;\\n        this.speed = 6;\\n        this.p = 0;\\n        this.dot.x = 0;\\n        this.dot.y = 0;\\n        this.dot.vx = 0;\\n        this.dot.vy = 0;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  scoreStars() {\\n    this.score = this.best;\\n    super.scoreStars();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport const LONG_EVENTS = [\\n  { t: 0, ring: 0.4, say: 'Stand.' },\\n  { t: 10, bias: 0.1 },\\n  { t: 20, impulse: -0.6 },\\n  { t: 30, ring: 0.34 },\\n  { t: 35, noise: 1.2 },\\n  { t: 45, say: 'Ignore her.' },\\n  { t: 50, ring: 0.28 },\\n  { t: 55, drift: true },\\n  { t: 65, shake: true },\\n  { t: 75, ring: 0.24, noise: 1, swell: true },\\n  { t: 85, bias: 0, impulse: 0.35 },\\n  { t: 90, say: 'You may blink.' },\\n];\\n\\nexport class LongSim extends StillSim {\\n  _built() {\\n    super._built();\\n    this.hold = 90;\\n    this.settle = 0;\\n    this.release = 0;\\n    this.ringNow = 0.4;\\n    this.bias = 0;\\n    this.noiseMul = 1;\\n    this.fired = new Set();\\n    this.says = [];\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n    return this.playT >= 90;\\n  }\\n  ring() {\\n    return this.ringOf(this.ringNow);\\n  }\\n  mods() {\\n    return { noise: this.noiseMul, inst: 1, bx: this.bias, by: 0, ring: this.ring() };\\n  }\\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\\n    if (scoring) {\\n      this.playT += dt;\\n      for (const ev of LONG_EVENTS) {\\n        if (this.playT >= ev.t && !this.fired.has(ev.t)) {\\n          this.fired.add(ev.t);\\n          if (ev.ring) this.ringNow = ev.ring;\\n          if (ev.bias !== undefined) this.bias = ev.bias;\\n          if (ev.noise) this.noiseMul = ev.noise;\\n          if (ev.impulse) this.dot.vy += ev.impulse;\\n          if (ev.shake) this.dot.vx += (this.rand() - 0.5) * 0.8;\\n          if (ev.say) this.says.push(ev.say);\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    const m = this.mods();\\n    this.stepDot(dt, u, m);\\n    if (!scoring) return;\\n    this.samples += 1;\\n    if (Math.hypot(this.dot.x, this.dot.y) < m.ring) this.inside += 1;\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport class WeighSim {\\n  constructor(kind, opts) {\\n    this.kind = kind;\\n    this.T = opts.tunables;\\n    this.rand = opts.rand;\\n    this.skill = opts.skill || 'idle';\\n    this.dot = new Dot(opts.rand);\\n    this.bot = new BotDriver(this.skill, opts.botRand || opts.rand, () => this.target());\\n    this.t = 0;\\n    this.done = false;\\n    this.Tscore = 0;\\n    this.samples = [];\\n    this.hold = 0;\\n    this.hit = 0;\\n    this.idx = 0;\\n    this.targets = [\\n      { x: -0.7, y: 0 },\\n      { x: 0.7, y: 0 },\\n      { x: 0, y: 0.55 },\\n    ];\\n  }\\n  target() {\\n    if (this.kind === 'lean') return this.targets[Math.min(this.idx, 2)];\\n    if (this.kind === 'chase') {\\n      return { x: 0.42 * Math.sin(0.7 * this.t), y: 0.32 * Math.sin(1.05 * this.t + 0.4) };\\n    }\\n    return { x: 0, y: 0 };\\n  }\\n  auto(dt) {\\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return { ...ZERO };\\n    return { ...ZERO, ...this.bot.read(this.dot, dt) };\\n  }\\n  step(dt, input) {\\n    if (this.done) return;\\n    const u = input || { ...ZERO };\\n    this.t += dt;\\n    this.dot.step(dt, u.x || 0, u.y || 0, this.T, {});\\n    if (this.kind === 'still') {\\n      if (this.t > 3 && this.t < 14) this.samples.push(Math.hypot(this.dot.x, this.dot.y) < 0.3 ? 1 : 0);\\n    } else if (this.kind === 'lean') {\\n      const tgt = this.targets[this.idx];\\n      if (tgt && Math.hypot(this.dot.x - tgt.x, this.dot.y - tgt.y) < 0.1) this.hold += dt;\\n      else this.hold = Math.max(0, this.hold - dt * 0.5);\\n      if (this.hold >= 1.5 && this.idx < 3) {\\n        this.hit += 1;\\n        this.idx += 1;\\n        this.hold = 0;\\n      }\\n    } else if (this.t > 1) {\\n      const tgt = this.target();\\n      this.samples.push(Math.hypot(this.dot.x - tgt.x, this.dot.y - tgt.y));\\n    }\\n    if (this.t >= 14) this.finish();\\n  }\\n  finish() {\\n    this.done = true;\\n    if (this.kind === 'still') this.Tscore = this.samples.length ? this.samples.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) / this.samples.length : 0;\\n    else if (this.kind === 'lean') this.Tscore = this.hit / 3;\\n    else {\\n      const mean = this.samples.length ? this.samples.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) / this.samples.length : 1;\\n      this.Tscore = clamp(1 - mean * 2, 0, 1);\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nconst KINDS = {\\n  still: StillSim,\\n  reps: RepSim,\\n  hoop: HoopSim,\\n  step: StepSim,\\n  header: HeaderSim,\\n  slack: SlackSim,\\n  tray: TraySim,\\n  jog: JogSim,\\n  pier: PierSim,\\n  long: LongSim,\\n};\\n\\nexport function createSim(id, opts) {\\n  const def = typeof id === 'string' ? ACTIVITY_BY_ID[id] : id;\\n  if (!def) throw new Error('unknown activity ' + id);\\n  const Ctor = KINDS[def.kind];\\n  if (!Ctor) throw new Error('unknown kind ' + def.kind);\\n  return new Ctor(def, opts);\\n}\\n\\nexport function simulate(id, opts) {\\n  const sim = createSim(id, opts);\\n  const dt = 1 / 60;\\n  let guard = 0;\\n  while (!sim.done && guard < 60 * 200) {\\n    const u = sim.auto(dt);\\n    sim.step(dt, u);\\n    guard += 1;\\n  }\\n  return sim;\\n}\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/core/sims.js has been created successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/core/sims.js has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/core/sims.js\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"import { ACTIVITY_BY_ID } from '../data/activities.js';\\nimport { Dot } from './dot.js';\\nimport { BotDriver } from './drivers.js';\\nimport { starsFor } from './score.js';\\n\\nconst ZERO = { x: 0, y: 0, breath: false, stepL: false, stepR: false, confirm: false, depth: 0, edgeL: false, edgeR: false };\\n\\nfunction clamp(v, a, b) {\\n  return Math.max(a, Math.min(b, v));\\n}\\nfunction lerp(a, b, t) {\\n  return a + (b - a) * t;\\n}\\n\\nexport class Sim {\\n  constructor(def, opts = {}) {\\n    this.def = def;\\n    this.opts = opts;\\n    this.T = opts.tunables;\\n    this.rand = opts.rand;\\n    this.skill = opts.skill || 'idle';\\n    this.hard = !!opts.hard;\\n    this.gentle = !!opts.gentle;\\n    this.god = !!opts.god;\\n    this.practiceOn = opts.first !== false && opts.practice !== false;\\n    this.dot = new Dot(opts.rand);\\n    this.botRand = opts.botRand || opts.rand;\\n    this.bot = new BotDriver(this.skill, this.botRand, () => this.botTarget());\\n    this.phase = 'intro';\\n    this.phaseT = 0;\\n    this.elapsed = 0;\\n    this.playT = 0;\\n    this.done = false;\\n    this.score = 0;\\n    this.stars = 0;\\n    this.seconds = 0;\\n    this.note = '';\\n    this.lied = false;\\n    this.queue = [['intro', 2.2]];\\n    if (this.practiceOn) this.queue.push(['practice', 8]);\\n    this.queue.push(['countdown', 3], ['play', null], ['outro', 1.2]);\\n    this.qi = 0;\\n    this._built();\\n  }\\n  _built() {}\\n  setSkill(skill) {\\n    this.skill = skill || 'idle';\\n    this.bot = new BotDriver(this.skill, this.botRand, () => this.botTarget());\\n  }\\n  ringOf(base) {\\n    const scale = (this.T.ringScale ?? 1) * (this.gentle ? 1.25 : 1) * (this.hard ? 0.85 : 1);\\n    return base * scale;\\n  }\\n  botTarget() {\\n    return { x: 0, y: 0 };\\n  }\\n  auto(dt) {\\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return { ...ZERO };\\n    const u = this.bot.read(this.dot, dt);\\n    return { ...ZERO, ...u };\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n    return this.playT >= (this.def.play || 30);\\n  }\\n  onStep() {}\\n  onPhase() {}\\n  step(dt, input) {\\n    if (this.done) return;\\n    const u = input || { ...ZERO };\\n    this.elapsed += dt;\\n    this.phaseT += dt;\\n    if (this.phase === 'play' || this.phase === 'practice') this.onStep(dt, u, this.phase === 'play');\\n    const limit = this.queue[this.qi][1];\\n    const over = this.phase === 'play' && this.playFinished();\\n    if ((limit != null && this.phaseT >= limit) || over) {\\n      this.qi += 1;\\n      if (this.qi >= this.queue.length) {\\n        this.finish();\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      this.phase = this.queue[this.qi][0];\\n      this.phaseT = 0;\\n      this.onPhase(this.phase);\\n    }\\n  }\\n  finish() {\\n    this.done = true;\\n    this.seconds = this.playT;\\n    this.scoreStars();\\n  }\\n  scoreStars() {\\n    this.stars = starsFor(this.score, this.def.thresholds, this.T.starThresholdScale ?? 1);\\n  }\\n  stepDot(dt, u, m) {\\n    const noiseMul = (this.gentle ? 0.8 : 1) * (m.noise ?? 1);\\n    this.dot.step(dt, u.x || 0, u.y || 0, this.T, { ...m, noise: noiseMul });\\n    if (this.god) {\\n      const r = (m.ring ?? 0.4) * 0.92;\\n      const d = Math.hypot(this.dot.x, this.dot.y);\\n      if (d > r) {\\n        const s = r / d;\\n        this.dot.x *= s;\\n        this.dot.y *= s;\\n        this.dot.vx *= 0.2;\\n        this.dot.vy *= 0.2;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport class StillSim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.inside = 0;\\n    this.samples = 0;\\n    this.breathSum = 0;\\n    this.breathN = 0;\\n    this.s = 0;\\n    this.hold = this.def.hold;\\n    this.settle = 4;\\n    this.release = 2;\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n    return this.playT >= this.settle + this.hold + this.release;\\n  }\\n  ring() {\\n    return this.ringOf(this.def.ring);\\n  }\\n  mods(scoring) {\\n    const m = { noise: 1, inst: 1, bx: 0, by: 0, ring: this.ring() };\\n    const twist = this.def.twist;\\n    const k = this.hold > 0 ? clamp(this.playT / this.hold, 0, 1) : 0;\\n    if (twist === 'bias') m.bx = (this.def.bias || 0.12) * Math.sin(0.45 * this.elapsed);\\n    if (twist === 'ynoise') m.noise = this.def.noise || 1.3;\\n    if (twist === 'ramp') m.noise = lerp(1, 1.5, clamp((this.playT - this.settle) / this.hold, 0, 1));\\n    if (twist === 'plank') {\\n      m.inst = 1.2;\\n      if (this.playT > this.settle + 20) m.noise = 1.35;\\n    }\\n    if (this.def.breath && scoring) {\\n      m.noise *= 1.25 - (this.T.breathBonus ?? 0.55) * this.s;\\n    }\\n    m.ring = this.ring();\\n    return m;\\n  }\\n  auto(dt) {\\n    const u = super.auto(dt);\\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return u;\\n    if (this.def.breath) {\\n      const p = this.def.breath;\\n      const ph = p ? (this.playT % p) / p : 0;\\n      u.breath = ph < 0.5;\\n    }\\n    if (this.skill === 'sloppy') {\\n      u.x += 0.35 * Math.sin(this.elapsed * 1.7);\\n      u.y += 0.35 * Math.cos(this.elapsed * 1.3);\\n    }\\n    return u;\\n  }\\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\\n    const m = this.mods(scoring);\\n    this.stepDot(dt, u, m);\\n    if (!scoring) return;\\n    this.playT += dt;\\n    const t = this.playT;\\n    const inHold = t >= this.settle && t < this.settle + this.hold;\\n    if (!inHold) return;\\n    this.samples += 1;\\n    if (Math.hypot(this.dot.x, this.dot.y) < m.ring) this.inside += 1;\\n    if (this.def.breath) {\\n      const p = this.def.breath;\\n      const ph = (t % p) / p;\\n      const inhale = ph < 0.5;\\n      const correct = inhale ? !!u.breath : !u.breath;\\n      this.s += ((correct ? 1 : 0) - this.s) * Math.min(1, dt / 0.12);\\n      this.breathSum += this.s;\\n      this.breathN += 1;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  scoreStars() {\\n    const inRing = this.samples ? this.inside / this.samples : 0;\\n    if (this.def.breath && this.breathN) {\\n      const b = this.breathSum / this.breathN;\\n      this.score = 100 * (0.8 * inRing + 0.2 * b);\\n    } else this.score = 100 * inRing;\\n    super.scoreStars();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction repTarget(u) {\\n  if (u < 0.4) return u / 0.4;\\n  if (u < 0.55) return 1;\\n  if (u < 0.9) return 1 - (u - 0.55) / 0.35;\\n  return 0;\\n}\\nfunction repSlope(u) {\\n  if (u < 0.4) return 1 / 0.4;\\n  if (u < 0.55) return 0;\\n  if (u < 0.9) return -1 / 0.35;\\n  return 0;\\n}\\n\\nexport class RepSim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.announced = this.def.reps;\\n    this.total = this.def.reps + 2;\\n    this.r = 0;\\n    this.err = 0;\\n    this.n = 0;\\n    this.rep = 0;\\n    this.gag = '';\\n  }\\n  tempo() {\\n    return (this.def.tempo / (this.T.repTempoScale || 1)) * (this.hard ? 0.85 : 1);\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n    return this.playT >= this.total * this.tempo();\\n  }\\n  auto(dt) {\\n    const tempo = this.tempo();\\n    const uRep = this.playT > 0 ? (this.playT % tempo) / tempo : 0;\\n    const target = repTarget(uRep);\\n    const slope = repSlope(uRep) / tempo;\\n    const lag = (this.T.repLag || 0.1) * (this.def.lag || 1);\\n    let depth = 0;\\n    if (this.skill === 'expert' || this.skill === 'good') depth = clamp(target + slope * lag, 0, 1);\\n    else if (this.skill === 'average') depth = clamp(target * 0.75, 0, 1);\\n    else if (this.skill === 'sloppy') depth = clamp(target * 0.25 + 0.1, 0, 1);\\n    const side = this.rep % 2 === 0 ? 1 : -1;\\n    return { ...ZERO, depth, x: this.def.axis === 'side' ? side * depth : 0, y: this.def.axis === 'up' ? depth : -depth };\\n  }\\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\\n    const tempo = this.tempo();\\n    if (scoring) this.playT += dt;\\n    const clock = scoring ? this.playT : this.phaseT;\\n    const rep = Math.min(this.total - 1, Math.floor(clock / tempo));\\n    if (rep !== this.rep) {\\n      this.rep = rep;\\n      const n = rep + 1;\\n      if (n === this.announced) this.gag = 'Last one.';\\n      else if (n === this.announced + 1) this.gag = 'Last one.';\\n      else if (n === this.announced + 2) {\\n        this.gag = 'I lied. This is the last one.';\\n        this.lied = true;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    const uRep = (clock % tempo) / tempo;\\n    const target = repTarget(uRep);\\n    const lag = (this.T.repLag || 0.1) * (this.def.lag || 1);\\n    let depth = u.depth || 0;\\n    if (u.useRate) {\\n      this.r = clamp(this.r + (u.rate || 0) * dt, 0, 1);\\n    } else {\\n      const k = Math.min(1, dt / lag);\\n      this.r += (depth - this.r) * k;\\n    }\\n    const amp = (this.T.repFatigue || 0) * (rep / this.total) ** 2;\\n    this.r = clamp(this.r + amp * Math.sin(40 * clock) * dt * 8, 0, 1);\\n    if (scoring && uRep < 0.9) {\\n      this.err += Math.abs(this.r - target);\\n      this.n += 1;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  scoreStars() {\\n    const mean = this.n ? this.err / this.n : 1;\\n    this.score = clamp(1 - 1.6 * mean, 0, 1) * 100;\\n    super.scoreStars();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport class HoopSim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.angle = 0;\\n    this.omega = 0;\\n    this.L = 1;\\n    this.rot = 0;\\n    this.drop = 0;\\n    this.theta = 0;\\n    this.catches = 0;\\n    this.throwT = 6;\\n    this.throw = null;\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n    return this.playT >= 60;\\n  }\\n  dirAt(t) {\\n    if (t < 25) return 1;\\n    if (t < 50) return -1;\\n    return 0;\\n  }\\n  auto(dt) {\\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return { ...ZERO };\\n    const speed = this.skill === 'expert' || this.skill === 'good' ? 2 : this.skill === 'average' ? 1.15 : 0.35;\\n    const want = this.dirAt(this.playT);\\n    const spin = want === 0 ? 1 : want;\\n    this.theta += spin * speed * Math.PI * 2 * dt;\\n    return { ...ZERO, x: Math.cos(this.theta), y: Math.sin(this.theta) };\\n  }\\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\\n    if (scoring) this.playT += dt;\\n    const t = scoring ? this.playT : 0;\\n    if (this.drop > 0) {\\n      this.drop -= dt;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const mag = Math.hypot(u.x, u.y);\\n    if (mag > 0.5) {\\n      const a = Math.atan2(u.y, u.x);\\n      let d = a - this.angle;\\n      while (d > Math.PI) d -= Math.PI * 2;\\n      while (d < -Math.PI) d += Math.PI * 2;\\n      this.angle = a;\\n      const inst = d / Math.max(dt, 1e-4);\\n      const k = 1 - Math.exp(-dt / 0.25);\\n      this.omega += (inst - this.omega) * k;\\n    } else {\\n      this.omega += (0 - this.omega) * Math.min(1, dt / 0.25);\\n    }\\n    const rev = this.omega / (Math.PI * 2);\\n    const want = this.dirAt(t);\\n    const low = this.T.hoopLow ?? 0.9;\\n    const high = (this.T.hoopHigh ?? 2.4) * (this.hard ? 0.9 : 1);\\n    const signOk = want === 0 || rev * want > 0;\\n    const inBand = Math.abs(rev) >= low && Math.abs(rev) <= high && signOk;\\n    const wrong = want !== 0 && rev * want < -0.2;\\n    const lift = this.T.hoopLiftRate ?? 0.35;\\n    if (inBand) this.L += lift * dt;\\n    else if (wrong) this.L -= 0.5 * dt;\\n    else this.L -= 0.25 * dt;\\n    this.L = clamp(this.L, 0, 1.4);\\n    if (this.L <= 0) this.drop = 1.5;\\n    if (scoring && inBand) this.rot += Math.abs(rev) * dt;\\n    if (scoring) this.toss(dt, u, t);\\n  }\\n  toss(dt, u, t) {\\n    if (!this.throw && t >= this.throwT) {\\n      this.throw = { side: this.rand() < 0.5 ? -1 : 1, age: 0 };\\n      this.throwT += 9;\\n    }\\n    if (!this.throw) return;\\n    this.throw.age += dt;\\n    const left = 1.5 - this.throw.age;\\n    if (left < 0.4 && left > 0 && Math.abs(u.x) > 0.7 && Math.sign(u.x) === this.throw.side) {\\n      this.catches += 1;\\n      this.rot += 0.5;\\n      this.throw = null;\\n    } else if (this.throw.age >= 1.5) this.throw = null;\\n  }\\n  scoreStars() {\\n    this.score = this.rot;\\n    super.scoreStars();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nconst STEP_BAR = 'L.R.L.R.LRL.R.L.R.';\\n\\nexport class StepSim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.notes = [];\\n    const bpm = 104;\\n    const step = 60 / bpm / 4;\\n    const bars = 32;\\n    let t = 0;\\n    for (let b = 0; b < bars; b++) {\\n      for (const ch of STEP_BAR) {\\n        if (ch === 'L' || ch === 'R') this.notes.push({ t, foot: ch, hit: false });\\n        t += step;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    this.playLen = t;\\n    this.p = 0;\\n    this.g = 0;\\n    this.o = 0;\\n    this.miss = 0;\\n    this.prevL = false;\\n    this.prevR = false;\\n    this.combo = 0;\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n    return this.playT >= this.playLen + 0.2;\\n  }\\n  auto() {\\n    const win = 0.02;\\n    const late = this.skill === 'sloppy' ? 0.12 : this.skill === 'average' ? 0.08 : this.skill === 'good' ? 0.04 : 0;\\n    let stepL = false;\\n    let stepR = false;\\n    if (this.skill !== 'idle') {\\n      for (const n of this.notes) {\\n        if (n.hit) continue;\\n        const when = n.t + late;\\n        if (Math.abs(this.playT - when) <= win) {\\n          if (n.foot === 'L') stepL = true;\\n          else stepR = true;\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    return { ...ZERO, stepL, stepR, edgeL: stepL, edgeR: stepR };\\n  }\\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\\n    if (scoring) this.playT += dt;\\n    const judged = this.playT + (this.T.stepOffsetMs || 0) / 1000;\\n    const scale = (this.T.stepWindow || 1) * (this.hard ? 0.85 : 1);\\n    const P = 0.055 * scale;\\n    const G = 0.1 * scale;\\n    const O = 0.14 * scale;\\n    const edgeL = !!u.stepL && !this.prevL;\\n    const edgeR = !!u.stepR && !this.prevR;\\n    this.prevL = !!u.stepL;\\n    this.prevR = !!u.stepR;\\n    if (!scoring) return;\\n    if (edgeL) this.strike('L', judged, P, G, O);\\n    if (edgeR) this.strike('R', judged, P, G, O);\\n    for (const n of this.notes) {\\n      if (!n.hit && judged > n.t + O) {\\n        n.hit = true;\\n        this.miss += 1;\\n        this.combo = 0;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  strike(foot, judged, P, G, O) {\\n    let best = null;\\n    let bestAbs = 1e9;\\n    for (const n of this.notes) {\\n      if (n.hit || n.foot !== foot) continue;\\n      const ad = Math.abs(judged - n.t);\\n      if (ad < bestAbs) {\\n        best = n;\\n        bestAbs = ad;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (!best || bestAbs > O) return;\\n    best.hit = true;\\n    if (bestAbs <= P) this.p += 1;\\n    else if (bestAbs <= G) this.g += 1;\\n    else this.o += 1;\\n    this.combo += 1;\\n  }\\n  scoreStars() {\\n    const N = this.notes.length || 1;\\n    this.score = (100 * (this.p + 0.7 * this.g + 0.4 * this.o)) / N;\\n    super.scoreStars();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport class HeaderSim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.x = 0;\\n    this.objs = [];\\n    this.spawn = 0.4;\\n    this.score = 0;\\n    this.combo = 0;\\n    this.daze = 0;\\n    this.hitR = 0.2;\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n    return this.playT >= 60;\\n  }\\n  lane() {\\n    return 2;\\n  }\\n  auto() {\\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return { ...ZERO };\\n    const soon = this.objs.filter((o) => !o.done).sort((a, b) => a.land - b.land)[0];\\n    if (!soon) return { ...ZERO, x: -this.x * 0.5 };\\n    let tx = soon.x;\\n    const dodge = this.skill === 'expert' || this.skill === 'good' || this.skill === 'average';\\n    if (soon.kind === 'flip' && dodge) tx = clamp(soon.x + (soon.x < 0 ? 0.7 : -0.7), -2, 2);\\n    const err = tx - this.x;\\n    const gain = this.skill === 'sloppy' ? 0.25 : 1;\\n    return { ...ZERO, x: clamp(err * 2 * gain, -1, 1) };\\n  }\\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\\n    if (scoring) this.playT += dt;\\n    const t = this.playT;\\n    if (this.daze > 0) this.daze -= dt;\\n    const speed = 4.5 * (this.daze > 0 ? 0 : u.x || 0);\\n    this.x = clamp(this.x + speed * dt, -this.lane(), this.lane());\\n    if (!scoring) return;\\n    const span = lerp(1.3, 0.7, clamp(t / 60, 0, 1)) * (this.T.headerInterval || 1) * (this.hard ? 0.8 : 1);\\n    this.spawn -= dt;\\n    if (this.spawn <= 0 && t < 58) {\\n      this.spawn += span;\\n      const roll = this.rand();\\n      const kind = roll < 0.7 ? 'coco' : roll < 0.95 ? 'flip' : 'pine';\\n      const x = (this.rand() * 2 - 1) * 1.85;\\n      this.objs.push({ x, kind, land: t + 1.4, done: false });\\n    }\\n    const radius = this.hitR * (this.hard ? 0.85 : 1);\\n    for (const o of this.objs) {\\n      if (o.done || t < o.land) continue;\\n      o.done = true;\\n      const hit = Math.abs(this.x - o.x) < radius;\\n      if (o.kind === 'coco' && hit) {\\n        this.combo += 1;\\n        const tier = this.combo >= 20 ? 4 : this.combo >= 10 ? 3 : this.combo >= 5 ? 2 : 1;\\n        this.score += 10 * tier;\\n      } else if (o.kind === 'pine' && hit) {\\n        this.combo += 1;\\n        this.score += 30;\\n      } else if (o.kind === 'flip' && hit) {\\n        this.score -= 10;\\n        this.combo = 0;\\n        this.daze = 0.6;\\n      } else if (o.kind === 'flip' && !hit) {\\n        /* dodged */\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  scoreStars() {\\n    super.scoreStars();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport class SlackSim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.progress = 0;\\n    this.falls = 0;\\n    this.stun = 0;\\n    this.finished = false;\\n    this.gustT = 0;\\n    this.gust = 0;\\n    this.nextGust = 6;\\n    this.kevin = false;\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n    return this.finished || this.playT >= 75;\\n  }\\n  auto(dt) {\\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return { ...ZERO };\\n    const u = this.bot.read(this.dot, dt);\\n    const limit = this.skill === 'expert' ? 0.45 : this.skill === 'good' ? 0.45 : this.skill === 'average' ? 0.4 : 0.3;\\n    u.y = Math.abs(this.dot.x) < limit && this.stun <= 0 ? 0.9 : 0;\\n    return { ...ZERO, x: u.x, y: u.y };\\n  }\\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\\n    if (scoring) this.playT += dt;\\n    if (this.finished) return;\\n    const walking = (u.y || 0) > 0.3 && this.stun <= 0;\\n    const standInst = 1.2 / (this.T.dotInstability || 0.6);\\n    const walkInst = (this.T.slackWalkInst || 2.6) / (this.T.dotInstability || 0.6);\\n    const m = {\\n      inst: (walking ? walkInst : standInst) * (this.hard ? 1.1 : 1),\\n      noise: 1.25,\\n      bx: this.gust * (this.T.gustForce || 1.6),\\n      ring: 1,\\n    };\\n    if (this.progress >= 18 && this.progress < 24) {\\n      m.bx += 0.45;\\n      this.kevin = true;\\n    }\\n    this.stepDot(dt, { x: u.x || 0, y: 0 }, m);\\n    this.dot.y = 0;\\n    this.dot.vy = 0;\\n    if (this.gustT > 0) this.gustT -= dt;\\n    else this.gust = 0;\\n    if (scoring && this.stun <= 0 && walking) this.progress += 1.1 * dt;\\n    if (this.progress >= this.nextGust && this.gustT <= 0) {\\n      this.gust = this.rand() < 0.5 ? -1 : 1;\\n      this.gustT = 1;\\n      this.nextGust += 6;\\n    }\\n    if (this.stun > 0) this.stun -= dt;\\n    if (Math.abs(this.dot.x) > 1) {\\n      this.falls += 1;\\n      this.stun = 1.2;\\n      this.dot.x = 0;\\n      this.dot.vx = 0;\\n      this.progress = this.progress >= 20 ? 20 : this.progress >= 10 ? 10 : 0;\\n      this.nextGust = this.progress + 6;\\n    }\\n    if (this.progress >= 30) this.finished = true;\\n  }\\n  scoreStars() {\\n    this.seconds = this.playT;\\n    if (!this.finished) {\\n      this.stars = 0;\\n      this.score = Math.round(this.progress * 10);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const time = this.playT;\\n    if (this.falls === 0 && time < 32) this.stars = 3;\\n    else if (this.falls <= 1 && time < 45) this.stars = 2;\\n    else this.stars = 1;\\n    if (this.hard && this.stars === 3 && time >= 30) this.stars = 2;\\n    this.score = 1000 - 60 * this.falls - 8 * (time - 27);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport const TRAY_BOARDS = [\\n  {\\n    id: 'straight',\\n    lanes: [\\n      { z: -1.35, color: 'R', xs: [-1.5, -0.9], cup: 1.45 },\\n      { z: -0.45, color: 'B', xs: [-1.5, -0.9], cup: 1.45 },\\n      { z: 0.45, color: 'Y', xs: [-1.5, -0.9], cup: 1.45 },\\n      { z: 1.35, color: 'R', xs: [-1.5, -0.9], cup: 1.45 },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n];\\n\\nexport class TraySim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.tiltX = 0;\\n    this.tiltZ = 0;\\n    this.wishX = 0;\\n    this.wishZ = 0;\\n    this.items = [];\\n    const board = TRAY_BOARDS[0];\\n    for (const lane of board.lanes) {\\n      for (const x of lane.xs) {\\n        this.items.push({\\n          color: lane.color,\\n          x,\\n          z: lane.z,\\n          vx: 0,\\n          vz: 0,\\n          cupX: lane.cup,\\n          cupZ: lane.z,\\n          homeX: x,\\n          homeZ: lane.z,\\n          done: false,\\n          wait: 0,\\n        });\\n      }\\n    }\\n    this.got = 0;\\n    this.bad = 0;\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n    return this.playT >= 60 || this.items.every((v) => v.done);\\n  }\\n  auto() {\\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return { ...ZERO };\\n    const open = this.items.filter((v) => !v.done && v.wait <= 0);\\n    if (!open.length) return { ...ZERO };\\n    open.sort((a, b) => Math.abs(a.cupX - a.x) - Math.abs(b.cupX - b.x));\\n    const v = open[0];\\n    const dx = v.cupX - v.x;\\n    const dz = v.cupZ - v.z;\\n    const gain = this.skill === 'sloppy' ? 0.15 : this.skill === 'average' ? 0.45 : 1;\\n    return { ...ZERO, x: clamp(dx * gain, -1, 1), y: clamp(dz * gain, -1, 1) };\\n  }\\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\\n    if (scoring) this.playT += dt;\\n    const max = (this.T.trayMaxTilt || 14) * (Math.PI / 180);\\n    this.wishX += ((u.x || 0) * max - this.wishX) * Math.min(1, dt / 0.12);\\n    this.wishZ += ((-(u.y || 0)) * max - this.wishZ) * Math.min(1, dt / 0.12);\\n    this.tiltX = this.wishX;\\n    this.tiltZ = this.wishZ;\\n    const g = this.T.trayGravity || 9.8;\\n    const ax = Math.sin(this.tiltX) * g;\\n    const az = Math.sin(this.tiltZ) * g;\\n    for (const v of this.items) {\\n      if (v.done) continue;\\n      if (v.wait > 0) {\\n        v.wait -= dt;\\n        continue;\\n      }\\n      v.vx += ax * dt;\\n      v.vz += az * dt;\\n      v.vx *= Math.exp(-dt * 1.4);\\n      v.vz *= Math.exp(-dt * 1.4);\\n      v.x += v.vx * dt;\\n      v.z += v.vz * dt;\\n      if (v.x < -1.8) {\\n        v.x = -1.8;\\n        v.vx *= -0.2;\\n      }\\n      if (v.x > 1.8) {\\n        v.x = 1.8;\\n        v.vx *= -0.2;\\n      }\\n      const wall = v.homeZ;\\n      if (Math.abs(v.z - wall) > 0.28) {\\n        v.z = wall + Math.sign(v.z - wall) * 0.28;\\n        v.vz *= -0.2;\\n      }\\n      if (Math.hypot(v.x - v.cupX, v.z - v.cupZ) < 0.3 && v.x > 1.05) {\\n        v.done = true;\\n        this.got += 1;\\n        v.vx = 0;\\n        v.vz = 0;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  scoreStars() {\\n    const max = this.items.length * 10;\\n    const raw = this.got * 10 - this.bad * 3;\\n    this.score = max ? (100 * Math.max(0, raw)) / max : 0;\\n    super.scoreStars();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport class JogSim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.cadence = 0;\\n    this.side = 'L';\\n    this.badSide = 0;\\n    this.bandT = 0;\\n    this.stitch = 0;\\n    this.over = 0;\\n    this.lateral = 0;\\n    this.dist = 0;\\n    this.cups = [];\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 18; i++) this.cups.push({ at: 12 + i * 11, x: i % 2 === 0 ? -0.8 : 0.8, got: false });\\n    this.got = 0;\\n    this.pulse = 0;\\n    this.nextFoot = 'L';\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n    return this.playT >= 70;\\n  }\\n  auto(dt) {\\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return { ...ZERO };\\n    const target = this.T.jogTargetCadence || 3;\\n    const rate = this.skill === 'sloppy' ? 1.2 : this.skill === 'average' ? 2.2 : this.skill === 'good' ? target : target;\\n    this.pulse += dt;\\n    const period = 1 / Math.max(0.5, rate);\\n    let stepL = false;\\n    let stepR = false;\\n    if (this.pulse >= period) {\\n      this.pulse -= period;\\n      if (this.nextFoot === 'L') stepL = true;\\n      else stepR = true;\\n      this.nextFoot = this.nextFoot === 'L' ? 'R' : 'L';\\n    }\\n    const upcoming = this.cups.find((c) => !c.got && c.at >= this.dist - 1);\\n    let x = 0;\\n    if (upcoming) x = clamp((upcoming.x - this.lateral) * 1.4, -1, 1);\\n    return { ...ZERO, x, stepL, stepR, edgeL: stepL, edgeR: stepR };\\n  }\\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\\n    if (scoring) this.playT += dt;\\n    const edgeL = !!u.edgeL || (!!u.stepL && !this.prevL);\\n    const edgeR = !!u.edgeR || (!!u.stepR && !this.prevR);\\n    this.prevL = !!u.stepL;\\n    this.prevR = !!u.stepR;\\n    let stepped = false;\\n    if (edgeL) {\\n      if (this.side === 'L') this.badSide += 1;\\n      this.side = 'L';\\n      stepped = true;\\n    }\\n    if (edgeR) {\\n      if (this.side === 'R') this.badSide += 1;\\n      this.side = 'R';\\n      stepped = true;\\n    }\\n    if (edgeL && edgeR) stepped = true;\\n    const target = this.T.jogTargetCadence || 3;\\n    if (stepped && scoring) this.cadence += (target * 0 + 1 / Math.max(dt, 0.05) - this.cadence) * 0.0;\\n    if (scoring && stepped) {\\n      this.stepTimes = this.stepTimes || [];\\n      this.stepTimes.push(this.playT);\\n    }\\n    if (scoring) {\\n      const times = this.stepTimes || [];\\n      const recent = times.filter((t) => this.playT - t < 2);\\n      this.cadence = recent.length / 2;\\n      const lo = target - 0.6;\\n      const hi = target + 0.6;\\n      let speed = 3;\\n      if (this.cadence >= lo && this.cadence <= hi) {\\n        this.bandT += dt;\\n        speed = 3;\\n        this.over = 0;\\n      } else {\\n        speed = 2;\\n        if (this.cadence > hi) this.over += dt;\\n        else this.over = 0;\\n      }\\n      if (this.over > 2) this.stitch = 3;\\n      if (this.stitch > 0) {\\n        this.stitch -= dt;\\n        speed *= 0.5;\\n      }\\n      if (this.badSide && edgeL && this.side === 'L') speed = Math.max(0, speed - 0.5);\\n      this.dist += speed * dt;\\n      this.lateral = clamp(this.lateral + (u.x || 0) * 2.2 * dt, -1.5, 1.5);\\n      for (const c of this.cups) {\\n        if (!c.got && this.dist >= c.at && this.dist - speed * dt < c.at + 0.6) {\\n          if (Math.abs(this.lateral - c.x) < 0.55) {\\n            c.got = true;\\n            this.got += 1;\\n          }\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  scoreStars() {\\n    const pace = this.playT > 0 ? this.bandT / this.playT : 0;\\n    const cups = this.got / this.cups.length;\\n    this.score = 70 * pace * 100 / 100 * 1 + 30 * cups;\\n    this.score = 70 * pace + 30 * cups;\\n    if (this.score <= 1) this.score *= 100;\\n    else this.score = 70 * (pace * 100) / 100 + 30 * cups;\\n    this.score = 70 * pace + 30 * cups;\\n    // pace and cups are 0..1. The published score is on a 0..100 scale.\\n    this.score = 100 * (0.7 * pace + 0.3 * cups);\\n    super.scoreStars();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport class PierSim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.attempt = 0;\\n    this.best = 0;\\n    this.phaseLocal = 'run';\\n    this.localT = 0;\\n    this.zoneT = 0;\\n    this.speed = 6;\\n    this.pressed = false;\\n    this.flightIn = 0;\\n    this.flightN = 0;\\n    this.cannon = false;\\n    this.attemptT = 0;\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n    return this.attempt >= 3;\\n  }\\n  botTarget() {\\n    if (this.phaseLocal === 'run') return { x: 0, y: -0.6 };\\n    return { x: 0, y: 0 };\\n  }\\n  auto(dt) {\\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return { ...ZERO };\\n    const u = this.bot.read(this.dot, dt);\\n    const lip = this.phaseLocal === 'run' && this.localT >= 4.92 && this.localT < 5.08;\\n    const cannon = this.phaseLocal === 'flight' && this.localT > 3.05 && this.localT < 3.25;\\n    const press = (this.skill === 'expert' || this.skill === 'good') && (lip || cannon);\\n    return { ...ZERO, x: u.x, y: u.y, confirm: press };\\n  }\\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\\n    if (!scoring) return;\\n    this.playT += dt;\\n    this.localT += dt;\\n    this.attemptT += dt;\\n    if (this.phaseLocal === 'run') {\\n      const inZone = this.dot.y < -0.4 && this.dot.y > -0.8;\\n      if (inZone) this.zoneT += dt;\\n      const m = { noise: 1, inst: 1, ring: 0.5 };\\n      this.stepDot(dt, u, m);\\n      if (u.confirm && !this.pressed && this.localT > 4.2) {\\n        this.pressed = true;\\n        this.lipDt = Math.abs(this.localT - 5);\\n      }\\n      if (this.localT >= 5) {\\n        this.speed = 6 + 8 * clamp(this.zoneT / 5, 0, 1);\\n        this.phaseLocal = 'flight';\\n        this.localT = 0;\\n        this.flightIn = 0;\\n        this.flightN = 0;\\n        const p = this.pressed ? clamp(1 - (this.lipDt || 0.25) / 0.25, 0, 1) : 0;\\n        this.p = p;\\n      }\\n    } else if (this.phaseLocal === 'flight') {\\n      const ring = this.ringOf(0.45);\\n      const m = { inst: 3, noise: 1, ring };\\n      this.stepDot(dt, u, m);\\n      this.flightN += 1;\\n      if (Math.hypot(this.dot.x, this.dot.y) < ring) this.flightIn += 1;\\n      if (u.confirm && this.localT > 3) this.cannon = true;\\n      if (this.localT >= 3.5) {\\n        const ringFrac = this.flightN ? this.flightIn / this.flightN : 0;\\n        const dist = this.speed * (0.8 + 0.6 * (this.p || 0)) * (0.6 + 0.4 * ringFrac) * (this.T.pierBoost || 2.14);\\n        if (dist > this.best) this.best = dist;\\n        this.attempt += 1;\\n        this.phaseLocal = 'run';\\n        this.localT = 0;\\n        this.zoneT = 0;\\n        this.pressed = false;\\n        this.speed = 6;\\n        this.p = 0;\\n        this.dot.x = 0;\\n        this.dot.y = 0;\\n        this.dot.vx = 0;\\n        this.dot.vy = 0;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  scoreStars() {\\n    this.score = this.best;\\n    super.scoreStars();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport const LONG_EVENTS = [\\n  { t: 0, ring: 0.4, say: 'Stand.' },\\n  { t: 10, bias: 0.1 },\\n  { t: 20, impulse: -0.6 },\\n  { t: 30, ring: 0.34 },\\n  { t: 35, noise: 1.2 },\\n  { t: 45, say: 'Ignore her.' },\\n  { t: 50, ring: 0.28 },\\n  { t: 55, drift: true },\\n  { t: 65, shake: true },\\n  { t: 75, ring: 0.24, noise: 1, swell: true },\\n  { t: 85, bias: 0, impulse: 0.35 },\\n  { t: 90, say: 'You may blink.' },\\n];\\n\\nexport class LongSim extends StillSim {\\n  _built() {\\n    super._built();\\n    this.hold = 90;\\n    this.settle = 0;\\n    this.release = 0;\\n    this.ringNow = 0.4;\\n    this.bias = 0;\\n    this.noiseMul = 1;\\n    this.fired = new Set();\\n    this.says = [];\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n    return this.playT >= 90;\\n  }\\n  ring() {\\n    return this.ringOf(this.ringNow);\\n  }\\n  mods() {\\n    return { noise: this.noiseMul, inst: 1, bx: this.bias, by: 0, ring: this.ring() };\\n  }\\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\\n    if (scoring) {\\n      this.playT += dt;\\n      for (const ev of LONG_EVENTS) {\\n        if (this.playT >= ev.t && !this.fired.has(ev.t)) {\\n          this.fired.add(ev.t);\\n          if (ev.ring) this.ringNow = ev.ring;\\n          if (ev.bias !== undefined) this.bias = ev.bias;\\n          if (ev.noise) this.noiseMul = ev.noise;\\n          if (ev.impulse) this.dot.vy += ev.impulse;\\n          if (ev.shake) this.dot.vx += (this.rand() - 0.5) * 0.8;\\n          if (ev.say) this.says.push(ev.say);\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    const m = this.mods();\\n    this.stepDot(dt, u, m);\\n    if (!scoring) return;\\n    this.samples += 1;\\n    if (Math.hypot(this.dot.x, this.dot.y) < m.ring) this.inside += 1;\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport class WeighSim {\\n  constructor(kind, opts) {\\n    this.kind = kind;\\n    this.T = opts.tunables;\\n    this.rand = opts.rand;\\n    this.skill = opts.skill || 'idle';\\n    this.dot = new Dot(opts.rand);\\n    this.bot = new BotDriver(this.skill, opts.botRand || opts.rand, () => this.target());\\n    this.t = 0;\\n    this.done = false;\\n    this.Tscore = 0;\\n    this.samples = [];\\n    this.hold = 0;\\n    this.hit = 0;\\n    this.idx = 0;\\n    this.targets = [\\n      { x: -0.7, y: 0 },\\n      { x: 0.7, y: 0 },\\n      { x: 0, y: 0.55 },\\n    ];\\n  }\\n  target() {\\n    if (this.kind === 'lean') return this.targets[Math.min(this.idx, 2)];\\n    if (this.kind === 'chase') {\\n      return { x: 0.42 * Math.sin(0.7 * this.t), y: 0.32 * Math.sin(1.05 * this.t + 0.4) };\\n    }\\n    return { x: 0, y: 0 };\\n  }\\n  auto(dt) {\\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return { ...ZERO };\\n    return { ...ZERO, ...this.bot.read(this.dot, dt) };\\n  }\\n  step(dt, input) {\\n    if (this.done) return;\\n    const u = input || { ...ZERO };\\n    this.t += dt;\\n    this.dot.step(dt, u.x || 0, u.y || 0, this.T, {});\\n    if (this.kind === 'still') {\\n      if (this.t > 3 && this.t < 14) this.samples.push(Math.hypot(this.dot.x, this.dot.y) < 0.3 ? 1 : 0);\\n    } else if (this.kind === 'lean') {\\n      const tgt = this.targets[this.idx];\\n      if (tgt && Math.hypot(this.dot.x - tgt.x, this.dot.y - tgt.y) < 0.1) this.hold += dt;\\n      else this.hold = Math.max(0, this.hold - dt * 0.5);\\n      if (this.hold >= 1.5 && this.idx < 3) {\\n        this.hit += 1;\\n        this.idx += 1;\\n        this.hold = 0;\\n      }\\n    } else if (this.t > 1) {\\n      const tgt = this.target();\\n      this.samples.push(Math.hypot(this.dot.x - tgt.x, this.dot.y - tgt.y));\\n    }\\n    if (this.t >= 14) this.finish();\\n  }\\n  finish() {\\n    this.done = true;\\n    if (this.kind === 'still') this.Tscore = this.samples.length ? this.samples.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) / this.samples.length : 0;\\n    else if (this.kind === 'lean') this.Tscore = this.hit / 3;\\n    else {\\n      const mean = this.samples.length ? this.samples.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) / this.samples.length : 1;\\n      this.Tscore = clamp(1 - mean * 2, 0, 1);\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nconst KINDS = {\\n  still: StillSim,\\n  reps: RepSim,\\n  hoop: HoopSim,\\n  step: StepSim,\\n  header: HeaderSim,\\n  slack: SlackSim,\\n  tray: TraySim,\\n  jog: JogSim,\\n  pier: PierSim,\\n  long: LongSim,\\n};\\n\\nexport function createSim(id, opts) {\\n  const def = typeof id === 'string' ? ACTIVITY_BY_ID[id] : id;\\n  if (!def) throw new Error('unknown activity ' + id);\\n  const Ctor = KINDS[def.kind];\\n  if (!Ctor) throw new Error('unknown kind ' + def.kind);\\n  return new Ctor(def, opts);\\n}\\n\\nexport function simulate(id, opts) {\\n  const sim = createSim(id, opts);\\n  const dt = 1 / 60;\\n  let guard = 0;\\n  while (!sim.done && guard < 60 * 200) {\\n    const u = sim.auto(dt);\\n    sim.step(dt, u);\\n    guard += 1;\\n  }\\n  return sim;\\n}\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"96844dcf-90aa-4685-ba1b-e7c58bed6e38"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_36","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A bug exists in JogSim's score calculation due to messy leftover code.\n\nThe final score assignment is correct but messy. It will be cleaned up after tests pass. The expert cadence calculation checks out at 3 Hz. One concern remains: auto() sets stepL true for a single call when a pulse fires.\n\nSteering uses the previous distance because auto runs before step. Header idle spawns objects at random x with a 0.2 hit radius. StillSim playT increments only during scoring, which aligns with the phase machine's playFinished check.\n\nHoop auto advances theta using dt. Header auto does not use dt. BotDriver.read is called correctly in auto methods but not in step. Pier, Slack, and Still auto methods all invoke bot.read properly. Rep auto does not use bot.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e4658644-77a2-49cb-b7f6-4425d061e897-70","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607\" && node --input-type=module -e '\nimport { ACTIVITIES } from \"./src/data/activities.js\";\nimport { simulate } from \"./src/core/sims.js\";\nimport { defaultTunables } from \"./src/core/tunables.js\";\nimport { mulberry32 } from \"./src/core/rng.js\";\nimport { dripsFor } from \"./src/core/score.js\";\nconst T = defaultTunables();\nfor (const a of ACTIVITIES) {\n  for (const skill of [\"idle\", \"expert\"]) {\n    const sim = simulate(a.id, { skill, tunables: T, rand: mulberry32(10 + a.id.length), botRand: mulberry32(99), first: false, practice: false });\n    const drips = dripsFor(sim.stars, sim.seconds, false);\n    console.log(skill.padEnd(7), a.id.padEnd(10), \"stars\", sim.stars, \"score\", sim.score.toFixed(1), \"sec\", sim.seconds.toFixed(1), \"drips\", drips, sim.done ? \"\" : \"NOTDONE\");\n  }\n}\n