im.jumps);\\n'\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Inspect pier jump components for expert\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3%2Fwork/01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469/terminal/call-a5b8a63c-dd7c-495d-bc99-d37c13cc6b34-73.log\",\"total_bytes\":790}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"5bffe5ec-9cac-4266-924a-d64dc10d1284"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_39","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Zone time is 4.28 of 5, not full 5, so speed is calculated as 6 plus 8 times 4.28.\n\nSpeed of 14 with perfect press and ring fraction of 0.85 yields roughly 39.4 meters, satisfying the 38-meter goal. The press window is 4.92 to 5.08 seconds; a 50-millisecond delay drops the press score to 0.8. Flight instability hurts the first jump more.\n\nThe 4.28-second zone time matches the travel time to reach y=-0.6 from the starting dot at y=0. The bot needs to settle in the tuck zone during that travel, but the five-second run-up is too short. Starting already inside the tuck would be cheating; the run-up length must be increased instead.\n\nThe standard expert bot is too conservative. Entering the tuck zone late leaves only about 4.3 seconds of speed-building time, yielding roughly 12.88 units per second and a marginal 38.6-meter distance. A 4.5-second zone would raise speed to 13.2 and push the total to 39.5 meters. The bot should accelerate more aggressively to reach the target faster.\n\nThe bot can accelerate into the tuck zone by directly commanding full downward thrust until y drops below -0.55, then switching to PD hold. This should cut travel time and secure the full five seconds of speed-building.\n\nThe press confirmation must be triggered at the exact frame where localT crosses 5.0, since localT increments by dt inside onStep before the check runs. A window of 4.99 to 5.01 seconds is needed to catch that transition.\n\nThe current press window of 4.92 to 5.08 seconds is too wide. Because auto() runs before step, it sees the previous frame's localT value. Triggering confirm at that earlier threshold causes the press to fire on the first frame where localT reaches 4.92, which lands well before the true 5-second mark. The bot should instead target the exact frame where localT crosses 5.0, yielding a lipDt near 0.008 and a press score of roughly 0.97.\n\nThe math confirms the current press window fires at frame 296, when localT is 4.933 and lipDt is 0.05. The next step pushes localT to 4.95, yielding a press score of 0.8. The bot should instead trigger confirm only when the upcoming frame will be closest to the 5-second mark.\n\nThe exact press trigger is localT >= 4.9833 and localT < 5.0. This fires at frame 299, immediately before the step pushes localT to exactly 5.0. The resulting lipDt is zero and the press score reaches 1.0.\n\nDuring the flight phase, the bot should apply stronger correction to the flight ring. If the dot drifts more than 0.15 units from the target, the command is scaled by 1.5 and clamped to ±1. This overrides the stock PD hold and compensates for the dot's instability and noise.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-cf20d52b-2bbc-44b3-b262-a0cbe64e1c84-74","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/core/sims.js","old_string":"  auto(dt) {\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return { ...ZERO };\n    const u = this.bot.read(this.dot, dt);\n    const lip = this.phaseLocal === 'run' && this.localT >= 4.92 && this.localT < 5.08;\n    const cannon = this.phaseLocal === 'flight' && this.localT > 3.05 && this.localT < 3.25;\n    const press = (this.skill === 'expert' || this.skill === 'good') && (lip || cannon);\n    return { ...ZERO, x: u.x, y: u.y, confirm: press };\n  }","new_string":"  auto(dt) {\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return { ...ZERO };\n    const u = this.bot.read(this.dot, dt);\n    if (this.phaseLocal === 'run' && this.dot.y > -0.58) u.y = -1;\n    if (this.phaseLocal === 'flight' && (this.skill === 'expert' || this.skill === 'good')) {\n      u.x = clamp(u.x - this.dot.x * 2.2, -1, 1);\n      u.y = clamp(u.y - this.dot.y * 2.2, -1, 1);\n    }\n    const lip = this.phaseLocal === 'run' && this.localT >= 5 - dt - 1e-4 && this.localT < 5;\n    const cannon = this.phaseLocal === 'flight' && this.localT >= 3.5 - 0.25 && this.localT < 3.5 - 0.25 + dt;\n    const tight = this.skill === 'expert' || this.skill === 'good';\n    const press = tight && (lip || cannon);\n    return { ...ZERO, x: u.x, y: u.y, confirm: press };\n  }"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":875,"output_tokens":2577,"cache_read_input_tokens":202368,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"28cf524c-aa94-47f9-b8a0-fbf30b84d08f"}
