ry frame's input since\"},{\"line_number\":548,\"content\":\"     * (src/engine/replay.ts). Plain JSON: save it, attach it to a bug, replay it with `replay()`.\"},{\"line_number\":550,\"content\":\"    recording(): Recording | null;\"},{\"line_number\":552,\"content\":\"     * Play a recording back: its seed and start time are restored, `start` loads the level it was\"},{\"line_number\":558,\"content\":\"     * the level's recording carries on from it. Live input is ignored during a replay, from the\"},{\"line_number\":560,\"content\":\"     * recording held stays held. A game hook's exception is reported and the replay\"},{\"line_number\":563,\"content\":\"    replay(rec: Recording, start: () => unknown, o?: {\"},{\"line_number\":577,\"content\":\"     * nothing in between is replayed. The level's recording starts again from it (`Recording.from`),\"},{\"line_number\":578,\"content\":\"     * so what is played next replays with `replay()`. Live input held now is let go.\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-6626950e-14e4-4590-9937-b8bec6da2ee1-40","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,49,54,48,55,95,95,120,54,57,56,49,101,51,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,57,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,49,54,48,55,95,95,120,54,57,56,49,101,51,47,119,111,114,107,47,77,105,110,116,32,68,105,97,108,45,87,105,105,32,70,105,116,45,103,114,11