{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_51","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"consumePress expires after the pressWindow of GAME time.\n\nI'll verify that queued presses drop at timeScale 0 with a quick headless test before building the pause UI.\n\nRunning the headless test now. Starting to write files, importing mirror from pixel-engine.\n\nClips will live in src/art/clips.js. I'll test whether loadModel works headlessly or needs a game context. Checking examples for hero loading patterns.\n\nI'll load the hero model inside setup via ctx.assets.get or loadModel. The MIN_THICKNESS threshold is 0.06, but some Ounce boxes are only 0.03 or 0.04 thick. I need to check if those thin parts will trigger warnings.\n\nThe 0.06 thickness check means a box with extents [0.06, 0.03, 0.09] would warn because its second-smallest extent is 0.03. I'll use the exact Ounce model from the plan and test checkModel. Extra models will be simple boxes to pass validation.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f31f225e-f9df-4236-a2a1-aa5094c8203b-42","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"torus:|cone:|lathe:|ball:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/ASSETS.md","head_limit":20}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f31f225e-f9df-4236-a2a1-aa5094c8203b-43","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/types/engine/animation/pose.d.ts","limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5498,"output_tokens":1144,"cache_read_input_tokens":105088,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"dc58da89-d2c4-4d34-980d-a8cd0065a0e9"}
