,10,50,50,56,45,101,120,112,111,114,116,32,100,101,99,108,97,114,101,32,102,117,110,99,116,105,111,110,32,119,105,116,104,85,114,108,79,112,116,105,111,110,115,40,111,112,116,105,111,110,115,58,32,69,110,103,105,110,101,79,112,116,105,111,110,115,44,32,115,101,97,114,99,104,63,58,32,115,116,114,105,110,103,41,58,32,69,110,103,105,110,101,79,112,116,105,111,110,115,59,10,50,50,57,45,101,120,112,111,114,116,32,100,101,99,108,97,114,101,32,99,108,97,115,115,32,69,110,103,105,110,101,32,123,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":1,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/types/engine/Engine.d.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":204,\"content\":\"export interface HeadlessOptions extends EngineOptions {\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"bdaf6e62-34c7-4ba9-843c-4590a8d1254d"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_69","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The default viewport is 960×540. Aspect fill will compute the art size.\n\nArt size is 480×270 at 960×540. Browser tests will use Playwright to resize the viewport and verify widgets and HUD size. At 1920×1080 the art size is 480×270. At 1280×720 it is 427×240. At 640×360 it is 640×360. The engine resizes on window resize. Internal resolution has minimum and maximum limits.\n\nWidget layout will derive from HUD dimensions with margins and scaling. Title text will scale down to 2× at narrow widths, and menu rows will scale to 1× when the viewport is under 360 pixels wide.\n\nTitle text scales to 2× below 240 pixels and 3× otherwise. Long lines wrap at width minus 24 pixels, with max characters calculated from six pixels per character times scale. The controller prompt wraps at 24 characters on narrow viewports. A dev overlay flag will be included, along with a paged how-to-play screen and a drop-in mode that unlocks all activities without story or drip progression.\n\nHard mode will appear on the station menu once the day reaches six, toggling activities to run with hard mode enabled. The long stand activity will be available on island page two and at the plaza station from day seven onward. Credits text will be generated by a Node script from CREDITS.md into a JSON export for the about screen. An exact medical disclaimer sentence is also noted.\n\nAbout.js will hold structured source fields and feedback arrays. Build.mjs will write the HTML to the workspace root and exit-interview.json. The dev folder path is Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607. The HTML and JSON paths both use ../ relative to that folder. PROGRESS.md will be written at the end. The goal plan checklist boxes will be flipped after verification.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ebc9d351-57d1-4569-8ab1-2b570b95e13c-66","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/core/sims.js","offset":580,"limit":120}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":799,"output_tokens":1023,"cache_read_input_tokens":136960,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"ae00ff06-780c-433f-82bd-ad05b4a545a9"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-ebc9d351-57d1-4569-8ab1-2b570b95e13c-66","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"580→    const time = this.playT;\\n    if (this.falls === 0 && time < 32) this.stars = 3;\\n    else if (this.falls <= 1 && time < 45) this.stars = 2;\\n    else this.stars = 1;\\n    if (this.hard && this.stars === 3 && time >= 30) this.stars = 2;\\n    this.score = 1000 - 60 * this.falls - 8 * (time - 27);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport const TRAY_BOARDS = [\\n590→  {\\n    id: 'straight',\\n    lanes: [\\n      { z: -1.35, color: 'R', xs: [-1.5, -0.9], cup: 1.45 },\\n      { z: -0.45, color: 'B', xs: [-1.5, -0.9], cup: 1.45 },\\n      { z: 0.45, color: 'Y', xs: [-1.5, -0.9], cup: 1.45 },\\n      { z: 1.35, color: 'R', xs: [-1.5, -0.9], cup: 1.45 },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n];\\n600→\\nexport class TraySim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.tiltX = 0;\\n    this.tiltZ = 0;\\n    this.wishX = 0;\\n    this.wishZ = 0;\\n    this.items = [];\\n    const board = TRAY_BOARDS[0];\\n    for (const lane of board.lanes) {\\n610→      for (const x of lane.xs) {\\n        this.items.push({\\n          color: lane.color,\\n          x,\\n          z: lane.z,\\n          vx: 0,\\n          vz: 0,\\n          cupX: lane.cup,\\n          cupZ: lane.z,\\n          homeX: x,\\n620→          homeZ: lane.z,\\n          done: false,\\n          wait: 0,\\n        });\\n      }\\n    }\\n    this.got = 0;\\n    this.bad = 0;\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n630→    return this.playT >= 60 || this.items.every((v) => v.done);\\n  }\\n  auto() {\\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return { ...ZERO };\\n    const open = this.items.filter((v) => !v.done && v.wait <= 0);\\n    if (!open.length) return { ...ZERO };\\n    open.sort((a, b) => Math.abs(a.cupX - a.x) - Math.abs(b.cupX - b.x));\\n    const v = open[0];\\n    const dx = v.cupX - v.x;\\n    const dz = v.cupZ - v.z;\\n640→    const gain = this.skill === 'sloppy' ? 0.15 : this.skill === 'average' ? 0.45 : 1;\\n    return { ...ZERO, x: clamp(dx * gain, -1, 1), y: clamp(dz * gain, -1, 1) };\\n  }\\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\\n    if (scoring) this.playT += dt;\\n    const max = (this.T.trayMaxTilt || 14) * (Math.PI / 180);\\n    this.wishX += ((u.x || 0) * max - this.wishX) * Math.min(1, dt / 0.12);\\n    this.wishZ += ((-(u.y || 0)) * max - this.wishZ) * Math.min(1, dt / 0.12);\\n    this.tiltX = this.wishX;\\n    this.tiltZ = this.wishZ;\\n650→    const g = this.T.trayGravity || 9.8;\\n    const ax = Math.sin(this.tiltX) * g;\\n    const az = Math.sin(this.tiltZ) * g;\\n    for (const v of this.items) {\\n      if (v.done) continue;\\n      if (v.wait > 0) {\\n        v.wait -= dt;\\n        continue;\\n      }\\n      v.vx += ax * dt;\\n660→      v.vz += az * dt;\\n      v.vx *= Math.exp(-dt * 1.4);\\n      v.vz *= Math.exp(-dt * 1.4);\\n      v.x += v.vx * dt;\\n      v.z += v.vz * dt;\\n      if (v.x < -1.8) {\\n        v.x = -1.8;\\n        v.vx *= -0.2;\\n      }\\n      if (v.x > 1.8) {\\n670→        v.x = 1.8;\\n        v.vx *= -0.2;\\n      }\\n      const wall = v.homeZ;\\n      if (Math.abs(v.z - wall) > 0.28) {\\n        v.z = wall + Math.sign(v.z - wall) * 0.28;\\n        v.vz *= -0.2;\\n      }\\n      if (Math.hypot(v.x - v.cupX, v.z - v.cupZ) < 0.3 && v.x > 1.05) {\\n        v.done = true;\\n680→        this.got += 1;\\n        v.vx = 0;\\n        v.vz = 0;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  scoreStars() {\\n    const max = this.items.length * 10;\\n    const raw = this.got * 10 - this.bad * 3;\\n    this.score = max ? (100 * Math.max(0, raw)) / max : 0;\\n690→    super.scoreStars();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport class JogSim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.cadence = 0;\\n    this.side = 'L';\\n    this.badSide = 0;\\n    this.bandT = 0;\",\"content_concise\":\"580→    const time = this.playT;\\n    if (this.falls === 0 && time < 32) this.stars = 3;\\n    else if (this.falls <= 1 && time < 45) this.stars = 2;\\n    else this.stars = 1;\\n    if (this.hard && this.stars === 3 && time >= 30) this.stars = 2;\\n    this.score = 1000 - 60 * this.falls - 8 * (time - 27);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport const TRAY_BOARDS = [\\n590→  {\\n    id: 'straight',\\n    lanes: [\\n      { z: -1.35, color: 'R', xs: [-1.5, -0.9], cup: 1.45 },\\n      { z: -0.45, color: 'B', xs: [-1.5, -0.9], cup: 1.45 },\\n      { z: 0.45, color: 'Y', xs: [-1.5, -0.9], cup: 1.45 },\\n      { z: 1.35, color: 'R', xs: [-1.5, -0.9], cup: 1.45 },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n];\\n600→\\nexport class TraySim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.tiltX = 0;\\n    this.tiltZ = 0;\\n    this.wishX = 0;\\n    this.wishZ = 0;\\n    this.items = [];\\n    const board = TRAY_BOARDS[0];\\n    for (const lane of board.lanes) {\\n610→      for (const x of lane.xs) {\\n        this.items.push({\\n          color: lane.color,\\n          x,\\n          z: lane.z,\\n          vx: 0,\\n          vz: 0,\\n          cupX: lane.cup,\\n          cupZ: lane.z,\\n          homeX: x,\\n620→          homeZ: lane.z,\\n          done: false,\\n          wait: 0,\\n        });\\n      }\\n    }\\n    this.got = 0;\\n    this.bad = 0;\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n630→    return this.playT >= 60 || this.items.every((v) => v.done);\\n  }\\n  auto() {\\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return { ...ZERO };\\n    const open = this.items.filter((v) => !v.done && v.wait <= 0);\\n    if (!open.length) return { ...ZERO };\\n    open.sort((a, b) => Math.abs(a.cupX - a.x) - Math.abs(b.cupX - b.x));\\n    const v = open[0];\\n    const dx = v.cupX - v.x;\\n    const dz = v.cupZ - v.z;\\n640→    const gain = this.skill === 'sloppy' ? 0.15 : this.skill === 'average' ? 0.45 : 1;\\n    return { ...ZERO, x: clamp(dx * gain, -1, 1), y: clamp(dz * gain, -1, 1) };\\n  }\\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\\n    if (scoring) this.playT += dt;\\n    const max = (this.T.trayMaxTilt || 14) * (Math.PI / 180);\\n    this.wishX += ((u.x || 0) * max - this.wishX) * Math.min(1, dt / 0.12);\\n    this.wishZ += ((-(u.y || 0)) * max - this.wishZ) * Math.min(1, dt / 0.12);\\n    this.tiltX = this.wishX;\\n    this.tiltZ = this.wishZ;\\n650→    const g = this.T.trayGravity || 9.8;\\n    const ax = Math.sin(this.tiltX) * g;\\n    const az = Math.sin(this.tiltZ) * g;\\n    for (const v of this.items) {\\n      if (v.done) continue;\\n      if (v.wait > 0) {\\n        v.wait -= dt;\\n        continue;\\n      }\\n      v.vx += ax * dt;\\n660→      v.vz += az * dt;\\n      v.vx *= Math.exp(-dt * 1.4);\\n      v.vz *= Math.exp(-dt * 1.4);\\n      v.x += v.vx * dt;\\n      v.z += v.vz * dt;\\n      if (v.x < -1.8) {\\n        v.x = -1.8;\\n        v.vx *= -0.2;\\n      }\\n      if (v.x > 1.8) {\\n670→        v.x = 1.8;\\n        v.vx *= -0.2;\\n      }\\n      const wall = v.homeZ;\\n      if (Math.abs(v.z - wall) > 0.28) {\\n        v.z = wall + Math.sign(v.z - wall) * 0.28;\\n        v.vz *= -0.2;\\n      }\\n      if (Math.hypot(v.x - v.cupX, v.z - v.cupZ) < 0.3 && v.x > 1.05) {\\n        v.done = true;\\n680→        this.got += 1;\\n        v.vx = 0;\\n        v.vz = 0;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  scoreStars() {\\n    const max = this.items.length * 10;\\n    const raw = this.got * 10 - this.bad * 3;\\n    this.score = max ? (100 * Math.max(0, raw)) / max : 0;\\n690→    super.scoreStars();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport class JogSim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.cadence = 0;\\n    this.side = 'L';\\n    this.badSide = 0;\\n    this.bandT = 0;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/core/sims.js\",\"offset\":580,\"limit\":120,\"raw_output\":\"    const time = this.playT;\\n    if (this.falls === 0 && time < 32) this.stars = 3;\\n    else if (this.falls <= 1 && time < 45) this.stars = 2;\\n    else this.stars = 1;\\n    if (this.hard && this.stars === 3 && time >= 30) this.stars = 2;\\n    this.score = 1000 - 60 * this.falls - 8 * (time - 27);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport const TRAY_BOARDS = [\\n  {\\n    id: 'straight',\\n    lanes: [\\n      { z: -1.35, color: 'R', xs: [-1.5, -0.9], cup: 1.45 },\\n      { z: -0.45, color: 'B', xs: [-1.5, -0.9], cup: 1.45 },\\n      { z: 0.45, color: 'Y', xs: [-1.5, -0.9], cup: 1.45 },\\n      { z: 1.35, color: 'R', xs: [-1.5, -0.9], cup: 1.45 },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n];\\n\\nexport class TraySim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.tiltX = 0;\\n    this.tiltZ = 0;\\n    this.wishX = 0;\\n    this.wishZ = 0;\\n    this.items = [];\\n    const board = TRAY_BOARDS[0];\\n    for (const lane of board.lanes) {\\n      for (const x of lane.xs) {\\n        this.items.push({\\n          color: lane.color,\\n          x,\\n          z: lane.z,\\n          vx: 0,\\n          vz: 0,\\n          cupX: lane.cup,\\n          cupZ: lane.z,\\n          homeX: x,\\n          homeZ: lane.z,\\n          done: false,\\n          wait: 0,\\n        });\\n      }\\n    }\\n    this.got = 0;\\n    this.bad = 0;\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n    return this.playT >= 60 || this.items.every((v) => v.done);\\n  }\\n  auto() {\\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return { ...ZERO };\\n    const open = this.items.filter((v) => !v.done && v.wait <= 0);\\n    if (!open.length) return { ...ZERO };\\n    open.sort((a, b) => Math.abs(a.cupX - a.x) - Math.abs(b.cupX - b.x));\\n    const v = open[0];\\n    const dx = v.cupX - v.x;\\n    const dz = v.cupZ - v.z;\\n    const gain = this.skill === 'sloppy' ? 0.15 : this.skill === 'average' ? 0.45 : 1;\\n    return { ...ZERO, x: clamp(dx * gain, -1, 1), y: clamp(dz * gain, -1, 1) };\\n  }\\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\\n    if (scoring) this.playT += dt;\\n    const max = (this.T.trayMaxTilt || 14) * (Math.PI / 180);\\n    this.wishX += ((u.x || 0) * max - this.wishX) * Math.min(1, dt / 0.12);\\n    this.wishZ += ((-(u.y || 0)) * max - this.wishZ) * Math.min(1, dt / 0.12);\\n    this.tiltX = this.wishX;\\n    this.tiltZ = this.wishZ;\\n    const g = this.T.trayGravity || 9.8;\\n    const ax = Math.sin(this.tiltX) * g;\\n    const az = Math.sin(this.tiltZ) * g;\\n    for (const v of this.items) {\\n      if (v.done) continue;\\n      if (v.wait > 0) {\\n        v.wait -= dt;\\n        continue;\\n      }\\n      v.vx += ax * dt;\\n      v.vz += az * dt;\\n      v.vx *= Math.exp(-dt * 1.4);\\n      v.vz *= Math.exp(-dt * 1.4);\\n      v.x += v.vx * dt;\\n      v.z += v.vz * dt;\\n      if (v.x < -1.8) {\\n        v.x = -1.8;\\n        v.vx *= -0.2;\\n      }\\n      if (v.x > 1.8) {\\n        v.x = 1.8;\\n        v.vx *= -0.2;\\n      }\\n      const wall = v.homeZ;\\n      if (Math.abs(v.z - wall) > 0.28) {\\n        v.z = wall + Math.sign(v.z - wall) * 0.28;\\n        v.vz *= -0.2;\\n      }\\n      if (Math.hypot(v.x - v.cupX, v.z - v.cupZ) < 0.3 && v.x > 1.05) {\\n        v.done = true;\\n        this.got += 1;\\n        v.vx = 0;\\n        v.vz = 0;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  scoreStars() {\\n    const max = this.items.length * 10;\\n    const raw = this.got * 10 - this.bad * 3;\\n    this.score = max ? (100 * Math.max(0, raw)) / max : 0;\\n    super.scoreStars();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport class JogSim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.cadence = 0;\\n    this.side = 'L';\\n    this.badSide = 0;\\n    this.bandT = 0;\\n\",\"total_lines\":1050}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"d3b0ee26-09c2-4b63-af9f-7e4538932aa1"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_70","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Tray currently has one board. Two more boards will be added as data. Selection will use a day or board ID. This avoids code changes for new boards.\n\nTraySim._built will be patched to select a board from opts.boardId or rotate through TRAY_BOARDS. New boards will use different lane z and cup positions.\n\nThe board selector will match `opts.board` or fall back to the first entry. New boards named 'corner' and 'split' will place vitamins away from a straight line to the cup. Expert auto-steering should still achieve three stars. Walls may lock z movement, so these boards might use looser walls or z-offset cups.\n\nThe straight board will remain the default to preserve the three-star result. The two new boards will differ only in x positions. The station menu can cycle through them. TraySim._built will select a board by ID. I am now writing all files.\n\nI will run the pier test in the background while writing files. I noticed LocalDriver uses wasPressed for confirm inside fixedUpdate, which is incorrect; menus should read wasPressed in update and gameplay should use consumePress in fixedUpdate. I will leave the jog scoreStars dead code untouched unless it causes issues.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-db91732d-bee4-47ca-bb10-378dd8f720df-67","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/core/sims.js","offset":356,"limit":90}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2408,"output_tokens":724,"cache_read_input_tokens":137728,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"46c2a527-8f23-4205-9f4a-2440256d2ace"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-db91732d-bee4-47ca-bb10-378dd8f720df-67","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"356→export class StepSim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.notes = [];\\n    const bpm = 104;\\n360→    const step = 60 / bpm / 4;\\n    const bars = 32;\\n    let t = 0;\\n    for (let b = 0; b < bars; b++) {\\n      for (const ch of STEP_BAR) {\\n        if (ch === 'L' || ch === 'R') this.notes.push({ t, foot: ch, hit: false });\\n        t += step;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    this.playLen = t;\\n370→    this.p = 0;\\n    this.g = 0;\\n    this.o = 0;\\n    this.miss = 0;\\n    this.prevL = false;\\n    this.prevR = false;\\n    this.combo = 0;\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n    return this.playT >= this.playLen + 0.2;\\n380→  }\\n  auto() {\\n    const win = 0.02;\\n    const late = this.skill === 'sloppy' ? 0.12 : this.skill === 'average' ? 0.08 : this.skill === 'good' ? 0.04 : 0;\\n    let stepL = false;\\n    let stepR = false;\\n    if (this.skill !== 'idle') {\\n      for (const n of this.notes) {\\n        if (n.hit) continue;\\n        const when = n.t + late;\\n390→        if (Math.abs(this.playT - when) <= win) {\\n          if (n.foot === 'L') stepL = true;\\n          else stepR = true;\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    return { ...ZERO, stepL, stepR, edgeL: stepL, edgeR: stepR };\\n  }\\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\\n    if (scoring) this.playT += dt;\\n400→    const judged = this.playT + (this.T.stepOffsetMs || 0) / 1000;\\n    const scale = (this.T.stepWindow || 1) * (this.hard ? 0.85 : 1);\\n    const P = 0.055 * scale;\\n    const G = 0.1 * scale;\\n    const O = 0.14 * scale;\\n    const edgeL = !!u.stepL && !this.prevL;\\n    const edgeR = !!u.stepR && !this.prevR;\\n    this.prevL = !!u.stepL;\\n    this.prevR = !!u.stepR;\\n    if (!scoring) return;\\n410→    if (edgeL) this.strike('L', judged, P, G, O);\\n    if (edgeR) this.strike('R', judged, P, G, O);\\n    for (const n of this.notes) {\\n      if (!n.hit && judged > n.t + O) {\\n        n.hit = true;\\n        this.miss += 1;\\n        this.combo = 0;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n420→  strike(foot, judged, P, G, O) {\\n    let best = null;\\n    let bestAbs = 1e9;\\n    for (const n of this.notes) {\\n      if (n.hit || n.foot !== foot) continue;\\n      const ad = Math.abs(judged - n.t);\\n      if (ad < bestAbs) {\\n        best = n;\\n        bestAbs = ad;\\n      }\\n430→    }\\n    if (!best || bestAbs > O) return;\\n    best.hit = true;\\n    if (bestAbs <= P) this.p += 1;\\n    else if (bestAbs <= G) this.g += 1;\\n    else this.o += 1;\\n    this.combo += 1;\\n  }\\n  scoreStars() {\\n    const N = this.notes.length || 1;\\n440→    this.score = (100 * (this.p + 0.7 * this.g + 0.4 * this.o)) / N;\\n    super.scoreStars();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport class HeaderSim extends Sim {\",\"content_concise\":\"356→export class StepSim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.notes = [];\\n    const bpm = 104;\\n360→    const step = 60 / bpm / 4;\\n    const bars = 32;\\n    let t = 0;\\n    for (let b = 0; b < bars; b++) {\\n      for (const ch of STEP_BAR) {\\n        if (ch === 'L' || ch === 'R') this.notes.push({ t, foot: ch, hit: false });\\n        t += step;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    this.playLen = t;\\n370→    this.p = 0;\\n    this.g = 0;\\n    this.o = 0;\\n    this.miss = 0;\\n    this.prevL = false;\\n    this.prevR = false;\\n    this.combo = 0;\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n    return this.playT >= this.playLen + 0.2;\\n380→  }\\n  auto() {\\n    const win = 0.02;\\n    const late = this.skill === 'sloppy' ? 0.12 : this.skill === 'average' ? 0.08 : this.skill === 'good' ? 0.04 : 0;\\n    let stepL = false;\\n    let stepR = false;\\n    if (this.skill !== 'idle') {\\n      for (const n of this.notes) {\\n        if (n.hit) continue;\\n        const when = n.t + late;\\n390→        if (Math.abs(this.playT - when) <= win) {\\n          if (n.foot === 'L') stepL = true;\\n          else stepR = true;\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    return { ...ZERO, stepL, stepR, edgeL: stepL, edgeR: stepR };\\n  }\\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\\n    if (scoring) this.playT += dt;\\n400→    const judged = this.playT + (this.T.stepOffsetMs || 0) / 1000;\\n    const scale = (this.T.stepWindow || 1) * (this.hard ? 0.85 : 1);\\n    const P = 0.055 * scale;\\n    const G = 0.1 * scale;\\n    const O = 0.14 * scale;\\n    const edgeL = !!u.stepL && !this.prevL;\\n    const edgeR = !!u.stepR && !this.prevR;\\n    this.prevL = !!u.stepL;\\n    this.prevR = !!u.stepR;\\n    if (!scoring) return;\\n410→    if (edgeL) this.strike('L', judged, P, G, O);\\n    if (edgeR) this.strike('R', judged, P, G, O);\\n    for (const n of this.notes) {\\n      if (!n.hit && judged > n.t + O) {\\n        n.hit = true;\\n        this.miss += 1;\\n        this.combo = 0;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n420→  strike(foot, judged, P, G, O) {\\n    let best = null;\\n    let bestAbs = 1e9;\\n    for (const n of this.notes) {\\n      if (n.hit || n.foot !== foot) continue;\\n      const ad = Math.abs(judged - n.t);\\n      if (ad < bestAbs) {\\n        best = n;\\n        bestAbs = ad;\\n      }\\n430→    }\\n    if (!best || bestAbs > O) return;\\n    best.hit = true;\\n    if (bestAbs <= P) this.p += 1;\\n    else if (bestAbs <= G) this.g += 1;\\n    else this.o += 1;\\n    this.combo += 1;\\n  }\\n  scoreStars() {\\n    const N = this.notes.length || 1;\\n440→    this.score = (100 * (this.p + 0.7 * this.g + 0.4 * this.o)) / N;\\n    super.scoreStars();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport class HeaderSim extends Sim {\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/core/sims.js\",\"offset\":356,\"limit\":90,\"raw_output\":\"export class StepSim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.notes = [];\\n    const bpm = 104;\\n    const step = 60 / bpm / 4;\\n    const bars = 32;\\n    let t = 0;\\n    for (let b = 0; b < bars; b++) {\\n      for (const ch of STEP_BAR) {\\n        if (ch === 'L' || ch === 'R') this.notes.push({ t, foot: ch, hit: false });\\n        t += step;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    this.playLen = t;\\n    this.p = 0;\\n    this.g = 0;\\n    this.o = 0;\\n    this.miss = 0;\\n    this.prevL = false;\\n    this.prevR = false;\\n    this.combo = 0;\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n    return this.playT >= this.playLen + 0.2;\\n  }\\n  auto() {\\n    const win = 0.02;\\n    const late = this.skill === 'sloppy' ? 0.12 : this.skill === 'average' ? 0.08 : this.skill === 'good' ? 0.04 : 0;\\n    let stepL = false;\\n    let stepR = false;\\n    if (this.skill !== 'idle') {\\n      for (const n of this.notes) {\\n        if (n.hit) continue;\\n        const when = n.t + late;\\n        if (Math.abs(this.playT - when) <= win) {\\n          if (n.foot === 'L') stepL = true;\\n          else stepR = true;\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n    return { ...ZERO, stepL, stepR, edgeL: stepL, edgeR: stepR };\\n  }\\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\\n    if (scoring) this.playT += dt;\\n    const judged = this.playT + (this.T.stepOffsetMs || 0) / 1000;\\n    const scale = (this.T.stepWindow || 1) * (this.hard ? 0.85 : 1);\\n    const P = 0.055 * scale;\\n    const G = 0.1 * scale;\\n    const O = 0.14 * scale;\\n    const edgeL = !!u.stepL && !this.prevL;\\n    const edgeR = !!u.stepR && !this.prevR;\\n    this.prevL = !!u.stepL;\\n    this.prevR = !!u.stepR;\\n    if (!scoring) return;\\n    if (edgeL) this.strike('L', judged, P, G, O);\\n    if (edgeR) this.strike('R', judged, P, G, O);\\n    for (const n of this.notes) {\\n      if (!n.hit && judged > n.t + O) {\\n        n.hit = true;\\n        this.miss += 1;\\n        this.combo = 0;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  strike(foot, judged, P, G, O) {\\n    let best = null;\\n    let bestAbs = 1e9;\\n    for (const n of this.notes) {\\n      if (n.hit || n.foot !== foot) continue;\\n      const ad = Math.abs(judged - n.t);\\n      if (ad < bestAbs) {\\n        best = n;\\n        bestAbs = ad;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (!best || bestAbs > O) return;\\n    best.hit = true;\\n    if (bestAbs <= P) this.p += 1;\\n    else if (bestAbs <= G) this.g += 1;\\n    else this.o += 1;\\n    this.combo += 1;\\n  }\\n  scoreStars() {\\n    const N = this.notes.length || 1;\\n    this.score = (100 * (this.p + 0.7 * this.g + 0.4 * this.o)) / N;\\n    super.scoreStars();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nexport class HeaderSim extends Sim {\\n\",\"total_lines\":1050}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"51fd465b-3f4d-433e-9204-a887c45b0d8c"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_71","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Step simulation derives edges from the held state of stepL.\n\nKeyboard arrows serve both lean and step functions. The auto() step bug is acceptable: it triggers one edge per frame within a 0.02s window, which equals roughly one frame at 60fps. I am now writing the code and designing app.js with careful attention to test-catchable bugs. Menu actions will be limited to one per frame.\n\nThe menu hover logic converts pointer coordinates to screen space and checks each row rectangle to set the active focus index.\n\nDown and up arrow keys, plus S and W, move the menu focus. The action flag is set to prevent duplicate frame processing.\n\nEnter, Space, PadCross, and MouseLeft confirm the current selection. Escape, Backspace, PadCircle, and MouseRight return to the previous menu. ArrowLeft, KeyA, and PadLeft handle leftward navigation.\n\nArrowRight, KeyD, and PadRight handle rightward navigation. A conflict was spotted: KeyS serves both menu focus and lean input. During name entry, pressing S would type the letter while also moving the menu focus. The plan is to restrict arrow and pad keys for menu focus only when the user is not actively typing a letter.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bbceb3be-141a-4ba6-991b-8479d1e22c2e-68","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"wheel","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/types/engine/input.d.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1747,"output_tokens":1020,"cache_read_input_tokens":140032,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"30e32db6-2093-4e72-9090-1f75e56ab85a"}
