, optional pointer lock (first-person). Mouse buttons on\"},{\"line_number\":134,\"content\":\"    wheel: number;\"},{\"line_number\":169,\"content\":\"     * True while a replay drives input (`engine.replay()`): keyboard, pointer and wheel events,\"},{\"line_number\":184,\"content\":\"     * pinch to zoom (emitted as wheel ticks).\"},{\"line_number\":262,\"content\":\"    /** Test hook: inject pointer movement / wheel for the next frame. */\"},{\"line_number\":263,\"content\":\"    addPointer(dx: number, dy: number, wheel?: number): void;\"},{\"line_number\":274,\"content\":\"    /** Replay, after `beginFrame` (which polled no gamepads): sticks, pointer, wheel, gamepad connection. */\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"8d09b9ab-d599-4b4a-9412-d57f1cf3cf88"}
