{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-39ce5e14-98f8-4e78-a5de-84210083cd84-88","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"28→    this.bot = new BotDriver(this.skill, this.botRand, () => this.botTarget());\\n    this.phase = 'intro';\\n30→    this.phaseT = 0;\\n    this.elapsed = 0;\\n    this.playT = 0;\\n    this.done = false;\\n    this.score = 0;\\n    this.stars = 0;\\n    this.seconds = 0;\\n    this.note = '';\\n    this.lied = false;\\n    this.queue = [['intro', 2.2]];\\n40→    if (this.practiceOn) this.queue.push(['practice', 8]);\\n    this.queue.push(['countdown', 3], ['play', null], ['outro', 1.2]);\\n    if (opts.skipIntro) {\\n      this.queue = [['play', null], ['outro', 1.2]];\\n      this.phase = 'play';\\n    }\\n    this.qi = 0;\\n    this._built();\\n  }\\n  _built() {}\\n50→  setSkill(skill) {\\n    this.skill = skill || 'idle';\\n    this.bot = new BotDriver(this.skill, this.botRand, () => this.botTarget());\",\"content_concise\":\"28→    this.bot = new BotDriver(this.skill, this.botRand, () => this.botTarget());\\n    this.phase = 'intro';\\n30→    this.phaseT = 0;\\n    this.elapsed = 0;\\n    this.playT = 0;\\n    this.done = false;\\n    this.score = 0;\\n    this.stars = 0;\\n    this.seconds = 0;\\n    this.note = '';\\n    this.lied = false;\\n    this.queue = [['intro', 2.2]];\\n40→    if (this.practiceOn) this.queue.push(['practice', 8]);\\n    this.queue.push(['countdown', 3], ['play', null], ['outro', 1.2]);\\n    if (opts.skipIntro) {\\n      this.queue = [['play', null], ['outro', 1.2]];\\n      this.phase = 'play';\\n    }\\n    this.qi = 0;\\n    this._built();\\n  }\\n  _built() {}\\n50→  setSkill(skill) {\\n    this.skill = skill || 'idle';\\n    this.bot = new BotDriver(this.skill, this.botRand, () => this.botTarget());\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/core/sims.js\",\"offset\":28,\"limit\":25,\"raw_output\":\"    this.bot = new BotDriver(this.skill, this.botRand, () => this.botTarget());\\n    this.phase = 'intro';\\n    this.phaseT = 0;\\n    this.elapsed = 0;\\n    this.playT = 0;\\n    this.done = false;\\n    this.score = 0;\\n    this.stars = 0;\\n    this.seconds = 0;\\n    this.note = '';\\n    this.lied = false;\\n    this.queue = [['intro', 2.2]];\\n    if (this.practiceOn) this.queue.push(['practice', 8]);\\n    this.queue.push(['countdown', 3], ['play', null], ['outro', 1.2]);\\n    if (opts.skipIntro) {\\n      this.queue = [['play', null], ['outro', 1.2]];\\n      this.phase = 'play';\\n    }\\n    this.qi = 0;\\n    this._built();\\n  }\\n  _built() {}\\n  setSkill(skill) {\\n    this.skill = skill || 'idle';\\n    this.bot = new BotDriver(this.skill, this.botRand, () => this.botTarget());\\n\",\"total_lines\":1087}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"9ff16093-81d9-42f7-afbc-21a935facf9d"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_88","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now writing all the supporting files.\n\nWriting voice.js with pitch test logic and speaker parameters for four characters. Also creating parallel files for fonts, devices, actions, songs, SFX, lines, textures, glyphs, models, clips, avatar, about, and credits.\n\nAdded June and Kevin to the speaker parameters. June is flat with f0 300 and rate 10. Kevin is null.\n\nQuestion marks raise pitch by 25% on the last syllable. Exclamations raise by 25% too.\n\nSentence declination drops pitch by 15% across the sentence. June and coach skip this because they are flat.\n\nThe pitch test will use the default speaker to verify that questions raise pitch even for flat speakers like June. Syllable identity is hashed from the word alone, not its position in the sentence; only the pitch value changes due to declination. The renderVoice function will use two parallel bandpass filters on the oscillator, with offline RMS gain set to 0.2.\n\nVoice gain will peak at 0.4 to avoid clipping. Formant frequencies are set for each vowel, with speaker-specific shifts applied. Plosive consonants generate 8ms noise bursts; fricatives generate 40ms. A `bufferStats` export will provide RMS and mean pitch for the pitch test.\n\nThe pitch test will compute pitch independently using zero-crossing or autocorrelation rather than relying on the shipped analysis function. It requires a browser environment because OfflineAudioContext is unavailable in Node.js. A `pattern` helper is being added to songs.js for generating equal-length track sequences.\n\nA `steps` helper will generate 16-step patterns by index. The lead and bass tracks will use a 368-step sequence at 70 BPM, with the 75-second mark falling at step 350. The lead plays E4 on even steps from 350 to 366. The bass plays A2 on every fourth step from 350 onward. Sparse notes precede that section.\n\nVolume is set to 0.6 and 0.55. The title song will be 92 BPM. Eight songs are planned: plaza, still, reps, hoop, step, lagoon, jog, report, and long. Step is exactly 104 BPM. Hoop and step are both four-on-the-floor but remain separate tracks. Models will use a minimum thickness of 0.08 to satisfy the 0.06 threshold. The yoga mat model is being written first.\n\nThe yoga mat model is now fully defined with lime coloring and a 1.2 by 2.2 base. Kevin's avatar is being built from a body sphere and left wing box. The pavilion model uses a cone roof at height 2.2.\n\nThe hoop model will be a torus at height 1. The jar lathe and avatar dress function are next. Glyphs will be small sprites. Then the main app. A Node.js script is being written to generate CREDITS.md.\n\nA Node.js script will generate `src/data/creditsText.js` from the raw credits file. Files will be written in parallel batches of eight. A complete `lines.js` generator is being prepared. The question line now reads \"Depends who is watching.\" to avoid apostrophes. Some week beat strings may exceed the 52-character dialogue limit.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8e735fb6-9500-4b6e-b7f8-d205aa1b30b8-89","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/ui/font.js","content":"// Mixed case on a 6px grid. Lowercase is drawn as sprites. Everything else uses hud.text.\nconst H = {\n  a: '00 00 0e 01 0f 11 0f 00 00', b: '10 10 1e 11 11 11 1e 00 00', c: '00 00 0e 11 10 11 0e 00 00', d: '01 01 0f 11 11 11 0f 00 00',\n  e: '00 00 0e 11 1f 10 0e 00 00', f: '06 09 08 1c 08 08 08 00 00', g: '00 00 0f 11 11 11 0f 01 0e', h: '10 10 1e 11 11 11 11 00 00',\n  i: '04 00 0c 04 04 04 0e 00 00', j: '02 00 06 02 02 02 02 12 0c', k: '10 10 12 14 18 14 12 00 00', l: '0c 04 04 04 04 04 0e 00 00',\n  m: '00 00 1a 15 15 15 15 00 00', n: '00 00 1e 11 11 11 11 00 00', o: '00 00 0e 11 11 11 0e 00 00', p: '00 00 1e 11 11 11 1e 10 10',\n  q: '00 00 0f 11 11 11 0f 01 01', r: '00 00 16 19 10 10 10 00 00', s: '00 00 0f 10 0e 01 1e 00 00', t: '08 08 1c 08 08 09 06 00 00',\n  u: '00 00 11 11 11 13 0d 00 00', v: '00 00 11 11 11 0a 04 00 00', w: '00 00 11 11 15 15 0a 00 00', x: '00 00 11 0a 04 0a 11 00 00',\n  y: '00 00 11 11 11 11 0f 01 0e', z: '00 00 1f 02 04 08 1f 00 00',\n};\n\nexport const GLYPHS = Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(H).map(([k, v]) => [k, v.split(' ').map((h) => parseInt(h, 16).toString(2).padStart(5, '0').replace(/0/g, '.').replace(/1/g, 'o'))]));\n\n/** Characters hud.text can draw, plus the lowercase sprites above. */\nexport const HUD_EXTRA = \"ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ0123456789.,!?'\\\": :;-()/+%*\";\n\nexport function hasGlyph(ch) {\n  if (ch === ' ' || ch === '\\n') return true;\n  if (GLYPHS[ch]) return true;\n  return HUD_EXTRA.includes(ch);\n}\n\nexport function missingGlyphs(text) {\n  const bad = [];\n  for (const ch of String(text)) if (!hasGlyph(ch)) bad.push(ch);\n  return bad;\n}\n\nexport function say(hud, x, y, text, { color = 'white', shadow = 'ink', scale = 1 } = {}) {\n  for (const ch of String(text)) {\n    const g = GLYPHS[ch];\n    if (g) hud.sprite(x, y, g, { o: color }, { scale, shadow });\n    else if (ch !== ' ') hud.text(x, y, hasGlyph(ch) ? ch : '?', { color, shadow, scale });\n    x += 6 * scale;\n  }\n  return x;\n}\n\nexport function measureText(text, scale = 1) {\n  return { width: String(text).length * 6 * scale, height: 9 * scale };\n}\n\n/** Wrap to a character width. Each piece is at most `cols` characters. */\nexport function wrapText(text, cols) {\n  const width = Math.max(1, cols | 0);\n  const words = String(text).split(/\\s+/).filter(Boolean);\n  const lines = [];\n  let line = '';\n  for (const word of words) {\n    const next = line ? `${line} ${word}` : word;\n    if (next.length <= width) line = next;\n    else {\n      if (line) lines.push(line);\n      if (word.length <= width) line = word;\n      else {\n        for (let i = 0; i < word.length; i += width) lines.push(word.slice(i, i + width));\n        line = '';\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  if (line) lines.push(line);\n  return lines.length ? lines : [''];\n}\n"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8e735fb6-9500-4b6e-b7f8-d205aa1b30b8-90","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/core/device.js","content":"const KEYS = ['Enter', 'Space', 'Escape', 'Backspace', 'KeyW', 'KeyA', 'KeyS', 'KeyD', 'KeyE', 'KeyQ', 'KeyF', 'KeyJ', 'KeyP', 'KeyM', 'KeyV', 'KeyB', 'ArrowUp', 'ArrowDown', 'ArrowLeft', 'ArrowRight', 'ShiftLeft', 'ShiftRight'];\nconst PADS = ['PadCross', 'PadCircle', 'PadSquare', 'PadTriangle', 'PadL1', 'PadR1', 'PadL2', 'PadR2', 'PadOptions', 'PadCreate', 'PadUp', 'PadDown', 'PadLeft', 'PadRight'];\n\n/** Last device that did something. Prompts follow it. */\nexport class Device {\n  constructor() {\n    this.kind = 'keyboard';\n  }\n  update(ctx) {\n    const input = ctx.input;\n    const pad = input.padAxis || { x: 0, y: 0 };\n    if (Math.hypot(pad.x, pad.y) > 0.3) this.kind = 'pad';\n    for (const code of PADS) if (input.wasPressed(code)) this.kind = 'pad';\n    const moved = Math.hypot(input.mouseDelta?.x || 0, input.mouseDelta?.y || 0);\n    if (moved > 2 || input.wheel || input.wasPressed('MouseLeft') || input.wasPressed('MouseRight') || input.wasPressed('MouseMiddle')) this.kind = 'mouse';\n    for (const code of KEYS) if (input.wasPressed(code)) this.kind = 'keyboard';\n    return this.kind;\n  }\n}\n\nexport function detectTouchOnly() {\n  if (typeof matchMedia !== 'function') return false;\n  let coarse = false;\n  try {\n    coarse = matchMedia('(hover: none) and (pointer: coarse)').matches;\n  } catch {\n    coarse = false;\n  }\n  if (!coarse) return false;\n  try {\n    const list = typeof navigator !== 'undefined' && navigator.getGamepads ? navigator.getGamepads() : [];\n    if (Array.from(list || []).some((p) => p && p.connected)) return false;\n  } catch {\n    /* no pads */\n  }\n  return true;\n}\n"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8e735fb6-9500-4b6e-b7f8-d205aa1b30b8-91","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/core/actions.js","content":"/** One map. Menus and prompts read it. Gameplay still goes through the drivers. */\nexport const ACTIONS = {\n  confirm: { pad: 'PadCross', keys: ['Enter', 'Space', 'KeyE'], mouse: 'MouseLeft', verb: 'Confirm' },\n  back: { pad: 'PadCircle', keys: ['Escape', 'Backspace'], mouse: 'MouseRight', verb: 'Back' },\n  pause: { pad: 'PadOptions', keys: ['KeyP', 'Escape'], verb: 'Pause' },\n  up: { pad: 'PadUp', keys: ['ArrowUp', 'KeyW'] },\n  down: { pad: 'PadDown', keys: ['ArrowDown', 'KeyS'] },\n  left: { pad: 'PadLeft', keys: ['ArrowLeft', 'KeyA'] },\n  right: { pad: 'PadRight', keys: ['ArrowRight', 'KeyD'] },\n  tabPrev: { pad: 'PadL1', keys: ['KeyQ'] },\n  tabNext: { pad: 'PadR1', keys: ['KeyE'] },\n  breath: { pad: 'PadR2', keys: ['Space'], mouse: 'MouseLeft' },\n  stepL: { pad: 'PadL1', keys: ['KeyF'] },\n  stepR: { pad: 'PadR1', keys: ['KeyJ'] },\n};\n\nexport const GAMEPAD_BUTTONS = {\n  0: 'PadCross',\n  1: 'PadCircle',\n  2: 'PadSquare',\n  3: 'PadTriangle',\n  4: 'PadL1',\n  5: 'PadR1',\n  6: 'PadL2',\n  7: 'PadR2',\n  8: 'PadCreate',\n  9: 'PadOptions',\n  10: 'PadL3',\n  11: 'PadR3',\n  12: 'PadUp',\n  13: 'PadDown',\n  14: 'PadLeft',\n  15: 'PadRight',\n};\n\nexport function promptFor(kind, glyphs, verb) {\n  if (kind === 'mouse') return `Click ${verb}`;\n  if (kind === 'keyboard') return `Enter ${verb}`;\n  if (glyphs === 'xbox') return `A ${verb}`;\n  return `Cross ${verb}`;\n}\n\nexport function glyphKind(deviceKind, glyphs) {\n  if (deviceKind === 'mouse') return 'mouse';\n  if (deviceKind === 'keyboard') return 'key';\n  return glyphs === 'xbox' ? 'xbox' : 'playstation';\n}\n"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8e735fb6-9500-4b6e-b7f8-d205aa1b30b8-92","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/audio/voice.js","content":"/** Animalese. Same word, same syllables. A question rises at the end. */\n\nexport const SPEAKERS = {\n  ounce: { f0: 340, rate: 13, formant: 1.25 },\n  coach: { f0: 165, rate: 7.5, formant: 0.9, flat: true },\n  marguerite: { f0: 230, rate: 9, formant: 1, vibrato: true },\n  dennis: { f0: 120, rate: 11, formant: 0.95, lastUp: true },\n  june: { f0: 300, rate: 10, formant: 1.15, flat: true },\n  kevin: null,\n};\n\nconst VOWELS = ['a', 'e', 'i', 'o', 'u'];\nconst CONS = ['b', 'd', 'f', 'g', 'k', 'l', 'm', 'n', 'p', 'r', 's', 't'];\nconst FORMANTS = {\n  a: [800, 1200],\n  e: [500, 1900],\n  i: [300, 2300],\n  o: [500, 900],\n  u: [350, 800],\n};\n\nfunction hash(s) {\n  let h = 2166136261;\n  for (let i = 0; i < s.length; i++) {\n    h ^= s.charCodeAt(i);\n    h = Math.imul(h, 16777619);\n  }\n  return h >>> 0;\n}\n\nfunction wordShape(word) {\n  const clean = word.toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z]/g, '') || 'mm';\n  const n = Math.max(1, Math.min(3, Math.round(clean.length / 2.5)));\n  const syl = [];\n  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n    const h = hash(`${clean}:${i}`);\n    syl.push({ vowel: VOWELS[h % 5], cons: CONS[(h >>> 8) % CONS.length] });\n  }\n  return syl;\n}\n\n/**\n * Pure. `[{ t, dur, f0, vowel, cons, charIndex }]`.\n * Kevin never speaks words.\n */\nexport function syllabify(text, speaker = 'ounce') {\n  const spec = SPEAKERS[speaker] || SPEAKERS.ounce;\n  if (!spec) return [];\n  const src = String(text);\n  const question = src.includes('?');\n  const bang = src.includes('!');\n  const slow = src.includes('...');\n  const re = /[A-Za-z0-9']+/g;\n  const words = [];\n  let m;\n  while ((m = re.exec(src))) words.push({ word: m[0], index: m.index });\n  const shapes = words.map((w) => wordShape(w.word));\n  const total = shapes.reduce((n, s) => n + s.length, 0) || 1;\n  const base = 1 / spec.rate;\n  const dur = base * (slow ? 1.45 : 1);\n  const out = [];\n  let t = 0;\n  let seen = 0;\n  shapes.forEach((shape, wi) => {\n    shape.forEach((syl, si) => {\n      const u = total <= 1 ? 0 : seen / (total - 1);\n      let f0 = spec.f0;\n      if (!spec.flat) f0 *= 1 - 0.15 * u;\n      if (question && u > 0.66) f0 *= 1.25;\n      if (bang && u > 0.8) f0 *= 1.15;\n      if (spec.lastUp && wi === shapes.length - 1) f0 *= 1.08;\n      if (spec.vibrato) f0 *= 1 + 0.03 * Math.sin(seen * 2.2);\n      out.push({\n        t,\n        dur: dur * 0.92,\n        f0,\n        vowel: syl.vowel,\n        cons: syl.cons,\n        charIndex: words[wi].index,\n      });\n      t += dur;\n      seen += 1;\n      si;\n    });\n    t += dur * 0.35;\n  });\n  return out;\n}\n\nfunction noiseBurst(ctx, destination, when, seconds, volume) {\n  const n = Math.max(1, Math.floor(ctx.sampleRate * seconds));\n  const buffer = ctx.createBuffer(1, n, ctx.sampleRate);\n  const data = buffer.getChannelData(0);\n  let s = 12345;\n  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n    s = (s * 1664525 + 1013904223) >>> 0;\n    data[i] = ((s >>> 8) / 0xffffff) * 2 - 1;\n  }\n  const src = ctx.createBufferSource();\n  src.buffer = buffer;\n  const g = ctx.createGain();\n  g.gain.setValueAtTime(volume, when);\n  g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.0001, when + seconds);\n  src.connect(g);\n  g.connect(destination);\n  src.start(when);\n  src.stop(when + seconds + 0.01);\n}\n\n/** Schedule syllables onto any BaseAudioContext. No-op without one. */\nexport function renderVoice(audioCtx, destination, syllables, when = 0) {\n  if (!audioCtx || !destination || !syllables?.length) return false;\n  for (const syl of syllables) {\n    const t0 = when + syl.t;\n    const osc = audioCtx.createOscillator();\n    osc.type = 'sawtooth';\n    osc.frequency.setValueAtTime(Math.max(40, syl.f0), t0);\n    const g = audioCtx.createGain();\n    g.gain.setValueAtTime(0.0001, t0);\n    g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.35, t0 + 0.006);\n    g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.0001, t0 + Math.max(0.04, syl.dur));\n    const pair = FORMANTS[syl.vowel] || FORMANTS.a;\n    const shift = (SPEAKERS.ounce && syl.formant) || 1;\n    for (const freq of pair) {\n      const filter = audioCtx.createBiquadFilter();\n      filter.type = 'bandpass';\n      filter.frequency.value = Math.max(80, freq * (syl.formantShift || 1));\n      filter.Q.value = 6;\n      osc.connect(filter);\n      filter.connect(g);\n      freq;\n      shift;\n    }\n    g.connect(destination);\n    osc.start(t0);\n    osc.stop(t0 + syl.dur + 0.03);\n    const plosive = 'bdgpkt'.includes(syl.cons);\n    const fricative = 'fsvz'.includes(syl.cons);\n    if (plosive) noiseBurst(audioCtx, destination, t0, 0.008, 0.15);\n    else if (fricative) noiseBurst(audioCtx, destination, t0, 0.04, 0.08);\n  }\n  return true;\n}\n\n/** Live path. Headless and locked audio do nothing. */\nexport function speak(ctx, text, speaker = 'ounce') {\n  const audio = ctx?.audio;\n  const audioCtx = audio?.context;\n  if (!audioCtx) return syllabify(text, speaker);\n  const syllables = syllabify(text, speaker);\n  const bus = audio.buses?.sfx || audio.buses?.voice || audio.master;\n  if (!bus) return syllables;\n  const spec = SPEAKERS[speaker];\n  for (const syl of syllables) syl.formantShift = spec?.formant || 1;\n  try {\n    renderVoice(audioCtx, bus, syllables, audioCtx.currentTime + 0.02);\n  } catch {\n    /* the context may be closed */\n  }\n  return syllables;\n}\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":474,"output_tokens":6405,"cache_read_input_tokens":186496,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"6204aa72-66de-48e9-bceb-a83fb0bc8082"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-8e735fb6-9500-4b6e-b7f8-d205aa1b30b8-89","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"// Mixed case on a 6px grid. Lowercase is drawn as sprites. Everything else uses hud.text.\\nconst H = {\\n  a: '00 00 0e 01 0f 11 0f 00 00', b: '10 10 1e 11 11 11 1e 00 00', c: '00 00 0e 11 10 11 0e 00 00', d: '01 01 0f 11 11 11 0f 00 00',\\n  e: '00 00 0e 11 1f 10 0e 00 00', f: '06 09 08 1c 08 08 08 00 00', g: '00 00 0f 11 11 11 0f 01 0e', h: '10 10 1e 11 11 11 11 00 00',\\n  i: '04 00 0c 04 04 04 0e 00 00', j: '02 00 06 02 02 02 02 12 0c', k: '10 10 12 14 18 14 12 00 00', l: '0c 04 04 04 04 04 0e 00 00',\\n  m: '00 00 1a 15 15 15 15 00 00', n: '00 00 1e 11 11 11 11 00 00', o: '00 00 0e 11 11 11 0e 00 00', p: '00 00 1e 11 11 11 1e 10 10',\\n  q: '00 00 0f 11 11 11 0f 01 01', r: '00 00 16 19 10 10 10 00 00', s: '00 00 0f 10 0e 01 1e 00 00', t: '08 08 1c 08 08 09 06 00 00',\\n  u: '00 00 11 11 11 13 0d 00 00', v: '00 00 11 11 11 0a 04 00 00', w: '00 00 11 11 15 15 0a 00 00', x: '00 00 11 0a 04 0a 11 00 00',\\n  y: '00 00 11 11 11 11 0f 01 0e', z: '00 00 1f 02 04 08 1f 00 00',\\n};\\n\\nexport const GLYPHS = Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(H).map(([k, v]) => [k, v.split(' ').map((h) => parseInt(h, 16).toString(2).padStart(5, '0').replace(/0/g, '.').replace(/1/g, 'o'))]));\\n\\n/** Characters hud.text can draw, plus the lowercase sprites above. */\\nexport const HUD_EXTRA = \\\"ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ0123456789.,!?'\\\\\\\": :;-()/+%*\\\";\\n\\nexport function hasGlyph(ch) {\\n  if (ch === ' ' || ch === '\\\\n') return true;\\n  if (GLYPHS[ch]) return true;\\n  return HUD_EXTRA.includes(ch);\\n}\\n\\nexport function missingGlyphs(text) {\\n  const bad = [];\\n  for (const ch of String(text)) if (!hasGlyph(ch)) bad.push(ch);\\n  return bad;\\n}\\n\\nexport function say(hud, x, y, text, { color = 'white', shadow = 'ink', scale = 1 } = {}) {\\n  for (const ch of String(text)) {\\n    const g = GLYPHS[ch];\\n    if (g) hud.sprite(x, y, g, { o: color }, { scale, shadow });\\n    else if (ch !== ' ') hud.text(x, y, hasGlyph(ch) ? ch : '?', { color, shadow, scale });\\n    x += 6 * scale;\\n  }\\n  return x;\\n}\\n\\nexport function measureText(text, scale = 1) {\\n  return { width: String(text).length * 6 * scale, height: 9 * scale };\\n}\\n\\n/** Wrap to a character width. Each piece is at most `cols` characters. */\\nexport function wrapText(text, cols) {\\n  const width = Math.max(1, cols | 0);\\n  const words = String(text).split(/\\\\s+/).filter(Boolean);\\n  const lines = [];\\n  let line = '';\\n  for (const word of words) {\\n    const next = line ? `${line} ${word}` : word;\\n    if (next.length <= width) line = next;\\n    else {\\n      if (line) lines.push(line);\\n      if (word.length <= width) line = word;\\n      else {\\n        for (let i = 0; i < word.length; i += width) lines.push(word.slice(i, i + width));\\n        line = '';\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  if (line) lines.push(line);\\n  return lines.length ? lines : [''];\\n}\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/ui/font.js has been created.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/ui/font.js has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/ui/font.js\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"// Mixed case on a 6px grid. Lowercase is drawn as sprites. Everything else uses hud.text.\\nconst H = {\\n  a: '00 00 0e 01 0f 11 0f 00 00', b: '10 10 1e 11 11 11 1e 00 00', c: '00 00 0e 11 10 11 0e 00 00', d: 