" * colour following. `skyAt(hour)` is pure (keyframes interpolated, unit-tested); `applySky`\"},{\"line_number\":8,\"content\":\" *   const s = skyAt(18.5);                 // 0..24\"},{\"line_number\":9,\"content\":\" *   applySky(engine, s);                   // or read s.night to light the lanterns\"},{\"line_number\":26,\"content\":\"export declare function skyAt(hour: number): SkyState;\"},{\"line_number\":28,\"content\":\"export declare function applySky(engine: Pick<Engine, 'sun' | 'ambient' | 'scene' | 'setSunDirection'>, s: SkyState): void;\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/types/engine/render/PixelRenderer.d.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":6,\"content\":\"/** The engine renders with WebGPU only (docs/DOCTRINE.md, principle 6); `headless` draws nothing (`Engine.headless`). */\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/types/engine/model/catalog.d.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":5,\"content\":\" * and `buildModel('id')` resolve ids through one (the library unless a build passes another);\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/types/engine/render/headlessView.d.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":2,\"content\":\" * The view `Engine.headless` runs with (docs/engine/headless.md): no GPU and no DOM. It keeps what\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/types/engine/model/compile.d.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":5,\"content\":\" * only), so the checks, the sheets and `buildModel` share it.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-202611