=\\\"Left stick, WASD or mouse: lean. R2, Space or click: breathe. L1/R1, F/J: step.\\\">\"},{\"line_number\":578,\"content\":\"<meta name=\\\"hub:session-minutes\\\" content=\\\"4\\\">\"},{\"line_number\":579,\"content\":\"<meta name=\\\"hub:webgpu\\\" content=\\\"required\\\">\"},{\"line_number\":763,\"content\":\"Download the kit (the URL is in your brief) and copy the contents of the zip's top-level `pixel-engine/` folder into the dev folder, so `pixel-engine.js`, `check.mjs` and the guides sit at its root. **Never edit `pixel-engine.js`**: record its sha256 in `vendor/pixel-engine.sha256` when you unzip, and a test compares it. Fetch the hub's `session.js`, `harness.html`, `bridge.js`, `round.js` and `README.md` into `vendor/hub/` from `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/michaelcrosato/ai-hub/main/lib/hub/`.\"},{\"line_number\":794,\"content\":\"## 17. Verified recipes\"},{\"line_number\":799,\"content\":\"// tools/build.mjs (esbuild is on this machine)\"},{\"line_number\":800,\"content\":\"execFileSync('esbuild', ['src/main.js', '--bundle', '--format=esm', '--platform=browser', '--target=esnext', '--charset=utf8', '--outfile=.build/bundle.js', '--log-level=warning'], { stdio: 'inherit' });\"},{\"line_number\":805,\"content\":\"<script>${readFileSync('vendor/hub/session.js', 'utf8')}</script>\"},{\"line_number\":944,\"content\":\"For Source Information: Source is Wii Fit; Genre and Perspective as in section 1; Tech: Pixel Engine with its version, three.js r186 and Rapier as bundled in it, esbuild for packaging; Art: the engine's native pixel look; Animation: engine `ClipDef`s with `AnimationMixer`; Audio: engine `Song` and `SoundDef` data plus a Web Audio formant voice; Online: AI Hub Session Protocol v1, ghost mode, own card, 1-4 players; Family Hour is local. For Research, describe what you did yourself, and note that the director's plan included engine and hub research and spikes.\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"9f840e8b-4b67-4606-aa70-54259a85a957"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_133","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to understand setKey and step.\n\nI'll check Input.setKey, Engine.step, and app.js rowsFor to build the week navigation. PLAN section 17 will provide the HTML template and gamepad remap. I also need hub session.js for AIHub API details. The plan is to fix app.js, write world.js, main.js, build.mjs, and test.mjs.\n\nI'll read more of app.js: rowsFor, openPause, activateDev, and setDriver. I also need the PLAN build recipe and hub connect details. The activities list will provide star thresholds for tests. I need to check weigh duration so the week script can wait correctly. sim.done conditions and durations will let tests step until completion instead of using fixed frames. The week test needs a D1 tree plus one other activity, a D2 activity with at least two stars, a new D3 activity, and three plays.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6b6b049f-01e6-43ff-a93d-57f1eae24848-33","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/app.js","offset":188,"limit":220}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6b6b049f-01e6-43ff-a93d-57f1eae24848-34","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/app.js","offset":740,"limit":240}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6b6b049f-01e6-43ff-a93d-57f1eae24848-35","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/PLAN.md","offset":540,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6b6b049f-01e6-43ff-a93d-57f1eae24848-36","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/PLAN.md","offset":780,"limit":180}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4309,"output_tokens":745,"cache_read_input_tokens":67456,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"48e936c4-a136-4800-8488-46dbc8a4ab4b"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-6b6b049f-01e6-43ff-a93d-57f1eae24848-33","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"188→  go(mode, arg) {\\n    if (mode === 'activity') {\\n190→      this.startActivity(typeof arg === 'string' ? arg : arg?.id);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (mode === 'medley') {\\n      this.openMedley(arg || {});\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    this.mode = mode;\\n    if (mode === 'title') {\\n      this.attracting = false;\\n200→      this.drop = false;\\n      this.idle = 0;\\n    }\\n    if (mode === 'island') this.islandPage = 0;\\n    if (mode === 'name') this.focus = 0;\\n    this.refresh(mode !== 'dev');\\n  }\\n\\n  setDriver(skill) {\\n    this.driver = skill || null;\\n210→    this.skillPick = Math.max(0, SKILLS.indexOf(this.driver));\\n    if (this.sim?.setSkill && this.driver) this.sim.setSkill(this.driver);\\n  }\\n\\n  refresh(resetFocus = false) {\\n    this.rows = this.rowsFor().slice(0, 8);\\n    if (resetFocus) this.focus = 0;\\n    if (this.focus >= this.rows.length) this.focus = Math.max(0, this.rows.length - 1);\\n  }\\n\\n220→  rowsFor() {\\n    const g = this.guest;\\n    switch (this.mode) {\\n      case 'title':\\n        return [{ id: 'start', label: 'Start' }];\\n      case 'menu':\\n        return [\\n          { id: 'week', label: 'Week' },\\n          { id: 'dropin', label: 'Drop-In' },\\n          { id: 'family', label: 'Family Hour' },\\n230→          { id: 'settings', label: 'Settings' },\\n          { id: 'about', label: 'About' },\\n        ];\\n      case 'slots':\\n        return [0, 1, 2].map((i) => {\\n          const slot = this.save.read().slots[i];\\n          return { id: `slot${i}`, label: slot ? `Guest ${i + 1}: ${slot.name}` : `Guest ${i + 1}: empty` };\\n        }).concat([{ id: 'back', label: 'Back' }]);\\n      case 'name':\\n        return [{ id: 'done', label: `Done (${this.nameBuf || 'Guest'})` }];\\n240→      case 'ferry':\\n        return [{ id: 'board', label: 'Board' }];\\n      case 'question':\\n        return (this.question?.answers || []).map((label, i) => ({ id: `a${i}`, label }));\\n      case 'reveal':\\n        return [{ id: 'onward', label: 'Onward' }];\\n      case 'island':\\n        return this.islandRows();\\n      case 'station':\\n        return this.stationRows();\\n250→      case 'results':\\n        return [\\n          { id: 'retry', label: 'Retry' },\\n          { id: 'next', label: 'Next' },\\n          { id: 'back', label: 'Island' },\\n        ];\\n      case 'hammock':\\n        return [{ id: 'rest', label: 'Rest' }];\\n      case 'report':\\n        return [{ id: 'sleep', label: 'Sleep' }];\\n260→      case 'confession':\\n        return [{ id: 'onward', label: 'Onward' }];\\n      case 'credits':\\n        return [{ id: 'onward', label: 'Onward' }];\\n      case 'settings':\\n        return this.settingsRows();\\n      case 'about':\\n      case 'howto':\\n        return [{ id: 'back', label: 'Back' }];\\n      case 'pause':\\n270→        return this.session\\n          ? [{ id: 'resume', label: 'Resume' }, { id: 'settings', label: 'Settings' }]\\n          : [\\n            { id: 'resume', label: 'Resume' },\\n            { id: 'restart', label: 'Restart' },\\n            { id: 'island', label: 'Island' },\\n            { id: 'settings', label: 'Settings' },\\n            { id: 'howto', label: 'How to play' },\\n            { id: 'about', label: 'About' },\\n            { id: 'dev', label: 'Dev Tools' },\\n280→          ];\\n      case 'dev':\\n        return this.devRows();\\n      case 'join':\\n        return [\\n          { id: 'fill', label: 'Fill with classmates' },\\n          { id: 'start', label: 'Start' },\\n          { id: 'back', label: 'Back' },\\n        ];\\n      case 'podium':\\n290→        return [{ id: 'again', label: 'Rematch' }, { id: 'back', label: 'Back' }];\\n      case 'locker':\\n        return [\\n          { id: 'skin', label: `Skin ${g?.look?.skin || ''}` },\\n          { id: 'hair', label: `Hair ${g?.look?.hair || ''}` },\\n          { id: 'top', label: `Top ${g?.look?.top || ''}` },\\n          { id: 'bottom', label: `Bottom ${g?.look?.bottom || ''}` },\\n          { id: 'headband', label: `Band ${g?.look?.headband || ''}` },\\n          { id: 'back', label: 'Back' },\\n        ];\\n300→      case 'hall':\\n      case 'jar':\\n        return [{ id: 'back', label: 'Back' }];\\n      case 'dropin':\\n        return [{ id: 'play', label: 'Play' }, { id: 'back', label: 'Back' }];\\n      default:\\n        return [];\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n310→  islandRows() {\\n    if (this.islandPage === 0) {\\n      return [\\n        ...STATIONS.map((s) => ({ id: `st-${s.id}`, label: s.name.replace(' of Holding Still', '').replace('The ', '').replace('Jogging Path', 'Jog') })),\\n        { id: 'more', label: 'More' },\\n      ];\\n    }\\n    const rows = [\\n      { id: 'jar', label: 'Sweat Jar' },\\n      { id: 'locker', label: 'Locker' },\\n320→      { id: 'hall', label: 'Hall' },\\n      { id: 'hammock', label: 'Hammock' },\\n    ];\\n    if (this.isOpen(ACTIVITY_BY_ID.longstand)) rows.push({ id: 'longstand', label: 'Long Stand' });\\n    rows.push({ id: 'back', label: 'Back' });\\n    return rows;\\n  }\\n\\n  stationRows() {\\n    const rows = activitiesAt(this.station).filter((a) => this.isOpen(a)).map((a) => ({ id: `act-${a.id}`, label: a.name }));\\n330→    if ((this.guest && (this.guest.day >= 6 || this.guest.unlockAll)) || this.drop) {\\n      rows.push({ id: 'hard', label: this.guest?.hard ? 'Hard: on' : 'Hard: off' });\\n    }\\n    rows.push({ id: 'back', label: 'Back' });\\n    return rows.slice(0, 8);\\n  }\\n\\n  settingsRows() {\\n    const s = this.settings;\\n    if ((this.setPage || 0) === 0) {\\n340→      return [\\n        { id: 'music', label: `Music ${Math.round(s.music * 100)}` },\\n        { id: 'sfx', label: `SFX ${Math.round(s.sfx * 100)}` },\\n        { id: 'voice', label: `Voice ${Math.round(s.voice * 100)}` },\\n        { id: 'glyphs', label: s.glyphs === 'xbox' ? 'Glyphs: Xbox' : 'Glyphs: PlayStation' },\\n        { id: 'gentle', label: s.gentle ? 'Gentle: on' : 'Gentle: off' },\\n        { id: 'more', label: 'More' },\\n      ];\\n    }\\n    return [\\n350→      { id: 'radius', label: `Mouse radius ${this.tunables.mouseLeanRadius}` },\\n      { id: 'offset', label: `Step offset ${this.tunables.stepOffsetMs}` },\\n      { id: 'flashes', label: s.flashes ? 'Flashes: low' : 'Flashes: on' },\\n      { id: 'look', label: `Look ${s.look}` },\\n      { id: 'pixel', label: `Pixels ${s.pixel}` },\\n      { id: 'full', label: 'Fullscreen' },\\n      { id: 'reset', label: 'Reset' },\\n      { id: 'back', label: 'Back' },\\n    ];\\n  }\\n360→\\n  devTabName() {\\n    return [...Object.keys(TUNABLE_TABS), 'Tools'][this.devTab] || 'Balance';\\n  }\\n\\n  devRows() {\\n    const tab = this.devTabName();\\n    if (tab === 'Tools') {\\n      const start = this.toolPage * 5;\\n      const slice = DEV_TOOLS.slice(start, start + 5).map(([id, label]) => ({ id, label: this.toolLabel(id, label) }));\\n370→      const rows = slice;\\n      if (start + 5 < DEV_TOOLS.length) rows.push({ id: 'more', label: 'More' });\\n      else if (this.toolPage > 0) rows.push({ id: 'prev', label: 'Previous' });\\n      rows.push({ id: 'back', label: 'Back' });\\n      return rows;\\n    }\\n    const keys = tabKeys(tab);\\n    const start = this.devPage * 5;\\n    const rows = keys.slice(start, start + 5).map((key) => ({ id: key, label: `${key} ${this.fmt(this.tunables[key])}` }));\\n    if (start + 5 < keys.length) rows.push({ id: 'more', label: 'More' });\\n380→    else if (this.devPage > 0) rows.push({ id: 'prev', label: 'Previous' });\\n    rows.push({ id: 'reset-tab', label: 'Reset tab' });\\n    rows.push({ id: 'reset-all', label: 'Reset all' });\\n    return rows;\\n  }\\n\\n  toolLabel(id, label) {\\n    if (id === 'day') return `Day ${this.guest?.day || 