tent\":\"     * Tooling: the render loop stops driving the game; advance it yourself with `step()`.\"},{\"line_number\":385,\"content\":\"     * console. It runs in manual time from the start: advance it with `step()`, give it input with\"},{\"line_number\":484,\"content\":\"    step(n?: number, dt?: number): void;\"},{\"line_number\":486,\"content\":\"     * One manual frame (`step()`), its input live or from a recorded frame (`replay()`). A game\"},{\"line_number\":487,\"content\":\"     * hook's exception finishes the frame first, then is thrown to the caller of `step()`; in a\"},{\"line_number\":544,\"content\":\"    /** Keep this frame's input in the level's recording (live play and `step()`, not replays). */\"},{\"line_number\":555,\"content\":\"     * (`step()`), waiting for promise callbacks wherever the recorded run did. `frames` stops\"},{\"line_number\":557,\"content\":\"     * game is deterministic) and stays in manual time: `step()` plays on from there, live, and\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"8288e3e8-3c58-446d-9b6d-da419cb76af0"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_136","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking whether GhostDriver.present exists and if it calls Dot.\n\nReading the rest of drivers.js and WeighSim. Checking if parseSong is exported from the engine. Searching for applyVolumes in app.js. Verifying headless HUD methods like clear and rect. Confirming Engine.step defaults to 1/60. Ensuring World.setup sets music volume to 0.10.\n\nChecking whether leftover localStorage data from prior runs could override the default music volume. Playwright contexts are fresh by default, so tests should not encounter stale save data.\n\nWorld.setup must call setVolume after engine initialization to overwrite any leftover pixel-engine:settings volume. The audio.setVolume API and gamepad remap also need review.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8a9bb38a-b672-4c35-a475-6e65f0ce49c7-54","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"gamepadButtons|PadCross|0\\.12","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/PLAN.md"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8a9bb38a-b672-4c35-a475-6e65f0ce49c7-55","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/core/device.js","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8a9bb38a-b672-4c35-a475-6e65f0ce49c7-56","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/core/drivers.js","offset":120,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8a9bb38a-b672-4c35-a475-6e65f0ce49c7-57","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/audio/songs.js","limit":90}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8a9bb38a-