a the engine repository's `npm run model -- credits` reads) and from the bundled packages' own licence files. Ship this file with a game built on the kit.\\\\n\\\\n## Models and textures\\\\n\\\\n- **The engine's own work**, made in its repository: 151 of the 151 library models (`MODEL_LIBRARY`), 126 of the 126 textures (`TEXTURE_LIBRARY`) and the built-in models (`assets/coin.glb`, `assets/hero.glb`, `assets/tree.glb`). Nothing to credit.\\\\n- **kenney-castle** by Kenney, Creative Commons Zero 1.0 (public domain dedication) (CC0-1.0, credit optional): https://kenney.nl/media/pages/assets/castle-kit/a395102d20-1711543616/kenney_castle-kit.zip. Models: kenney-castle/bridge-draw, kenney-castle/bridge-straight-pillar, kenney-castle/bridge-straight, kenney-castle/door, kenney-castle/flag-banner-long, kenney-c [... truncated (1031 chars total)]\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/core/tunables.js\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":4,\"content\":\"export const TUNABLE_TABS = {\"},{\"line_number\":43,\"content\":\"export function defaultTunables() {\"},{\"line_number\":51,\"content\":\"export const DEFAULT_TUNABLES = defaultTunables();\"},{\"line_number\":53,\"content\":\"export function cloneTunables(src = DEFAULT_TUNABLES) {\"},{\"line_number\":57,\"content\":\"export function tabKeys(name) {\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/core/rng.js\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":2,\"content\":\"export function mulberry32(seed) {\"},{\"line_number\":13,\"content\":\"export function hashString(s) {\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/core/dot.js\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":2,\"content\":\"export class Dot {\"},{\"line_number\":38,\"conte