{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_172","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to understand how Engine.headless and loadGame work so tests can reuse one engine.\n\nI also need to understand the replay API. Full headless simulation of expert bot tests would take roughly 400–500 seconds of game time, but batching at 60fps should reduce that to about 5–10 seconds.\n\nConfirmed that engine.step(n) runs n fixed updates. A 30-second activity can be simulated with step(1800). The week test plan starts with booting headless and navigating menus.\n\nSet the driver to 'expert' before each activity to skip intros. Step frames until the mode leaves the activity state.\n\nThe weigh activity alone needs 6720 frames. Other activities vary in length.\n\nMenu screens are MENU_IDLE, so attract mode can start after ten seconds of idle input. I must choose an option quickly rather than stepping while on menus. Activities and weigh are not MENU_IDLE, so attract does not interfere during those states.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6103c2af-a89d-435c-b080-c8a4f202aa73-13","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"headless\\(|step\\(|loadGame\\(|recording\\(|replay\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607","glob":"*.d.ts","head_limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6103c2af-a89d-435c-b080-c8a4f202aa73-14","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/scenes/world.js","limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6103c2af-a89d-435c-b080-c8a4f202aa73-15","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/core/save.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6103c2