{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_176","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"validateClip requires HERO_RIG.\n\nanalyzeClip returns a ClipReport with problems. I need to replicate the exact dot band measurement method from the previous script. The acceptance criteria specify ring 0.30, ignoring the first 2 seconds, and target idle below 20%, average 35–65%, good above 80%, and expert above 95%.\n\nThe prior test used Dot and BotDriver directly, not the full still sim. I am now writing a `timeInRing` measurement function that seeds Dot and BotDriver with mulberry32, runs 37 seconds of 60 fps frames, and counts time inside the ring.\n\nThe `timeInRing` loop is complete. It steps Dot and the bot, counts frames inside the 0.30 ring after the first two seconds, and returns the ratio.\n\nI worry that the exact bot random seed may differ from my current guess. I will check the segment transcript for the original measurement script.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-32626dee-197b-433e-9261-0c34bad05d0a-35","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"idle 7\\.1|timeInRing|ring 0\\.30","path":"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3%2Fwork/01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","head_limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-32626dee-197b-433e-9261-0c34bad05d0a-36","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"problems","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/types/engine/animation/metrics.d.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-32626dee-197b-433e-9261-0c34bad05d0a-37","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/core/sims.js","offset":990,"limit":90}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-32626dee-197b-433e-9261-0c34bad05d0a-38