 \\\"text\\\": \\\"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\\\\n\\\\nSummary:\\\\n1. Primary Request and Intent: The user (via the goal harness) requires implementing the game described in STAGE.md / PLAN.md / TASK.md in the workspace, fully, with no follow-up questions and no leftover manual steps. Do not restart this goal or revive a prior unrelated task. Continue from the current next step.\\\\n\\\\nWorkspace: /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work\\\\n\\\\nSTAGE.md: \\\\\\\"Build the game PLAN.md describes. Take your file names and what to hand in from TASK.md... Keep progress in PROGRESS.md.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nTASK.md: Original game inspired by SOURCE Wii Fit. Single HTML named [GameTitle-SOURCE-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607].html in the workspace root. Dev subfolder of the same stem. Build on pixel-engine.zip; do not edit pixel-engine.js. All audio in code (Animalese/ [... truncated (1031 chars total)]\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3%2Fwork/01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469/goal/plan.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":8,\"content\":\"2. **The Dot.** Leaning (standard-mapping stick, WASD/arrows with Shift = half lean, mouse offset from the dial as a force) drives an unstable centre-of-balance with lag, sway, noise, overshoot, and velocity impulses — not a 1:1 position map. With PLAN.md’s default tunables, bot time-in-ring over ~35 s (first 2 s ignored) stays in the documented bands: at ring 0.30, idle under 20%, average about 35–65%, good over 80%, expert over 95%. Dot-score stars stay 45 / 70 / 90, so at ring 0.30 idle gets no stars, an average player one, a good player three.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3%2Fwork/01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469/goal/plan.baseline.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":8,\"content\":\"2. **The Dot.** Leaning (standard-mapping stick, WASD/arrows with Shift = half lean, mouse offset from the dial as a force) drives an unstable centre-of-balance with lag, sway, noise, overshoot, and velocity impulses — not a 1:1 position map. With PLAN.md’s default tunables, bot time-in-ring over ~35 s (first 2 s ignored) stays in the documented bands: at ring 0.30, idle under 20%, average about 35–65%, good over 80%, expert over 95%. Dot-score stars stay 45 / 70 / 90, so at ring 0.30 idle gets no stars, an average player one, a good player three.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3%2Fwork/01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469/compaction/segment_003.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":41,\"content\":\"2. The Dot: unstable centre-of-balance (lag, sway, noise, overshoot, impulses), not 1:1. Default tunables. Bot time-in-ring ~35s (first 2s ignored): ring 0.30 idle &lt;20%, average ~35–65%, good &gt;80%, expert &gt;95%. Stars 45/70/90 so idle 0, average 1, good 3.\"},{\"line_number\":69,\"content\":\"- Dot EXACT from PLAN §4 (src/core/dot.js). Defaults: dotInstability 0.6, dotAuthority 3.0, dotDamping 3.4, dotNoise 0.8, dotLag 0.08. p clamped to radius 1.2 with velocity *0.3. Dot.t accumulates dt. Constructor calls rand() four times — rand MUST be a function. Engine Rng is not callable; use ctx.random.fork(label).next via a wrapper () =&gt; rng.next(). mulberry32(seed) already returns a function. THIS STRETCH remeasured seed 1 (first 2s ignored, ring 0.30, 37s): idle 7.1%, sloppy 5.0%, average 42.0%, good 92.3%, expert 100%. Seed 1 meets idle&lt;20, average 35–65, good&gt;80, expert&gt;95. Seeds 2/7 fail average band (73/68.8). Use seed 1. Do not retune. Stars 45/70/90.\"},{\"line_number\":216,\"content\":\"- Dot bands at ring 0.30 over ~37s, ignore first 2s, shipped Dot+BotDriver+mulberry32, SEED 1. idle 7.1% &lt;0.20, average 42% in 0.35–0.65, good 92.3% &gt;0.80, expert 100% &gt;0.95. starsFor 45/70/90.\"},{\"line_number\":288,\"content\":\"- Dot band script, exit 0: seed 1 idle 7.1 | sloppy 5.0 | average 42.0 | good 92.3 | expert 100.0. Other seeds logged; seed 1 is the one that fits the acceptance bands.\"},{\"line_number\":300,\"content\":\"Quote of where the work stopped: the last tool result was the seed-1 dot band (`1 idle 7.1 | sloppy 5.0 | average 42.0 | good 92.3 | expert 100.0`, exit 0). Immediately before that, the join-claim edit and the noHero constructor field were applied successfully, and analyzeClip had already passed for all 11 clips with compileClips. tools/test.mjs had not been written yet.\"},{\"line_number\":438,\"content\":\"2. The Dot: unstable centre-of-balance (lag, sway, noise, overshoot, impulses), not 1:1. Default tunables. Bot time-in-ring ~35s (first 2s ignored): ring 0.30 idle &lt;20%, average ~35–65%, good &gt;80%, expert &gt;95%. Stars 45/70/90 so idle 0, average 1, good 3.\"},{\"line_number\":468,\"content\":\"- Dot EXACT from PLAN §4 (src/core/dot.js). Defaults: dotInstability 0.6, dotAuthority 3.0, dotDamping 3.4, dotNoise 0.8, dotLag 0.08. p clamped to radius 1.2 with velocity *0.3. Dot.t accumulates dt. Constructor calls rand() four times — rand MUST be a function. Engine Rng is not callable; use ctx.random.fork(label).next via a wrapper () =&gt; rng.next(). mulberry32(seed) already returns a function. Measured bot bands (do not retune): ring 0.30 idle 7.0%, sloppy 12.6%, average 50.4%, good 92.4%, expert 100%. Stars 45/70/90.\"},{\"line_number\":3035,\"content\":\"2. **The Dot.** Leaning (standard-mapping stick, WASD/arrows with Shift = half lean, mouse offset from the dial as a force) drives an unstable centre-of-balance with lag, sway, noise, overshoot, and velocity impulses — not a 1:1 position map. With PLAN.md’s default tunables, bot time-in-ring over ~35 s (first 2 s ignored) 