dotLag 0.08. p clamped to radius 1.2 with velocity *0.3. Measured bot bands (reproduced): ring 0.30 idle 7.0%, sloppy 12.6%, average 50.4%, good 92.4%, expert 100%. Stars 45/70/90. Do not retune Dot or default bot gains.\"},{\"line_number\":218,\"content\":\"- Title RNG done: \\\"Mint Dial\\\". Dot + bots verified (40 seeds, 35s, first 2s ignored, ring 0.30). After pier fix, expert is 3★ on every activity that was swept, including pier and hard pier; idle 0★. Notable numbers: tree ~31s play 3★; hoop 60 rot; step score 100; header 1310; slack expert 0 falls 27.8s 3★; tray expert 100% in ~2.5s on the straight board only; jog ~98.6; longstand expert 98.5 / idle 4.3. Drips match 2+3*stars+floor(sec/30). WeighSim unmeasured. Practice phase untested. Split/wide tray boards unmeasured; default stays straight.\"},{\"line_number\":406,\"content\":\"2. The Dot: unstable centre-of-balance (lag, sway, noise, overshoot, impulses), not 1:1. Default tunables, bot time-in-ring ~35s (first 2s ignored): ring 0.30 idle &lt;20%, average ~35–65%, good &gt;80%, expert &gt;95%. Stars 45/70/90 so idle 0, average 1, good 3.\"},{\"line_number\":426,\"content\":\"- Dot model is EXACT from PLAN §4. Defaults: dotInstability 0.6, dotAuthority 3.0, dotDamping 3.4, dotNoise 0.8, dotLag 0.08. p clamped to radius 1.2 with velocity *0.3. Measured bot bands (already reproduced): ring 0.30 idle 7.0%, sloppy 12.6%, average 50.4%, good 92.4%, expert 100%. Stars 45/70/90. Do not retune Dot or default bot gains.\"},{\"line_number\":531,\"content\":\"  - WeighSim kinds still/lean/chase, 14s, Tscore 0..1. still: fraction in ring 0.30 after t&gt;3. lean: 3 targets (−0.7,0)/(0.7,0)/(0,0.55), hold 1.5s within 0.1, T=hits/3. chase: target x=0.42*sin(0.7t), y=0.32*sin(1.05t+0.4), T=clamp(1−meanDist*2,0,1). Not yet measured.\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-32626dee-197b-433e-9261-0c34bad05d0a-36","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,10