{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_193","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Considering whether to test the webkit session using an iframe for game.html.\n\nWill serve the parent page from the HTTP server so iframe postMessage works. The test will trigger a WebGPU unavailable error by having the parent post a welcome message to the iframe, which causes Engine.start to fail and record an error. This scenario will be included in the browser suite.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d7554f9f-736d-49af-a878-bafe7df3a1a3-68","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"exit-interview|testingFeedback|sourceInformation","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/TASK.md"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1035,"output_tokens":244,"cache_read_input_tokens":137088,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"d4590cc4-0fba-4228-afb0-39e9eab8e616"}
