{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_215","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The week passed, including confession and week 2.\n\nOnly four failures remain. The playT freeze bug is being investigated. TimeScale 0 might still run a fixed step per frame. The pause assertion order and manual step logic are being checked.\n\nThe frozen playT error confirms pause mode and zero timeScale are active. Yet playT still advanced. This means fixedUpdate is running at timeScale 0, or the clock is being updated elsewhere. The earlier probe may have targeted the wrong clock.\n\nThe engine comment near line 239 is being reviewed. The earlier empirical check showed fixedUpdate does not run at timeScale 0, so the frozen playT must come from another source. sim.playT might be incremented in update instead of fixed. Another possibility is that manual step() still triggers fixedUpdate despite the zero timeScale.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e5e555a4-d5d7-47e8-84fd-f71ba7668862-102","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/audio/voice.js","old_string":"export function syllabify(text, speaker = 'ounce') {\n  const spec = SPEAKERS[speaker] || SPEAKERS.ounce;\n  if (!spec) return [];","new_string":"export function syllabify(text, speaker = 'ounce') {\n  if (Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(SPEAKERS, speaker) && !SPEAKERS[speaker]) return [];\n  const spec = SPEAKERS[speaker] || SPEAKERS.ounce;\n  if (!spec) return [];"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e5e555a4-d5d7-47e8-84fd-f71ba7668862-103","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/app.js","old_string":"  fixed(ctx, dt) {\n    this.ctx = ctx;\n    if (this.mode === 'activity' && 