{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_234","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The engine drops key presses during frozen states, such as when a menu is open.\n\nThe test taps the down key while timeScale is 0, then taps the arrow key while timeScale remains 0. The engine drops those queued presses during the frozen state.\n\nwasPressed('Enter') fires during the update even at timeScale 0. The headless step path may not clear the input queue, or the drop might only affect the next frame.\n\nclearQueued runs before advance, so queued presses are cleared before the update sees them. If frozen, the key press delivered during beginFrame is wiped out before update can fire wasPressed. This would break menu navigation while paused.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-96a0c6ec-0eee-475e-9870-828f80031218-31","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607\" && node --input-type=module -e '\nimport { readFileSync } from \"fs\";\nconst s = readFileSync(\"pixel-engine.js\",\"utf8\");\nconst p = s.indexOf(\"step(e=1,t\");\nconsole.log(\"idx\", p);\nconsole.log(s.slice(p, p+900));\nconsole.log(\"\\\\n---- clearQueued\");\nconst q = s.indexOf(\"clearQueued()\");\nconsole.log(s.slice(q-200, q+500));\n'","description":"Read headless step and clearQueued"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1708,"output_tokens":776,"cache_read_input_tokens":74624,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"a9ab600d-1c3f-4446-826d-33dff5a94897"}
