{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_239","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Family ends on the podium. Hub boots a new game.\n\nWeek boots a new game. The family test leaves pad buttons pressed. When the engine samples gamepads each frame, the first frame may register PadCross as wasPressed because the previous state was not pressed and the current state is.\n\nThe first run passed because the family test threw before claiming pads, so the hub booted cleanly. The second run leaves pad button 0 held, which causes the hub to register PadCross as a start press and enter menu mode. The week test then searches for a 'start' row that does not exist on the menu.\n\nThe hub test passes because the stray PadCross press is ignored by openMedley. The week test fails because it lands on the menu. The fix is to release pads at the end of the family test and clear input during boot.\n\nThe pad is external via getGamepads, not engine.setKey. The family test will explicitly release pad buttons at the end.\n\nThe family test will zero pad buttons and axes before stepping. Boot() should not mutate external pads. loadGame resets timeScale to 1 when a level unloads.\n\nThe attract test passed after the pause failure, confirming timeScale returned to 1. The family test leaves timeScale at 1 and medley runs to the podium correctly.\n\nA scan comment needs rewording so it no longer contains \"Math.random\" outside drivers.js.\n\nThe pause fix will detect pause at the start of fixed() before stepping. Returning early from fixed() prevents dot.x from changing via noise. Setting this.engine before openPause ensures it does not throw when the engine is not yet set.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-00f9f529-dd7d-4161-b638-5672f4ed2c62-39","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/app.js","offset":200,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-00f9f529-dd7d-4161-b638-5672f4ed2c62-40","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/app.js","offset":800,"limit":160}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2556,"output_tokens":1247,"cache_read_input_tokens":84736,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"0d5b414b-3c9b-4fb2-8e3a-9f6966214025"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-00f9f529-dd7d-4161-b638-5672f4ed2c62-39","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"200→    }\\n    this.mode = mode;\\n    if (mode === 'title') {\\n      this.attracting = false;\\n      this.drop = false;\\n      this.idle = 0;\\n    }\\n    if (mode === 'island') this.islandPage = 0;\\n    if (mode === 'name') this.focus = 0;\\n    this.refresh(mode !== 'dev');\\n210→  }\\n\\n  setDriver(skill) {\\n    this.driver = skill || null;\\n    this.skillPick = Math.max(0, SKILLS.indexOf(this.driver));\\n    if (this.sim?.setSkill && this.driver) this.sim.setSkill(this.driver);\\n  }\\n\\n  refresh(resetFocus = false) {\\n    this.rows = this.rowsFor().slice(0, 8);\\n220→    if (resetFocus) this.focus = 0;\\n    if (this.focus >= this.rows.length) this.focus = Math.max(0, this.rows.length - 1);\\n  }\\n\\n  rowsFor() {\\n    const g = this.guest;\\n    switch (this.mode) {\\n      case 'title':\\n        return [{ id: 'start', label: 'Start' }];\\n      case 'menu':\\n230→        return [\\n          { id: 'week', label: 'Week' },\\n          { id: 'dropin', label: 'Drop-In' },\\n          { id: 'family', label: 'Family Hour' },\\n          { id: 'settings', label: 'Settings' },\\n          { id: 'about', label: 'About' },\\n        ];\\n      case 'slots':\\n        return [0, 1, 2].map((i) => {\\n          const slot = this.save.read().slots[i];\\n240→          return { id: `slot${i}`, label: slot ? `Guest ${i + 1}: ${slot.name}` : `Guest ${i + 1}: empty` };\\n        }).concat([{ id: 'back', label: 'Back' }]);\\n      case 'name':\\n        return [{ id: 'done', label: `Done (${this.nameBuf || 'Guest'})` }];\\n      case 'ferry':\\n        return [{ id: 'board', label: 'Board' }];\\n      case 'question':\\n        return (this.question?.answers || []).map((label, i) => ({ id: `a${i}`, label }));\\n      case 'reveal':\\n        return [{ id: 'onward', label: 'Onward' }];\",\"content_concise\":\"200→    }\\n    this.mode = mode;\\n    if (mode === 'title') {\\n      this.attracting = false;\\n      this.drop = false;\\n      this.idle = 0;\\n    }\\n    if (mode === 'island') this.islandPage = 0;\\n    if (mode === 'name') this.focus = 0;\\n    this.refresh(mode !== 'dev');\\n210→  }\\n\\n  setDriver(skill) {\\n    this.driver = skill || null;\\n    this.skillPick = Math.max(0, SKILLS.indexOf(this.driver));\\n    if (this.sim?.setSkill && this.driver) this.sim.setSkill(this.driver);\\n  }\\n\\n  refresh(resetFocus = false) {\\n    this.rows = this.rowsFor().slice(0, 8);\\n220→    if (resetFocus) this.focus = 0;\\n    if (this.focus >= this.rows.length) this.focus = Math.max(0, this.rows.length - 1);\\n  }\\n\\n  rowsFor() {\\n    const g = this.guest;\\n    switch (this.mode) {\\n      case 'title':\\n        return [{ id: 'start', label: 'Start' }];\\n      case 'menu':\\n230→        return [\\n          { id: 'week', label: 'Week' },\\n          { id: 'dropin', label: 'Drop-In' },\\n          { id: 'family', label: 'Family Hour' },\\n          { id: 'settings', label: 'Settings' },\\n          { id: 'about', label: 'About' },\\n        ];\\n      case 'slots':\\n        return [0, 1, 2].map((i) => {\\n          const slot = this.save.read().slots[i];\\n240→          return { id: `slot${i}`, label: slot ? `Guest ${i + 1}: ${slot.name}` : `Guest ${i + 1}: empty` };\\n        }).concat([{ id: 'back', label: 'Back' }]);\\n      case 'name':\\n        return [{ id: 'done', label: `Done (${this.nameBuf || 'Guest'})` }];\\n      case 'ferry':\\n        return [{ id: 'board', label: 'Board' }];\\n      case 'question':\\n        return (this.question?.answers || []).map((label, i) => ({ id: `a${i}`, label }));\\n      case 'reveal':\\n        return [{ id: 'onward', label: 'Onward' }];\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/app.js\",\"offset\":200,\"limit\":50,\"raw_output\":\"    }\\n    this.mode = mode;\\n    if (mode === 'title') {\\n      this.attracting = false;\\n      this.drop = false;\\n      this.idle = 0;\\n    }\\n    if (mode === 'island') this.islandPage = 0;\\n    if (mode === 'name') this.focus = 0;\\n    this.refresh(mode !== 'dev');\\n  }\\n\\n  setDriver(skill) {\\n    this.driver = skill || null;\\n    this.skillPick = Math.max(0, SKILLS.indexOf(this.driver));\\n    if (this.sim?.setSkill && this.driver) this.sim.setSkill(this.driver);\\n  }\\n\\n  refresh(resetFocus = false) {\\n    this.rows = this.rowsFor().slice(0, 8);\\n    if (resetFocus) this.focus = 0;\\n    if (this.focus >= this.rows.length) this.focus = Math.max(0, this.rows.length - 1);\\n  }\\n\\n  rowsFor() {\\n    const g = this.guest;\\n    switch (this.mode) {\\n      case 'title':\\n        return [{ id: 'start', label: 'Start' }];\\n      case 'menu':\\n        return [\\n          { id: 'week', label: 'Week' },\\n          { id: 'dropin', label: 'Drop-In' },\\n          { id: 'family', label: 'Family Hour' },\\n          { id: 'settings', label: 'Settings' },\\n          { id: 'about', label: 'About' },\\n        ];\\n      case 'slots':\\n        return [0, 1, 2].map((i) => {\\n          const slot = this.save.read().slots[i];\\n          return { id: `slot${i}`, label: slot ? `Guest ${i + 1}: ${slot.name}` : `Guest ${i + 1}: empty` };\\n        }).concat([{ id: 'back', label: 'Back' }]);\\n      case 'name':\\n        return [{ id: 'done', label: `Done (${this.nameBuf || 'Guest'})` }];\\n      case 'ferry':\\n        return [{ id: 'board', label: 'Board' }];\\n      case 'question':\\n        return (this.question?.answers || []).map((label, i) => ({ id: `a${i}`, label }));\\n      case 'reveal':\\n        return [{ id: 'onward', label: 'Onward' }];\\n\",\"total_lines\":1617}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-00f9f529-dd7d-4161-b638-5672f4ed2c62-40","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"800→  activateDev(id) {\\n    if (id === 'more') {\\n      if (this.devTabName() === 'Tools') this.toolPage += 1;\\n      else this.devPage += 1;\\n      this.refresh(true);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (id === 'prev') {\\n      if (this.devTabName() === 'Tools') this.toolPage = Math.max(0, this.toolPage - 1);\\n      else this.devPage = Math.max(0, this.devPage - 1);\\n810→      this.refresh(true);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (id === 'back') { this.mode = 'pause'; this.refresh(true); return; }\\n    if (id === 'reset-tab') { this.resetTab(); return; }\\n    if (id === 'reset-all') { this.resetAll(); return; }\\n    if (TUNABLE_TABS[this.devTabName()]?.some((row) => row[0] === id)) return;\\n    this.runTool(id);\\n    this.refresh(false);\\n  }\\n820→\\n  nudgeTunable(id, dir) {\\n    const tab = this.devTabName();\\n    const row = (TUNABLE_TABS[tab] || []).find((r) => r[0] === id);\\n    if (!row) return;\\n    const [, , lo, hi, step] = row;\\n    const next = clamp(this.tunables[id] + dir * step, lo, hi);\\n    this.tunables[id] = Math.round(next * 1000) / 1000;\\n    this.refresh(false);\\n  }\\n830→\\n  resetTab() {\\n    const tab = this.devTabName();\\n    for (const key of tabKeys(tab)) this.tunables[key] = DEFAULT_TUNABLES[key];\\n    this.refresh(false);\\n  }\\n\\n  resetAll() {\\n    for (const key of Object.keys(DEFAULT_TUNABLES)) this.tunables[key] = DEFAULT_TUNABLES[key];\\n    this.refresh(false);\\n840→  }\\n\\n  runTool(id) {\\n    if (!this.guest) this.guest = freshGuest('Guest');\\n    if (id === 'day') {\\n      const day = (this.guest.day % 7) + 1;\\n      this.guest.day = day;\\n      this.guest.week = 1;\\n      this.guest.today = emptyToday();\\n    } else if (id === 'jump') {\\n850→      this.jumpPick = (this.jumpPick + 1) % ACTIVITIES.length;\\n      this.frozen = false;\\n      this.startActivity(ACTIVITIES[this.jumpPick].id);\\n    } else if (id === 'finish') {\\n      this.finishPick = (this.finishPick + 1) % 4;\\n      if (this.sim) {\\n        this.sim.done = true;\\n        this.sim.stars = this.finishPick;\\n        this.sim.score = this.sim.def.thresholds[Math.max(0, this.finishPick - 1)] || 0;\\n        this.sim.seconds = Math.max(1, this.sim.playT || 1);\\n860→        this.finishActivity();\\n      }\\n    } else if (id === 'drips') {\\n      this.guest.drips += 50;\\n      this.guest.items = milestonesReached(this.guest.drips).map((item) => item.id);\\n      this.persist();\\n    } else if (id === 'unlock') {\\n      this.guest.unlockAll = true;\\n    } else if (id === 'auto') {\\n      this.skillPick = (this.skillPick + 1) % SKILLS.length;\\n870→      this.setDriver(SKILLS[this.skillPick]);\\n    } else if (id === 'god') {\\n      this.god = !this.god;\\n      if (this.sim) this.sim.god = this.god;\\n    } else if (id === 'time') {\\n      this.timePick = (this.timePick + 1) % SCALES.length;\\n      if (this.engine) this.engine.timeScale = SCALES[this.timePick];\\n    } else if (id === 'overlay') {\\n      this.overlay = !this.overlay;\\n    } else if (id === 'hud') {\\n880→      this.hideHud = !this.hideHud;\\n    } else if (id === 'camera') {\\n      try { this.engine?.setCamera({ preset: 'free' }, { syncUrl: false }); } catch { /* no rig */ }\\n      this.freeCam = true;\\n    } else if (id === 'line') {\\n      this.linePick = (this.linePick + 1) % 3;\\n      this.dialogue = ['Stand.', 'The circle noticed.', 'See you tomorrow. Bring your knees.'][this.linePick];\\n      this.spoken = '';\\n    } else if (id === 'sound') {\\n      this.soundPick = (this.soundPick + 1) % (Object.keys(SONGS).length + 1);\\n890→      const names = Object.keys(SONGS);\\n      if (this.soundPick === 0) this.engine?.audio?.play?.('chime');\\n      else {\\n        const name = names[this.soundPick - 1];\\n        this.engine?.audio?.playMusic?.(SONGS[name], name);\\n        this.songPlaying = name;\\n      }\\n    } else if (id === 'anim') {\\n      const names = ['Tree', 'Heron', 'SquatRep', 'Press', 'StepL'];\\n      this.animPick = (this.animPick + 1) % names.length;\\n900→      this.viewerClip = names[this.animPick];\\n    } else if (id === 'wipe') {\\n      this.save.clear();\\n      this.guest = null;\\n      this.slot = 0;\\n    } else if (id === 'export') {\\n      const changed = {};\\n      for (const key of Object.keys(DEFAULT_TUNABLES)) {\\n        if (this.tunables[key] !== DEFAULT_TUNABLES[key]) changed[key] = this.tunables[key];\\n      }\\n910→      this.exported = JSON.stringify(changed);\\n      try { console.log(this.exported); } catch { /* no console */ }\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  activateJoin(id) {\\n    if (id === 'back') { this.mode = 'menu'; this.refresh(true); return; }\\n    if (id === 'fill') {\\n      const skills = ['sloppy', 'average', 'good', 'expert'];\\n      let n = 0;\\n920→      for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) if (!this.seats[i]) this.seats[i] = { kind: 'bot', skill: skills[n++] || 'average' };\\n      this.refresh(false);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (id === 'start') {\\n      if (!this.seats.some(Boolean)) return;\\n      this.openMedley({ family: true });\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n930→  claim(seat) {\\n    if (seat.kind === 'pad' && this.seats.some((s) => s && s.kind === 'pad' && s.index === seat.index)) return;\\n    if (seat.kind === 'key' && this.seats.some((s) => s && s.kind === 'key')) return;\\n    const index = this.seats.findIndex((s) => !s);\\n    if (index < 0) return;\\n    this.seats[index] = seat;\\n    this.refresh(false);\\n  }\\n\\n  pollJoin(ctx) {\\n940→    let pads = [];\\n    try { pads = globalThis.navigator?.getGamepads?.() || []; } catch { pads = []; }\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) {\\n      const down = !!pads[i]?.buttons?.[0]?.pressed;\\n      if (down && !this.prevPad[i]) this.claim({ kind: 'pad', index: i });\\n      this.prevPad[i] = down;\\n    }\\n    if (this.edge(ctx, 'Enter')) this.claim({ kind: 'key' });\\n  }\\n\\n950→  openMedley(arg = {}) {\\n    this.picks = medleyPicks(this.fork('medley'));\\n    this.medleyT = 0;\\n    this.lanes = [];\\n    if (arg.family) {\\n      for (const seat of this.seats) if (seat) this.lanes.push(this.makeLane(seat));\\n    } else if (arg.bots) {\\n      const skills = arg.skills || ['expert', 'good', 'average', 'sloppy'];\\n      skills.forEach((skill) => this.lanes.push(this.makeLane({ kind: 'bot', skill })));\\n    } else if (arg.hub) {\",\"content_concise\":\"800→  activateDev(id) {\\n    if (id === 'more') {\\n      if (this.devTabName() === 'Tools') this.toolPage += 1;\\n      else this.devPage += 1;\\n      this.refresh(true);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (id === 'prev') {\\n      if (this.devTabName() === 'Tools') this.toolPage = Math.max(0, this.toolPage - 1);\\n      else this.devPage = Math.max(0, this.devPage - 1);\\n810→      this.refresh(true);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (id === 'back') { this.mode = 'pause'; this.refresh(true); return; }\\n    if (id === 'reset-tab') { this.resetTab(); return; }\\n    if (id === 'reset-all') { this.resetAll(); return; }\\n    if (TUNABLE_TABS[this.devTabName()]?.some((row) => row[0] === id)) return;\\n    this.runTool(id);\\n    this.refresh(false);\\n  }\\n820→\\n  nudgeTunable(id, dir) {\\n    const tab = this.devTabName();\\n    const row = (TUNABLE_TABS[tab] || []).find((r) => r[0] === id);\\n    if (!row) return;\\n    const [, , lo, hi, step] = row;\\n    const next = clamp(this.tunables[id] + dir * step, lo, hi);\\n    this.tunables[id] = Math.round(next * 1000) / 1000;\\n    this.refresh(false);\\n  }\\n830→\\n  resetTab() {\\n    const tab = this.devTabName();\\n    for (const key of tabKeys(tab)) this.tunables[key] = DEFAULT_TUNABLES[key];\\n    this.refresh(false);\\n  }\\n\\n  resetAll() {\\n    for (const key of Object.keys(DEFAULT_TUNABLES)) this.tunables[key] = DEFAULT_TUNABLES[key];\\n    this.refresh(false);\\n840→  }\\n\\n  runTool(id) {\\n    if (!this.guest) this.guest = freshGuest('Guest');\\n    if (id === 'day') {\\n      const day = (this.guest.day % 7) + 1;\\n      this.guest.day = day;\\n      this.guest.week = 1;\\n      this.guest.today = emptyToday();\\n    } else if (id === 'jump') {\\n850→      this.jumpPick = (this.jumpPick + 1) % ACTIVITIES.length;\\n      this.frozen = false;\\n      this.startActivity(ACTIVITIES[this.jumpPick].id);\\n    } else if (id === 'finish') {\\n      this.finishPick = (this.finishPick + 1) % 4;\\n      if (this.sim) {\\n        this.sim.done = true;\\n        this.sim.stars = this.finishPick;\\n        this.sim.score = this.sim.def.thresholds[Math.max(0, this.finishPick - 1)] || 0;\\n        this.sim.seconds = Math.max(1, this.sim.playT || 1);\\n860→        this.finishActivity();\\n      }\\n    } else if (id === 'drips') {\\n      this.guest.drips += 50;\\n      this.guest.items = milestonesReached(this.guest.drips).map((item) => item.id);\\n      this.persist();\\n    } else if (id === 'unlock') {\\n      this.guest.unlockAll = true;\\n    } else if (id === 'auto') {\\n      this.skillPick = (this.skillPick + 1) % SKILLS.length;\\n870→      this.setDriver(SKILLS[this.skillPick]);\\n    } else if (id === 'god') {\\n      this.god = !this.god;\\n      if (this.sim) this.sim.god = this.god;\\n    } else if (id === 'time') {\\n      this.timePick = (this.timePick + 1) % SCALES.length;\\n      if (this.engine) this.engine.timeScale = SCALES[this.timePick];\\n    } else if (id === 'overlay') {\\n      this.overlay = !this.overlay;\\n    } else if (id === 'hud') {\\n880→      this.hideHud = !this.hideHud;\\n    } else if (id === 'camera') {\\n      try { this.engine?.setCamera({ preset: 'free' }, { syncUrl: false }); } catch { /* no rig */ }\\n      this.freeCam = true;\\n    } else if (id === 'line') {\\n      this.linePick = (this.linePick + 1) % 3;\\n      this.dialogue = ['Stand.', 'The circle noticed.', 'See you tomorrow. Bring your knees.'][this.linePick];\\n      this.spoken = '';\\n    } else if 