{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_240","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A bug was found in the finish tool.\n\nfinishPick and jumpPick increment correctly from 0 to 1. The test sequence then repeatedly selects 'prev' until the 'time' row appears.\n\nThe test sequence navigates through tool pages. After export, pressing 'prev' cycles back to page 1 where 'time' is located. Then it selects 'time', and continues pressing 'prev' until 'jump' appears on page 0. The SCALES array is needed for the time tool.\n\nThe test sequence continues with jump, pause, and finish. The finish tool should still work correctly because finishPick remains at 0 after jump. A potential issue was noted: the wipe tool sets guest to null.\n\nThe jump tool creates a fresh guest if none exists. The sound tool increments correctly and plays the first track. The god tool sets the simulation flag because the tree activity was paused without leaving.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-572a88bd-06f2-4c9f-8e2a-c85662d4e5ed-41","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"case 'dev'|case 'pause'","glob":"**/app.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-572a88bd-06f2-4c9f-8e2a-c85662d4e5ed-42","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/core/tunables.js","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3914,"output_tokens":910,"cache_read_input_tokens":87168,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"79d46d65-4424-4391-9ff4-00c4aeebbe14"}
