{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_243","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A bug was found in the devRows logic for Tools. When toolPage is 0, the slice returns only 5 items. The code then incorrectly adds a MORE entry because the start index plus 5 is still less than the total length of 16.\n\nPage 1 shows only a MORE entry with no PREV. Page 3 shows only an export row and adds PREV because the slice ends at index 15.\n\nPage 2 also lacks a PREV button. The while loop fails because choosing PREV throws `no row prev`. This confirms the bug: forward navigation works, but backward navigation is impossible from page 2 onward.\n\nThe fix adds a PREV button whenever toolPage is greater than zero, alongside MORE. This keeps both forward and backward navigation available on intermediate pages. The same pattern applies to tunable pages, such as Balance.\n\nTunable tabs are unaffected because their pages fit within the 8-row limit. Only Tools has 16 items, so its middle pages need both More and Previous. The test's backward navigation from page 3 is valid.\n\nThe fix preserves the exact eight-row limit. Page two now shows five tools, More, Previous, and Back. The test can step back from page three to page two, then to page one to select Time, then back to page zero for Jump. Page three correctly shows only Export, Previous, and Back.\n\nBalance page one fits six rows with only three keys, so adding both More and Previous there is safe. A tab with eleven keys would overflow the eight-row limit once both buttons are present.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4e15f055-fd8a-474c-ae01-0e613f5e4c4d-47","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"startActivity\\(","glob":"**/app.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1781,"output_tokens":1259,"cache_read_input_tokens":94080,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"5bdb5ef9-070a-47e1-aec4-a4d6909140af"}
