{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_264","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking that main.js sets __GAME__.\n\nVerifying World.setup sets __GAME__. Tracing drive() button press timing to ensure the title prompt is read before start activates.\n\nChecking device switching logic. The pad-to-mouse delta is roughly 1.6 NDC units, which is below the 2-unit threshold, so mouse mode likely only activates on MouseLeft. The test reads the mouse prompt before that click occurs.\n\nThe prompt is read before the button press, so if the mouse delta stays below 2 pixels the test will fail. I will check device.js to confirm how mouseDelta is calculated and fix it if needed.\n\nGlyphs are verified: after toggling to Xbox, the prompt shows \"A\" for pad input, then \"Enter\" for key input.\n\nThe settings page might not have a row-back widget.\n\nThe settings page lacks a back widget. The test falls back to the first row, which is music. If that row is already focused, hover does not move focus and the test fails.\n\nTracing the glyphs toggle: focus starts on music. ArrowDown moves it to glyphs. Enter toggles glyphs. The glyphs menu uses nudge for left/right.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-94e233d6-e973-4d11-bfdf-96f1cec433f0-80","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/app.js","offset":673,"limit":70}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-94e233d6-e973-4d11-bfdf-96f1cec433f0-81","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/core/device.js","limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-94e233d6-e973-4d11-bfdf-96f1cec433f0-82","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"__GAME__","glob":"**/*.{js,mjs}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"