{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_265","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The device update order is pad, then mouse, then keys.\n\nKeys win same-frame conflicts with mouse unless a key was also pressed. The drive test requires confirming that overriding navigator.getGamepads makes the engine poll remapped gamepad buttons each frame. After releasing pad and choosing settings, keys should switch the device to keyboard. On the glyphs screen, tapping Enter toggles Xbox mode before pressing button 0 in step 2.\n\nThe test sequence confirms the pad press becomes the pad device and prompts A. Releasing the button before tapping Enter lets keys win and prompt Enter.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-43e90d6d-5d8d-40c9-8a4e-58867e2801f2-83","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607\" && node --input-type=module -e '\nimport { readFileSync } from \"fs\";\nconst s = readFileSync(\"pixel-engine.js\",\"utf8\");\nlet i = s.indexOf(\"mouseDelta\");\nconsole.log(\"count search\");\nlet n = 0;\nwhile (i !== -1 && n < 6) {\n  console.log(\"---\", i);\n  console.log(s.slice(i-120, i+200));\n  console.log();\n  i = s.indexOf(\"mouseDelta\", i+10);\n  n++;\n}\n'","description":"See how the engine computes mouseDelta"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2713,"output_tokens":605,"cache_read_input_tokens":137472,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"1da5c871-77a7-48c1-860a-0a915fff12fb"}
