{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-2c2b7f7c-325c-41f3-833a-9ee492a256a5-87","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"30→  12: 'PadUp',\\n  13: 'PadDown',\\n  14: 'PadLeft',\\n  15: 'PadRight',\\n};\\n\\nexport function promptFor(kind, glyphs, verb) {\\n  if (kind === 'mouse') return `Click ${verb}`;\\n  if (kind === 'keyboard') return `Enter ${verb}`;\\n  if (glyphs === 'xbox') return `A ${verb}`;\\n40→  return `Cross ${verb}`;\\n}\\n\\nexport function glyphKind(deviceKind, glyphs) {\\n  if (deviceKind === 'mouse') return 'mouse';\\n  if (deviceKind === 'keyboard') return 'key';\\n  return glyphs === 'xbox' ? 'xbox' : 'playstation';\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"30→  12: 'PadUp',\\n  13: 'PadDown',\\n  14: 'PadLeft',\\n  15: 'PadRight',\\n};\\n\\nexport function promptFor(kind, glyphs, verb) {\\n  if (kind === 'mouse') return `Click ${verb}`;\\n  if (kind === 'keyboard') return `Enter ${verb}`;\\n  if (glyphs === 'xbox') return `A ${verb}`;\\n40→  return `Cross ${verb}`;\\n}\\n\\nexport function glyphKind(deviceKind, glyphs) {\\n  if (deviceKind === 'mouse') return 'mouse';\\n  if (deviceKind === 'keyboard') return 'key';\\n  return glyphs === 'xbox' ? 'xbox' : 'playstation';\\n}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/core/actions.js\",\"offset\":30,\"limit\":30,\"raw_output\":\"  12: 'PadUp',\\n  13: 'PadDown',\\n  14: 'PadLeft',\\n  15: 'PadRight',\\n};\\n\\nexport function promptFor(kind, glyphs, verb) {\\n  if (kind === 'mouse') return `Click ${verb}`;\\n  if (kind === 'keyboard') return `Enter ${verb}`;\\n  if (glyphs === 'xbox') return `A ${verb}`;\\n  return `Cross ${verb}`;\\n}\\n\\nexport function glyphKind(deviceKind, glyphs) {\\n  if (deviceKind === 'mouse') return 'mouse';\\n  if (deviceKind === 'keyboard') return 'key';\\n  return glyphs === 'xbox' ? 'xbox' : 'playstation';\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":47}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"90f2f96a-4aac-46cd-973b-18eb046522de"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_270","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The mouse prompt is either \"Click Start\" or \"Click Confirm\".\n\nUpdating drive() to use addPointer for mouse deltas. Fixing hover assertions to compare against the row before hover and target a different widget.\n\nAdding assertions to verify the prompt contains \"Click\" and that hover actually moves focus. Clicking a settings row may toggle state without changing mode, so the assertion must detect a detectable change.\n\nThe test currently clicks without asserting activation. I will record the mode before and after clicking, and add an `activated` flag if mode, glyphs, or rows change. I also need to handle `navigator.getGamepads` carefully since it may already be defined.\n\nUsing `Object.defineProperty` to safely override `navigator.getGamepads` in the browser test, avoiding strict-mode assignment errors.\n\nThe family section also uses direct assignment for `navigator.getGamepads`, so it needs the same `Object.defineProperty` fix. Phone touch detection will be left alone unless it causes issues. I will patch both browser.mjs and the family code, then run the full test.\n\nChecking build.mjs to confirm the HTML path is correct. The full test will run in the background after the browser.mjs fix, with a monitor script polling test.log for \"passed\" or \"FAIL\" and exiting once the job completes.\n\nI will not finalize the about.js feedback or PROGRESS draft until the browser test finishes, since those require honest results from the actual run.\n\nI am reading about.js and TASK.md to prepare for the exit interview. I also spotted a timing issue in the pad-driven test: pressing button 0 on the title screen may activate Start before the prompt updates, so the prompt could still read \"Cross Confirm\" if the mode remains menu.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The fast suite is clean. The browser drive script samples the mouse prompt before a real pointer delta, and it treats a hover onto Music as a failure. I'll fix that before the full run."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-74e323fe-f014-4b27-9243-53406ab0dc2d-88","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/tools/browser.mjs","old_string":"    const buttons = Array.from({ length: 16 }, () => ({ pressed: false, value: 0 }));\n    const pad = { connected: true, mapping: 'standard', axes: [0, 0, 0, 0], buttons };\n    navigator.getGamepads = () => [pad, null, null, null];","new_string":"    const buttons = Array.from({ length: 16 }, () => ({ pressed: false, value: 0 }));\n    const pad = { connected: true, mapping: 'standard', axes: [0, 0, 0, 0], buttons };\n    Object.defineProperty(navigator, 'getGamepads', { configurable: true, value: () => [pad, null, null, null] });"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-74e323fe-f014-4b27-9243-53406ab0dc2d-89","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/tools/browser.mjs","old_string":"    tap('Enter');\n    const key = app.state().prompt;\n    engine.input.setPointer(-0.9, 0.4, false);\n    engine.step(1);\n    engine.input.setPointer(0.7, -0.5, false);\n    engine.step(1);\n    const mouse = app.state().prompt;\n    const widget = app.state().widgets.find((w) => w.id === 'row-back') || app.state().widgets.find((w) => String(w.id).startsWith('row-'));\n    let hovered = app.state().row;\n    if (widget) {\n      const hud = app.ctx.hud;\n      const nx = ((widget.x + widget.w / 2) / hud.width) * 2 - 1;\n      const ny = 1 - ((widget.y + widget.h / 2) / hud.height) * 2;\n      engine.input.setPointer(nx, ny, false);\n      engine.step(1);\n      hovered = app.state().row;\n      engine.input.setPointer(nx, ny, true);\n      engine.step(1);\n      engine.input.setPointer(nx, ny, false);\n      engine.step(1);\n    }\n    return { cross, xbox, key, mouse, hovered, mode: app.mode, glyphs: app.state().glyphs };\n  });\n  log(browserLog, `drive ${JSON.stringify(out)}`);\n  if (!String(out.cross).includes('Cross')) bad(`pad prompt ${out.cross}`);\n  if (!String(out.xbox).includes('A')) bad(`xbox prompt ${out.xbox}`);\n  if (!String(out.key).includes('Enter')) bad(`key prompt ${out.key}`);\n  if (!String(out.mouse).includes('Click')) bad(`mouse prompt ${out.mouse}`);\n  if (out.hovered === 'music') bad('hover did not move focus');\n}","new_string":"    tap('Enter');\n    const key = app.state().prompt;\n    engine.input.setPointer(-0.2, 0.2, false);\n    engine.input.addPointer(48, 16);\n    engine.step(1);\n    const mouse = app.state().prompt;\n    const widgets = app.state().widgets.filter((w) => String(w.id).startsWith('row-'));\n    const before = app.state().row;\n    const widget = widgets.find((w) => w.id !== `row-${before}`) || null;\n    let hovered = before;\n    let activated = false;\n    if (widget) {\n      const hud = app.ctx.hud;\n      const nx = ((widget.x + widget.w / 2) / hud.width) * 2 - 1;\n      const ny = 1 - ((widget.y + widget.h / 2) / hud.height) * 2;\n      const rowsBefore = app.state().rows.join(',');\n      engine.input.setPointer(nx, ny, false);\n      engine.step(1);\n      hovered = app.state().row;\n      engine.input.setPointer(nx, ny, true);\n      engine.step(1);\n      engine.input.setPointer(nx, ny, false);\n      engine.step(1);\n      activated = app.state().row !== hovered || app.state().rows.join(',') !== rowsBefore || app.mode !== 'settings';\n    }\n    return { cross, xbox, key, mouse, hovered, before, activated, mode: app.mode, glyphs: app.state().glyphs };\n  });\n  log(browserLog, `drive ${JSON.stringify(out)}`);\n  if (!String(out.cross).includes('Cross')) bad(`pad prompt ${out.cross}`);\n  if (!String(out.xbox).includes('A')) bad(`xbox prompt ${out.xbox}`);\n  if (!String(out.key).includes('Enter')) bad(`key prompt ${out.key}`);\n  if (!String(out.mouse).includes('Click')) bad(`mouse prompt ${out.mouse}`);\n  if (!out.before || out.hovered === out.before) bad(`hover did not move focus ${out.before} -> ${out.hovered}`);\n  if (!out.activated) bad('click did not activate');\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-74e323fe-f014-4b27-9243-53406ab0dc2d-90","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/tools/browser.mjs","old_string":"    navigator.getGamepads = () => pads;","new_string":"    Object.defineProperty(navigator, 'getGamepads', { configurable: true, value: () => pads });"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":299,"output_tokens":2618,"cache_read_input_tokens":145408,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"264cda6d-7549-4cf0-a4d3-4a8d01f799d4"}
