{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_271","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Click activation requires moving focus to the row via hover before clicking.\n\nThe `activated` flag is unreliable for toggling rows like gentle, since it stays false even when the label changes. Comparing row labels or recording full state is needed.\n\nA `snap()` function will record mode, row, rows, gentle, glyphs, and page before the click. After clicking, comparing the pre and post snapshots determines if activation occurred.\n\nThe activation check now compares mode, rows, gentle, glyphs, and page between snapshots. Clicking music does not trigger a visible change because its activate handler falls through to persist and refresh without altering any value.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-cd5208a4-ccb0-427d-b1b6-0fdc42618335-91","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/tools/browser.mjs","offset":250,"limit":50}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2905,"output_tokens":666,"cache_read_input_tokens":145664,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"1c544ad4-1b67-469a-afea-a9d94ee8614f"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-cd5208a4-ccb0-427d-b1b6-0fdc42618335-91","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"250→    choose('settings');\\n    while (app.state().row !== 'glyphs' && app.state().rows.includes('glyphs')) tap('ArrowDown');\\n    tap('Enter');\\n    buttons[0].pressed = true;\\n    engine.step(2);\\n    const xbox = app.state().prompt;\\n    buttons[0].pressed = false;\\n    tap('Enter');\\n    const key = app.state().prompt;\\n    engine.input.setPointer(-0.2, 0.2, false);\\n260→    engine.input.addPointer(48, 16);\\n    engine.step(1);\\n    const mouse = app.state().prompt;\\n    const widgets = app.state().widgets.filter((w) => String(w.id).startsWith('row-'));\\n    const before = app.state().row;\\n    const widget = widgets.find((w) => w.id !== `row-${before}`) || null;\\n    let hovered = before;\\n    let activated = false;\\n    if (widget) {\\n      const hud = app.ctx.hud;\\n270→      const nx = ((widget.x + widget.w / 2) / hud.width) * 2 - 1;\\n      const ny = 1 - ((widget.y + widget.h / 2) / hud.height) * 2;\\n      const rowsBefore = app.state().rows.join(',');\\n      engine.input.setPointer(nx, ny, false);\\n      engine.step(1);\\n      hovered = app.state().row;\\n      engine.input.setPointer(nx, ny, true);\\n      engine.step(1);\\n      engine.input.setPointer(nx, ny, false);\\n      engine.step(1);\\n280→      activated = app.state().row !== hovered || app.state().rows.join(',') !== rowsBefore || app.mode !== 'settings';\\n    }\\n    return { cross, xbox, key, mouse, hovered, before, activated, mode: app.mode, glyphs: app.state().glyphs };\\n  });\\n  log(browserLog, `drive ${JSON.stringify(out)}`);\\n  if (!String(out.cross).includes('Cross')) bad(`pad prompt ${out.cross}`);\\n  if (!String(out.xbox).includes('A')) bad(`xbox prompt ${out.xbox}`);\\n  if (!String(out.key).includes('Enter')) bad(`key prompt ${out.key}`);\\n  if (!String(out.mouse).includes('Click')) bad(`mouse prompt ${out.mouse}`);\\n  if (!out.before || out.hovered === out.before) bad(`hover did not move focus ${out.before} -> ${out.hovered}`);\\n290→  if (!out.activated) bad('click did not activate');\\n}\\n\\nasync function phone(browser, devices, fileUrl, bad, browserLog) {\\n  const profile = devices['iPhone 13'] || devices['iPhone 12'] || devices['iPhone 14'];\\n  const context = await browser.newContext({ ...profile, deviceScaleFactor: 1 });\\n  const errors = [];\\n  const page = await context.newPage();\\n  watch(page, errors);\\n  await page.goto(fileUrl);\",\"content_concise\":\"250→    choose('settings');\\n    while (app.state().row !== 'glyphs' && app.state().rows.includes('glyphs')) tap('ArrowDown');\\n    tap('Enter');\\n    buttons[0].pressed = true;\\n    engine.step(2);\\n    const xbox = app.state().prompt;\\n    buttons[0].pressed = false;\\n    tap('Enter');\\n    const key = app.state().prompt;\\n    engine.input.setPointer(-0.2, 0.2, false);\\n260→    engine.input.addPointer(48, 16);\\n    engine.step(1);\\n    const mouse = app.state().prompt;\\n    const widgets = app.state().widgets.filter((w) => String(w.id).startsWith('row-'));\\n    const before = app.state().row;\\n    const widget = widgets.find((w) => w.id !== `row-${before}`) || null;\\n    let hovered = before;\\n    let activated = false;\\n    if (widget) {\\n      const hud = app.ctx.hud;\\n270→      const nx = ((widget.x + widget.w / 2) / hud.width) * 2 - 1;\\n      const ny = 1 - ((widget.y + widget.h / 2) / hud.height) * 2;\\n      const rowsBefore = app.state().rows.join(',');\\n      engine.input.setPointer(nx, ny, false);\\n      engine.step(1);\\n      hovered = app.state().row;\\n      engine.input.setPointer(nx, ny, true);\\n      engine.step(1);\\n      engine.input.setPointer(nx, ny, false);\\n      engine.step(1);\\n280→      activated = app.state().row !== hovered || app.state().rows.join(',') !== rowsBefore || app.mode !== 'settings'