{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_274","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A device order bug was found: setPointer runs before update during click.\n\nHover runs after menuInput in the update loop. The pointer is set before hover updates focus.\n\nThe click uses the previous hover frame's focus. Launching the full test now. Build logs go to a pipe and won't pollute test.log. Playwright stderr might still appear in test.log. I'll monitor the log for pass or fail and the process exit.\n\nThe exit code will be written to a separate file so the log still ends with the pass line. The monitor script will watch both the log and the process.\n\nThe monitor polls every 20 seconds. It checks the log for a pass line and no FAIL line to confirm success. The test only prints FAIL at the end, so the exit file is the main signal.\n\nThe monitor will also watch browser.log for FAIL lines and print only new ones to avoid spam. The test will launch first with block_until 0, then the monitor starts. Node tests finish in about ten seconds; browser tests may take five to ten minutes. I'll check about.js during execution and verify TASK.md hand-in locations.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e5e3b56c-4739-4483-887a-409ed05695bb-94","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607\" && export PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE=ubuntu24.04-x64 && env -u NO_COLOR -u FORCE_COLOR node tools/test.mjs > \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/tmp/grok-goal-46b978a86300/implementer/test.log\" 2>&1; echo $? > \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/tmp/grok-goal-46b978a86300/implementer/test.exit\"","description":"Run full node, browser, and hub suite","block_until_ms":0}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":859,"output_tokens":1109,"cache_read_input_tokens":150400,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"0d5d3591-e749-41ce-bea1-6d703c3aa930"}
