{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_281","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking the order of becomeReady() calls on the left and right sides.\n\nThe engine sets __PIXEL_ENGINE__ before marking started, but World.js may set __GAME__ earlier. Checking world.js lines 88 and 94.\n\nWorld.setup assigns __PIXEL_ENGINE__ before the engine sets started. waitGame therefore returns early and step throws. The fix is to await window.__PIXEL_ENGINE__.started in addition to __PIXEL_ENGINE__ and __GAME__.\n\nThe current suite is in hub. I will patch waitGame now and let hub finish to gather evidence. If hub passes, a full rerun of chromium boots, phone, widgets, and shots is still required for a single green run. Hub might pass because it does not call engine.step directly; the game loop runs on its own. Killing the suite now would lose that data.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f438fe5a-127e-4122-b949-b5dc661503b9-105","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/scenes/world.js","offset":70,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f438fe5a-127e-4122-b949-b5dc661503b9-106","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/tmp/grok-goal-46b978a86300/implementer/hub.log","limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":564,"output_tokens":656,"cache_read_input_tokens":161024,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"b0cc790c-b1d9-460f-9a0c-f651b5554319"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-f438fe5a-127e-4122-b949-b5dc661503b9-105","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"70→    applySky(engine, skyAt(this.hour()));\\n    ctx.input.gamepadButtons = { ...GAMEPAD_BUTTONS };\\n    ctx.input.gamepadDeadzone = 0.12;\\n    registerSfx(ctx.audio);\\n    this.app.applyVolumes();\\n\\n    this.addGround(ctx);\\n    if (this.app.session) this.addMats(scene);\\n    else this.addIsland(scene);\\n    this.addDial(scene);\\n80→\\n    if (!this.app.session && !this.app.noHero) {\\n      try {\\n        await this.loadHero(ctx);\\n      } catch {\\n        this.hero = null;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    globalThis.__GAME__ = this.app;\\n    globalThis.__PIXEL_ENGINE__ = engine;\\n90→  }\\n\\n  ready(ctx) {\\n    this.app.applyVolumes();\\n    globalThis.__GAME__ = this.app;\\n    globalThis.__PIXEL_ENGINE__ = ctx.engine;\\n  }\\n\\n  hour() {\\n    const day = this.app.guest?.day || 1;\\n100→    return 8 + ((day - 1) % 5);\\n  }\\n\\n  addGround(ctx) {\\n    const { scene } = ctx;\\n    const ground = new Mesh(new BoxGeometry(64, 1, 64), toonMaterial(PALETTE.lime));\\n    ground.position.set(0, -0.5, 0);\\n    ground.receiveShadow = true;\\n    scene.add(ground);\\n    const sand = new Mesh(new BoxGeometry(16, 0.08, 16), toonMaterial(PALETTE.sand));\",\"content_concise\":\"70→    applySky(engine, skyAt(this.hour()));\\n    ctx.input.gamepadButtons = { ...GAMEPAD_BUTTONS };\\n    ctx.input.gamepadDeadzone = 0.12;\\n    registerSfx(ctx.audio);\\n    this.app.applyVolumes();\\n\\n    this.addGround(ctx);\\n    if (this.app.session) this.addMats(scene);\\n    else this.addIsland(scene);\\n    this.addDial(scene);\\n80→\\n    if (!this.app.session && !this.app.noHero) {\\n      try {\\n        await this.loadHero(ctx);\\n      } catch {\\n        this.hero = null;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    globalThis.__GAME__ = this.app;\\n    globalThis.__PIXEL_ENGINE__ = engine;\\n90→  }\\n\\n  ready(ctx) {\\n    this.app.applyVolumes();\\n    globalThis.__GAME__ = this.app;\\n    globalThis.__PIXEL_ENGINE__ = ctx.engine;\\n  }\\n\\n  hour() {\\n    const day = this.app.guest?.day || 1;\\n100→    return 8 + ((day - 1) % 5);\\n  }\\n\\n  addGround(ctx) {\\n    const { scene } = ctx;\\n    const ground = new Mesh(new BoxGeometry(64, 1, 64), toonMaterial(PALETTE.lime));\\n    ground.position.set(0, -0.5, 0);\\n    ground.receiveShadow = true;\\n    scene.add(ground);\\n    const sand = new Mesh(new BoxGeometry(16, 0.08, 16), toonMaterial(PALETTE.sand));\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/scenes/world.js\",\"offset\":70,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"    applySky(engine, skyAt(this.hour()));\\n    ctx.input.gamepadButtons = { ...GAMEPAD_BUTTONS };\\n    ctx.input.gamepadDeadzone = 0.12;\\n    registerSfx(ctx.audio);\\n    this.app.applyVolumes();\\n\\n    this.addGround(ctx);\\n    if (this.app.session) this.addMats(scene);\\n    else this.addIsland(scene);\\n    this.addDial(scene);\\n\\n    if (!this.app.session && !this.app.noHero) {\\n      try {\\n        await this.loadHero(ctx);\\n      } catch {\\n        this.hero = null;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    globalThis.__GAME__ = this.app;\\n    globalThis.__PIXEL_ENGINE__ = engine;\\n  }\\n\\n  ready(ctx) {\\n    this.app.applyVolumes();\\n    globalThis.__GAME__ = this.app;\\n    globalThis.__PIXEL_ENGINE__ = ctx.engine;\\n  }\\n\\n  hour() {\\n    const day = this.app.guest?.day || 1;\\n    return 8 + ((day - 1) % 5);\\n  }\\n\\n  addGround(ctx) {\\n    const { scene } = ctx;\\n    const ground = new Mesh(new BoxGeometry(64, 1, 64), toonMaterial(PALETTE.lime));\\n    ground.position.set(0, -0.5, 0);\\n    ground.receiveShadow = true;\\n    scene.add(ground);\\n    const sand = new Mesh(new BoxGeometry(16, 0.08, 16), toonMaterial(PALETTE.sand));\\n\",\"total_lines\":213}}","is_e