{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_282","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Hub 4 URLs all passed. The suite is likely on no-session or webkit session-fail now, or finishing.\n\nChromium capture failed and will cause a test failure. I need to patch waitGame and wrap grab's step so it returns capture-error instead of aborting the whole block. Then I'll rerun the full suite for a clean log.\n\nThe waitGame fix waits for the engine to be fully started before proceeding. The grab step is wrapped in a try/catch so one capture failure won't abort phone, drive, or shots. The current Chromium run already failed and skipped those captures, so the overall test will fail.\n\nThe current run will finish to preserve the nosession log. I'll patch waitGame now and rerun once it exits.\n\nI also confirmed a race condition where the engine might report started before the page evaluate sees it. Calling step() sets manual mode, which stops the render loop; this is acceptable because the tests step manually.\n\nThe boot 1 grab will be followed by drive on boot 2. Manual mode is fine for this flow.\n\nWebGPU likely works because the game state was already readable before the race condition. The failure was only the timing issue.\n\nI'll patch waitGame and grab now, then wait for the suite to exit via the monitor.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a8bb526a-0c6a-4588-8f9f-0469d6936a0b-107","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/tools/browser.mjs","old_string":"async function waitGame(page) {\n  await page.waitForFunction(() => window.__GAME__ && window.__PIXEL_ENGINE__, null, { timeout: 30000 });\n}","new_string":"async function waitGame(page) {\n  await page.waitForFunction(() => {\n    const engine = window.__PIXEL_ENGINE__;\n    return !!(engine && engine.started && window.__GAME__);\n  }, null, { timeout: 30000 });\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a8bb526a-0c6a-4588-8f9f-0469d6936a0b-108","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/tools/shot.mjs","old_string":"    const engine = window.__PIXEL_ENGINE__;\n    const app = window.__GAME__;\n    engine.step(20);\n    let frame;\n    try {\n      frame = await engine.renderer.capture();\n    } catch (err) {\n      return { error: String(err && err.stack || err) };\n    }","new_string":"    const engine = window.__PIXEL_ENGINE__;\n    const app = window.__GAME__;\n    let frame;\n    try {\n      if (!engine.started) await window.__PIXEL_READY__;\n      engine.step(20);\n      frame = await engine.renderer.capture();\n    } catch (err) {\n      return { error: String(err && err.stack || err) };\n    }"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1277,"output_tokens":1055,"cache_read_input_tokens":161536,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"430faac3-be11-4723-970f-f8ebc3809352"}
