Build the island, weigh-in, seven-day loop, saves, report, sweat jar, and locker unlocks; start the scripted playthrough test.\"},{\"line_number\":44,\"content\":\"- [ ] Add Hoop, Reps, Header, Step, Slackline, Vitamin Tray, Pier Jump, and Island Jog, each with idle-vs-expert bot tests and original lines.\"},{\"line_number\":45,\"content\":\"- [ ] Add The Medley, Family Hour, and the AI Hub ghost card; run all four harness URLs.\"},{\"line_number\":46,\"content\":\"- [ ] Add attract mode, the dev tools tab, the touch-only gate, Hall of Numbers, ferry, daily beats, Long Stand, confession (−7), credits, and the full code-only soundtrack.\"},{\"line_number\":47,\"content\":\"- [ ] Write About/Credits from one data source, emit `exit-interview.json`, update `PROGRESS.md`, and capture `node tools/test.mjs`, two `file://` launches, and the hub log under `{SCRATCH}`.\"},{\"line_number\":49,\"content\":\"## Risks / Contradictions\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-89d17a3f-25fc-46d7-ac87-31258129f5fc-113","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"100→- Animation: system used\\n- Audio: music, sound effects and voice used\\n- Online: network features used, or none\\n- Testing: testing parameters allowed\\n- Research: research done, or none\\n- Environment: Grok CLI (headless); Linux\\n- Model: xAI, grok-4.7, reasoning effort xhigh\\n- Usage: write \\\"added on import\\\". You can't see your own cost, so don't estimate it: the runner records the real cost, tokens and time, and the agent that imports the game into AI Hub puts them on your About/Credits screen.\\n\\nExit interview: before you finish, also save these answers as exit-interview.json in this folder's root, beside the game's .html: one JSON object in exactly the shape below, every value filled in (\\\"unknown\\\" for anything you can't confirm). Tools read it (the game's run record and the AI Hub catalogue), so write plain text, and check that the file parses a