{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_286","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The plan lacks a ## Deviations section.\n\nThe build is still running. I will wait for it to finish before flipping any checkboxes. I am also reviewing the code for potential browser failures, starting with Playwright iPhone 13 touch detection.\n\nI am checking the settings button class in the engine CSS. Headless WebAudio silence could break audio analyser tests. I will also verify widget overflow at 640x360, capture blank spans, click activation, hover behavior, and family lanes.\n\nThe empty nosession.log was caused by truncating browser.log and hub.log without touching nosession.log. The browser log tail showed a webkit session, so the nosession write should have occurred before that.\n\nThe empty nosession.log may be caused by the second run's startup code wiping it with writeFileSync('') before the first run's write could complete.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d0995c73-1b01-4b1f-b9d5-fb1bf861765b-115","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607\" && node --input-type=module -e '\nimport { readFileSync } from \"fs\";\nconst s = readFileSync(\"pixel-engine.js\",\"utf8\");\nconst i = s.indexOf(\"settings-button\");\nconsole.log(\"idx\", i);\nconsole.log(s.slice(i-120, i+200));\n'","description":"Confirm the engine settings button class name"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2210,"output_tokens":772,"cache_read_input_tokens":166656,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"504d42f2-7f85-40b0-80d1-7fdd685ebf6e"}
