0 span 188.8 title start\"},{\"line_number\":5,\"content\":\"drive {\\\"cross\\\":\\\"Cross Confirm\\\",\\\"xbox\\\":\\\"Enter Confirm\\\",\\\"key\\\":\\\"Enter Confirm\\\",\\\"mouse\\\":\\\"Click Confirm\\\",\\\"hovered\\\":\\\"gentle\\\",\\\"before\\\":\\\"glyphs\\\",\\\"activated\\\":true,\\\"mode\\\":\\\"settings\\\",\\\"glyphs\\\":\\\"playstation\\\"}\"},{\"line_number\":6,\"content\":\"FAIL xbox prompt Enter Confirm\"},{\"line_number\":7,\"content\":\"phone {\\\"touch\\\":true,\\\"message\\\":\\\"Controller or keyboard required\\\",\\\"engineTouch\\\":null,\\\"gear\\\":true}\"},{\"line_number\":8,\"content\":\"widgets 1920x1080 {\\\"hudW\\\":480,\\\"hudH\\\":270,\\\"badRows\\\":[],\\\"overflow\\\":false}\"},{\"line_number\":9,\"content\":\"widgets 1280x720 {\\\"hudW\\\":480,\\\"hudH\\\":270,\\\"badRows\\\":[],\\\"overflow\\\":false}\"},{\"line_number\":10,\"content\":\"widgets 640x360 {\\\"hudW\\\":427,\\\"hudH\\\":240,\\\"badRows\\\":[\\\"band\\\",\\\"prompt\\\"],\\\"overflow\\\":false}\"},{\"line_number\":11,\"content\":\"FAIL widgets outside 640x360 band,prompt\"},{\"line_number\":12,\"content\":\"FAIL chromium page.evaluate: TypeError: Cannot read properties of null (reading 'createAnalyser')\"},{\"line_number\":16,\"content\":\"    at widgets (/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/tools/browser.mjs:360:28)\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"49c0346f-1620-4f18-b306-8ecb5b4927b2"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_288","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Boots are working at 1281x720 with span 188.\n\nMouse and pad controls work. Xbox glyphs remain stuck on \"playstation\" because Enter toggles them back. The drive sequence is being reviewed.\n\nThe pad pulse captured \"Enter Confirm\", confirming the device was still keyboard at that moment. The pad button likely failed to switch because getGamepads override did not work, the engine polled gamepads too late, or keyboard state overrode the pad input.\n\nThe engine likely cached the native getGamepads function at startup, so the runtime override never took effect. The pad button was probably ignored because the engine still used the original implementation.\n\nThe first pad pulse succeeded, so the override did work initially. The second pulse failed because the keyboard was already active from the glyph toggle. The pad button was ignored while the keyboard device remained selected.\n\nThe engine only switches to pad mode on a button edge, not while held. If the pad button was still down from the first press, the second press would be treated as continuous input and ignored. The keyboard navigation may have left the button in a held state.\n\nThe first pad pulse read \"Cross Confirm\", not \"Cross Start\". This confirms the engine was in normal mode, not title mode, when the button fired. The fake gamepad object should still be readable each frame, so the earlier theory about a held button state may not explain the second failure.\n\nThe pad button is a PRESS action. It reactivates the glyphs row and toggles the glyphs back to playstation. This explains why the prompt reads \"Enter Confirm\" and the final glyph stays on playstation.\n\nThe prompt reading \"Enter Confirm\" proves the device was still keyboard during the second pad pulse. The pad press never switched the device at all. The first pulse worked but the second did not.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bda56e5f-4d13-4be2-bebb-f1d7a140e3a1-117","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607\" && node --input-type=module -e '\nimport { readFileSync } from \"fs\";\nconst s = readFileSync(\"pixel-engine.js\",\"utf8\");\nlet i = 0, n = 0;\nwhile ((i = s.indexOf(\"getGamepads\", i)) !== -1 && n < 8) {\n  console.log(\"---\", i);\n  console.log(s.slice(Math.max(0,i-150), i+250));\n  console.log();\n  i += 12; n++;\n}\n'","description":"See how the engine polls gamepads"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":873,"output_tokens":1422,"cache_read_input_tokens":169856,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"0a639816-a0c0-47b7-9356-046d58899b96"}
