{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_299","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The test suite is still running. Two failures have occurred so far.\n\nThe hover failure occurs because focus is already on \"gentle\" when the test tries to hover over it. The voice RMS failure is 0.0182, below the required 0.02 threshold. I will read the browser log to diagnose and fix these issues.\n\nThe ArrowDown step already moves focus to \"gentle\", so hovering that same row leaves before and hovered identical. The fix is to hover a different row first, then click to activate.\n\nThe hover target must be a different row than the current focus. Clicking 'more' changes pages and alters the widget list, which will help verify activation.\n\nI will compare JSON snapshots of rows, settings, and page before and after the click to detect activation. The voice RMS is 0.0182, slightly below the 0.02 threshold; I will increase the offline render volume rather than lower the test limit.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The suite is still running and already failed two checks: hover stayed on Gentle, and the voice render is just under the loudness line. I'll fix both before the next run."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e03118f9-4955-4ca8-a493-816929376a1a-131","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"gain|destination|rms","glob":"**/voice.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e03118f9-4955-4ca8-a493-816929376a1a-132","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/tmp/grok-goal-46b978a86300/implementer/browser.log","limit":20}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":184283,"output_tokens":805,"cache_read_input_tokens":6656,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"2489ce74-6eb8-469c-be2d-3e26c36a1344"}
