{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_300","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Ounce RMS is 0.018. Coach is 0.\n\nOunce is higher pitch but quieter. Its faster speech ends sooner, leaving more silence in the 2-second RMS buffer and lowering the reading. Coach's slower speech fills that buffer with sound, keeping its RMS above 0.02.\n\nOunce's RMS must exceed 0.02. The plan requires this alongside Ounce's mean pitch being higher than Coach's. Raising Ounce's gain is the likely fix, since its faster speech produces shorter syllables that carry less energy.\n\nRaising the envelope peak from 0.4 to 0.55 should lift Ounce's RMS above 0.02 with a comfortable margin. Coach would rise proportionally but remain above 0.02, and pitch stays unchanged. The test only requires Ounce's RMS to clear that threshold.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-17faaf2e-77f4-4b71-8094-c779265fd360-133","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/tools/browser.mjs","offset":255,"limit":45}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-17faaf2e-77f4-4b71-8094-c779265fd360-134","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/audio/voice.js","offset":108,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1777,"output_tokens":733,"cache_read_input_tokens":190848,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"470490ff-d5a8-4484-8c1a-a8f1d2dd5814"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-17faaf2e-77f4-4b71-8094-c779265fd360-133","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"255→    while (app.state().row !== 'glyphs' && app.state().rows.includes('glyphs')) tap('ArrowDown');\\n    tap('Enter');\\n    pad.axes[0] = 0.9;\\n    engine.step(2);\\n    const xbox = app.state().prompt;\\n260→    pad.axes[0] = 0;\\n    engine.step(1);\\n    tap('ArrowDown');\\n    const key = app.state().prompt;\\n    engine.input.setPointer(-0.2, 0.2, false);\\n    engine.input.addPointer(48, 16);\\n    engine.step(1);\\n    const mouse = app.state().prompt;\\n    const widgets = app.state().widgets.filter((w) => String(w.id).startsWith('row-'));\\n    const before = app.state().row;\\n270→    const widget = widgets.find((w) => w.id === 'row-gentle') || widgets.find((w) => w.id !== `row-${before}`) || null;\\n    let hovered = before;\\n    let activated = false;\\n    if (widget) {\\n      const hud = app.ctx.hud;\\n      const nx = ((widget.x + widget.w / 2) / hud.width) * 2 - 1;\\n      const ny = 1 - ((widget.y + widget.h / 2) / hud.height) * 2;\\n      engine.input.setPointer(nx, ny, false);\\n      engine.step(1);\\n      hovered = app.state().row;\\n280→      const gentle = app.settings.gentle;\\n      engine.input.setPointer(nx, ny, true);\\n      engine.step(1);\\n      engine.input.setPointer(nx, ny, false);\\n      engine.step(1);\\n      activated = app.settings.gentle !== gentle;\\n    }\\n    return { cross, xbox, key, mouse, hovered, before, activated, mode: app.mode, glyphs: app.state().glyphs };\\n  });\\n  log(browserLog, `drive ${JSON.stringify(out)}`);\\n290→  if (!String(out.cross).includes('Cross')) bad(`pad prompt ${out.cross}`);\\n  if (!String(out.xbox).includes('A')) bad(`xbox prompt ${out.xbox}`);\\n  if (!String(out.key).includes('Enter')) bad(`key prompt ${out.key}`);\\n  if (!String(out.mouse).includes('Click')) bad(`mouse prompt ${out.mouse}`);\\n  if (!out.before || out.hovered === out.before) bad(`hover did not move focus ${out.before} -> ${out.hovered}`);\\n  if (!out.activated) bad('click did not activate');\\n}\\n\\nasync function phone(browser, devices, fileUrl, bad, browserLog) {\\n  const profile = devices['iPhone 13'] || devices['iPhone 12'] || devices['iPhone 14'];\",\"content_concise\":\"255→    while (app.state().row !== 'glyphs' && app.state().rows.includes('glyphs')) tap('ArrowDown');\\n    tap('Enter');\\n    pad.axes[0] = 0.9;\\n    engine.step(2);\\n    const xbox = app.state().prompt;\\n260→    pad.axes[0] = 0;\\n    engine.step(1);\\n    tap('ArrowDown');\\n    const key = app.state().prompt;\\n    engine.input.setPointer(-0.2, 0.2, false);\\n    engine.input.addPointer(48, 16);\\n    engine.step(1);\\n    const mouse = app.state().prompt;\\n    const widgets = app.state().widgets.filter((w) => String(w.id).startsWith('row-'));\\n    const before = app.state().row;\\n270→    const widget = widgets.find((w) => w.id === 'row-gentle') || widgets.find((w) => w.id !== `row-${before}`) || null;\\n    let hovered = before;\\n    let activated = false;\\n    if (widget) {\\n      const hud = app.ctx.hud;\\n      const nx = ((widget.x + widget.w / 2) / hud.width) * 2 - 1;\\n      const ny = 1 - ((widget.y + widget.h / 2) / hud.height) * 2;\\n      engine.input.setPointer(nx, ny, false);\\n      engine.step(1);\\n      hovered = app.state().row;\\n280→      const gentle = app.settings.gentle;\\n      engine.input.setPointer(nx, ny, true);\\n      engine.step(1);\\n      engine.input.setPointer(nx, ny, false);\\n      engine.step(1);\\n      activated = app.settings.gentle !== gentle;\\n    }\\n    return { cross, xbox, key, mouse, hovered, before, activated, mode: app.mode, glyphs: app.state().glyphs };\\n  });\\n  log(browserLog, `drive ${JSON.stringify(out)}`);\\n290→  if (!String(out.cross).includes('Cross')) bad(`pad prompt ${out.cross}`);\\n  if (!String(out.xbox).includes('A')) b