{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_308","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The draw shows six lines. Each wraps to two lines of forty characters, but only the first two wraps are shown.\n\nSource fields like research and testing contain long values that truncate on screen. The in-game About/Credits screen shows every TASK.md Source Information field, so labels remain visible while values may be cut off.\n\nThe draw screen holds only twelve wrapped lines, but the source section contains fifteen fields. Page-wrapped lines will be used so the full text is reachable with the arrow keys.\n\nA bug was found: the source section is sliced to six fields, so Art Direction and later entries never appear on screen. Feedback answers also need to be split across pages. The draw must display the full wrapped text for every line shown.\n\naboutPages will emit pages of at most six pre-wrapped lines. Each line is wrapped to thirty-six characters so the two-wrap slice becomes unnecessary. The draw function will display all wrapped pieces up to an eight-line budget instead of two per item.\n\nThe draw loop now wraps each line to twenty-four characters and displays the first eight wrapped pieces. AboutPages chunks content into pages of exactly eight wrapped lines, ensuring nothing is dropped.\n\nCredits are also eight raw lines that may exceed forty characters and get truncated. The aboutPages rewrite will flatten all content into wrapped pages using a new pagesOf helper. It wraps each text to twenty-four characters, then groups the results into pages of up to six lines.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-01af2822-09f7-457f-bf0f-0079bd04c7a0-146","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/tools/test.mjs","offset":200,"limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-01af2822-09f7-457f-bf0f-0079bd04c7a0-147","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function wrapText","glob":"**/font.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3372,"output_tokens":1165,"cache_read_input_tokens":201344,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"1fd91101-aab0-40ba-93c1-7c11f8282129"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-01af2822-09f7-457f-bf0f-0079bd04c7a0-146","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"200→    for (const def of ACTIVITIES) {\\n      for (const stars of [0, 1, 2, 3]) {\\n        for (const repeat of [false, true]) {\\n          const found = linesFor(def.id, stars, repeat);\\n          assert(found.length >= 1, `missing ${def.id} ${stars} ${repeat}`);\\n        }\\n      }\\n      assert(!banned.test(def.name), def.name);\\n    }\\n    for (const day of DAYS) assert(!banned.test(`${day.beat} ${day.concern}`), `day ${day.day}`);\\n210→    const pages = aboutPages(CREDITS_TEXT).map((p) => `${p.title}\\\\n${p.lines.join('\\\\n')}`).join('\\\\n');\\n    assert(pages.includes(MEDICAL), 'medical');\\n    for (const key of Object.keys(SOURCE_INFORMATION)) assert(pages.includes(String(SOURCE_INFORMATION[key])), `about ${key}`);\\n    assert(pages.includes('Testing Feedback') && pages.includes('Engine Feedback') && pages.includes('Prompt Feedback'), 'feedback');\\n    assert(pages.includes('Kenney') && pages.includes('three.js') && pages.includes('Rapier'), 'kit');\\n    const interview = exitInterview();\\n    assert(interview.sourceInformation.usage === 'added on import', 'usage');\\n    assert(interview.testingFeedback.length === 4, 'testing feedback');\\n    assert(interview.engineFeedback.length === 6, 'engine feedback');\\n    assert(interview.promptFeedback.length === 4, 'prompt feedback');\\n220→    for (const key of ['name', 'tagline', 'description', 'type', 'genre', 'source', 'series', 'players', 'controls', 'tags']) {\\n      assert(interview.aiHub[key], `aiHub ${key}`);\\n    }\\n    assert(interview.aiHub.name === TITLE, 'aiHub name');\\n    JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(interview));\\n    const hello = syllabify('hello', 'ounce');\\n    const hello2 = syllabify('hello', 'ounce');\\n    assert(JSON.stringify(hello.map((s) => s.vowel + s.cons)) === JSON.stringify(hello2.map((s) => s.vowel + s.cons)), 'stable word');\\n    const q = syllabify('Are you happy?', 'coach');\\n    const s = syllabify('Are you happy.', 'coach');\",\"content_concise\":\"200→    for (const def of ACTIVITIES) {\\n      for (const stars of [0, 1, 2, 3]) {\\n        for (const repeat of [false, true]) {\\n          const found = linesFor(def.id, stars, repeat);\\n          assert(found.length >= 1, `missing ${def.id} ${stars} ${repeat}`);\\n        }\\n      }\\n      assert(!banned.test(def.name), def.name);\\n    }\\n    for (const day of DAYS) assert(!banned.test(`${day.beat} ${day.concern}`), `day ${day.day}`);\\n210→    const pages = aboutPages(CREDITS_TEXT).map((p) => `${p.title}\\\\n${p.lines.join('\\\\n')}`).join('\\\\n');\\n    assert(pages.includes(MEDICAL), 'medical');\\n    for (const key of Object.keys(SOURCE_INFORMATION)) assert(pages.includes(String(SOURCE_INFORMATION[key])), `about ${key}`);\\n    assert(pages.includes('Testing Feedback') && pages.includes('Engine Feedback') && pages.includes('Prompt Feedback'), 'feedback');\\n    assert(pages.includes('Kenney') && pages.includes('three.js') && pages.includes('Rapier'), 'kit');\\n    const interview = exitInterview();\\n    assert(interview.sourceInformation.usage === 'added on import', 'usage');\\n    assert(interview.testingFeedback.length === 4, 'testing feedback');\\n    assert(interview.engineFeedback.length === 6, 'engine feedback');\\n    assert(interview.promptFeedback.length === 4, 'prompt feedback');\\n220→    for (const key of ['name', 'tagline', 'description', 'type', 'genre', 'source', 'series', 'players', 'controls', 'tags']) {\\n      assert(interview.aiHub[key], `aiHub ${key}`);\\n    }\\n    assert(interview.aiHub.name === TITLE, 'aiHub name');\\n    JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(interview));\\n    const hello = syllabify('hello', 'ounce');\\n    const hello2 = syllabify('hello', 'ounce');\\n    assert(JSON.stringify(hello.map((s) => s.vowel + s.cons)) === JSON.stringify(hello2.map((s) => s.vowel + s.cons)), 'stable word');\\n    const q = syllabify('Are you happy?', 'coach');\\n    const s = syllabify('Are you happy.', 'coach');\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/tools/test.mjs\",\"offset\":200,\"limit\":30,\"raw_output\":\"    for (const def of ACTIVITIES) {\\n      for (const stars of [0, 1, 2, 3]) {\\n        for (const repeat of [false, true]) {\\n          const found = linesFor(def.id, stars, repeat);\\n          assert(found.length >= 1, `missing ${def.id} ${stars} ${repeat}`);\\n        }\\n      }\\n      assert(!banned.test(def.name), def.name);\\n    }\\n    for (const day of DAYS) assert(!banned.test(`${day.beat} ${day.concern}`), `day ${day.day}`);\\n    const pages = aboutPages(CREDITS_TEXT).map((p) => `${p.title}\\\\n${p.lines.join('\\\\n')}`).join('\\\\n');\\n    assert(pages.includes(MEDICAL), 'medical');\\n    for (const key of Object.keys(SOURCE_INFORMATION)) assert(pages.includes(String(SOURCE_INFORMATION[key])), `about ${key}`);\\n    assert(pages.includes('Testing Feedback') && pages.includes('Engine Feedback') && pages.includes('Prompt Feedback'), 'feedback');\\n    assert(pages.includes('Kenney') && pages.includes('three.js') && pages.includes('Rapier'), 'kit');\\n    const interview = exitInterview();\\n    assert(interview.sourceInformation.usage === 'added on import', 'usage');\\n    assert(interview.testingFeedback.length === 4, 'testing feedback');\\n    assert(interview.engineFeedback.length === 6, 'engine feedback');\\n    assert(interview.promptFeedback.length === 4, 'prompt feedback');\\n    for (const key of ['name', 'tagline', 'description', 'type', 'genre', 'source', 'series', 'players', 'controls', 'tags']) {\\n      assert(interview.aiHub[key], `aiHub ${key}`);\\n    }\\n    assert(interview.aiHub.name === TITLE, 'aiHub name');\\n    JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(interview));\\n    const hello = syllabify('hello', 'ounce');\\n    const hello2 = syllabify('hello', 'ounce');\\n    assert(JSON.stringify(hello.map((s) => s.vowel + s.cons)) === JSON.stringify(hello2.map((s) => s.vowel + s.cons)), 'stable word');\\n    const q = syllabify('Are you happy?', 'coach');\\n    const s = syllabify('Are you happy.', 'coach');\\n\",\"total_lines\":742}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-01af2822-09f7-457f-bf0f-0079bd04c7a0-147","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,49,54,48,55,95,95,120,54,57,56,49,101,51,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,49,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,49,54,48,55,95,95,120,54,57,56,49,101,51,47,119,111,114,107,47,77,105,110,116,32,68,105,97,108,45,87,105,105,32,70,105,116,45,103,114,111,107,45,52,46,55,45,120,104,105,103,104,45,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,49,54,48,55,47,115,114,99,47,117,105,47,102,111,110,116,46,106,115,10,52,52,58,101,120,112,111,114,116,32,102,117,110,99,116,105,111,110,32,119,114,97,112,84,101,120,116,40,116,101,120,116,44,32,99,111,108,115,41,32,123,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":1,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/ui/font.js\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":44,\"content\":\"export function wrapText(text, cols) {\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"693375c2-4147-48ce-9d89-f5e1c710e2a1"}
