/coin.glb`, `assets/hero.glb`, `assets/tree.glb`). Nothing to credit.\\\\n- **kenney-castle** by Kenney, Creative Commons Zero 1.0 (public domain dedication) (CC0-1.0, credit optional): https://kenney.nl/media/pages/assets/castle-kit/a395102d20-1711543616/kenney_castle-kit.zip. Models: kenney-castle/bridge-draw, kenney-castle/bridge-straight-pillar, kenney-castle/bridge-straight, kenney-castle/door, kenney-castle/flag-banner-long, kenney-c [... truncated (1031 chars total)]\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"3ec929dc-99bd-4c18-b100-43ce631c623b"}
