MARY = \\\"Kenney assets are CC0. three.js is MIT. Rapier is Apache-2.0. The Sweetie 16 palette is credited with the kit. A short page, then the full kit text.\\\";\\nexport const CREDITS_TEXT = \\\"# Credits (Pixel Engine 0.46.0)\\\\n\\\\nWhat this kit carries and where it came from, generated by `npm run bundle` from each built-in model's and texture's `source` (the data the engine repository's `npm run model -- credits` reads) and from the bundled packages' own licence files. Ship this file with a game built on the kit.\\\\n\\\\n## Models and textures\\\\n\\\\n- **The engine's own work**, made in its repository: 151 of the 151 library models (`MODEL_LIBRARY`), 126 of the 126 textures (`TEXTURE_LIBRARY`) and the built-in models (`assets/coin.glb`, `assets/hero.glb`, `assets/tree.glb`). Nothing to credit.\\\\n- **kenney-castle** by Kenney, Creative Commons Zero 1.0 (public domain dedication) (CC0-1.0, credit optional): https://kenney.nl/media/pages/assets/castle-kit/a395102d20-1711543616/kenney_castle-kit.zip. Models: kenney-castle/bridge-draw, kenney-castle/bridge-straight-pillar, kenney-castle/bridge-straight, kenney-castle/door, kenney-castle/flag-banner-long, kenney-castle/flag-banner-short, kenney-castle/flag-pennant, kenney-castle/flag-wide, kenney-castle/flag, kenney-castle/gate, kenney-castle/ground-hills, kenney-castle/ground, kenney-castle/metal-gate, kenney-castle/rocks-large, kenney-castle/rocks-small, kenney-castle/siege-ballista-demolished, kenney-castle/siege-ballista, kenney-castle/siege-catapult-demolished, kenney-castle/siege-catapult, kenney-castle/siege-ram-demolished, kenney-castle/siege-ram, kenney-castle/siege-tower-demolished, kenney-castle/siege-tower, kenney-castle/siege-trebuchet-demolished, kenney-castle/siege-trebuchet, kenney-castle/stairs-stone-square, kenney-castle/stairs-stone, kenney-castle/tower-base, kenney-castle/tower-hexagon-base, kenney-castle/tower-hexagon-mid, kenney-castle/tower-hexagon-roof-secondary, kenney-castle/tower-