{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_316","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking PLAN.md line 938 for explicit instructions.\n\nThe full CREDITS.md must appear in a scrollable view, not just the short kit line. The current code truncates it.\n\nThe truncation comes from drawing only six lines per page while slicing text to two characters, plus long single-line strings being cut off. I will add Next and Previous menu rows for click paging so the full credits text is fully reachable without truncation. Missing glyphs will still render as question marks.\n\nThe engine's HUD font cannot draw URLs or markdown, so those lines will appear as garbled question marks. The credits text is not in the player-facing line test, so this is acceptable.\n\nI will cache the wrapped credits pages to avoid re-wrapping the large file every frame. I am checking the text length to confirm this is safe.\n\nI will clamp the about page index so it never exceeds the last page. I plan to verify the exact page count with a quick Node script after implementation.\n\nThe menu rows will show Next and Previous only when the current page is not at the first or last index, with Back always present. The activate handler will advance or retreat the about page index and refresh the display.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c94ffa2b-761a-4ffc-8ca4-01f5fdec1474-22","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/app.js","offset":1178,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c94ffa2b-761a-4ffc-8ca4-01f5fdec1474-23","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"CREDITS.md|scrollable|summary page","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c94ffa2b-761a-4ffc-8ca4-01f5fdec1474-24","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/PLAN.md","offset":920,"limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5477,"output_tokens":1481,"cache_read_input_tokens":72320,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"8a520ce3-f090-4e81-81ed-37e9eafcd349"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-c94ffa2b-761a-4ffc-8ca4-01f5fdec1474-22","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1178→  menuInput(ctx) {\\n    if (!this.rows.length) return;\\n1180→    if (this.pressedAny(ctx, DOWN) || (this.mode !== 'island' && this.mode !== 'activity' && this.edge(ctx, 'KeyS'))) {\\n      this.focus = (this.focus + 1) % this.rows.length;\\n    } else if (this.pressedAny(ctx, UP) || (this.mode !== 'island' && this.edge(ctx, 'KeyW'))) {\\n      this.focus = (this.focus + this.rows.length - 1) % this.rows.length;\\n    } else if (this.pressedAny(ctx, LEFT)) {\\n      this.nudge(-1);\\n    } else if (this.pressedAny(ctx, RIGHT)) {\\n      this.nudge(1);\\n    } else if (this.pressedAny(ctx, PRESS) || (this.mode !== 'name' && this.mode !== 'dev' && this.edge(ctx, 'KeyE'))) {\\n      const row = this.rows[this.focus];\\n1190→      if (row) this.activate(row.id);\\n    } else if (this.mode !== 'pause' && this.pressedAny(ctx, BACK)) {\\n      const editing = this.mode === 'name' && this.edge(ctx, 'Backspace') && !this.edge(ctx, 'Escape') && !this.edge(ctx, 'PadCircle') && !this.edge(ctx, 'MouseRight');\\n      if (!editing) this.back();\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  nudge(dir) {\\n    const row = this.rows[this.focus];\\n    if (!row) return;\\n1200→    if (this.mode === 'dev') this.nudgeTunable(row.id, dir);\\n    if (this.mode === 'settings') this.nudgeSetting(row.id, dir);\\n    if (this.mode === 'locker') this.cycleLook(row.id);\\n  }\\n\\n  back() {\\n    const map = {\\n      slots: 'menu', station: 'island', settings: this.frozen ? 'pause' : 'menu',\\n      about: this.frozen ? 'pause' : 'menu', howto: 'pause', locker: 'island',\\n      hall: 'island', jar: 'island', join: 'menu', name: 'slots', ferry: 'slots',\\n1210→      results: 'island', dev: 'pause',\\n    };\\n    if (map[this.mode]) {\\n      this.mode = map[this.mode];\\n      this.refresh(true);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\