{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-48e827ab-48d0-40c0-b8ae-0c73209425ce-25","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→# Credits (Pixel Engine 0.46.0)\\n\\nWhat this kit carries and where it came from, generated by `npm run bundle` from each built-in model's and texture's `source` (the data the engine repository's `npm run model -- credits` reads) and from the bundled packages' own licence files. Ship this file with a game built on the kit.\\n\\n## Models and textures\\n\\n- **The engine's own work**, made in its repository: 151 of the 151 library models (`MODEL_LIBRARY`), 126 of the 126 textures (`TEXTURE_LIBRARY`) and the built-in models (`assets/coin.glb`, `assets/hero.glb`, `assets/tree.glb`). Nothing to credit.\\n- **kenney-castle** by Kenney, Creative Commons Zero 1.0 (public domain dedication) (CC0-1.0, credit optional): https://kenney.nl/media/pages/assets/castle-kit/a395102d20-1711543616/kenney_castle-kit.zip. Models: kenney-castle/bridge-draw, kenney-castle/bridge-straight-pillar, kenney-castle/bridge-straight, kenney-castle/door, kenney-castle/flag-banner-long, kenney-castle/flag-banner-short, kenney-castle/flag-pennant, kenney-castle/flag-wide, kenney-castle/flag, kenney-castle/gate, kenney-castle/ground-hills, kenney-castle/ground, kenney-castle/metal-gate, kenney-castle/rocks-large, kenney-castle/rocks-small, kenney-castle/siege-ballista-demolished, kenney-castle/siege-ballista, kenney-castle/siege-catapult-demolished, kenney-castle/siege-catapult, kenney-castle/siege-ram-demolished, kenney-castle/siege-ram, kenney-castle/siege-tower-demolished, kenney-castle/siege-tower, kenney-castle/siege-trebuchet-demolished, kenney-castle/siege-trebuchet, kenney-castle/stairs-stone-square, kenney-castle/stairs-stone, kenney-castle/tower-base, kenney-castle/tower-hexagon-base, kenney-castle/tower-hexagon-mid, kenney-castle/tower-hexagon-roof-secondary, kenney-castle/tower-hexagon-roof, kenney-castle/tower-hexagon-top-wood, kenney-castle/tower-hexagon-top, kenney-castle/tower-slant-roof, kenney-castle/tower-square-arch, kenney-castle/tower-square-base-border, kenney-castle/tower-square-base-color, kenney-castle/tower-square-base, kenney-castle/tower-square-mid-color, kenney-castle/tower-square-mid-door, kenney-castle/tower-square-mid-open-simple, kenney-castle/tower-square-mid-open, kenney-castle/tower-square-mid-windows, kenney-castle/tower-square-mid, kenney-castle/tower-square-roof, kenney-castle/tower-square-top-color, kenney-castle/tower-square-top-roof-high-windows, kenney-castle/tower-square-top-roof-high, kenney-castle/tower-square-top-roof-rounded, kenney-castle/tower-square-top-roof, kenney-castle/tower-square-top, kenney-castle/tower-square, kenney-castle/tower-top, kenney-castle/tree-large, kenney-castle/tree-log, kenney-castle/tree-small, kenney-castle/tree-trunk, kenney-castle/wall-corner-half-tower, kenney-castle/wall-corner-half, kenney-castle/wall-corner-slant, kenney-castle/wall-corner, kenney-castle/wall-doorway, kenney-castle/wall-half-modular, kenney-castle/wall-half, kenney-castle/wall-narrow-corner, kenney-castle/wall-narrow-gate, kenney-castle/wall-narrow-stairs-rail, kenney-castle/wall-narrow-stairs, kenney-castle/wall-narrow-wood-fence, kenney-castle/wall-narrow-wood, kenney-castle/wall-narrow, kenney-castle/wall-pillar, kenney-castle/wall-stud, kenney-castle/wall-to-narrow, kenney-castle/wall.\\n- **kenney-furniture** by Kenney, Creative Commons Zero 1.0 (public domain dedication) (CC0-1.0, credit optional): https://kenney.nl/media/pages/assets/furniture-kit/440e0608a4-1677580847/kenney_furniture-kit.zip. Models: kenney-furniture/bathroom-cabinet, kenney-furniture/bathroom-cabinet-drawer, kenney-furniture/bathroom-mirror, kenney-furniture/bathroom-sink, kenney-furniture/bathroom-sink-square, kenney-furniture/bathtub, kenney-furniture/bear, kenney-furniture/bed-bunk, kenney-furniture/bed-double, kenney-furniture/bed-sing