{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_319","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking state() to expose about text for a headless screen test.\n\nA headless test will boot the app and step through each about page. The draw logic and test will share a `visibleAboutLines(page, cols)` function to avoid extra surface.\n\nDefined `ABOUT_COLS` and `ABOUT_ROWS` constants. The `pageLines` helper returns pre-wrapped lines directly. Draw will re-wrap and slice to 26 columns as a safety measure, matching the test logic.\n\nThe headless test will verify paging by pressing next and confirming the page index advances while the mode stays about. Y-overflow will be checked by setting a small headless viewport, avoiding manual layout math.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f1d8b114-c0ae-4f25-8f15-5a6c5d96487a-30","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"hud\\.width|setViewport|resize","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src","glob":"*.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f1d8b114-c0ae-4f25-8f15-5a6c5d96487a-31","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function widget|this.widget","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/app.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f1d8b114-c0ae-4f25-8f15-5a6c5d96487a-32","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/tools/build.mjs","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4063,"output_tokens":768,"cache_read_input_tokens":92672,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"013444b9-199e-4284-aead-39fe0af89f99"}
