{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_334","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The step function calls frameStep and then hud.sync(renderer).\n\nThe HUD size must be set before step because the draw happens inside frameStep and sync resets it afterward. The test will verify widget positions against the pre-sync size of 427×240. A centered widget's x coordinate will confirm the draw used that width. The \"About\" title scales at 3 since its width is under 400.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The About screen was only drawing the first six lines, so later source fields never appeared. I’ll page the full text to the width the HUD actually draws, then retest."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e2508030-390f-4385-b6cb-e2529c3f2114-52","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/data/about.js","old_string":"/** One source for the About screen and exit-interview.json. */\n\nexport const MEDICAL = 'This is not medical advice. Ounce is a scale.';","new_string":"/** One source for the About screen and exit-interview.json. */\n\nimport { wrapText } from '../ui/font.js';\nimport { CREDITS_SUMMARY } from './creditsText.js';\n\nexport const MEDICAL = 'This is not medical advice. Ounce is a scale.';"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e2508030-390f-4385-b6cb-e2529c3f2114-53","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/data/about.js","old_string":"  'Nine issues. The expert pier jump scored two stars, pause let the pose clock move on the frame the button went down, two songs had uneven pattern lengths, a tray board lookup named a variable that was not in scope, a few model parts floated, the seagull was spoken as the scale, a dev-tool page could not go back, the prompt could draw past a short screen, and the scale\\'s voice measured just under the loudness line.',\n  'Two were game-breaking. The pier jump sat under the three-star line until takeoff recentred the dot, and the pose kept playing for one frame after pause. The others failed a data check, a voice check, or a menu, and they were fixed before the hand-in.',","new_string":"  'Ten issues. The expert pier jump scored two stars, pause let the pose clock move on the frame the button went down, two songs had uneven pattern lengths, a tray board lookup named a variable that was not in scope, a few model parts floated, the seagull was spoken as the scale, a dev-tool page could not go back, the prompt could draw past a short screen, the scale\\'s voice measured just under the loudness line, and the About screen kept only the first six lines so later source fields never appeared.',\n  'Two were game-breaking. The pier jump sat under the three-star line until takeoff recentred the dot, and the pose kept playing for one frame after pause. The others failed a data check, a voice check, a menu, or the About screen, and they were fixed before the hand-in.',"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e2508030-390f-4385-b6cb-e2529c3f2114-54","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/data/about.js","old_string":"/** Pages for the in-game screen. Built only from the fields above. */\nexport function aboutPages(creditsText) {\n  const src = SOURCE_INFORMATION;\n  const pages = [\n    { title: 'A note', lines: [MEDICAL] },\n    {\n      title: 'Source Information',\n      lines: [\n        `Date: ${src.date}`,\n        `Source: ${src.source}`,\n        `Plan: ${src.plan}`,\n        `Genre: ${src.genre}`,\n        `Perspective: ${src.perspective}`,\n        `Tech: ${src.tech}`,\n        `Art Direction: ${src.artDirection}`,\n        `Animation: ${src.animation}`,\n        `Audio: ${src.audio}`,\n        `Online: ${src.online}`,\n        `Testing: ${src.testing}`,\n        `Research: ${src.research}`,\n        `Environment: ${src.environment}`,\n        `Model: ${src.model}`,\n        `Usage: ${src.usage}`,\n      ],\n    },\n    { title: 'Testing Feedback', lines: TESTING_FEEDBACK.map((t, i) => `${i + 1}. ${t}`) },\n    { title: 'Engine Feedback', lines: ENGINE_FEEDBACK.map((t, i) => `${i + 1}. ${t}`) },\n    { title: 'Prompt Feedback', lines: PROMPT_FEEDBACK.map((t, i) => `${i + 1}. ${t}`) },\n    { title: 'Kit credits', lines: [KIT_CREDITS, 'Kenney, three.js, Rapier, and Sweetie 16.'] },\n  ];\n  const full = String(creditsText || '').split(/\\r?\\n/);\n  const size = 8;\n  for (let i = 0; i < full.length; i += size) {\n    pages.push({ title: i === 0 ? 'Credits' : 'Credits', lines: full.slice(i, i + size) });\n  }\n  return pages;\n}","new_string":"/** Narrow HUD wraps at 26 columns and the screen keeps 6 body lines. */\nexport const ABOUT_COLS = 26;\nexport const ABOUT_ROWS = 6;\n\nlet cachedKey = null;\nlet cachedPages = null;\n\nfunction pushPages(pages, title, paragraphs) {\n  const lines = [];\n  for (const paragraph of paragraphs) {\n    for (const bit of wrapText(paragraph, ABOUT_COLS)) if (bit) lines.push(bit);\n  }\n  if (!lines.length) return;\n  for (let i = 0; i < lines.length; i += ABOUT_ROWS) {\n    pages.push({ title, lines: lines.slice(i, i + ABOUT_ROWS) });\n  }\n}\n\n/** Pages for the in-game screen. Built only from the fields above. */\nexport function aboutPages(creditsText) {\n  const key = String(creditsText || '');\n  if (cachedPages && cachedKey === key) return cachedPages;\n  const src = SOURCE_INFORMATION;\n  const pages = [];\n  pushPages(pages, 'A note', [MEDICAL]);\n  pushPages(pages, 'Source Information', [\n    `Date: ${src.date}`,\n    `Source: ${src.source}`,\n    `Plan: ${src.plan}`,\n    `Genre: ${src.genre}`,\n    `Perspective: ${src.perspective}`,\n    `Tech: ${src.tech}`,\n    `Art Direction: ${src.artDirection}`,\n    `Animation: ${src.animation}`,\n    `Audio: ${src.audio}`,\n    `Online: ${src.online}`,\n    `Testing: ${src.testing}`,\n    `Research: ${src.research}`,\n    `Environment: ${src.environment}`,\n    `Model: ${src.model}`,\n    `Usage: ${src.usage}`,\n  ]);\n  pushPages(pages, 'Testing Feedback', TESTING_FEEDBACK.map((t, i) => `${i + 1}. ${t}`));\n  pushPages(pages, 'Engine Feedback', ENGINE_FEEDBACK.map((t, i) => `${i + 1}. ${t}`));\n  pushPages(pages, 'Prompt Feedback', PROMPT_FEEDBACK.map((t, i) => `${i + 1}. ${t}`));\n  pushPages(pages, 'Kit credits', [KIT_CREDITS, CREDITS_SUMMARY]);\n  pushPages(pages, 'Credits', key.split(/\\r?\\n/));\n  cachedKey = key;\n  cachedPages = pages;\n  return pages;\n}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1181,"output_tokens":2084,"cache_read_input_tokens":121344,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"a5bc5430-58d6-4075-9f75-6bd1fb677d05"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-e2508030-390f-4385-b6cb-e2529c3f2114-52","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"/** One source for the About screen and exit-interview.json. */\\n\\nexport const MEDICAL = 'This is not medical advice. Ounce is a scale.';\",\"new_string\":\"/** One source for the About screen and exit-interview.json. */\\n\\nimport { wrapText } from '../ui/font.js';\\nimport { CREDITS_SUMMARY } from './creditsText.js';\\n\\nexport const MEDICAL = 'This is not medical advice. Ounce is a scale.';\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/data/about.js has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/data/about.js has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/data/about.js\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"/** One source for the About screen and exit-interview.json. */\\n\\nexport const MEDICAL = 'This is not medical advice. Ounce is a scale.';\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"/** One source for the About screen and exit-interview.json. */\\n\\nimport { wrapText } from '../ui/font.js';\\nimport { CREDITS_SUMMARY } from './creditsText.js';\\n\\nexport const MEDICAL = 'This is not medical advice. Ounce is a scale.';\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\\nexport const SOURCE_INFORMATION = {\\n  date: '2026-11-04 22:16:07',\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-e2508030-390f-4385-b6cb-e2529c3f2114-53","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"  'Nine issues. The expert pier jump scored two stars, pause let the pose clock move on the frame the button went down, two songs had uneven pattern lengths, a tray board lookup named a variable that was not in scope, a few model parts floated, the seagull was spoken as the scale, a dev-tool page could not go back, the prompt could draw past a short screen, and the scale\\\\'s voice measured just under the loudness line.',\\n  'Two were game-breaking. The pier jump sat under the three-star line until takeoff recentred the dot, and the pose kept playing for one frame after pause. The others failed a data check, a voice check, or a menu, and they were fixed before the hand-in.',\",\"new_string\":\"  'Ten issues. The expert pier jump scored two stars, pause let the pose clock move on the frame the button went down, two songs had uneven pattern lengths, a tray board lookup named a variable that was not in scope, a few model parts floated, the seagull was spoken as the scale, a dev-tool page could not go back, the prompt could draw past a short screen, the scale\\\\'s voice measured just under the loudness line, and the About screen kept only the first six lines so later source fields never appeared.',\\n  'Two were game-breaking. The pier jump sat under the three-star line until takeoff recentred the dot, and the pose kept playing for one frame after pause. The others failed a data check, a voice check, a menu, or the About screen, and they were fixed before the hand-in.',\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/data/about.js has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/data/about.js has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/g