{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_339","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Page 0 has 2 lines but 3 widgets.\n\nThe wrapped MEDICAL text should have produced 2 lines at width 26. Yet the engine drew 3 widgets for only 2 lines. One line must have split into two wrap pieces.\n\nThe `startsWith('about-')` filter matched the heading widget `about-h` in addition to the two content lines. That produced three widgets instead of two. The fix is to use a stricter regex like `/^about-\\d/`. The other ten tests passed.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5273d0d9-a718-4bd5-bc13-6e711801adc7-64","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/tools/test.mjs","old_string":"        const drawn = app.widgets.filter((w) => String(w.id).startsWith('about-'));","new_string":"        const drawn = app.widgets.filter((w) => /^about-\\d/.test(w.id));"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":709,"output_tokens":518,"cache_read_input_tokens":130176,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"52ef4363-c37d-4f54-9990-e16edd7675ef"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-5273d0d9-a718-4bd5-bc13-6e711801adc7-64","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"        const drawn = app.widgets.filter((w) => String(w.id).startsWith('about-'));\",\"new_string\":\"        const drawn = app.widgets.filter((w) => /^about-\\\\d/.test(w.id));\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/tools/test.mjs has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/tools/test.mjs has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/tools/test.mjs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"        const drawn = app.widgets.filter((w) => String(w.id).startsWith('about-'));\",\"old_line\":245,\"new_string\":\"        const drawn = app.widgets.filter((w) => /^about-\\\\d/.test(w.id));\",\"new_line\":245,\"context_before\":\"        app.idle = 0;\\n        app.refresh(true);\\n        aboutEngine.step(1);\\n\",\"context_after\":\"        assert(drawn.length === pages[index].lines.length, `page ${index} drew ${drawn.length}/${pages[index].lines.length} at ${width}x${height}`);\\n        for (const w of app.widgets) {\\n          assert(w.x >= -0.5 && w.y >= -0.5 && w.x + w.w <= width + 0.5 && w.y + w.h <= height + 0.5, `${w.id} outside ${width}x${height}: ${w.x},${w.y} ${w.w}x${w.h}`);\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"0d3f5e3b-fb90-4d19-975d-8ab43b1a6c49"}
