{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_341","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The title widget was not found.\n\nThe headless renderer's paint function returns early because `hud.clear` is missing, so the title widget never gets drawn.\n\nRuled out widget clearing during step or sync. The title widget is still missing.\n\nThe about mode heading widget is actually named `head`, not `title`. The `head()` helper only creates widgets for title and card modes. This explains why the title widget was never found.\n\nThe about heading widget is named `head` and uses the `scale` variable, not `titleScale`. The body lines rendered correctly, so the size sync works for those widgets. I need to assert the `head` widget instead of `title`.\n\nAll widgets fit within the 480×270 bounds. The title widget was never found because the assertion searched for `title` instead of `head`. I will update the assertion to target the `head` widget and use the correct scale and width calculations.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a23835ab-02e5-4516-9838-6584a05b2eb8-66","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/tools/test.mjs","old_string":"        const title = app.widgets.find((w) => w.id === 'title');\n        const titleW = 5 * 6 * (width < 220 ? 2 : width < 400 ? 3 : 4);\n        const expectedX = Math.max(width < 200 ? 4 : 12, Math.floor((width - titleW) / 2));\n        assert(title && title.x === expectedX, `title x ${title?.x} wanted ${expectedX} at ${width}`);","new_string":"        const head = app.widgets.find((w) => w.id === 'head');\n        const headW = 'About'.length * 6 * (width < 220 ? 1 : 2);\n        const expectedX = Math.max(width < 200 ? 4 : 12, Math.floor((width - headW) / 2));\n        assert(head && head.x === expectedX, `head x ${head?.x} wanted ${expectedX} at ${width}`);"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":701,"output_tokens":1272,"cache_read_input_tokens":131456,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"25b5e1ac-b59d-4317-84c7-0868f4522d91"}
