{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_343","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The fast test suite passed. The full suite must now be run to collect the HTML report, exit-interview, browser logs, and test.log from a single execution that includes the about fix.\n\nThe full suite will run in the background. A monitor will track test.exit and browser.log for failures. It will wake me when the run finishes or fails.\n\nThe full suite will run with a ten-minute block timeout. I will continue in this turn when it finishes. This avoids a round trip to wait for the monitor.\n\nThe block timeout is set to twelve minutes. Any prior watcher will be killed first. test.log will be truncated rather than appended. PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE must be exported before the suite starts.\n\nThe suite will run with a zero-second block so I can do prep work in parallel. I will verify the pixel-engine hash and draft the PROGRESS content while waiting. The monitor polls every thirty seconds and only prints on terminal conditions.\n\nThe monitor script will track seen FAIL lines in a scratch file to avoid duplicate alerts. It will also verify that test.log contains no FAIL entries when the suite exits successfully.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a577a287-f667-4a75-87f7-a413bc1470b4-68","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/tmp/grok-goal-46b978a86300/implementer/watch-suite.sh"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":282,"output_tokens":1199,"cache_read_input_tokens":133504,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"11804342-a44a-4da1-976f-8f7185e150eb"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-a577a287-f667-4a75-87f7-a413bc1470b4-68","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→#!/bin/bash\\nSCRATCH=\\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/tmp/grok-goal-46b978a86300/implementer\\\"\\nLOG=\\\"$SCRATCH/test.log\\\"\\nBLOG=\\\"$SCRATCH/browser.log\\\"\\nHLOG=\\\"$SCRATCH/hub.log\\\"\\nEXITF=\\\"$SCRATCH/test.exit\\\"\\nSEEN=\\\"$SCRATCH/watch-seen.txt\\\"\\n: > \\\"$SEEN\\\"\\nwhile [ ! -f \\\"$EXITF\\\" ]; do\\n10→  if [ -f \\\"$BLOG\\\" ]; then\\n    while IFS= read -r line; do\\n      case \\\"$line\\\" in\\n        FAIL*) echo \\\"ACTION_REQUIRED: $line\\\" ;;\\n      esac\\n    done < <(grep -F 'FAIL' \\\"$BLOG\\\" | grep -F -x -v -f \\\"$SEEN\\\" || true)\\n    grep -F 'FAIL' \\\"$BLOG\\\" >> \\\"$SEEN\\\" 2>/dev/null || true\\n  fi\\n  sleep 20\\ndone\\n20→code=$(cat \\\"$EXITF\\\")\\ntail -5 \\\"$LOG\\\"\\nif [ \\\"$code\\\" = \\\"0\\\" ] && grep -q '^[0-9][0-9]*/[0-9][0-9]* passed$' \\\"$LOG\\\" && ! grep -q '^FAIL' \\\"$LOG\\\"; then\\n  echo \\\"DONE: suite exit 0\\\"\\nelse\\n  echo \\\"FAILED: suite exit $code\\\"\\n  echo \\\"--- browser ---\\\"\\n  tail -40 \\\"$BLOG\\\" 2>/dev/null || true\\n  echo \\\"--- hub ---\\\"\\n  tail -40 \\\"$HLOG\\\" 2>/dev/null || true\\n30→fi\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→#!/bin/bash\\nSCRATCH=\\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/tmp/grok-goal-46b978a86300/implementer\\\"\\nLOG=\\\"$SCRATCH/test.log\\\"\\nBLOG=\\\"$SCRATCH/browser.log\\\"\\nHLOG=\\\"$SCRATCH/hub.log\\\"\\nEXITF=\\\"$SCRATCH/test.exit\\\"\\nSEEN=\\\"$SCRATCH/watch-seen.txt\\\"\\n: > \\\"$SEEN\\\"\\nwhile [ ! -f \\\"$EXITF\\\" ]; do\\n10→  if [ -f \\\"$BLOG\\\" ]; then\\n    while IFS= read -r line; do\\n      case \\\"$line\\\" in\\n        FAIL*) echo \\\"ACTION_REQUIRED: $line\\\" ;;\\n      esac\\n    done < <(grep -F 'FAIL' \\\"$BLOG\\\" | grep -F -x -v -f \\\"$SEEN\\\" || true)\\n    grep -F 'FAIL' \\\"$BLOG\\\" >> \\\"$SEEN\\\" 2>/dev/null || true\\n  fi\\n  sleep 20\\ndone\\n20→code=$(cat \\\"$EXITF\\\")\\ntail -5 \\\"$LOG\\\"\\nif [ \\\"$code\\\" = \\\"0\\\" ] && grep -q '^[0-9][0-9]*/[0-9][0-9]* passed$' \\\"$LOG\\\" && ! grep -q '^FAIL' \\\"$LOG\\\"; then\\n  echo \\\"DONE: suite exit 0\\\"\\nelse\\n  echo \\\"FAILED: suite exit $code\\\"\\n  echo \\\"--- browser ---\\\"\\n  tail -40 \\\"$BLOG\\\" 2>/dev/null || true\\n  echo \\\"--- hub ---\\\"\\n  tail -40 \\\"$HLOG\\\" 2>/dev/null || true\\n30→fi\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/tmp/grok-goal-46b978a86300/implementer/watch-suite.sh\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"#!/bin/bash\\nSCRATCH=\\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/tmp/grok-goal-46b978a86300/implementer\\\"\\nLOG=\\\"$SCRATCH/test.log\\\"\\nBLOG=\\\"$SCRATCH/browser.log\\\"\\nHLOG=\\\"$SCRATCH/hub.log\\\"\\nEXITF=\\\"$SCRATCH/test.exit\\\"\\nSEEN=\\\"$SCRATCH/watch-seen.txt\\\"\\n: > \\\"$SEEN\\\"\\nwhile [ ! -f \\\"$EXITF\\\" ]; do\\n  if [ -f \\\"$BLOG\\\" ]; then\\n    while IFS= read -r line; do\\n      case \\\"$line\\\" in\\n        FAIL*) echo \\\"ACTION_REQUIRED: $line\\\" ;;\\n      esac\\n    done < <(grep -F 'FAIL' \\\"$BLOG\\\" | grep -F -x -v -f \\\"$SEEN\\\" || true)\\n    grep -F 'FAIL' \\\"$BLOG\\\" >> \\\"$SEEN\\\" 2>/dev/null || true\\n  fi\\n  sleep 20\\ndone\\ncode=$(cat \\\"$EXITF\\\")\\ntail -5 \\\"$LOG\\\"\\nif [ \\\"$code\\\" = \\\"0\\\" ] && grep -q '^[0-9][0-9]*/[0-9][0-9]* passed$' \\\"$LOG\\\" && ! grep -q '^FAIL' \\\"$LOG\\\"; then\\n  echo \\\"DONE: suite exit 0\\\"\\nelse\\n  echo \\\"FAILED: suite exit $code\\\"\\n  echo \\\"--- browser ---\\\"\\n  tail -40 \\\"$BLOG\\\" 2>/dev/null || true\\n  echo \\\"--- hub ---\\\"\\n  tail -40 \\\"$HLOG\\\" 2>/dev/null || true\\nfi\\n\",\"total_lines\":30}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session