{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_350","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The screenshots show the 3D scene without HUD text composited in.\n\nThe browser log shows the title text was captured in the pixel buffer. The verification plan requires compositing the HUD into renderer.capture() before saving PNGs. The shots from shot.mjs may not be doing this.\n\nThe image describer missed the \"Mint Dial\" text. The browser test passed its buffer checks, so the HUD composite likely succeeded despite the describer's failure to detect small pixel text.\n\nI will inspect the capture code to confirm whether HUD pixels are actually composited into the PNG. If all four shots and the boot capture consistently omit UI text, the HUD may be missing from the image entirely. The vision model likely focused on the 3D scene rather than the small HUD elements.\n\nI will inspect the top pixels of boot-1.png directly. A navy band at the top would confirm the HUD was composited into the saved PNG. If only sky blue appears, the HUD was missing from the file itself. The test may have passed in memory while the image did not include it.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-72ea1ff7-cfa0-4140-b70a-e32e89d1d75e-82","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function composite|boot-1|writeFileSync.*png|span","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/tools"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-72ea1ff7-cfa0-4140-b70a-e32e89d1d75e-83","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"python3 - << 'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\ntry:\n    from PIL import Image\nexcept ImportError:\n    import subprocess, sys\n    print('no pillow')\n    raise SystemExit\npaths = [\n\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/tmp/grok-goal-46b978a86300/implementer/boot-1.png\",\n\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/tmp/grok-goal-46b978a86300/implementer/boot-2.png\",\n\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/tmp/grok-goal-46b978a86300/implementer/shots/title.png\",\n\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/tmp/grok-goal-46b978a86300/implementer/shots/pause.png\",\n]\nfor p in paths:\n    im = Image.open(p).convert('RGB')\n    w,h = im.size\n    # sample a grid and unique-ish colors\n    cols=set()\n    px=im.load()\n    for y in range(0,h,max(1,h//40)):\n        for x in range(0,w,max(1,w//40)):\n            cols.add(px[x,y])\n    top = [px[x, 8] for x in range(0,w,max(1,w//20))]\n    print(Path(p).name, im.size, 'samples', len(cols), 'top8', top[:6])\nPY","description":"Sample screenshot pixels for a HUD band"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8647,"output_tokens":1253,"cache_read_input_tokens":140544,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"e668b158-7ab2-475b-87c5-78974850f5d1"}
