{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_354","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will fix grab to draw only the HUD canvas on top of the capture.\n\nSpan will remain on the 3D buffer to avoid hiding a blank frame behind the HUD. I will re-run the full suite so the evidence matches.\n\nI will also record the number of HUD canvases in the shot metadata. The test suite will fail if no HUD canvas is found, ensuring honest evidence.\n\nI will sample the composited canvas for navy pixels in the top band to verify the HUD rendered. I need to look up the exact Sweetie navy palette values.\n\nThe navy pixel detector correctly identifies Sweetie's #1a1c2c palette. Sky pixels are excluded. The title band covers y=8, so the sample point falls inside the stretched HUD.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a565e4e7-6884-465a-a598-9e2ec4d616b8-88","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"navy","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/GUIDE.md","head_limit":15}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1445,"output_tokens":935,"cache_read_input_tokens":155264,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"000488fa-098f-4498-9724-af46f37f398c"}
