{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_357","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking if 2700911 decimal equals hex 0x29366F.\n\nConfirmed 2700911 equals 0x29366F. RGB values are 41, 54, 111. The detector correctly identifies navy and rejects sky blue. Adding the check.\n\nWhite text pixels near (245, 245, 245) are visible. I'll implement the grab fix and a boot assertion that the composited top band contains navy pixels. Then I'll re-run the full suite. JSON validation will be finished after or in parallel.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0fde3fb6-7c4a-4e67-9a35-59cb8480faea-91","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/tools/shot.mjs","old_string":"    const huds = [...document.querySelectorAll('canvas')].filter((c) => c !== canvas && c.width > 0);\n    for (const hud of huds) {\n      try { ctx.drawImage(hud, 0, 0, frame.width, frame.height); } catch { /* a canvas may be tainted or empty */ }\n    }","new_string":"    // The scene canvas is already in the capture. Draw only the pixel HUD, or the scene canvas paints over it.\n    const huds = [...document.querySelectorAll('canvas')].filter((c) => c.dataset.hud === 'true' && c.width > 0);\n    for (const hud of huds) {\n      try { ctx.drawImage(hud, 0, 0, frame.width, frame.height); } catch { /* a canvas may be tainted or empty */ }\n    }\n    const band = ctx.getImageData(0, 8, frame.width, 1).data;\n    let navy = 0;\n    for (let i = 0; i < band.length; i += 16) {\n      if (band[i + 2] > band[i] + 20 && band[i + 2] > band[i + 1] && band[i] < 80) navy += 1;\n    }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0fde3fb6-7c4a-4e67-9a35-59cb8480faea-92","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-202