{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_377","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"No Node process appears in the process list.\n\nThe HTML file was built during this test suite. It reflects the current about.js content. The suite is now in the browser phase.\n\nI will not edit about.js now. The browser is testing the HTML built at 00:43, which already includes the focus marker fix from app.js. Changing about.js would create a mismatch with the tested build.\n\nThe cursor issue should be counted in the feedback. I will add it after the green run, then rebuild the HTML and exit-interview to match about.js. The browser evidence will remain from the pre-change build.\n\nThe test.log predates the feedback change. A fresh --fast run will confirm the suite passes with eleven issues. The HTML hash will update, but another full browser run is unnecessary since only the sentence text changed.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-33b548a9-1827-4f57-95db-63cc254b7957-118","name":"get_command_or_subagent_output","input":{"task_ids":["a9ce0efc-6255-49d4-9b0c-a66009e46a27"],"timeout_ms":180000}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":946,"output_tokens":865,"cache_read_input_tokens":182528,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"4f737852-3eca-49d0-8424-2709c0b92b3a"}
