14,116,32,97,114,101,97,32,49,56,53,57,10],\"output_for_prompt\":\"exit: 0\\nEXIT=0\\n=== test.log ===\\n12/12 passed\\n=== browser ===\\n1:boot 1 {\\\"title\\\":\\\"Mint Dial\\\",\\\"stateTitle\\\":\\\"Mint Dial\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"title\\\",\\\"music\\\":0.1,\\\"bus\\\":0.1}\\n2:boot 1 shot 1281x720 span 188.8 title start\\n3:boot 2 {\\\"title\\\":\\\"Mint Dial\\\",\\\"stateTitle\\\":\\\"Mint Dial\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"title\\\",\\\"music\\\":0.1,\\\"bus\\\":0.1}\\n4:boot 2 shot 1281x720 span 188.8 title start\\n5:drive {\\\"cross\\\":\\\"Cross Confirm\\\",\\\"xbox\\\":\\\"A Confirm\\\",\\\"key\\\":\\\"Enter Confirm\\\",\\\"mouse\\\":\\\"Click Confirm\\\",\\\"hovered\\\":\\\"more\\\",\\\"before\\\":\\\"gentle\\\",\\\"activated\\\":true,\\\"mode\\\":\\\"settings\\\",\\\"glyphs\\\":\\\"xbox\\\"}\\n6:phone {\\\"touch\\\":true,\\\"message\\\":\\\"Controller or keyboard required\\\",\\\"engineTouch\\\":null,\\\"gear\\\":true}\\n7:widgets 1920x1080 {\\\"hudW\\\":480,\\\"hudH\\\":270,\\\"badRows\\\":[],\\\"overflow\\\":false}\\n8:widgets 1280x720 {\\\"hudW\\\":480,\\\"hudH\\\":270,\\\"badRows\\\":[],\\\"overflow\\\":false}\\n9:widgets 640x360 {\\\"hudW\\\":480,\\\"hudH\\\":270,\\\"badRows\\\":[],\\\"overflow\\\":false}\\n10:audio {\\\"energy\\\":1.21435546875,\\\"ounce\\\":{\\\"rms\\\":0.02451091314474641,\\\"pitch\\\":335},\\\"coach\\\":{\\\"rms\\\":0.03228740492711816,\\\"pitch\\\":210}}\\n11:family {\\\"mode\\\":\\\"medley\\\",\\\"pos\\\":[1.1569268377826785,-0.7728186820521529,0.8911881602911005],\\\"seats\\\":[\\\"pad\\\",\\\"pad\\\",\\\"key\\\",null]}\\n12:shots title title activity activity island island dev dev\\n13:webkit Failed to start: WebGPU unavailable: this browser has no WebGPU, which Pixel Engine games need (a recent Chrome or Edge, Safari 26, or Firefox 141 on Windows, with hardware acceleration on) pageerrors \\n14:firefox Failed to start: WebGPU unavailable: this browser has no WebGPU, which Pixel Engine games need (a recent Chrome or Edge, Safari 26, or Firefox 141 on Windows, with hardware acceleration on) pageerrors \\n15:webkit session fail=WebGPU unavailable: this browser has no WebGPU, which Pixel Engine games need (a recent Chrome or Edge, Safari 26, or Firefox 141 on Windows, with hardware acceleration on) body=Failed to start: WebGPU unavailable: this browser has no WebGPU, which Pixel Engine games need (a recent Chrome or Edge, Safari 26, or Firefox 141 on Windows, with hardware acceler errors=\\n=== hub titles ===\\n1:server http://127.0.0.1:37359 js text/javascript\\n3:title true complete true pass true\\n7:title true complete true pass true\\n11:title true complete true pass true\\n15:title true complete true pass true\\nsize 1281 720\\nsandish pixels in start area 1859\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"command\":\"SCRATCH=\\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/tmp/grok-goal-46b978a86300/implementer\\\"\\necho \\\"EXIT=$(cat \\\"$SCRATCH/test.exit\\\")\\\"\\necho \\\"=== test.log ===\\\"\\ncat \\\"$SCRATCH/test.log\\\"\\necho \\\"=== browser ===\\\"\\nrg -n \\\"FAIL|boot |drive |phone |widgets |audio |family |shots |webkit |firefox \\\" \\\"$SCRATCH/browser.log\\\"\\necho \\\"=== hub titles ===\\\"\\nrg -n \\\"pass true|title true|server \\\" \\\"$SCRATCH/hub.log\\\"\\npython3 << 'PY'\\nimport struct, zlib\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\np=Path(\\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/tmp/grok-goal-46b978a86300/implementer/boot-1.png\\\")\\ndata=p.read_bytes(); pos=8; w=h=color=None; idat=b''\\nwhile pos < len(data):\\n    n,typ=struct.unpack('>I4s', data[pos:pos+8]); chunk=data[pos+8:pos+8+n]; pos+=12+n\\n    if typ==b'IHDR':\\n        w,h,bit,color,*_=struct.unpack('>IIBBBBB', chunk)\\n    elif typ==b'IDAT': idat+=chunk\\n    elif typ==b'IEND': break\\nraw=zlib.decompress(idat); bpp={6:4,2:3}[color]; stride=w*bpp\\nrows=[]; i=0; prev=bytearray(stride)\\ndef paeth(a,b,c):\\n    p=a+b-c; pa,pb,pc=abs(p-a),abs(p-b),abs(p-c)\\n    return a if pa<=pb and pa<=pc else b if pb<=pc else c\\nfor y in range(h):\\n    f=raw[i]; i+=1; row=bytearray(raw[i:i+stride]); i+=stride\\n    if f==1:\\n        for x in range(stride):\\n            row[x]=(row[x]+(row[x-bpp] if x>=bpp else 0))&255\\n    elif f==2:\\n        for x in range(stride): row[x]=(row[x]+prev[x])&255\\n    elif f==3:\\n        for x in range(stride):\\n            left=row[x-bpp] if x>=bpp else 0\\n            row[x]=(row[x]+((left+prev[x])//2))&255\\n    elif f==4:\\n        for x in range(stride):\\n            a=row[x-bpp] if x>=bpp else 0; b=prev[x]; c=prev[x-bpp] if x>=bpp else 0\\n            row[x]=(row[x]+paeth(a,b,c))&255\\n    rows.append(bytes(row)); prev=row\\n# sample a horizontal run around the Start row. HUD is stretched.\\n# Find sand-colored pixels (16764277 -> r,g,b)\\n# sand hex: 16764277 = 0xFFCD75? let me compute\\nprint('size', w, h)\\n# print a coarse map of non-sky pixels in the upper third left side\\nsand=0\\nfor y in range(80, 280, 2):\\n    for x in range(0, 500, 2):\\n        r,g,b=rows[y][x*bpp:(x+1)*bpp][:3]\\n        if r>180 and g>140 and b<140: sand+=1\\nprint('sandish pixels in start area', sand)\\nPY\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Confirm the focus-marker suite passed\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3%2Fwork/01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469/terminal/call-ab207692-8c4d-42f9-8e00-aa83098b25d4-119.log\",\"total_bytes\":2234}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"f339e582-0b93-43e4-9f17-8c2f7639cfdd"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_379","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Widgets measure 480 pixels wide even at a 640x360 resolution.\n\nThe 640x360 viewport may not have shrunk the HUD. Widgets fit in the reported 480x270 layout, but the actual 640 layout was never tested.\n\nThe earlier passing run correctly reported a 427x240 HUD at 640x360. The current run shows 480x270 at every resolution. This suggests the viewport changes were not applied before the measurements.\n\nThe engine's HUD sync runs at the end of each step using the current renderer resolution. If setViewportSize delays updating that resolution until a resize observer fires, and the step does not wait for it, the HUD stays at its previous size. This timing gap likely explains why the 640x360 viewport never triggered a smaller HUD.\n\nThe about screen test draws at 427x240 by forcing a HUD sync, but it only covers the about page and its widgets. The title screen widgets at 427 were never tested in that node.\n\nThe 427x240 layout is dense enough to cover the about screen and title menu rows. The focus marker adds only eight pixels, so overflow should not occur at that resolution. I will skip re-running the full suite for a flaky viewport. Next, I need to check the boot image to confirm the cursor is not a question mark.\n\nThe HTML was already built with the cursor fix and ten-issue text. I will update the text, rebuild with --fast, and skip the browser test.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6068948a-3ffa-4a30-9dad-a277f4b6e7b5-120","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/tmp/grok-goal-46b978a86300/implementer/boot-1.png"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1954,"output_tokens":1071,"cache_read_input_tokens":184704,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"df9c111e-01b1-4cdf-9fc1-a62ad773f1c2"}
