{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_387","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Updating the checklist with a bulk replacement and appending deviations.\n\nWriting PROGRESS.md in the workspace root. Composing the final user message from existing JSON data.\n\nPROGRESS.md now lists the full island experience and verification results. Twelve tests passed with no failures. Chromium launches confirmed the title, music bus, and boot frames.\n\nController prompts and hover-to-click activation work. Phone profile shows the controller message, settings control, and attract mode with no touch play. Widget rectangles fit at 1920×1080, 1280×720, and 640×360. Voice RMS is above 0.02 and Ounce’s pitch exceeds Coach’s. WebKit and Firefox report WebGPU unavailable but show no page errors. The hub harness on 127.0.0.1:38059 passed all four URLs; the title boots without an active session.\n\nThe pixel-engine.js kit file has SHA256 `80408b4c72ef08be3ec628d578f8b008644c1c7e447a4cc8c5979b08212e78aa`. The About screen covers every source field, the three feedback sections, the kit credits, the medical line, and the full kit credits text. Next and Previous, or the shoulder buttons, navigate between pages. Overhead Mortgage was in the optional cut list per PLAN.md.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9afad083-0e61-4f2b-8d3c-d55a103cc34e-130","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"mortgage|Mortgage|overhead","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src","glob":"*.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1094,"output_tokens":867,"cache_read_input_tokens":196992,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"b641f267-9f51-428c-a0e5-a323a2ebf2bd"}
