],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":1,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/data/activities.js\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":15,\"content\":\"  { id: 'press', name: 'Overhead Mortgage', station: 'shed', kind: 'reps', clip: 'Press', reps: 8, tempo: 3.6, axis: 'up', lag: 1.5, unlock: 4, easy: false, song: 'reps', thresholds: [55, 75, 90] },\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"0f870454-6296-464b-a7d8-4b8d490ff438"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_388","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Overhead Mortgage is a reps activity.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-12a214a1-0efa-46a5-8466-5a2e5de28b72-131","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3%2Fwork/01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469/goal/plan.md","old_string":"- [ ]","new_string":"- [x]","replace_all":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-12a214a1-0efa-46a5-8466-5a2e5de28b72-132","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3%2Fwork/01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469/goal/plan.md","old_string":"- Player-facing text must avoid Nintendo names, but Source Information and the filename must say Wii Fit. Those two places are the exception.","new_string":"- Player-facing text must avoid Nintendo names, but Source Information and the filename must say Wii Fit. Those two places are the exception.\n\n## Deviations\n- Mode changes cut instantly. There is no screen iris.\n- One World and one App draw every screen, rather than a scene file per screen.\n- Vitamin Tray slides vitamins with a tilt formula on three lane boards. It does not use Rapier bodies.\n- Pier Jump recentres the dot when the flight starts, so the jump is not scored from the crouch.\n- Attract mode, the medley, and bot-driven activities skip the intro.\n- The session card uses palette stand-ins for the four seat colours.\n- A join press that claims a seat does not also activate the focused menu row on that same frame.\n- On the name screen, Backspace edits the name and does not also leave the screen.\n- Pause is taken at the start of fixed, before the sim step, because the headless stepper still runs fixedUpdate on the frame timeScale becomes 0."}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-12a214a1-0efa-46a5-8466-5a2e5de28b72-133","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/PROGRESS.md","content":"# Mint Dial\n\nThe hand-in is in this folder: `Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607.html` and `exit-interview.json`. The dev folder uses the same stem. `src/data/about.js` is the only copy of the source fields and the feedback. `tools/build.mjs` writes the HTML and the exit interview from it.\n\n## Shipped\n\nA week with Ounce the scale. Weigh-in, three guest slots, the ferry, seven days, the island, every planned activity (including Pier Jump, Vitamin Tray, Island Jog, Overhead Mortgage, and The Long Stand), the jar, the confession that subtracts 7, and an open Week 2. Family Hour runs three medley events for up to four players. An AI Hub session uses ghost mode and its own card. Attract mode, dev-tool sliders, and the touch gate are in. Music, effects, and the two voices are code.\n\n## Verification\n\n`node tools/test.mjs` from the dev folder printed `12/12 passed` and no failure lines.\n\nTwo `file://` Chromium launches, with the five software WebGPU flags, showed the title Mint Dial, music bus 0.10, and no page errors. Both captures are 1281×720 and painted. The saved frames show the title, the tagline, and the medical line. Prompts follow Cross, Xbox A, Enter, and click. Hover moved the focus from Gentle to More, and the click activated. A phone profile shows “Controller or keyboard required”, a settings control, and attract, and it does not start play from a touch. Widget rects fit at 1920×1080, 1280×720, and 640×360. An analyser read the mix, and an offline voice render was above 0.02 RMS with Ounce’s pitch above Coach’s. Three Family Hour lanes moved. WebKit and Firefox show “Failed to start: WebGPU unavailable” and raise no page error.\n\nThe hub harness on `127.0.0.1:38059` passed all four URLs (`players=1`, `players=2`, the lossy four-player case, and host-leave). With no session, the title still boots. JavaScript was served as `text/javascript`.\n\n`pixel-engine.js` sha256 is `80408b4c72ef08be3ec628d578f8b008644c1c7e447a4cc8c5979b08212e78aa`, the same as the kit.\n\n## About\n\nThe About screen pages every source field, the three feedback sections, the kit credits, the medical sentence, and the full kit credits text. Next, Previous, and the shoulder buttons move between pages.\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1155,"output_tokens":1277,"cache_read_input_tokens":198016,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"597c4ee2-5f97-4c7a-a7da-4b89a507e0f8"}
