tests.\\n- [x] Ship Holding Still end to end (avatar, coach, results, voice, music) and check the bot star table before adding more activities.\\n- [x] Build the island, weigh-in, seven-day loop, saves, report, sweat jar, and locker unlocks; start the scripted playthrough test.\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"},{\"old_string\":\"- [ ]\",\"old_line\":41,\"new_string\":\"- [x]\",\"new_line\":41,\"context_before\":\"\\n## Task checklist\\n- [x] Download the kit and hub files, record the engine sha256, scaffold the dev folder and the single-file build, and boot a title scene from `file://`.\\n\",\"context_after\":\"- [x] Ship Holding Still end to end (avatar, coach, results, voice, music) and check the bot star table before adding more activities.\\n- [x] Build the island, weigh-in, seven-day loop, saves, report, sweat jar, and locker unlocks; start the scripted playthrough test.\\n- [x] Add Hoop, Reps, Header, Step, Slackline, Vitamin Tray, Pier Jump, and Island Jog, each with idle-vs-expert bot tests and original lines.\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"},{\"old_string\":\"- [ ]\",\"old_line\":42,\"new_string\":\"- [x]\",\"new_line\":42,\"context_before\":\"## Task checklist\\n- [x] Download the kit and hub files, record the engine sha256, scaffold the dev folder and the single-file build, and boot a title scene from `file://`.\\n- [x] Implement the Dot, drivers, actions, device tracking, tunables, pixel HUD (mixed case, glyphs, prompts), settings, pause, and dev sliders; lock the bot ring-time tests.\\n\",\"context_after\":\"- [x] Build the island, weigh-in, seven-day loop, saves, report, sweat jar, and locker unlocks; start the scripted playthrough test.\\n- [x] Add Hoop, Reps, Header, Step, Slackline, Vitamin Tray, Pier Jump, and Island Jog, each with idle-vs-expert bot tests and original lines.\\n- [x] Add The Medley, Family Hour, and the AI Hub ghost card; run all four harness URLs.\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"},{\"old_string\":\"- [ ]\",\"old_line\":43,\"new_string\":\"- [x]\",\"n