99,114,101,101,110,44,32,66,97,99,107,115,112,97,99,101,32,101,100,105,116,115,32,116,104,101,32,110,97,109,101,32,97,110,100,32,100,111,101,115,32,110,111,116,32,97,108,115,111,32,108,101,97,118,101,32,116,104,101,32,115,99,114,101,101,110,46,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":16,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3%2Fwork/01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469/goal/plan.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":9,\"content\":\"3. **Week-long vertical slice.** From a fresh save the real menus reach a named guest (3 slots), a ferry intro, and seven short days: morning weigh-in (stillness, lean, or chase, plus one absurd question), a free island of four stations, at least one activity, hammock, evening report, then the next morning. Shown Wobble Age is the true age plus 7 until the confession, which subtracts exactly 7 from every chart point; play then continues into an open Week 2. There is no lose state. Stars are 0–3; Drips are `2 + 3×stars + floor(playSeconds/30)` plus +5 for the day’s prescription; jar milestones unlock locker items; saves are versioned JSON (in-memory fallback if storage is missing) and survive reload. Every PLAN.md §5 activity is playable to a results screen, including hard versions: Holding Still poses, Reps (scrubbed motion, “last one” gag), Hoop Economics, Step Class, Coconut Header, Slackline, Vitamin Tray, Island Jog, Pier Jump, and The Long Stand’s 90 s distraction timeline. An idl [... truncated (1031 chars total)]\"},{\"line_number\":10,\"content\":\"4. **10-foot controls, dev mode, attract, audio.** One pixel HUD serves pad, keyboard, and mouse (no DOM menus, no dense data screens). Prompts follow the last device: PlayStation glyphs by default, an Xbox glyph option, keycaps, and mouse buttons. Pause sets `timeScale` to 0 (simulation frozen, menus still read input) and opens Dev Tools with live sliders for the PLAN.md §10 balance, breath/reps, rhythm, games, and economy variables, plus reset-tab and reset-all. After 10 s with no input on the title or any menu, a looping attract demo plays real scenes of every activity family (cheats allowed) until any input returns to the title; it does not start during play, pause, or a hub session. Touch-only devices get no touch controls, the text “Controller or keyboard required”, a settings button, and a running attract loop. All music, SFX, and voices are code (no audio files). Voices are Animalese/Simlish gibberish: the same word always yields the same syllables, a “?” rises in pitch, and an [... truncated (1031 chars total)]\"},{\"line_number\":14,\"content\":\"1. **gating:** Add or update real tests that drive the shipped Dot, scoring, Wobble Age, save, voice syllabifier, activity scenes, and menu flow from their real start states (no mocked unit under test, no re-implementation, no hardcoded title). Run `node tools/test.mjs` from the dev folder after the code it covers is in place. Capture stdout/stderr to `{SCRATCH}/test.log`. Pass only if the log ends in a one-line all-passed count, prints no failures, and the assertions cover: Dot bands and 45/70/90 stars; every activity idle 0★ vs expert ≥2★ and correct Drips; a scripted fresh-save week through Day 7, confession −7, and Week 2; save reload, corrupt JSON, and missing storage; pause freeze and resume; every dev slider live plus both resets; attract at 10 s on title and on a menu, no trigger in play, any input exits; medley windows and a ghost lane that does not simulate; stable syllabify and a rising question; `pixel-engine.js` hash equals the kit zip.\"},{\"line_number\":40,\"content\":\"- [x] Download the kit and hub files, record the engine sha256, scaffold the dev folder and the single-file build, and boot a title scene from `file://`.\"},{\"line_number\":41,\"content\":\"- [x] Implement the Dot, drivers, actions, device tracking, tunables, pixel HUD (mixed case, glyphs, prompts), settings, pause, and dev sliders; lock the bot ring-time tests.\"},{\"line_number\":42,\"content\":\"- [x] Ship Holding Still end to end (avatar, coach, results, voice, music) and check the bot star table before adding more activities.\"},{\"line_number\":43,\"content\":\"- [x] Build the island, weigh-in, seven-day loop, saves, report, sweat jar, and locker unlocks; start the scripted playthrough test.\"},{\"line_number\":44,\"content\":\"- [x] Add Hoop, Reps, Header, Step, Slackline, Vitamin Tray, Pier Jump, and Island Jog, each with idle-vs-expert bot tests and original lines.\"},{\"line_number\":45,\"content\":\"- [x] Add The Medley, Family Hour, and the AI Hub ghost card; run all four harness URLs.\"},{\"line_number\":46,\"content\":\"- [x] Add attract mode, the dev tools tab, the touch-only gate, Hall of Numbers, ferry, daily beats, Long Stand, confession (−7), credits, and the full code-only soundtrack.\"},{\"line_number\":47,\"content\":\"- [x] Write About/Credits from one data source, emit `exit-interview.json`, update `PROGRESS.md`, and capture `node tools/test.mjs`, two `file://` launches, and the hub log under `{SCRATCH}`.\"},{\"line_number\":57,\"content\":\"## Deviations\"},{\"line_number\":59,\"content\":\"- One World and one App draw every screen, rather than a scene file per screen.\"},{\"line_number\":60,\"content\":\"- Vitamin Tray slides vitamins with a tilt formula on three lane boards. It does not use Rapier bodies.\"},{\"line_number\":64,\"content\":\"- A join press that claims a seat does not also activate the focused menu row on that same frame.\"},{\"line_number\":65,\"content\":\"- On the name screen, Backspace edits the name and does not also leave the screen.\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"51242559-f943-4753-acad-b0ae27508dad"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_390","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The \"does not\" bullets describe actual behavior that differs from a naive reading.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f3dcb5a2-fa2d-4055-a083-d26be5bc8c2b-135","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3%2Fwork/01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469/goal/plan.md","old_string":"- One World and one App draw every screen, rather than a scene file per screen.","new_string":"- Screens share one World and one App."}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f3dcb5a2-fa2d-4055-a083-d26be5bc8c2b-136","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"7","content":"Fix About HUD so every source field and the full feedback are visible, then rebuild","status":"completed"},{"id":"8","content":"Hand in exit-interview.json, PROGRESS.md, checklist and deviations","status":"completed"}],"merge":true}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1699,"output_tokens":327,"cache_read_input_tokens":200704,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"555857fa-c20b-4478-8a02-47b04c481602"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-f3dcb5a2-fa2d-4055-a083-d26be5bc8c2b-135","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"- One World and one App draw every screen, rather than a scene file per screen.\",\"new_string\":\"- Screens share one World and one App.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3%2Fwork/01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469/goal/plan.md has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3%2Fwork/01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469/goal/plan.md has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3%2Fwork/01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469/goal/plan.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"- One World and one App draw every screen, rather than a scene file per screen.\",\"old_line\":59,\"new_string\":\"- Screens share one World and one App.\",\"new_line\":59,\"context_before\":\"\\n## Deviations\\n- Mode changes cut instantly. There is no screen iris.\\n\",\"context_after\":\"- Vitamin Tray slides vitamins with a tilt formula on three lane boards. It does not use Rapier bodies.\\n- Pier Jump recentres the dot when the flight starts, so the jump is not scored from the crouch.\\n- Attract mode, the medley, and bot-driven activities skip the intro.\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-f3dcb5a2-fa2d-4055-a083-d26be5bc8c2b-136","content":"{\"type\":\"Todo\",\"TodosUpdated\":{\"summary_for_prompt\":\"- [completed] 1: Download kit and hub, record sha256, scaffold dev folder and title\\n- [completed] 2: Implement Dot, drivers, actions, device, tunables, HUD, pause, dev sliders\\n- [completed] 3: Ship Holding Still end to end and lock bot star tests\\n- [completed] 4: Build island, weigh-in, seven-day loop, saves, report, jar, locker\\n- [completed] 5: Add remaining activities with idle-vs-expert bot tests and lines\\n- [completed] 6: Fix remaining --fast failures (rng scan, pause freeze, week boot) and get 11/11\\n- [completed] 7: Fix About HUD so every source field and the full feedback are visible, then rebuild\\n- [completed] 8: Hand in exit-interview.json, PROGRESS.md, checklist and deviations\\n\",\"todos\":[{\"content\":\"Download kit and hub, record sha256, scaffold dev folder and title\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"Implement Dot, drivers, actions, device, tunables, HUD, pause, dev sliders\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"Ship Holding Still end to end and lock bot star tests\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"Build island, weigh-in, seven-day loop, saves, report, jar, locker\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"Add remaining activities with idle-vs-expert bot tests and lines\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"Fix remaining --fast failures (rng scan, pause freeze, week boot) and get 11/11\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"Fix About HUD so every source field and the full feedback are visible, then rebuild\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"Hand in exit-interview.json, PROGRESS.md, checklist and deviations\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"}],\"state\":{\"todos\":{\"1\":{\"content\":\"Download kit and hub, record sha256, scaffold dev folder and title\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"2\":{\"content\":\"Implement Dot, drivers, actions, device, tunables, HUD, pause, dev sliders\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"3\":{\"content\":\"Ship 