{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_405","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to find real defects.\n\nI will read PLAN.md sections 8-12, 15, and 18. I will compare the implementation against critical mechanics. The OBJECTIVE treats PLAN.md as the contract. I will look for tests that do not test what they claim. I will also look for real bugs and missing features.\n\nI must not invent requirements beyond the contract. The objective is everything in PLAN.md that can be done, so omitting a core PLAN.md feature is a valid refute even if the goal criteria were looser.\n\nI must avoid nitpicking every detail of PLAN.md. I may only refute when a plan gap actually misses the objective's core intent. If every criterion is met, I should return Not Refuted even if more could have been built.\n\nI am systematically checking core mechanics against PLAN.md. I am focusing on substantive features like the dot model, wobble age formula, breath mechanic, rep scrubbing, hoop circling, and step class. I am skipping superficial details such as sunbeams or dust motes.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-58db5c84-f9dd-4c76-aac9-c24a3bcea312-20","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"skill === |stars\\s*=|god","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src","glob":"*.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-58db5c84-f9dd-4c76-aac9-c24a3bcea312-21","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/PLAN.md","offset":350,"limit":280}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-58db5c84-f9dd-4c76-aac9-c24a3bcea312-22","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/data/title.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-58db5c84-f9dd-4c76-aac9-c24