{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_417","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A decisive finding emerged from the activity screenshot.\n\nThe activity mode shows the same island scene as the title. The balance dial is missing from the HUD. The character stands idle with no activity-specific visuals. Defined animation clips exist but are never triggered by the mixer. The hero exists, yet activities do not drive its animations.\n\nThe balance ring likely sits beneath the character and is obscured by the sphere. The code must be checked against every core behavior the objective implies, not just those listed in the plan.\n\nThe dot physics and activity simulations both exist. The animation system is dead. Clips compile and validate, yet they never reach the mixer.\n\nThe coach character has no demonstration animation. The play screen is a static diorama with only a timer and a ground dot. Player feedback exists through input scoring and the results screen, but the defining UI element—the balance dial—is missing. Activity cameras never change.\n\nRep scrubbing is invisible because the animation never plays. The input mapping for lunge and press is also wrong. The activity heading falls back to the generic mode name, so players see \"activity\" instead of the specific activity title during play.\n\nTests verify state machines and scores, not visual feedback. The gating tests passed. Core behaviors are being separated from polish. Dot physics, week loops, and activity scoring are implemented. The player seeing the dot inside a circle is only partially satisfied.\n\nThe balance ring is likely hidden under the yoga mat at the origin. The screenshot description mentions the mat but not a white ring, so the player sees no dial.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5606896a-a76f-42c3-82fb-1e377d59fc80-62","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"hero\\.|play\\(|clipAction|AnimationMixer|viewerClip|HERO_CLIPS|crossFade","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src","glob":"*.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5606896a-a76f-42c3-82fb-1e377d59fc80-63","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/art/clips.js","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5606896a-a76f-42c3-82fb-1e377d59fc80-64","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"hud\\.circle|hud\\.ring|Ring|dial","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/app.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5442,"output_tokens":1268,"cache_read_input_tokens":138880,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"9d9a877f-e6a2-43eb-8e8c-e25d278975be"}
