{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_423","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will read STAGE.md and follow its instructions to complete the remaining tasks.\n\nVerification failed due to two high-priority bugs. The Reps bug in sims.js:253 causes reps to ignore rate control because LocalDriver only sets depth and never useRate, leaving r at zero for stick-right lunges and stick-up presses. Bots pass only because auto() writes depth directly. I will drive RepSim with LocalDriver-shaped input and assert that r tracks the correct axis.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Verification found two real gaps: reps ignore stick and key input, and activity scenes never play the pose or show the dial. I will read those paths and fix them in the shipped code."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6ab7bb1f-d901-4a9f-9934-4383f0102481-16","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"reps-input","content":"Drive RepSim from LocalDriver right/up lean and key rate, with a real-path test","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"activity-scene","content":"Play activity clips, draw the balance dial, show the activity name, recapture the activity frame","status":"pending"},{"id":"reverify","content":"Re-run the suite and confirm the activity shot shows the clip, dial, and name","status":"pending"}],"merge":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6ab7bb1f-d901-4a9f-9934-4383f0102481-17","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/core/sims.js","offset":180,"limit":200}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6ab7bb1f-d901-4a9f-9934-4383f0102481-18","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/core/drivers.js","limit":180}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6ab7bb1f-d901-4a9f-9934-4383f0