 while blending: mixer.update(dt); blend.apply(weight 0 → 1)\"},{\"line_number\":96,\"content\":\"     * call `apply(w)` after the mixer each frame, w going 0 → 1.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/types/engine/character/animator.d.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":9,\"content\":\" *   fades → gait phase → mixer → RotationBlend → (feet captured) → PoseLayers (lean, look,\"},{\"line_number\":65,\"content\":\"    private readonly mixer;\"},{\"line_number\":76,\"content\":\"     * The animated pose of every joint the procedural passes change, saved after the mixer and\"},{\"line_number\":77,\"content\":\"     * put back before the next mixer update. three's mixer only writes a joint whose blended\"},{\"line_number\":98,\"content\":\"    /** Advance fades, the gait and the mixer, then the procedural passes. */\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/types/game/hero/animations.d.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":1,\"content\":\"export { HERO_CLIPS } from './clips';\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/types/engine/animation/rotationBlend.d.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":5,\"content\":\" * three's mixer blends quaternions along the shortest arc. When two clips hold a joint more\"},{\"line_number\":10,\"content\":\" * Run this after `mixer.update()`. It re-blends the rotation tracks of the playing actions\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/types/game/hero/clips/index.d.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":2,\"content\":\"export declare const HERO_CLIPS: readonly ClipDef[];\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.