{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_426","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to understand how RepSim is driven from the app and how LocalDriver input reaches the simulation.\n\nThe skeptic found that LocalDriver only sets depth for downward lean and never sets useRate, so stick-right lunges and stick-up presses leave rate at zero. Bots pass only because auto() writes depth itself. The fix is either to make LocalDriver set depth based on the activity axis or to have RepSim read the correct axis from u.x/u.y using def.axis, and to enable keyboard rate control.\n\nThe plan specifies that stick right drives lunge rate, stick up drives press rate, and keyboard S/W keys control rate without holding. LocalDriver currently only sets downward lean depth.\n\nLocalDriver does not know which activity is active. Two approaches are possible: either LocalDriver always supplies x, y, and keyboard rate values, or RepSim derives depth from the input axis directly. The test should construct input in the same shape as LocalDriver produces it rather than hand-crafting a fixed depth object.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3935a3f7-52ce-428e-977e-892130b41322-26","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"RepSim|readFrom|\\.step\\(|kind === 'reps'|axis","glob":"**/{app.js,test.mjs,sims.js}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3935a3f7-52ce-428e-977e-892130b41322-27","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/PLAN.md","offset":210,"limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3935a3f7-52ce-428e-977e-892130b41322-28","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/art/clips.js","limit":120}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":15472,"output_tokens":832,"cache_read_input_tokens":65152,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"ef4c6894-d9a3-48cd-915e-24005d656a5a"}
