{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_433","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The hero's animator mixer is private, so I need another way to play clips.\n\nThe best approach is to compile the activity clips onto the hero model and keep a separate AnimationMixer for them. This avoids conflicting with the character's state machine.\n\nDuring activities, I will skip hero.updateVisual to avoid overwriting the pose. The separate mixer will play clips directly. Repetitions will scrub the action time. Poses will hold. Body language will be applied after each update. I am unsure whether the hero should still update during activities or if the clips alone are sufficient.\n\nThe platformer state machine does not recognize our activity clips, so calling hero.fixedUpdate during activities would only make the character stand. I will compile both kit clips and our activity clips together.\n\nI will skip hero.updateVisual during activities entirely. The separate mixer must drive the pose alone to avoid procedural layers resetting it afterward.\n\nThe hero is currently frozen at spawn because fixedUpdate only runs on the island. Physics should update during activities so the character remains grounded and visible in the shot.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-23652fa1-ce87-454d-b477-5aa71675a45d-50","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"cameraTarget|setCamera","glob":"**/*.{d.ts,md}","head_limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-23652fa1-ce87-454d-b477-5aa71675a45d-51","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/data/activities.js","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-23652fa1-ce87-454d-b477-5aa71675a45d-52","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"go\\(|startActivity|viewerClip|skipIntro","glob":"**/app.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2246,"output_tokens":738,"cache_read_input_tokens":105088,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"31be8bd3-86a4-4d72-b782-2246abaf1f03"}
