{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_442","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Mapping the Y-axis to forward movement, with stick up as positive Y.\n\nLocalDriver reads axis.y directly. The fake input must return {x, y} for the driver. Tests will use LocalDriver.readFrom with a stub input rather than real engine input.\n\nLocalDriver.readFrom will be used to satisfy the reviewer's scrutiny. The pad path stub already provides moveAxis. A short progress note will be added to PROGRESS.md after the fix works. The dial placement below the heading may need a deviation note.\n\nThe activity name will sit at the top-left to avoid overlapping the dial. The dial stays centered at (W/2, 56) with radius 44. The \"Apologetic Tree\" label is 192 pixels wide and will clear the dial's left edge.\n\nCentered text would overlap the dial. The activity name will sit at the top-left, leaving only a slight eight-pixel overlap.\n\nThe activity name will sit centered directly below the dial. The dial stays at (240, 56) with radius 44. The label sits at y=108 in scale 2. A phase line will appear under it.\n\nThe activity, attract, and weigh modes will bypass the top heading. The activity name will be drawn directly below the dial instead.\n\nThe dialLayout function now clamps the radius between 14 and 44 and keeps the dial centered at y=56. It shrinks gracefully on short HUDs. LocalDriver.readFrom will call it with the actual HUD dimensions.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4cdfce4a-2e14-415d-b691-3c4acec77814-74","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/core/sims.js","offset":115,"limit":70}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1139,"output_tokens":1340,"cache_read_input_tokens":133120,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"32b095fc-a2d8-4d98-91f1-39929c09839a"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-4cdfce4a-2e14-415d-b691-3c4acec77814-74","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"115→export class StillSim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.inside = 0;\\n    this.samples = 0;\\n    this.breathSum = 0;\\n120→    this.breathN = 0;\\n    this.s = 0;\\n    this.hold = this.def.hold;\\n    this.settle = 4;\\n    this.release = 2;\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n    return this.playT >= this.settle + this.hold + this.release;\\n  }\\n  ring() {\\n130→    return this.ringOf(this.def.ring);\\n  }\\n  mods(scoring) {\\n    const m = { noise: 1, inst: 1, bx: 0, by: 0, ring: this.ring() };\\n    const twist = this.def.twist;\\n    const k = this.hold > 0 ? clamp(this.playT / this.hold, 0, 1) : 0;\\n    if (twist === 'bias') m.bx = (this.def.bias || 0.12) * Math.sin(0.45 * this.elapsed);\\n    if (twist === 'ynoise') m.noise = this.def.noise || 1.3;\\n    if (twist === 'ramp') m.noise = lerp(1, 1.5, clamp((this.playT - this.settle) / this.hold, 0, 1));\\n    if (twist === 'plank') {\\n140→      m.inst = 1.2;\\n      if (this.playT > this.settle + 20) m.noise = 1.35;\\n    }\\n    if (this.def.breath && scoring) {\\n      m.noise *= 1.25 - (this.T.breathBonus ?? 0.55) * this.s;\\n    }\\n    m.ring = this.ring();\\n    return m;\\n  }\\n  auto(dt) {\\n150→    const u = super.auto(dt);\\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return u;\\n    if (this.def.breath) {\\n      const p = this.def.breath;\\n      const ph = p ? (this.playT % p) / p : 0;\\n      u.breath = ph < 0.5;\\n    }\\n    if (this.skill === 'sloppy') {\\n      u.x += 0.35 * Math.sin(this.elapsed * 1.7);\\n      u.y += 0.35 * Math.cos(this.elapsed * 1.3);\\n160→    }\\n    return u;\\n  }\\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\\n    const m = this.mods(scoring);\\n    this.stepDot(dt, u, m);\\n    if (!scoring) return;\\n    this.playT += dt;\\n    const t = this.playT;\\n    const inHold = t >= this.settle && t < this.settle + this.hold;\\n170→    if (!inHold) return;\\n    this.samples += 1;\\n    if (Math.hypot(this.dot.x, this.dot.y) < m.ring) this.inside += 1;\\n    if (this.def.breath) {\\n      const p = this.def.breath;\\n      const ph = (t % p) / p;\\n      const inhale = ph < 0.5;\\n      const correct = inhale ? !!u.breath : !u.breath;\\n      this.s += ((correct ? 1 : 0) - this.s) * Math.min(1, dt / 0.12);\\n      this.breathSum += this.s;\\n180→      this.breathN += 1;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  scoreStars() {\\n    const inRing = this.samples ? this.inside / this.samples : 0;\",\"content_concise\":\"115→export class StillSim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.inside = 0;\\n    this.samples = 0;\\n    this.breathSum = 0;\\n120→    this.breathN = 0;\\n    this.s = 0;\\n    this.hold = this.def.hold;\\n    this.settle = 4;\\n    this.release = 2;\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n    return this.playT >= this.settle + this.hold + this.release;\\n  }\\n  ring() {\\n130→    return this.ringOf(this.def.ring);\\n  }\\n  mods(scoring) {\\n    const m = { noise: 1, inst: 1, bx: 0, by: 0, ring: this.ring() };\\n    const twist = this.def.twist;\\n    const k = this.hold > 0 ? clamp(this.playT / this.hold, 0, 1) : 0;\\n    if (twist === 'bias') m.bx = (this.def.bias || 0.12) * Math.sin(0.45 * this.elapsed);\\n    if (twist === 'ynoise') m.noise = this.def.noise || 1.3;\\n    if (twist === 'ramp') m.noise = lerp(1, 1.5, clamp((this.playT - this.settle) / this.hold, 0, 1));\\n    if (twist === 'plank') {\\n140→      m.inst = 1.2;\\n      if (this.playT > this.settle + 20) m.noise = 1.35;\\n    }\\n    if (this.def.breath && scoring) {\\n      m.noise *= 1.25 - (this.T.breathBonus ?? 0.55) * this.s;\\n    }\\n    m.ring = this.ring();\\n    return m;\\n  }\\n  auto(dt) {\\n150→    const u = super.auto(dt);\\n    if (this.skill === 'idle') return u;\\n    if (this.def.breath) {\\n      const p = this.def.breath;\\n      const ph = p ? (this.playT % p) / p : 0;\\n      u.breath = ph < 0.5;\\n    }\\n    if (this.skill === 'sloppy') {\\n      u.x += 0.35 * Math.sin(this.elapsed * 1.7);\\n      u.y += 0.35 * Math.cos(this.elapsed * 1.3);\\n160→    }\\n    return u;\\n  }\\n  onStep(dt, u, scoring) {\\n    const m = this.mods(scoring);\\n    this.stepDot(dt, u, m);\\n    if (!scoring) return;\\n    this.playT += dt;\\n    const t = this.playT;\\n    const inHold = t >= this.settle && t < this.settle + this.hold;\\n170→    if (!inHold) return;\\n    this.samples += 1;\\n    if (Math.hypot(this.dot.x, this.dot.y) < m.ring) this.inside += 1;\\n    if (this.def.breath) {\\n      const p = this.def.breath;\\n      const ph = (t % p) / p;\\n      const inhale = ph < 0.5;\\n      const correct = inhale ? !!u.breath : !u.breath;\\n      this.s += ((correct ? 1 : 0) - this.s) * Math.min(1, dt / 0.12);\\n      this.breathSum += this.s;\\n180→      this.breathN += 1;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  scoreStars() {\\n    const inRing = this.samples ? this.inside / this.samples : 0;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/core/sims.js\",\"offset\":115,\"limit\":70,\"raw_output\":\"export class StillSim extends Sim {\\n  _built() {\\n    this.inside = 0;\\n    this.samples = 0;\\n    this.breathSum = 0;\\n    this.breathN = 0;\\n    this.s = 0;\\n    this.hold = this.def.hold;\\n    this.settle = 4;\\n    this.release = 2;\\n  }\\n  playFinished() {\\n    return this.playT >= this.settle + this.hold + this.release;\\n  }\\n  ring() {\\n    return this.ringOf(this.def.ring);\\n  }\\n  mods(scoring) {\\n    const m = { noise: 1, inst: 1, bx: 0, by: 0, ring: this.ring() };\\n    const twist = this.def.twist;\\n    const k = this.hold > 0 ? clamp(this.playT / this.hold, 0, 1) : 0;\\n    if (twist === 'bias') m.bx = (this.def.bias || 0.12) * Math.sin(0.45 * this.elapsed);\\n    if (twist === 'ynoise') m.noise = this.def.noise || 1.3;\\n    if (twist === 'ramp') m.