{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_443","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"`ring()` is a method. The dial zone radius is related to simulation parameters.\n\nA `zoneOf` helper will read the dial zone radius from either a function or a property. Zero moves are valid. I'll import Vector3 into world.js. The pose mixer needs care to avoid overwriting visuals, so I'll test headless. I'm also checking if `getObjectByName` works for Torso.\n\nA test will be added to the clips test block. It sets the expert driver, runs the tree activity for 30 steps, asserts the pose is Tree, and checks that LegR has a significant x rotation after the clip.\n\nThe test will check the leg quaternion's total offset from identity rather than a single Euler angle. I'll also verify that poseTime or action.time is advancing to confirm the mixer is scrubbing or playing.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5900cada-29fe-47d5-a3ff-cf76b2e8b282-75","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"await test\\(","glob":"**/test.mjs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5900cada-29fe-47d5-a3ff-cf76b2e8b282-76","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/core/drivers.js","offset":64,"limit":45}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2307,"output_tokens":667,"cache_read_input_tokens":134144,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"7743b738-0da7-4edc-9408-b26c75ae1382"}
