{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_447","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The state() function includes widgets. After grab, the last draw's widgets are stored in state.\n\nGrab triggers a draw step. I will add assertions in browser.mjs shots to verify the dial and head widgets exist after grab. Missing or incorrect widgets will fail the suite.\n\nThe widget IDs are checked for 'dial' and 'head'. The heading text is missing from the widget object. I will add an `activityName` field to `state()` so the test can assert the exact label \"Apologetic Tree\".","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a322a642-4283-49d0-9e7d-a11a9544f7e7-80","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/app.js","offset":1120,"limit":60}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":620,"output_tokens":526,"cache_read_input_tokens":140672,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"fe898129-001c-47b0-8852-170f26a00934"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-a322a642-4283-49d0-9e7d-a11a9544f7e7-80","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1120→    if (this.engine && this.engine.timeScale === 0) this.engine.timeScale = 1;\\n  }\\n\\n  update(ctx, dt) {\\n    this.ctx = ctx;\\n    this.engine = ctx.engine;\\n    this.device.update(ctx);\\n    if (ctx.audio?.volume) this.busMusic = ctx.audio.volume.music;\\n    if (this.mode === 'card') this.cardInput(ctx);\\n    let claimedJoin = false;\\n1130→    if (this.mode === 'join') {\\n      const before = this.seats.filter(Boolean).length;\\n      this.pollJoin(ctx);\\n      claimedJoin = this.seats.filter(Boolean).length > before;\\n    }\\n    if (this.mode === 'name') this.typeName(ctx);\\n    const kind = this.device.kind;\\n    if (this.touchOnly && (kind === 'keyboard' || kind === 'pad') && this.anyPressed(ctx)) this.touchOnly = false;\\n    if (this.mode === 'attract' && this.anyInput(ctx)) {\\n      this.attracting = false;\\n1140→      this.sim = null;\\n      this.idle = 0;\\n      this.mode = 'title';\\n      this.refresh(true);\\n      this.draw(ctx);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.wantsPause(ctx) && PAUSABLE.has(this.mode)) this.openPause();\\n    else if (!claimedJoin && this.rows.length && this.mode !== 'activity' && this.mode !== 'weigh' && this.mode !== 'attract' && this.mode !== 'card') this.menuInput(ctx);\\n    if (!this.session && !this.frozen && MENU_IDLE.has(this.mode)) {\\n1150→      if (this.anyInput(ctx)) this.idle = 0;\\n      else this.idle += dt > 0 ? dt : 1 / 60;\\n      if (this.idle >= 10) {\\n        this.attractI = 0;\\n        this.attractT = 0;\\n        this.idle = 0;\\n        this.beginAttract();\\n      }\\n    } else if (this.mode !== 'attract') this.idle = 0;\\n    if (this.mode === 'dev') {\\n1160→      const tab = this.edge(ctx, 'KeyE') || this.edge(ctx, 'PadR1');\\n      const prev = this.edge(ctx, 'KeyQ') || thi