{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_448","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The draw function runs every update. Widgets will exist after the step.\n\nA small rep counter will appear on the HUD. Missing mixer bones will be caught and skipped. Mirror lunges will use model scaling instead of toon materials to avoid normal flipping. The hero still updates during frozen time.\n\nThe hero only receives fixedUpdate when the app is live and active. This prevents frozen or paused states from moving the character. Activities that use body physics include activity, weigh, attract, and medley.\n\nThe pose mixer updates during pause so the screenshot captures the pose. A zero delta time during pause still applies the current pose. The first frame of a hold may need one normal update to register.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-db6a4637-ec5d-41d1-a52b-a6a1f7db3814-81","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/app.js","offset":180,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1480,"output_tokens":2388,"cache_read_input_tokens":141184,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"fc8d14c9-7f9f-4fde-9223-05dd1c6c95e4"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-db6a4637-ec5d-41d1-a52b-a6a1f7db3814-81","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"180→  }\\n\\n  fork(label) {\\n    this.forkN += 1;\\n    const id = `${label}:${this.forkN}`;\\n    if (this.ctx?.random) {\\n      const rng = this.ctx.random.fork(id);\\n      return () => rng.next();\\n    }\\n    return mulberry32(hashString(id) || 1);\\n190→  }\\n\\n  go(mode, arg) {\\n    if (mode === 'activity') {\\n      this.startActivity(typeof arg === 'string' ? arg : arg?.id);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (mode === 'medley') {\\n      this.openMedley(arg || {});\\n      return;\\n200→    }\\n    this.mode = mode;\\n    if (mode === 'title') {\\n      this.attracting = false;\\n      this.drop = false;\\n      this.idle = 0;\\n    }\\n    if (mode === 'island') this.islandPage = 0;\\n    if (mode === 'name') this.focus = 0;\\n    this.refresh(mode !== 'dev');\\n210→  }\\n\\n  setDriver(skill) {\\n    this.driver = skill || null;\\n    this.skillPick = Math.max(0, SKILLS.indexOf(this.driver));\\n    if (this.sim?.setSkill && this.driver) this.sim.setSkill(this.driver);\\n  }\\n\\n  refresh(resetFocus = false) {\\n    this.rows = this.rowsFor().slice(0, 8);\",\"content_concise\":\"180→  }\\n\\n  fork(label) {\\n    this.forkN += 1;\\n    const id = `${label}:${this.forkN}`;\\n    if (this.ctx?.random) {\\n      const rng = this.ctx.random.fork(id);\\n      return () => rng.next();\\n    }\\n    return mulberry32(hashString(id) || 1);\\n190→  }\\n\\n  go(mode, arg) {\\n    if (mode === 'activity') {\\n      this.startActivity(typeof arg === 'string' ? arg : arg?.id);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (mode === 'medley') {\\n      this.openMedley(arg || {});\\n      return;\\n200→    }\\n    this.mode = mode;\\n    if (mode === 'title') {\\n      this.attracting = false;\\n      this.drop = false;\\n      this.idle = 0;\\n    }\\n    if (mode === 'island') this.islandPage = 0;\\n    if (mode === 'name') this.focus = 0;\\n    this.refresh(mode !== 'dev');\\n210→  }\\n\\n  setDriver(skill) {\\n    this.driver = skill || null;\\n    this.skillPick = Math.max(0, SKILLS.indexOf(this.driver));\\n    if (this.sim?.setSkill && this.driver) this.sim.setSkill(this.driver);\\n  }\\n\\n  refresh(resetFocus = false) {\\n    this.rows = this.rowsFor().slice(0, 8);\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/app.js\",\"offset\":180,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"  }\\n\\n  fork(label) {\\n    this.forkN += 1;\\n    const id = `${label}:${this.forkN}`;\\n    if (this.ctx?.random) {\\n      const rng = this.ctx.random.fork(id);\\n      return () => rng.next();\\n    }\\n    return mulberry32(hashString(id) || 1);\\n  }\\n\\n  go(mode, arg) {\\n    if (mode === 'activity') {\\n      this.startActivity(typeof arg === 'string' ? arg : arg?.id);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (mode === 'medley') {\\n      this.openMedley(arg || {});\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    this.mode = mode;\\n    if (mode === 'title') {\\n      this.attracting = false;\\n      this.drop = false;\\n      this.idle = 0;\\n    }\\n    if (mode === 'island') this.islandPage = 0;\\n    if (mode === 'name') this.focus = 0;\\n    this.refresh(mode !== 'dev');\\n  }\\n\\n  setDriver(skill) {\\n    this.driver = skill || null;\\n    this.skillPick = Math.max(0, SKILLS.indexOf(this.driver));\\n    if (this.sim?.setSkill && this.driver) this.sim.setSkill(this.driver);\\n  }\\n\\n  refresh(resetFocus = false) {\\n    this.rows = this.rowsFor().slice(0, 8);\\n\",\"total_lines\":1644}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"64841556-22ba-49c8-abe5-32f2db123d97"}
