{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_466","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The pelvis y-coordinate is 0.45, which is positive rather than negative.\n\nThe SquatRep clip is playing and poseName, poseTime, and shot all passed. The pelvis y assertion failed. I need to compare the pelvis height before and after the activity to confirm it dropped.\n\nThe pelvis y value might already be the squat position if rest is near 0.9, or it might be the rest pose from local keys. The analyzeClip step could leave the model in a prior pose, so I will snapshot the pelvis height before the activity and compare it to the height after the squat.\n\nThe test will step the engine 40 times and assert the pelvis moved by more than 0.02. If the mixer is not writing position, the clip is not affecting the bone and I will debug.\n\nThe mixer and character both use the same model, so the pelvis bone should be the one being driven. I will print poseTime to verify the action is progressing. If the height delta is near zero, the mixer is not writing positions and I will debug.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d0b1bc91-2707-4a2a-9c89-681d6ed94386-121","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/tmp/grok-goal-46b978a86300/implementer/pose-check.mjs","old_string":"","new_string":"import { Engine } from '/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/pixel-engine.js';\nimport { App } from '/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/app.js';\nimport { CAMERA, World } from '/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/scenes/world.js';\n\nconst app = new App({ storage: null, noHero: false });\nconst world = new World(app);\nconst engine = await Engine.headless(world, { camera: CAMERA });\nengine.step(2);\nconst pelvis = world.heroModel.getObjectByName('Pelvis');\nconst before = pelvis.position.y;\napp.setDriver('expert');\napp.go('activity', 'squat');\nengine.step(40);\nconst cam = engine.camera?.position || engine.rig?.camera?.position;\nconsole.log(JSON.stringify({\n  pose: world.poseName,\n  time: world.poseTime,\n  r: app.sim?.r,\n  shot: world.shot,\n  before,\n  after: pelvis.position.y,\n  qx: pelvis.quaternion.x,\n  cam: cam ? [cam.x, cam.y, cam.z] : null,\n  name: app.state().activityName,\n  widgets: app.state().widgets.map((w) => w.id),\n}, null, 2));\nengine.dispose();\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":933,"output_tokens":1214,"cache_read_input_tokens":174848,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"93fa05d9-7516-4e29-9c4e-13d36bbdd29c"}
