{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_483","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Continuing from the previous conversation.\n\nThe skeptic panel rejected verification because two bugs were still present. Reps only follow u.depth, and LocalDriver never sets useRate. Pose and rep clips are never compiled or played, so the camera stays on the title shot and paint() draws no balance dial. The summary claims these are already fixed in source and HTML/logs were regenerated, but the skeptic cites old line numbers.\n\nThe evaluator requires a fresh rebuild of the single-file HTML from current sources, regeneration of exit-interview.json from about.js, and recapture of the activity shot. The three hand-in files and a fresh browser/hub log must then be checked against PLAN.md.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The skeptic flagged two play bugs again. I will read the current rep and activity code first, then rebuild and recapture only if those paths still fail."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-575487e8-d07b-4dd8-b0b1-44aa953ce0f4-0","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"verify-reps","content":"Confirm RepSim follows stick axes and keyboard rate via LocalDriver","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"verify-pose","content":"Confirm activity clips, close camera, dial, and exercise name","status":"pending"},{"id":"rebuild-evidence","content":"Rebuild HTML and exit-interview, recapture activity shot, fresh suite logs","status":"pending"}],"merge":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-575487e8-d07b-4dd8-b0b1-44aa953ce0f4-1","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/core/sims.js","offset":200,"limit":150}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-575487e8-d07b-4dd8-b0b1-44aa953ce0f4-2","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__