{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_484","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The code already contains the necessary fixes.\n\nThe skeptic panel is flagging stale line numbers from before the fixes were applied. The system reminder still treats these as open bugs, but the last check confirmed the fixes are present in both source and HTML.\n\nThe evaluator rejected the previous candidate. I will rebuild the single-file HTML from current sources, regenerate exit-interview.json, recapture the activity shot, and run a fresh full test suite to verify all hand-in files match PLAN.md.\n\nThe verifier audits committed tests and saved evidence rather than rebuilding them. This explains why a fresh build might still be rejected if the HTML or activity.png evidence is stale. I will verify the current source code directly to confirm the fixes are correct.\n\nThe verifier may be using a cached analysis based on stale line numbers. The activity.png might still look like the title diorama to their vision model. There could also be an actual behavior bug that the tests miss.\n\nI will inspect world.js playPose, app.js paint, and the rep-axes test directly. I will also verify whether the workspace HTML is current or stale by comparing file timestamps and unique strings. Before running the full suite, I need to read the long-running-background-tasks skill.\n\nI will inspect activity.png directly to see if the vision model would reject it. I will also verify PLAN.md's exact verification steps. Even without code changes, the full test suite must be rerun because the previous submission was rejected. I am now reading the relevant source carefully to check for any real remaining bug that still matches the skeptic's description.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The cited lines are the fixed paths now. I am reading the play path and the tests to see whether a real gap is still there."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ead90dee-bcd0-4630-9829-61631813e098-4","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/scenes/world.js","offset":140,"limit":220}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ead90dee-bcd0-4630-9829-61631813e098-5","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/app.js","offset":1455,"limit":220}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ead90dee-bcd0-4630-9829-61631813e098-6","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"rep axes|clips on the hero|activity pose|SquatRep|useRate","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/tools"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ead90dee-bcd0-4630-9829-61631813e098-7","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/.grok/bundled/skills/long-running-background-tasks/SKILL.md","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5311,"output_tokens":1335,"cache_read_input_tokens":31616,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"913fae35-9353-4073-a43a-56c8185432da"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-ead90dee-bcd0-4630-9829-61631813e098-4","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"140→      mat.position.set((i - 1.5) * 2.2, 0.06, 0);\\n      scene.add(mat);\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  addIsland(scene) {\\n    for (const [def, x, y, z] of LAYOUT) {\\n      const built = buildModel(def);\\n      built.object.position.set(x, y, z);\\n      scene.add(built.object);\\n150→    }\\n  }\\n\\n  addDial(scene) {\\n    this.ringMesh = new Mesh(new RingGeometry(0.72, 0.84, 28), toonMaterial(PALETTE.white));\\n    this.ringMesh.rotation.x = -Math.PI / 2;\\n    this.ringMesh.position.set(0, 0.08, 0);\\n    this.dotMesh = new Mesh(new SphereGeometry(0.16, 10, 8), toonMaterial(PALETTE.red));\\n    this.dotMesh.position.set(0, 0.28, 0);\\n    scene.add(this.ringMesh, this.dotMesh);\\n160→  }\\n\\n  async loadHero(ctx) {\\n    const loaded = await ctx.loadModel(HERO_MODEL, { castShadow: false });\\n    const model = loaded.scene;\\n    setLookLayer(model, 'actors');\\n    try {\\n      dress(model, { ...PLAYER_LOOK });\\n    } catch {\\n      model.traverse((obj) => {\\n170→        if (obj.name === 'Eyes' || obj.name === 'Hat' || obj.name === 'Moustache') obj.visible = false;\\n      });\\n    }\\n    this.heroRoot = model;\\n    this.heroModel = model;\\n    const poses = compileClips(CLIPS, HERO_RIG, model);\\n    this.heroClips = [...compileClips([...HERO_CLIPS], HERO_RIG, model), ...poses];\\n    this.poseMixer = new AnimationMixer(model);\\n    this.poseActions = {};\\n    for (const clip of poses) {\\n180→      const action = this.poseMixer.clipAction(clip);\\n      action.setLoop(LoopRepeat, Infinity);\\n      action.clampWhenFinished = true;\\n      this.poseActions[clip.name] = action;\\n    }\\n    this.shadow = new ContactShadow(0.42);\\n    model.position.set(0, 0, 3.2);\\n    ctx.scene.add(model, this.shadow);\\n    this.hero = new PlatformerCharacter(ctx.physics, { position: [0, 0, 3.2] });\\n    this.hero.attachModel(model, this.heroClips, HERO_RIG);\\n190→  }\\n\\n  stillInput() {\\n    if (!this.holdMove) this.holdMove = { move: new Vector3(), jump: false, jumpHeld: false, crouch: false };\\n    this.holdMove.move.set(0, 0, 0);\\n    this.holdMove.jump = false;\\n    this.holdMove.jumpHeld = false;\\n    this.holdMove.crouch = false;\\n    return this.holdMove;\\n  }\\n200→\\n  clipName() {\\n    if (!this.poseActions) return '';\\n    if (this.app.mode === 'dev' && this.app.viewerClip && this.poseActions[this.app.viewerClip]) return this.app.viewerClip;\\n    if (this.app.mode === 'activity' || this.app.mode === 'attract') {\\n      const clip = ACTIVITY_BY_ID[this.app.activityId]?.clip;\\n      if (clip && this.poseActions[clip]) return clip;\\n    }\\n    return '';\\n  }\\n210→\\n  fixedUpdate(ctx, dt) {\\n    this.app.fixed(ctx, dt);\\n    if (!this.hero) return;\\n    const live = !this.app.frozen && ctx.engine?.timeScale !== 0;\\n    if (!live) return;\\n    if (this.app.mode === 'island' && !this.app.driver) {\\n      this.move = readMoveInput(ctx, this.hero, this.move);\\n      this.hero.fixedUpdate(dt, this.move);\\n    } else if (PLAY_MODES.has(this.app.mode)) {\\n220→      this.hero.fixedUpdate(dt, this.stillInput());\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  update(ctx, dt) {\\n    this.app.update(ctx, dt);\\n    if (this.app.settings && ctx.engine) applySky(ctx.engine, skyAt(this.hour()));\\n    this.frameCamera(ctx);\\n    this.placeDot();\\n    if (this.hero && this.heroRoot) {\\n230→      const name = this.clipName();\\n      if (name) this.playPose(name, dt);\\n      else {\\n        this.stopPose();\\n        this.hero.updateVisual(this.heroRoot, dt, ctx.physics.alpha);\\n      }\\n      const feet = this.heroRoot.position;\\n      if (this.shadow) this.shadow.place(feet.x, 0, feet.z, Math.max(0, feet.y));\\n    }\\n  }\\n240→\\n  playPose(name, dt) {\\n    const action = this.poseActions[name];\\n    if (!action) return;\\n    if (this.poseName !== name) {\\n      this.stopPose();\\n      action.reset();\\n      action.setLoop(LoopRepeat, Infinity);\\n      action.enabled = true;\\n      action.paused = false;\\n250→      action.play();\\n      this.poseAction = action;\\n      this.poseName = name;\\n    }\\n    const def = ACTIVITY_BY_ID[this.app.activityId];\\n    const scrub = def?.kind === 'reps' && typeof this.app.sim?.r === 'number' && this.app.mode !== 'dev';\\n    this.restoreSnap();\\n    if (scrub) {\\n      action.paused = true;\\n      const dur = action.getClip().duration || 1;\\n260→      action.time = Math.min(1, Math.max(0, this.app.sim.r)) * dur;\\n      this.poseMixer.update(0);\\n    } else {\\n      action.paused = false;\\n      this.poseMixer.update(Math.max(0, dt));\\n    }\\n    this.poseTime = action.time;\\n    this.saveSnap();\\n    this.leanBody();\\n  }\\n270→\\n  /** The mixer skips a joint it did not change, so last frame's lean would stack. */\\n  restoreSnap() {\\n    const snap = this.poseSnap;\\n    if (!snap?.ready || !this.heroRoot) return;\\n    const torso = this.heroRoot.getObjectByName('Torso');\\n    const pelvis = this.heroRoot.getObjectByName('Pelvis');\\n    if (torso) torso.quaternion.copy(snap.torso);\\n    if (pelvis) {\\n      pelvis.position.copy(snap.pelvis);\\n280→      pelvis.quaternion.copy(snap.pelvisQ);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  saveSnap() {\\n    if (!this.heroRoot) return;\\n    if (!this.poseSnap) this.poseSnap = { torso: new Quaternion(), pelvis: new Vector3(), pelvisQ: new Quaternion(), ready: false };\\n    const torso = this.heroRoot.getObjectByName('Torso');\\n    const pelvis = this.heroRoot.getObjectByName('Pelvis');\\n    if (torso) this.poseSnap.torso.copy(torso.quaternion);\\n290→    if (pelvis) {\\n      this.poseSnap.pelvis.copy(pelvis.position);\\n      this.poseSnap.pelvisQ.copy(pelvis.quaternion);\\n    }\\n    this.poseSnap.ready = true;\\n  }\\n\\n  stopPose() {\\n    if (this.poseAction) this.poseAction.stop();\\n    this.poseAction = null;\\n300→    this.poseName = '';\\n    this.poseTime = 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  leanBody() {\\n    const dot = this.app.sim?.dot || this.app.weigh?.dot || null;\\n    if (!dot || !this.heroRoot) return;\\n    const torso = this.heroRoot.getObjectByName('Torso');\\n    const pelvis = this.heroRoot.getObjectByName('Pelvis');\\n    if (torso) {\\n310→      torso.rotateZ(-dot.x * 0.18);\\n      torso.rotateX(-dot.y * 0.12);\\n    }\\n    if (pelvis) pelvis.position.x += dot.x * 0.05;\\n  }\\n\\n  frameCamera(ctx) {\\n    if (!ctx.engine || this.app.freeCam) return;\\n    if (PLAY_MODES.has(this.app.mode)) this.latchedPlay = true;\\n    if (WIDE_MODES.has(this.app.mode)) this.latchedPlay = false;\\n320→    const close = this.latchedPlay && (PLAY_MODES.has(this.app.mode) || this.app.mode === 'pause' || this.app.mode === 'dev');\\n    const shot = close ? 'play' : 'wide';\\n    if (shot === this.shot) return;\\n    this.shot = shot;\\n    if (shot === 'wide') {\\n      ctx.engine.setCamera({ ...CAMERA }, { syncUrl: false });\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const p = this.heroRoot?.position;\\n    const tx = p ? p.x : 0;\\n330→    const ty = (p ? p.y : 0) + 1.05;\\n    const tz = p ? p.z : 3.2;\\n    ctx.engine.setCamera({\\n      preset: 'fixed',\\n      position: [tx + 1.7, ty + 0.35, tz + 2.5],\\n      target: [tx, ty, tz],\\n      fov: 28,\\n    }, { syncUrl: false });\\n  }\\n\\n340→  placeDot() {\\n    if (!this.dotMesh) return;\\n    const dot = this.app.sim?.dot || this.app.weigh?.dot || this.app.lanes?.[0]?.dot;\\n    const show = this.app.mode === 'activity' || this.app.mode === 'weigh' || this.app.mode === 'attract' || this.app.mode === 'medley';\\n    this.dotMesh.visible = true;\\n    this.ringMesh.visible = true;\\n    const x = dot ? dot.x : Math.sin((this.app.ctx?.time?.now || 0) * 0.7) * 0.15;\\n    const y = dot ? dot.y : 0;\\n    this.dotMesh.position.set(x * 0.9, 0.28, y * 0.9);\\n    const outside = dot && Math.hypot(dot.x, dot.y) > 0.45;\\n350→    this.dotMesh.scale.setScalar(show ? (outside ? 1.25 : 1) : 0.85);\\n  }\\n\\n  cameraTarget() {\\n    return this.target.set(0, 1, 0);\\n  }\\n\\n  fingerprint() {\\n    return this.app.fingerprint();\\n  }\",\"content_concise\":\"140→      mat.position.set((i - 1.5) * 2.2, 0.06, 0);\\n      scene.add(mat);\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  addIsland(scene) {\\n    for (const [def, x, y, z] of LAYOUT) {\\n      const built = buildModel(def);\\n      built.object.position.set(x, y, z);\\n      scene.add(built.object);\\n150→    }\\n  }\\n\\n  addDial(scene) {\\n    this.ringMesh = new Mesh(new RingGeometry(0.72, 0.84, 28), toonMaterial(PALETTE.white));\\n    this.ringMesh.rotation.x = -Math.PI / 2;\\n    this.ringMesh.position.set(0, 0.08, 0);\\n    this.dotMesh = new Mesh(new SphereGeometry(0.16, 10, 8), toonMaterial(PALETTE.red));\\n    this.dotMesh.position.set(0, 0.28, 0);\\n    scene.add(this.ringMesh, this.dotMesh);\\n160→  }\\n\\n  async loadHero(ctx) {\\n    const loaded = await ctx.loadModel(HERO_MODEL, { castShadow: false });\\n    const model = loaded.scene;\\n    setLookLayer(model, 'actors');\\n    try {\\n      dress(model, { ...PLAYER_LOOK });\\n    } catch {\\n      model.traverse((obj) => {\\n170→        if (obj.name === 'Eyes' || obj.name === 'Hat' || obj.name === 'Moustache') obj.visible = false;\\n      });\\n    }\\n    this.heroRoot = model;\\n    this.heroModel = model;\\n    const poses = compileClips(CLIPS, HERO_RIG, model);\\n    this.heroClips = [...compileClips([...HERO_CLIPS], HERO_RIG, model), ...poses];\\n    this.poseMixer = new AnimationMixer(model);\\n    this.poseActions = {};\\n    for (const clip of poses) {\\n180→      const action = this.poseMixer.clipAction(clip);\\n      action.setLoop(LoopRepeat, Infinity);\\n      action.clampWhenFinished = true;\\n      this.poseActions[clip.name] = action;\\n    }\\n    this.shadow = new ContactShadow(0.42);\\n    model.position.set(0, 0, 3.2);\\n    ctx.scene.add(model, this.shadow);\\n    this.hero = new PlatformerCharacter(ctx.physics, { position: [0, 0, 3.2] });\\n    this.hero.attachModel(model, this.heroClips, HERO_RIG);\\n190→  }\\n\\n  stillInput() {\\n    if (!this.holdMove) this.holdMove = { move: new Vector3(), jump: false, jumpHeld: false, crouch: false };\\n    this.holdMove.move.set(0, 0, 0);\\n    this.holdMove.jump = false;\\n    this.holdMove.jumpHeld = false;\\n    this.holdMove.crouch = false;\\n    return this.holdMove;\\n  }\\n200→\\n  clipName() {\\n    if (!this.poseActions) return '';\\n    if (this.app.mode === 'dev' && this.app.viewerClip && this.poseActions[this.app.viewerClip]) return this.app.viewerClip;\\n    if (this.app.mode === 'activity' || this.app.mode === 'attract') {\\n      const clip = ACTIVITY_BY_ID[this.app.activityId]?.clip;\\n      if (clip && this.poseActions[clip]) return clip;\\n    }\\n    return '';\\n  }\\n210→\\n  fixedUpdate(ctx, dt) {\\n    this.app.fixed(ctx, dt);\\n    if (!this.hero) return;\\n    const live = !this.app.frozen && ctx.engine?.timeScale !== 0;\\n    if (!live) return;\\n    if (this.app.mode === 'island' && !this.app.driver) {\\n      this.move = readMoveInput(ctx, this.hero, this.move);\\n      this.hero.fixedUpdate(dt, this.move);\\n    } else if (PLAY_MODES.has(this.app.mode)) {\\n220→      this.hero.fixedUpdate(dt, this.stillInput());\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  update(ctx, dt) {\\n    this.app.update(ctx, dt);\\n    if (this.app.settings && ctx.engine) applySky(ctx.engine, skyAt(this.hour()));\\n    this.frameCamera(ctx);\\n    this.placeDot();\\n    if (this.hero && this.heroRoot) {\\n230→      const name = this.clipName();\\n      if (name) this.playPose(name, dt);\\n      else {\\n        this.stopPose();\\n        this.hero.updateVisual(this.heroRoot, dt, ctx.physics.alpha);\\n      }\\n      const feet = this.heroRoot.position;\\n      if (this.shadow) this.shadow.place(feet.x, 0, feet.z, Math.max(0, feet.y));\\n    }\\n  }\\n240→\\n  playPose(name, dt) {\\n    const ac