{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_487","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"PadDriver does not set useRate. Stick-right lunges and stick-up presses still work because depthOf uses the stick's x and y values.\n\nBugs are fixed. A fresh full test run is needed to rebuild HTML and recapture the shot. The evaluator requires a complete pass, so --fast will not be used.\n\nThe full suite will be run directly. Node tests should pass since the code is unchanged from the last green run. I will check for leftover browser processes before launching. I also need to read STAGE.md and verify PLAN.md steps.\n\nThe full test will run for up to three minutes. The scratch directory path is confirmed.\n\nThe test command uses `;` to ensure `echo $?` always writes the exit code to `test.exit`, even if the node process fails. The shell itself exits with status 0 because `echo` succeeds.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c4a83771-0a04-47dd-a6de-fadd17267fc9-15","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"browser\\.log|hub\\.log|test\\.mjs|build\\.mjs|nosession","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/tools/test.mjs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c4a83771-0a04-47dd-a6de-fadd17267fc9-16","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"chromium|playwright","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/tools/browser.mjs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2267,"output_tokens":896,"cache_read_input_tokens":53632,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"7a7795c9-5eab-4364-9f36-34195e7b5d1e"}
