p named a variable that was not in scope, a few model parts floated, the seagull was spoken as the scale, a dev-tool page could not go back, the prompt could draw past a short screen, the scale's voice measured just under the loudness line, the About screen kept only the first six lines so later source fields never appeared, the menu cursor was a greater-than sign the font cannot draw, so it showed as a question mark, reps listened only to a downward lean so a sideways lunge and an upward press did nothing, and an activity kept the title camera, never played its pose, and labelled the screen activity.\\\",\"},{\"line_number\":45442,\"content\":\"    return { x: x3, y: y3, breath, stepL: stepL2, stepR: stepR2, confirm, depth: Math.max(0, -y3), useRate: keyboard, rate };\"},{\"line_number\":45756,\"content\":\"    if (u3.useRate) {\"},{\"line_number\":47576,\"content\":\"      const names = [\\\"Tree\\\", \\\"Heron\\\", \\\"SquatRep\\\", \\\"Press\\\", \\\"StepL\\\"];\"},{\"line_number\":48430,\"content\":\"  name: \\\"SquatRep\\\",\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-644ab632-8ed0-4494-99b1-19e8d41c2227-28","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,49,54,48,55,95,95,120,54,57,56,49,101,51,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,51,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,49,54,48,55,95,95,120,54,57,56,49,101,51,47,119,111,114,107,47,80,82,79,71