 when the def doesn't set `texel`: the densest Gate B passed for\"},{\"line_number\":3173,\"content\":\"- `readonly catalog?: ModelCatalog`: Where `use` ids (and a string id passed to build) resolve; default `MODEL_LIBRARY`.\"},{\"line_number\":3244,\"content\":\"The densest a moving model passed Gate B at (its sliding crate); denser wasn't measured.\"},{\"line_number\":4693,\"content\":\"- `transition(kind: TransitionKind, between: () => unknown, o: TransitionOptions & { revealCenter?: TransitionOptions['center'] } = {}): Promise<boolean>`: Cover, run `between` (load a level, teleport), then reveal, also when `between` throws (the error is passed on). Resolves to whether the cover completed.\"},{\"line_number\":4892,\"content\":\"- `update(dt: number): void`: Advance by `dt` seconds of game time (times `speed`) while playing, firing the cues passed.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/tmp/grok-goal-46b978a86300/implementer/kit/pixel-engine/check.mjs\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":240,\"content\":\"    console.log(`${report.ok ? 'ok' : 'FAILED'}: ${join(out, 'report.json')}`);\"},{\"line_number\":421,\"content\":\"  console.log(`${report.ok ? 'OK' : 'FAILED'}  sheets: ${items.join(', ')}  (engine ${report.version ?? '?'}, ${report.sheets.length} drawn)`);\"},{\"line_number\":577,\"content\":\"console.log(`${report.ok ? 'OK' : 'FAILED'}  ${report.page}${s ? `  (${s.backend}, engine ${s.version}, ${s.frame} frames, \\\"${s.status}\\\")` : ''}`);\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/tmp/grok-goal-46b978a86300/implementer/kit/pixel-engine/types/engine/model/uv.d.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":3,\"content\":\" * Texels per metre for `tex` parts when the def doesn't set `texel`: the densest Gate B passed for\"},{\"line_number\":8,\"content\":\"/** The densest a moving model passed Gate B at (its sliding crate); denser wasn't measured. */\"}]},{\"path\":\