{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_516","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The image descriptionThe keyboard rate control plan specifies software movement at target speed. Keys do not hold the position. indicates the character\n\nStick controls are mapped to squat depth, lunging targets, and pressing. The rate control math is being audited against the plan. The target speed equals one divided by forty percent of tempo. The code clamps the accumulated value between zero and one. is standing upright\n\nThe rate sign is negated for the up axis. Keyboard S and W keys now correctly rather than squatting.\n\nThe prior gap required increase or decrease the accumulated value for squat, press, and lunge. a play clip with scrubbed reps, a lean dial, and the activity name. The current screenshot shows \"Squats of Regret\" and a balance dial. The camera is closer and fills the frame. The \"play 1s\" label remains.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3bc21b48-0f8a-4057-a60c-f5ab0fecc43c-15","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/app.js","offset":1340,"limit":220}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3bc21b48-0f8a-4057-a60c-f5ab0fecc43c-16","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"SquatRep|LungeRep|Press","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/art/clips.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3bc21b48-0f8a-4057-a60c-f5ab0fecc43c-17","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"activity|squat|shot","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/tools/shot.mjs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5210,"output_tokens":965,"cache_read_input_tokens":52352,"cache_creatio