{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_517","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe keyboard uses S and W for rate control rather than A and D. Both keys held together correctly cancel the rate. The additive tremor path matches the plan. A potential side-axis bug with alternating lunging targets is being examined.\n\nThe alternating lunging targets work correctly. Even when the stickI need to locate drawDial, is centered, the depth falls back to zero. Keyboard input always exerciseName, and the uses rate control. clip definitions.\n\nBot auto() writes depth and lean values directly. The bot path uses depthOf, which correctly maps those inputs to the target axis. Up, side, and\n\nThe HUD dial is drawn down axes all resolve to the intended depth. on the screenshot. The dotted circle with orange ring and red center sits at the top-center of the screen, matching the balance dial overlay.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2701c47e-82b3-4dde-905e-b3f2a21b5bf3-18","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/art/clips.js","limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2701c47e-82b3-4dde-905e-b3f2a21b5bf3-19","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function drawDial|function drawRepTrack|function exerciseName|function phaseLine|function line\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/app.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2701c47e-82b3-4dde-905e-b3f2a21b5bf3-20","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/tools/shot.mjs","limit":200}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4318,"output_tokens":595,"cache_read_in