{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_521","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":" for that frame. If the two mixers share state, the character's mixer might still reset the pose. A potential bug with compileClips being called twice is also being considered.\n\nThe duplicate compileClips call is harmless. Pose actions are drawn only from the poses array, while activity clips remain in CLIPS. The mixer binds clips to the model correctly. All thirteen tests passed, confirming the pose moves the pelvis and the character appears.\n\nActivity name, dial widget, and camera shot all match the tests and screenshot. The keyboard rate target speed is being re-examined against the plan. The default repTempoScale value must be checked to verify the squat tempo calculation.\n\nDirect integration at target speed is correct for rate control. The test only covers squat with S, not press with W. The inverted rate path remains untested.\n\nThe up-axis rate inversion is correct design. The plan only requires S and W to move rate at target speed, not to always increase it regardless of axis. For press, stick up maps to press depth, so W increasing rate is the natural mapping. Lunge uses S and W for rate control rather than A and D.\n\nThe plan confirms keyboard input is rate control, not directional hold. S always deepens the rep regardless of stick side. The press flip logic is correct and untested. Side lunges correctly alternate targets on even reps. Using D instead of S leaves rate at zero.\n\nThe prior gap only meant the S/W rate path was dead, not that A/D should drive lunges. The screenshot and browser log confirm the Squats of Regret pose is active. The pelvis moved more than 0.04 in tests, so the squat animation is working.\n\nThe pose animation's arm position is ambiguous, but the test validates it through pelvis displacementThe test.log shows only rather than visual inspection. The expert bot reaches roughly a single line: \"13/13 passed\". half the rep target after forty frames, confirming the scrub logic correctly maps accumulated rate to clip time.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f5f15a03-e629-4ca6-b641-f361014aebd1-23","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/app.js","offset":980,"limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f5f15a03-e629-4ca6-b641-f361014aebd1-24","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"activityName|state\\(\\)","glob":"**/src/app.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f5f15a03-e629-4ca6-b641-f361014aebd1-25","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/tools/browser.mjs","offset":450,"limit":70}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5333,"output_tokens":2948,"cache_read_input_tokens":70016,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"6e3917c5-9c3b-492e-9cd2-e028414174fe"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-f5f15a03-e629-4ca6-b641-f361014aebd1-23","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"980→    this.mode = 'medley';\\n    this.hubClock = !!arg.hub;\\n    this.refresh(true);\\n  }\\n\\n  makeLane(seat) {\\n    const lane = {\\n      kind: seat.kind,\\n      index: seat.index ?? 0,\\n      skill: seat.skill || 'average',\\n990→      driver: seat.kind === 'pad' ? new PadDriver(seat.index) : seat.kind === 'key' ? new LocalDriver() : null,\\n      ghost: seat.kind === 'ghost' ? new GhostDriver() : null,\\n      simulated: seat.kind !== 'ghost',\\n      steps: 0,\\n      pos: 0,\\n      scores: [0, 0, 0],\\n      sim: null,\\n      event: -1,\\n      dot: seat.kind === 'ghost' ? new Dot(() => 0.5) : null,\\n    };\\n1000→    return lane;\\n  }\\n\\n  addGhost() {\\n    const lane = this.makeLane({ kind: 'ghost' });\\n    this.lanes.push(lane);\\n    return lane;\\n  }\\n\\n  laneTotal(lane) {\\n1010→    return lane.scores.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0);\\n  }\\n\\n  fixed(ctx, dt) {\\n    this.ctx = ctx;\\n    this.engine = ctx.engine;\\n    // Physics steps before update, so the pause press has to freeze this step too.\\n    if (this.wantsPause(ctx) && PAUSABLE.has(this.mode)) this.openPause();\\n    if (this.frozen || this.engine?.timeScale === 0) return;\\n    if (this.mode === 'activity' && this.sim && !this.sim.done) {\\n1020→      this.sim.gentle = !!this.settings.gentle;\\n      this.sim.god = !!this.god;\\n      const input = this.driver ? this.sim.auto(dt) : this.local.readFrom(ctx, this.device.kind, dialLayout(ctx.hud.width, ctx.hud.height), this.tunables.mouseLeanRadius, dt);\\n      this.sim.step(dt, input);\\n      if (this.sim.done) this.finishActivity();\\n    } else if (this.mode === 'weigh' && this.weigh && !this.weigh.done) {\\n      const input = this.driver ? this.weigh.auto(dt) : this.local.readFrom(ctx, this.device.kind, dialLayout(ctx.hud.width, ctx.hud.height), this.tunables.mouseLeanRadius, dt);\\n      this.weigh.step(dt, input);\\n      if (this.weigh.done) this.finishWeigh();\\n    } else if (this.mode === 'attract' && this.sim) {\\n1030→      this.sim.step(dt, this.sim.auto(dt));\\n      this.attractT += dt;\\n      if (this.attractT >= 14 || this.sim.done) {\\n        this.attractI += 1;\\n        this.attractT = 0;\\n        this.beginAttract();\\n      }\\n    } else if (this.mode === 'medley') {\\n      this.tickMedley(ctx, dt);\\n    }\\n1040→  }\\n\\n  tickMedley(ctx, dt) {\\n    if (this.hubClock && this.hub) {\\n      const ms = this.hub.time?.() ?? -Infinity;\\n      if (!(ms >= 0)) return;\\n      this.medleyT = ms / 1000;\\n    }\\n    const win = medleyWindow(this.medleyT);\\n    for (const lane of this.lanes) {\\n1050→      if (lane.kind === 'ghost') {\\n        lane.ghost.present(dt);\\n        lane.hidden = lane.ghost.target != null && lane.ghost.shown.a !== win.index;\\n        lane.steps = 0;\\n        continue;\\n      }\\n      if (win.phase === 'play') {\\n        const id = [this.picks.still, this.picks.beat, this.picks.lean][win.index];\\n        if (lane.event !== win.index) {\\n          if (lane.event >= 0 && lane.sim) {\\n1060→            const max = lane.sim.def.thresholds?.[2] || 1;\\n            lane.scores[lane.event] = normalise(lane.sim.score || 0, max);\\n          }\\n          lane.sim = createSim(id, {\\n            tunables: this.tunables,\\n            rand: this.fork(`m-${id}`),\\n            botRand: this.fork(`mb-${id}`),\\n            skill: lane.kind === 'bot' ? lane.skill : (this.driver || 'idle'),\\n            skipIntro: true,\\n            first: false,\\n1070→            practice: false,\\n          });\\n          lane.event = win.index;\\n          lane.dot = lane.sim.dot;\\n        }\\n        let input;\\n        if (lane.kind === 'bot') input = lane.sim.auto(dt);\\n        else if (lane.kind === 'pad') input = lane.driver.read();\\n        else if (lane.kind === 'key') input = lane.driver.readFrom(ctx, 'keyboard', dialLayout(ctx.hud.width, ctx.hud.height), this.tunables.mouseLeanRadius, dt);\\n        else input = lane.sim.auto(dt);\\n1080→        lane.sim.step(dt, input);\\n        lane.steps += 1;\\n        lane.pos = lane.sim.dot ? lane.sim.dot.x : (lane.sim.x || 0);\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (!this.hubClock) this.medleyT += dt;\\n    if (this.medleyT >= MEDLEY_SPAN && this.mode === 'medley') this.finishMedley();\\n    const player = this.lanes.find((lane) => lane.kind !== 'ghost');\\n    this.hubScore = player ? this.laneTotal(player) + (player.sim?.score || 0) : 0;\\n  }\\n1090→\\n  finishMedley() {\\n    for (const lane of this.lanes) {\\n      if (lane.sim && lane.event >= 0 && lane.kind !== 'ghost') {\\n        const max = lane.sim.def.thresholds?.[2] || 1;\\n        lane.scores[lane.event] = normalise(lane.sim.score || 0, max);\\n      }\\n    }\\n    this.mode = 'podium';\\n    this.refresh(true);\",\"content_concise\":\"980→    this.mode = 'medley';\\n    this.hubClock = !!arg.hub;\\n    this.refresh(true);\\n  }\\n\\n  makeLane(seat) {\\n    const lane = {\\n      kind: seat.kind,\\n      index: seat.index ?? 0,\\n      skill: seat.skill || 'average',\\n990→      driver: seat.kind === 'pad' ? new PadDriver(seat.index) : seat.kind === 'key' ? new LocalDriver() : null,\\n      ghost: seat.kind === 'ghost' ? new GhostDriver() : null,\\n      simulated: seat.kind !== 'ghost',\\n      steps: 0,\\n      pos: 0,\\n      scores: [0, 0, 0],\\n      sim: null,\\n      event: -1,\\n      dot: seat.kind === 'ghost' ? new Dot(() => 0.5) : null,\\n    };\\n1000→    return lane;\\n  }\\n\\n  addGhost() {\\n    const lane = this.makeLane({ kind: 'ghost' });\\n    this.lanes.push(lane);\\n    return lane;\\n  }\\n\\n  laneTotal(lane) {\\n1010→    return lane.scores.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0);\\n  }\\n\\n  fixed(ctx, dt) {\\n    this.ctx = ctx;\\n    this.engine = ctx.engine;\\n    // Physics steps before update, so the pause press has to freeze this step too.\\n    if (this.wantsPause(ctx) && PAUSABLE.has(this.mode)) this.openPause();\\n    if (this.frozen || this.engine?.timeScale === 0) return;\\n    if (this.mode === 'activity' && this.sim && !this.sim.done) {\\n1020→      this.sim.gentle = !!this.settings.gentle;\\n      this.sim.god = !!this.god;\\n      const input = this.driver ? this.sim.auto(dt) : this.local.readFrom(ctx, this.device.kind, dialLayout(ctx.hud.width, ctx.hud.height), this.tunables.mouseLeanRadius, dt);\\n      this.sim.step(dt, input);\\n      if (this.sim.done) this.finishActivity();\\n    } else if (this.mode === 'weigh' && this.weigh && !this.weigh.done) {\\n      const input = this.driver ? this.weigh.auto(dt) : this.local.readFrom(ctx, this.device.kind, dialLayout(ctx.hud.width, ctx.hud.height), this.tunables.mouseLeanRadius, dt);\\n      this.weigh.step(dt, input);\\n      if (this.weigh.done) this.finishWeigh();\\n    } else if (this.mode === 'attract' && this.sim) {\\n1030→      this.sim.step(dt, this.sim.auto(dt));\\n      this.attractT += dt;\\n      if (this.attractT >= 14 || this.sim.done) {\\n        this.attractI += 1;\\n        this.attractT = 0;\\n        this.beginAttract();\\n      }\\n    } else if (this.mode === 'medley') {\\n      this.tickMedley(ctx, dt);\\n    }\\n1040→  }\\n\\n  tickMedley(ctx, dt) {\\n    if (this.hubClock && this.hub) {\\n      const ms = this.hub.time?.() ?? -Infinity;\\n      if (!(ms >= 0)) return;\\n      this.medleyT = ms / 1000;\\n    }\\n    const win = medleyWindow(this.medleyT);\\n    for (const lane of this.lanes) {\\n1050→      if (lane.kind === 'ghost') {\\n        lane.ghost.present(dt);\\n        lane.hidden = lane.ghost.target != null && lane.ghost.shown.a !== win.index;\\n        lane.steps = 0;\\n        continue;\\n      }\\n      if (win.phase === 'play') {\\n        const id = [this.picks.still, this.picks.beat, this.picks.lean][win.index];\\n        if (lane.event !== win.index) {\\n          if (lane.event >= 0 && lane.sim) {\\n1060→            const max = lane.sim.def.thresholds?.[2] || 1;\\n            lane.scores[lane.event] = normalise(lane.sim.score || 0, max);\\n          }\\n          lane.sim = createSim(id, {\\n            tunables: this.tunables,\\n            rand: this.fork(`m-${id}`),\\n            botRand: this.fork(`mb-${id}`),\\n            skill: lane.kind === 'bot' ? lane.skill : (this.driver || 'idle'),\\n            skipIntro: true,\\n            first: false,\\n1070→            practice: false,\\n          });\\n          lane.event = win.index;\\n          lane.dot = lane.sim.dot;\\n        }\\n        let input;\\n        if (lane.kind === 'bot') input = lane.sim.auto(dt);\\n        else if (lane.kind === 'pad') input = lane.driver.read();\\n        else if (lane.kind === 'key') input = lane.driver.readFrom(ctx, 'keyboard', dialLayout(ctx.hud.width, ctx.hud.height), this.tunables.mouseLeanRadius, dt);\\n        else input = lane.sim.auto(dt);\\n1080→        lane.sim.step(dt, input);\\n        lane.steps += 1;\\n        lane.pos = lane.sim.dot ? lane.sim.dot.x : (lane.sim.x || 0);\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (!this.hubClock) this.medleyT += dt;\\n    if (this.medleyT >= MEDLEY_SPAN && this.mode === 'medley') this.finishMedley();\\n    const player = this.lanes.find((lane) => lane.kind !== 'ghost');\\n    this.hubScore = player ? this.laneTotal(player) + (player.sim?.score || 0) : 0;\\n  }\\n1090→\\n  finishMedley() {\\n    for (const lane of this.lanes) {\\n      if (lane.sim && lane.event >= 0 && lane.kind !== 'ghost') {\\n        const max = lane.sim.def.thresholds?.[2] || 1;\\n        lane.scores[lane.event] = normalise(lane.sim.score || 0, max);\\n      }\\n    }\\n    this.mode = 'podium';\\n    this.refresh(true);\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/app.js\",\"offset\":980,\"limit\":120,\"raw_output\":\"    this.mode = 'medley';\\n    this.hubClock = !!arg.hub;\\n    this.refresh(true);\\n  }\\n\\n  makeLane(seat) {\\n    const lane = {\\n      kind: seat.kind,\\n      index: seat.index ?? 0,\\n      skill: seat.skill || 'average',\\n      driver: seat.kind === 'pad' ? new PadDriver(seat.index) : seat.kind === 'key' ? new LocalDriver() : null,\\n      ghost: seat.kind === 'ghost' ? new GhostDriver() : null,\\n      simulated: seat.kind !== 'ghost',\\n      steps: 0,\\n      pos: 0,\\n      scores: [0, 0, 0],\\n      sim: null,\\n      event: -1,\\n      dot: seat.kind === 'ghost' ? new Dot(() => 0.5) : null,\\n    };\\n    return lane;\\n  }\\n\\n  addGhost() {\\n    const lane = this.makeLane({ kind: 'ghost' });\\n    this.lanes.push(lane);\\n    return lane;\\n  }\\n\\n  laneTotal(lane) {\\n    return lane.scores.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0);\\n  }\\n\\n  fixed(ctx, dt) {\\n    this.ctx = ctx;\\n    this.engine = ctx.engine;\\n    // Physics steps before update, so the pause press has to freeze this step too.\\n    if (this.wantsPause(ctx) && PAUSABLE.has(this.mode)) this.openPause();\\n    if (this.frozen || this.engine?.timeScale === 0) return;\\n    if (this.mode === 'activity' && this.sim && !this.sim.done) {\\n      this.sim.gentle = !!this.settings.gentle;\\n      this.sim.god = !!this.god;\\n      const input = this.driver ? this.sim.auto(dt) : this.local.readFrom(ctx, this.device.kind, dialLayout(ctx.hud.width, ctx.hud.height), this.tunables.mouseLeanRadius, dt);\\n      this.sim.step(dt, input);\\n      if (this.sim.done) this.finishActivity();\\n    } else if (this.mode === 'weigh' && this.weigh && !this.weigh.done) {\\n      const input = this.driver ? this.weigh.auto(dt) : this.local.readFrom(ctx, this.device.kind, dialLayout(ctx.hud.width, ctx.hud.height), this.tunables.mouseLeanRadius, dt);\\n      this.weigh.step(dt, input);\\n      if (this.weigh.done) this.finishWeigh();\\n    } else if (this.mode === 'attract' && this.sim) {\\n      this.sim.step(dt, this.sim.auto(dt));\\n      this.attractT += dt;\\n      if (this.attractT >= 14 || this.sim.done) {\\n        this.attractI += 1;\\n        this.attractT = 0;\\n        this.beginAttract();\\n      }\\n    } else if (this.mode === 'medley') {\\n      this.tickMedley(ctx, dt);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  tickMedley(ctx, dt) {\\n    if (this.hubClock && this.hub) {\\n      const ms = this.hub.time?.() ?? -Infinity;\\n      if (!(ms >= 0)) return;\\n      this.medleyT = ms / 1000;\\n    }\\n    const win = medleyWindow(this.medleyT);\\n    for (const lane of this.lanes) {\\n      if (lane.kind === 'ghost') {\\n        lane.ghost.present(dt);\\n        lane.hidden = lane.ghost.target != null && lane.ghost.shown.a !== win.index;\\n        lane.steps = 0;\\n        continue;\\n      }\\n      if (win.phase === 'play') {\\n        const id = [this.picks.still, this.picks.beat, this.picks.lean][win.index];\\n        if (lane.event !== win.index) {\\n          if (lane.event >= 0 && lane.sim) {\\n            const max = lane.sim.def.thresholds?.[2] || 1;\\n            lane.scores[lane.event] = normalise(lane.sim.score || 0, max);\\n          }\\n          lane.sim = createSim(id, {\\n            tunables: this.tunables,\\n            rand: this.fork(`m-${id}`),\\n            botRand: this.fork(`mb-${id}`),\\n            skill: lane.kind === 'bot' ? lane.skill : (this.driver || 'idle'),\\n            skipIntro: true,\\n            first: false,\\n            practice: false,\\n          });\\n          lane.event = win.index;\\n          lane.dot = lane.sim.dot;\\n        }\\n        let input;\\n        if (lane.kind === 'bot') input = lane.sim.auto(dt);\\n        else if (lane.kind === 'pad') input = lane.driver.read();\\n        else if (lane.kind === 'key') input = lane.driver.readFrom(ctx, 'keyboard', dialLayout(ctx.hud.width, ctx.hud.height), this.tunables.mouseLeanRadius, dt);\\n        else input = lane.sim.auto(dt);\\n        lane.sim.step(dt, input);\\n        lane.steps += 1;\\n        lane.pos = lane.sim.dot ? lane.sim.dot.x : (lane.sim.x || 0);\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (!this.hubClock) this.medleyT += dt;\\n    if (this.medleyT >= MEDLEY_SPAN && this.mode === 'medley') this.finishMedley();\\n    const player = this.lanes.find((lane) => lane.kind !== 'ghost');\\n    this.hubScore = player ? this.laneTotal(player) + (player.sim?.score || 0) : 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  finishMedley() {\\n    for (const lane of this.lanes) {\\n      if (lane.sim && lane.event >= 0 && lane.kind !== 'ghost') {\\n        const max = lane.sim.def.thresholds?.[2] || 1;\\n        lane.scores[lane.event] = normalise(lane.sim.score || 0, max);\\n      }\\n    }\\n    this.mode = 'podium';\\n    this.refresh(true);\\n\",\"total_lines\":1716}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-f5f15a03-e629-4ca6-b641-f361014aebd1-24","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,49,54,48,55,95,95,120,54,57,56,49,101,51,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,51,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,49,54,48,55,95,95,120,54,57,56,49,101,51,47,119,111,114,107,47,77,105,110,116,32,68,105,97,108,45,87,105,105,32,70,105,116,45,103,114,111,107,45,52,46,55,45,120,104,105,103,104,45,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,49,54,48,55,47,115,114,99,47,97,112,112,46,106,115,10,49,51,56,54,58,32,32,115,116,97,116,101,40,41,32,123,10,49,52,49,49,58,32,32,32,32,32,32,97,99,116