37259) and the no-session title boot still match the earlier gating captures. No new shipped defect in these paths.\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/tmp/grok-goal-46b978a86300/goal-classifier-46b978a86300-2-skeptic-1.md has been created.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/tmp/grok-goal-46b978a86300/goal-classifier-46b978a86300-2-skeptic-1.md has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/tmp/grok-goal-46b978a86300/goal-classifier-46b978a86300-2-skeptic-1.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"Both prior gaps are fixed in the shipped path, with honest tests and captures taken after the source changes.\\n\\n**Rep axes.** `LocalDriver.readFrom` (`drivers.js:103-108`) sets `depth` to downward lean only, and now also sets `useRate` and `rate` for the keyboard (S = +1, W = -1). `RepSim.depthOf` (`sims.js:271-279`) reads stick-right as a lunge (`axis === 'side'`, alternating sign) and stick-up as a press (`axis === 'up'`). Keyboard rate integrates `r` at `1/(0.4*tempo)`, and the up axis flips the sign so W raises a press (`sims.js:253-257`). `tools/test.mjs:159-202` builds those inputs with `LocalDriver.readFrom` and steps real `RepSim`s: pad right on a lunge, pad up on a press, pad down on a squat, and KeyS on a squat all raise `r`; a centred stick and a rightward press do not. `implementer/test.log` (01:24, after the 01:08–01:12 source edits) is `13/13 passed`. The same logic is in the single-file HTML (`useRate` at the built `readFrom`).\\n\\n**Activity frame.** `world.js` compiles `CLIPS` (`world.js:175-183`), plays the activity clip in `playPose`, and scrubs rep clips with `action.time = r * duration` and `mixer.update(0)` (`world.js:241-261`). The play camera is the close shot (`wor