{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_533","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Evidence is newer than the source. Tests ran after the code was written.\n\nChecking for a real bug in the stick input path. The engine uses `moveAxis` and `padAxis` to detect pad input, but test stubs may not match how the real engine handles gamepads.\n\nThe prior bug was depth-only. Now checking if the standard-mapping stick Y axis is inverted, since many engines treat up as negative.\n\nIf the engine reports stick-up as y=-1, depthOf returns zero for up presses. LocalDriver only sets downward lean and never sets useRate, so stick-right lunges and stick-up presses leave r at zero. The fix should make LocalDriver's output for stick-up drive r.\n\nThe test assumes stick-up is y=+1. If the real engine reports up as negative Y, this input shape never occurs and stick-up presses still leave r at zero. The prior gap called for driving RepSim with LocalDriver-shaped input.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9c4db321-eb72-4080-a9fa-f873e9b3eb86-39","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"moveAxis|padAxis|kind = 'pad'|device\\.kind","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/src/core/device.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9c4db321-eb72-4080-a9fa-f873e9b3eb86-40","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"moveAxis\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607/types/engine/input.d.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9c4db321-eb72-4080-a9fa-f873e9b3eb86-41","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"stick|lean|axis|up","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/PLAN.md","head_limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1752,"output_tokens":921,"cache_read_input_tokens":82176,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"6161ca11-1421-4797-b2d3-23c12b7fe8eb"}
