{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-309369d2-6439-401d-8ca5-660b3b9ebff6-8","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"39→  \\\"aiHub\\\": {\\n40→    \\\"name\\\": \\\"Mint Dial\\\",\\n    \\\"tagline\\\": \\\"Keep the dot in the circle.\\\",\\n    \\\"description\\\": \\\"A week on a small island with a polite scale. Hold still, keep time, and try not to believe the number.\\\",\\n    \\\"type\\\": \\\"Game\\\",\\n    \\\"genre\\\": \\\"Sports\\\",\\n    \\\"source\\\": \\\"Wii Fit\\\",\\n    \\\"series\\\": \\\"Wii Fit\\\",\\n    \\\"players\\\": \\\"1–4\\\",\\n    \\\"controls\\\": \\\"Left stick, WASD or mouse: lean. R2, Space or click: breathe. L1/R1, F/J or mouse buttons: step.\\\",\\n    \\\"tags\\\": [\\n50→      \\\"pixel art\\\",\\n      \\\"comedy\\\",\\n      \\\"versus\\\",\\n      \\\"arcade\\\",\\n      \\\"3d\\\",\\n      \\\"story\\\"\\n    ]\\n  }\\n}\",\"content_concise\":\"39→  \\\"aiHub\\\": {\\n40→    \\\"name\\\": \\\"Mint Dial\\\",\\n    \\\"tagline\\\": \\\"Keep the dot in the circle.\\\",\\n    \\\"description\\\": \\\"A week on a small island with a polite scale. Hold still, keep time, and try not to believe the number.\\\",\\n    \\\"type\\\": \\\"Game\\\",\\n    \\\"genre\\\": \\\"Sports\\\",\\n    \\\"source\\\": \\\"Wii Fit\\\",\\n    \\\"series\\\": \\\"Wii Fit\\\",\\n    \\\"players\\\": \\\"1–4\\\",\\n    \\\"controls\\\": \\\"Left stick, WASD or mouse: lean. R2, Space or click: breathe. L1/R1, F/J or mouse buttons: step.\\\",\\n    \\\"tags\\\": [\\n50→      \\\"pixel art\\\",\\n      \\\"comedy\\\",\\n      \\\"versus\\\",\\n      \\\"arcade\\\",\\n      \\\"3d\\\",\\n      \\\"story\\\"\\n    ]\\n  }\\n}\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-221607__x6981e3/work/exit-interview.json\",\"offset\":39,\"limit\":20,\"raw_output\":\"  \\\"aiHub\\\": {\\n    \\\"name\\\": \\\"Mint Dial\\\",\\n    \\\"tagline\\\": \\\"Keep the dot in the circle.\\\",\\n    \\\"description\\\": \\\"A week on a small island with a polite scale. Hold still, keep time, and try not to believe the number.\\\",\\n    \\\"type\\\": \\\"Game\\\",\\n    \\\"genre\\\": \\\"Sports\\\",\\n    \\\"source\\\": \\\"Wii Fit\\\",\\n    \\\"series\\\": \\\"Wii Fit\\\",\\n    \\\"players\\\": \\\"1–4\\\",\\n    \\\"controls\\\": \\\"Left stick, WASD or mouse: lean. R2, Space or click: breathe. L1/R1, F/J or mouse buttons: step.\\\",\\n    \\\"tags\\\": [\\n      \\\"pixel art\\\",\\n      \\\"comedy\\\",\\n      \\\"versus\\\",\\n      \\\"arcade\\\",\\n      \\\"3d\\\",\\n      \\\"story\\\"\\n    ]\\n  }\\n}\",\"total_lines\":58}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"52960fd9-479f-491d-bbcd-8878c75d149b"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_543","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I have enough information to write the closing summary.\n\nMint Dial is a playable browser fitness-week game in a single HTML file. Open it in Chromium with WebGPU. Lean with the left stick or WASD. Breathe with R2, Space, or a click. Step with L1, R1, F, J, or mouse buttons. Family Hour supports 1–4 local players. Pause for settings and dev tools.\n\nThe game is a week of balance, yoga, and island activities with a polite scale. Touch-only devices show a controller requirement.\n\nThe draft is trimmed to one sentence and three bullets. Shift provides a half-lean. The guest, ferry, and seven-day menus are confirmed.\n\nThe draft is being tightened to fit the 80-word cap. The opening sentence is being rewritten as a single concise line: \"Mint Dial is a playable browser fitness week: keep a balance dot in the ring across seven island days, in one HTML file.\" The remaining instructions will be compressed into one short line or up to three bullets.\n\nThe final draft uses one sentence plus three bullets. The opening line is \"Mint Dial is a self-contained browser game: a seven-day island of balance, yoga, and island sports with a polite scale.\" The bullets cover opening the file in Chromium, leaning with the left stick or WASD, breathing with R2 or Space, stepping with L1/R1 or F/J, and confirming the guest to begin the week.\n\nThe draft totals 77 words, safely under the 80-word cap. The phrase \"island of balance, yoga, and island sports\" is redundant and will be tightened. Complete sentences are preferred over shorthand.\n\nThe draft hit 89 words. I am trimming the third bullet to \"Lean with the stick, WASD or arrows (Shift halves it), or the mouse.\"\n\nThe draft is still 3 words over the cap. The opening sentence is being tightened to \"Mint Dial is a self-contained browser fitness week: keep the balance dot in the ring for seven island days.\"\n\nThe opening sentence is now 19 words. The second bullet is trimmed to 8 words. The fourth bullet is being shortened to 6 words.\n\nThe draft is finalized at 76 words. The opening sentence reads: \"Mint Dial is a self-contained browser game: a seven-day fitness island where you keep a balance dot in the ring.\" The bullets cover opening the file in Chromium with WebGPU, leaning with the left stick or WASD (Shift halves the lean), and breathing with R2, Space, or click.\n\nThe draft is 83 words, three over the cap. I am trimming the third bullet by dropping \"live,\" \"left,\" and \"a guest and.\" The second bullet is also being tightened to 15 words.\n\nThe three action bullets are being merged into one compact line. It uses semicolons to list leaning, breathing, and stepping controls in a single sentence.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Mint Dial is a self-contained browser game: a seven-day fitness island where you keep a balance dot in the ring.\n\n- Open `Mint Dial-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-221607.html` in Chromium with WebGPU (`file://` works).\n- Use the stick, WASD or arrows (Shift halves the lean), or the mouse to lean; R2, Space, or click to breathe; L1/R1, F/J, or mouse buttons to step.\n- Confirm to play the week. Pause opens settings and dev sliders. Up to four play Family Hour on one screen."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":360,"output_tokens":3838,"cache_read_input_tokens":22400,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa22-c3bd-7423-a5f1-ddadc552f469","uuid":"1a7c8615-2189-48a0-b4e0-068aef271d5c"}
